const CHOIR_DATA = {"KK-0001": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0001-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0001-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 2, "tune": 2, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0001-malayalam-1.jpg", "choir/KK-0001-malayalam-2.jpg"], "manglish": "Athiraaviley thirusannidhi Anhayunnoru samayey\nAthinaay ninney sthuthippaan kripa Arulhka Yeshuparaney\n\n1. Rajaneeyathil adiyaaney nee\n\n    Sukhamaay kaatha kripakyaay\n\n    Bhajaneeyamaam thiru naamathin\n    Anantham sthuthi mahathwam\n\n Athiraaviley thirusannidhi\n\n\n2. Evidellaamee nishayil mruthi\n\n    Nadannittundu paraney\n\n    Athil ninnenney paripaalichcha\n\n    Kripakkaay sthuthi ninakkaay\n\nAthiraaviley thirusannidhi\n\n3. Neduveerpittu karanjeedunnu\n\n    Pala marthyaree samayay\n\n    Adiyannullhil kuthukam thanna\n    Kripakkaay sthuthi ninakku\n\nAthiraaviley thirusannidhi\n\n4. Kidakkayil vachchariyaam\n    Saathaa Nadukkaathirippathinen\n\n    Adukkal doothaganhathey\n    Kaavalanhachu kripayanalpam\n\nAthiraaviley thirusannidhi\n\n5. Urakkathinu sukhavum thanen\n    Arikey ninnu kripayaal\n    Urangaathenney balamaay kaatha\n   Thirumenikku mahathwam\n\nAthiraaviley thirusannidhi\n\n\n6. Arunhan udichuyarnnikshithi\n\n    Dyuthiyaal vilhangidumpol\n\n    Parane entey akame velhi\n\n    Varulhka thirukripayaal\n\n\nAthiraaviley thirusannidhi\n       (P.M. Kochukuru)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0002": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0002-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0002-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Paraney! Thirumukha shobhayin\nKathirennudey hridaye\nNiravaan kripayarulhenhamee\nDivasaarambha samaye\n\n1. Irulhin balamakhilam mama\n\nNikadey ninnangozhivaan\n\nParamaananda jaya kaanthiyen\n\nManathaarinkal pozhivaan\n\n\n\n\n\n-Paraney!...\n\n2. Puthujeevanin vazhiye mama\n\nCharanhangalhilinnurappa an\n\nAthishobhitha karunhaaghana\n\nMahimaamvazhi nadaththaal\n\n\n\n\n-Paraney!...\n3. Hridaye thirukaramekiye\n\nParmaamrutha Jeevan\n\nPrathivaasaram valharnettavum\n\nBelayukthamaay bhavippaan\n\n\n\n\n-Paraney!...\n4. Paramaaviyin thirujeevantey\n\nMulhayeeyennil valharni\n\nttari sanchaanaduvil ninte\n\nGunhashakthikal vilhangaan\n\n\n\n\n-Paraney!...\n5. Maranhamvarey samaraankanha\n\nmathil njaan nilaninnee\n\nTtamarcheithente nilakaakkuvaan\n\nThava saakshiyaayirippaan\n\n\n\n\n-Paraney!...\n6. Amithaananda sukhashobhana\n\nNilaye vannangh anhavaan\n\nAvidennudey priyanodotthu\n\nYugakaalangal vasippaan\n\n\n\n\n\n-Paraney!...\n         (K.V. Simon)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0003": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0003-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0003-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Vandanam ponneshu naadha!\nNintey kripaikaay ennumey\n\n1. Innushassin prabhakaanhmathinaay\nThanna kripayorthithaa vandanam\n\n-Vandanam…\n\n2. Poyaraavil enney kaaval cheitha\nNaayakaney! Nanniyaai vandanam\n-Vandananm…\n\n3. Innaleykaalh innu ninnodettam\nChèrnnu jeevikkènham njaan vandanam\n-Vandananm…\n\n4. Innu nintey aathmashakthi moolam\nEnney muttum kaakkuka vandanam\n-Vandananm…\n\n5. Nin mukhathilullha divya kaanthi\nEnmel shobhikkenhamey\n\n\n-Vandananm…\n\n6. Azhiyaatha jeevashakthi ennil\nOzhiyaathey paarkanham vandanam\n-Vandananm…\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(P.V. Thommi)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0004": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0004-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0004-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Unharuka neeyenaathmave!\nChèrukenneshuvinnarikil nee\nThunhayavanallaathaarullhee\nÈzhakalh nammeypaalippaan\n\n2. Puthiyoru divasam vannathinaal\nEnganey nammudey jeevithaththey\nBhoothalamathiley nayicheedenham\nAayathariyikka Thaathanodu\n\n3. Poyoru divasam athupoley\nBhooviley vaasavum neengipom\nNeeyathu dhyaanicheeshankal\nAashrayam puthukkanham eekshanathil\n\n4.Veedumillaarumillonnumillee\nLokaththilenikkennorkuka nee\nVittakalum nee orunaalhil\nUndennuthonunna sakalaththeyum\n\n5. Nithya soubhaagyangalh anubhavippaan\nSwargathil namukkullha veedumathi\nNithyajeevaamruthamodamanhin\nappantey madiyil vasikkarutho\n\n6. Snehithar namukkundu swargaththil\nDaivathin dootharum parishudharum\nSneham kondeshuvé vaazhthipaadun\navidey namukkum paadarutho?\n\n7. Kristhantey kaahalhamoothum dhwani\nKelhkumo ee dinamaararinju\nVishramavaasaththilaakumo naam\nAethinumorungukenn aathmavey\n\n(Muthampakkal  Kochukunju Upadeshi)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0005": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0005-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0005-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Manamey! Pakshiganhangalhunhar\nnnithaa paadunnu geethangal\nManamey! Neeyumunharnnitteshu\nParaney paadi sthuthikka\n\n2. Manamey! Ninney paramonnathan\nParipaalikkunnathiney\nNinachchaal ninakkushassil kida\nNnurangaan kazhinjeedumo\n\n3.Mrugajaalangalunharnee dunna\nSamayaththu nee kidannu\nMrugaththeykaalhum nirvichaariyaa\nYurangaathentey manamey\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n4. Maraththil kombilirikkum pakshi\nYuraykkum shabdamathuke\nTturakkamthelhinjudaney ninety\nParaney paadi sthuthikka\n\n5. Paraneshu thaanathiraaviley\nThaniyayoru vanaththil\nParichodunharnezhunnu praarthi\nChchathu nee chinthikka.\n\n6. Oruvaasaramushassaaya ppol\nPeelaathosintey arikey\nParaneshuvorajam pol ninna\nNila nee chinthicheeduka.\n\n7. Paraneythallhiparanja pathro\nsathiraaviley samaye\nPeruththa dukham niranju pura\nththirangipotti karanju.\n\n8. Mariyaamathiraavil Yeshuvey\nKaanhaanjittullham thakarnu\nKarayunnathenthathula sneham\nManamey ninakkathundo?\n      (P.M. Kochukuru)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0006": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0006-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0006-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Ushakaalam naam ezhunnelkkuka\nParaneshuvey sthuthippaan\nUshakaalamenthanandam nammal\nPriyanodaduththeedukil\n\n2. Ithupoloru prabhaatham\nNamukkadutheedunnu manamey\nHaa enthaanandam nammudey priyan\nNeethi suryanaay varunnaalh\n\n3. Nanniyaalullham thudicheedunnu\nThallhayaameshu kaarunhyam\nOronnoronnaai dhyaanippathinu nalla\nsandarbhamaakunnu\n\n4. Innaley bhoovil paarthirunnavar ethraper\nLokam vittupoy\nEnnaalo namukkorunaalhkoodey\nPriyaney paadisthuthikkaam\n\n\n5. Nagnanaai njaan lokaththil vannu\nnagnanaai thanney pokumey\nLokaththilenikkilla yaathonnum\nEntey koodannu poruvaan.\n\n6. Haa en priyantey premaththey\nOrthittaanandam paramaandam\nHaa en priyanaa puthuvaanabhudaanam\ncheithathenthaanandam\n\n7. Maruvil ninnu priyanmel chaari\nvarunnorivalh aarupol\nVannathilkoodey pokunney njaanum\nSwantharaajyaththil chelluvaan.\n\n8. Kodunkaattundi vanadeshaththen\nPriyaney enney vidalley\nKothiyodey njaan varunney entey\nSankadamangu theerkkanhey\n\n(Muthampakkal  Kochukunju Upadeshi)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0007": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0007-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0007-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Aathmavey unharuka neram - Pularunnathinakamey nintey\nDaivika karmaniyamangal - cheivathinuzhareeduka vegam\n\n2. Arkanudichchuvarunnallo - paarkaruthey paramaathmaavil\nPakkalanhappaan poojakalhe - Vekkamorukkuka pularkaaley\n\n3. Kaalam poyi vruthaagathamaam - Kaalam thavaveendiduka nee\nKaalam inisheshichchathiney - Paalichchiduka phalamodé\n\n4. Kaala vilhambanamaruthey nal - Kaalamithey kalhayaruthey nin\nNaalhavasaanichchenorthi - naalhil jeevichcheeduka nee\n\n5. Valiyoru naalhu varunnallo - malakalhumannu viraykkumbol\nBelamoduneeyum nilpathinnaay - Belamudayoney sthuthicheika\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n6. Paramapadaththey snehikka - paragathivauvaan mohikka\nParasnehaththey paalikka - Paramaarththam samsaarikka\n\n7. Manassuthelhinyu prakaashikka - Mahimaathmaavinkannhuk al nin\nManamathilullha rahasyangal - Maravukalh maattikaakkunnu\n\n8. Unharuka manamey, unharuka poycheruka maalaakhamaarod-\nUyaranghalhilathyunnatha - nanguchchai sthuthi paadam cheika\n\n9. Sainyangalhude naadha! Nee shudhdhan, shudhdhan parishudhdhan\nEnnanavaratham paadunna Vrindamodoththu vanhangavaney\n\n10. Nidrayathaamen kanhkalhudey - Mudraye neekkuvathinnaayi\nAardratha valharey kaattiya nin - Kaalthalhiril panhicheiyunnen\n\n11. Nidrayilee njaan veenhappolh shathruvil - Ninnidal kaathenney\nBhadramaayippaalichoru nin kaalthalhiril panhicheiyyunnen\n\n12. Irulhnirathannudey maramuzhuvan viravodu rahasivalichchudaney\nIrulokaththil velhivutharum - karamathiney sthuthi cheiyyunnen\n\n13. Garbhagruhaththiladanjath il njaan arbhakanaayi valharnnappolh\nAthbhudamaay paripaalichcha Salparaney sthuthicheiyyunney\n\n14. Daivapithaavey ninakkum nin eka suthan mashihaayikkum\nAthupoley roohaaykkum sthuthiyundaakanhamenn eykkum\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(Chekottashan)\nSandhya Keerthanangalh", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0008": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0008-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0008-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "‘Abide with me’\n1. Koodey paarkka neram vaikunnithaa\nKoorirulherunnu paarkka Devaa\nAashrayam verillaa neram thannil\nAashrithavathsalaa koodey paarkka\n\n2. Aayussaam cherudinam odunnu\nBhoosanthoshamahima mangunnu\nChuttilum kaanhunnu maattam kèdum\nMaattamillaa Devaa koodey paarkka\n\n3. Raajaraajanpol bhayankaranaay\nSaadhuvey darshichcheedaruthey nin\nChirakinkeezh soukhyavaramodey\nNanma daya nalki koodey paarkka\n\n4. Èki kashtathayil sahathaapam\nApekshayil manassalivodey\nNissahaayarin sahaayakanaay\nVannu rakshichchu nee koodey paarkka\n\n5. Sadaanin saannidhyam venham thaathaa\nPaathakanmel jayam ninkripayaal\nThunhacheivaan neeyallaathaarullhu\nSanthosha santhaapey koodey paarkka\n\n6. Shathru bhayamilla neeyundenkil\nLokakannheer innilla kaipottum\nPaathaalhamey! Jayam evidey nin?\nMrithyumulh poy, jayam: koodey paarkka\n\n7. Kannhadanjeedumbol nin krushiney\nKaanhikka mel lokamahimayum\nBhoomithyaa nizhal gamikkunnithaa\nBhaagyodayamaay nee koodey paarkka\n  (Translation: Rev. T. Koshy)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0009": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0009-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0009-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "‘Sun of my Soul’\n- John Keble\n1. En aathmaavin aadithyané\nEn priya rakshaakarané\nNee vasikkilen sameepé\nRaathri pakal polaakumé\n\n2. Bhoojaathamaam megham athaal\nMarappaan ninnil ninnenney\nIdayaakkaruthey raavil\nKaakkanhey sarvashakthaney\n\n3. Kanhmayangi njaan nidrayil\nKidakkumbolh ksheenhathayil\nEn rakshakaa nin madiyil\nVishramikkunnenorppikka\n\n4. Ninne koodaathey jeevippaan\nPaathramalley onninaalum\nSandhyayil koodey irippaan\nUshassolham nee vannaalum\n5. Illaathaakaan bhayam lesham\nRaavinn irulhathinaalum\nEn sameepey venham vaasam\nKaividalley orikkalum\n\n6. Thetti alanjeedunnorum\nMathsaripporum sarvarum\nPaapanidra cheitheedaaivaan\nKripaavèla thudarnnarulh.\n\n7. Dukhithannu kaaval neeyey\nAgathikku dhanam neeyey\nKarayunnavantey nidra\nShishuvin samamaakkuka\n\n8. Unharum samayam vannu\nVaazhththanham arikey ninnu\nRaajyam cherumvarey sneham\nThannil vazhi nadathenham", "qaStatus": "REVIEW", "qaIssues": ["CROP_MARGIN_TOO_SMALL"]}, "KK-0010": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0010-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0010-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Innu pakalilenney\nNannaay anugrahichchu\nMannavaa sthuthi nina\nKkennekum cheitheedunnen\n\n2. Sarvashakthiyullha nin\nChirakin keezhadiyaney\nSarvanèravum raaja\nRaajaney kaaththukolhka\n\n3. Ee divasam njaan cheitha\nDoshamaakavey nintey\nPreethiyerum makaney\nOrththu kshamikka Deva\n\n4. Innu njaanurangum mu-\nnbanyunamanassaakshi\nNinnodum janaththodum\nUndaavaan thunhayka nee\n\n5. Maranham nirmalashayya\nShayanam nirbhayamaayi\nSaadaram thonnumaaren\nDaivamey padippikka\n\n6. Kaahalha dhwani kettu\nVegam nin mahathwaththé\nKaanhmaan njaan kothikkunnu\nKarunhaavaaridhey Deva!\n         (Rev. T. Koshy)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0011": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0011-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0011-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1.Karthaney ippakalilenné Nee\nKaaval cheithathi modamai\nCherththanhachchu nin paadaththilaaya-\nthorththadi panhiyunnu njaan\n\n\n\n\n\nKarthaney...\n2. Pakshikalh koodanhanju kondava\nNirbhayamaai vasikumpol\nPakshamodentey rakshakaa! Thava\nvakshasil anhanjeedunnen\n\n\n\n\nKarthaney...\n3. Bhoothaleyudichuyarna soorya\nShobha poi maranjeedunnu\nNeethi sooryaney modamodaka-\nthaaril neeyudikkenhamey\n\n\n\n\nKarthaney...\n4. Keshaadipaadam sarvvavum bhari-\nchchidenham parishudhdhaney\nDaasan nin thiru sannidhiyinpra-\nkaashaththil vasicheeduvan\n\n\n\n\nKarthaney...\n5. Nidrayil nin chirakinkeezhenney\nbhadramaai maraikenhamey\nRaathri muzhuvannaviyaalenney\nShathruvil ninnu kaakkuka\n\n\n\n\nKarthaney...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n6. Raathriyil njaan kidakkayil praanha-\nnaathaney vedavaakyangal\nOrththu dhyaanichchu modamaai praarthi\nchcheduvaan kripanalkuké\n\n\n\n\nKarthaney...\n\n7. Praanhanaayakan Yeshuvey neeyee\nRaathriyil ezhunnallhiyaal\nAnandaththodey daasanum ethi-\nrelkkuvaan thunhaikkenhamey\n\n\n\n\nKarthaney...\n8. Innu raathriyil entey jeevaney\nNee eduththeedukil vibho\nNinnil njaan nidrakondu vishrami-\nchcheeduvaan kripanalkanhey\n\n\n\n\nKarthaney…\n(P.V. Thommi)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0012": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0012-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0012-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1.Innu pakal muzhuvan\nKarunhayodenney sookshichchavaney\nNanniyode thirunaamaththinu sadaa\nVandanam cheitheedunnen\n\n2. Anna vastraadikalhum\nSukham belamenneevakal samastham\nThannadiyaaney nithyam\nPottidunna unnathan nee paraney\n\n3. Mannidam thannilinnum\nPalajanam khinnaraai mevidumbol\nNinnadiyaanu sukham\nThanna kripa vandaneeyam paraney\n\n4. Thettukuttangalhennil\nVannathalhavatta nintey kripayaal\nMuttum kshemikkenhamey\nAdiyaaney uttu snehippavaney\n\n5. En karunheshanudey\nBelamezhum thankanaamam enikku\nSanketha pattanhamaam\nAthilaaham shankayennyey vasikkum\n\n6. Vallabhan neeyurangaathey\nNinnenney nallapol kaathidumbol\nIlla ripuganhangal\nkkadikaaramallal peduththeeduvaan\n\n7. Shaanthathayodu karthaa\nThirumunbil chanthamaayinnurangi\nSanthoshamod unharenham njaan\nthiru kaanthi kandullassippaan\n\n(P.V. Thommi)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0013": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0013-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0013-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "At even ere the sun was set – Canon.H.Twells\n1. Sandhyay sooryaasthamana mun\nVyaadikkaar karththan chuttumaai\nEthra aadhiyil kidannor\nEthra modamodey poyi\n2. Veendumithaa sandhyayinkal\nKashtapedunnoramenghal\nKaanhaathenkilum nee chaarey\nUndennarinju varunney\n3. Karthaney thaapam theerkkanham\nNjangalhil rogadukhithar\nNinney snehikkaththaavarum\nMun sneham vittorumundey\n4. Aakulachinthayaal palar\nSamshaya bhaaraththaal chilar\nDehamohaththaalum chilar\nKhedikkunnu! Raksha nee thaan\n\n5. Lokam maayayaai kandittum\nLokaththey vidaanjor chilar\nMithrangal drohichchittum nin\nMithrathwam thèdaanjor chilar\n6. Paapa bandham vidaanjathaal\nSwaasthyamillaarkum naathane\nNin sevaikkettam thalparan\nHriththil thettetam kaanhunnu\n7. Karththaa nee marthyanaayallo\nKashtadukhangal orkkum nee\nNaanhaththaal moodum vranhavum\nKaanhunnu nin kanh spashtamaai\n\n8. Innu nin sparsham phalikkum\nOnnum pizheykkaa nin vaakkum\nSandhyayithil kelhyaachana\nSwaasthyam nalki njangalhkellaam\n(P.V. Thommi)", "qaStatus": "REVIEW", "qaIssues": ["CROP_MARGIN_TOO_SMALL"]}, "KK-0014": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0014-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0014-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "‘Now the day is over’\n- Rev. S. Baring Gould\n1. Theernu pakalkaalam raavanhayunnu\nKoorirulhin chchaaya vaanam moodunnu\n\n2. Thaaraka ganhangal minnunnoronnaay\nSrishtiganhamaakey urakkaththilaay\n\n3. Ksheenhichchonu Yeshu! Swastham nalkuka\nNidrayaalen kanhkalhvegam mooduka\n\n4. Raamuzhuvanum nindoothar kaakattey\nChirakavarenmèl virichcheedattey\n\n5. Sooryodayaththodey njaan unharattey\nNinteydrishtiyil njaan shudhdhanaakattey\n\n6. Thaathanu mahathwam Suthanum-ennum\nAathmanum avannham undaakattennum", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0015": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0015-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0015-malayalam-1.jpg", "choir/KK-0015-malayalam-2.jpg"], "manglish": "I\n1. Aadiyumanthavumillaaththo-raadipithaave! Karunhakalh nee,\nEe dinam ennodu cheythathinaai modamode sthuthicheyyunnen\n\n2. Dinamathinantham vannathupol thanuvinumantham varumennum\nDinakaranaadiyum maarhumennum – anudinamorppikkenhame nee\n\n3. Swapnamenikku vaarum munpe – shamanam manassil varuththanhame\nAnaghamurhakkaththilum-ente – mananam ninmel-aakenhame,\n\n4. Nirupama gunhanum neethikripa-kiranhanumaayullhavane nin\nKarunhayude chirhakin nizhalil kanivodenne kaakkenhame,\n\n5. ninthirusuthane prathiyente – vanthara veezhcha porhukkanhame\nAnthiyilum sukhamathupolen anthythinkalumekanhame\n\n6. Maranham shikshavidhi, chodyam – ariyum narakaththeekkuzhiyum\nUrukum yaathana vedanayum – karuthaan neeyarulheedenhame\n\n7. Jeevanuyirppim nithyathayum – jeevanumochana rakshakalhum\nBhaaviyil sukhameeyaashakalhen jeevaadhaaramathaakanhame\n\n8. Aathmavalippavumeedehe sathmaththinte-yarishtathayum\nAlpaayussum mama chiththe eppozhumorppikkanhame nee\n\n9. Nithyaanithyangalheyum nin – sathyaa sathyangalheyum njan\nKrithyaa krithyavumarhivaan en – chiththe velhivundakanhame\n\n10. Kuttam njan cheythavayellaam – aettayyo parhayunnadiyaan\nChuttumithaa vanmalapole – muttunnennude paapangalh\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n11. Vazhithetti valanjaadathupol – pizhakalh peruththoru van kaattil\nUzhalunnathinaalazhalerhi kuzhayunnen njan karthave\n\n12. Durvriththikalhelaam cheythen – durvvahamaam duschinthakalhum\nGarvvamodadiyan chinthichen – sarvajnja! Ninthirumumbil\n\n13. Thirukalpanakalhashesham njan – parilanghichathinaal nine\nParihaasam cheythathi dukhe – parninhaamaththilakappetten\n\n14. Daivapithaave ninakkum nin – aekasuthan mashihaaykkum\nAthupole roohaaykkum – sthuthiyunkanhamennekkum\n\nII\n1. Aadiyum anthavumillaaththo-raadi pithaave! Karunhakalh nee\nEe dinamennodu cheythathinaai – modamode sthuthi cheyyunnen\n\n2. Maranhaththinude dukhamathum – narakaththinude vedanayum\nArikaththaayi valhanjayyo duritham nee pokkeedenhame\n\n3. Sharanham neeyallathilla – paramilladiyanoraashrayavum\nPerukunnaadhikalhennhiyivan – karayunnathu nee kelhkkenhame\n\n4. Maa paapikalhe rakshippaan – vaanavan avaneecharanaayi\nVan paadukalhettathumeesho – nin kaarunhyam kondallo\n\n5. Naraveshaththe kaikondu – naradurithaththe kayyettu\nKrooshil thoongi marichathumen – durithaththe prathiyallo nee\n\n6. Maranhaththeyum vennu pithaa-varikaththangu gamichathu nin\nSharanhappettavare moksha-varanham cheyvathinaayallo\n\n7. Aghamakalunnathinaayente – akamathine puthuthaakkenhame\nAkavelhivinnaathmavine nee – akame nivasippikkenhame\n\n8. Vilamathiyaarakthathaalen – manamkhilam nee kazhukenhame\nValuthaayoru divasaththil njan – nilakolhvaan balamekanhame\n\n9. Randaamaththe varavil nee – randaayulaku pirikkumbolh\nAandavane nin valabhaage – kondeedanhame neeyenne\n\n10. Nithyam neeyadhipathiyennum – sathyam sakaleshwaranennum\nShudhdhar nee shubhakaran-ennum – marthyannavalambanamennum\n\n11. mahimakalhude mahaathmaave – mahimanirhanjoru ninnaamam\nMahiyathil njangalhkkeppozhum mahithathayode vilhangenhame\n\n12. Daivapithaave! Ninakkum nin aekasuthan mashihaaykkum\nAthupole roohaaykkum – sthuthiyundaakanhamennekkum\n\n(Chekkottashan)\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nShushrooshaarambham", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0016": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0016-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0016-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Holy Holy Holy\n- R. Heber\n1. Shudhdha! Shudhdha! Shudhdha! Sarva shaktha Devaa\nBhakthageetham kaaley Njangalh anguyarththumey\nPaapam shaapam pokum kaarunhya Yahovaa\nDeva Thriyèka, bhaagya Thrithwamey\n\n2. Shudhdha! Shudhdha! Shudhdha! Sarvadivyar vaazhthi\nAarththu ponkireedangalh Nin kaalkal veezhthunnu\nAasthayôdu dootha vrindavum pukazhthi\nAadyanthaheena, Ninney vaazhththunnu\n\n3. Shudhdha! Shudhdha! Shudhdha! Koorirulh anhanju\nBhakthiheenan ninprabhaavam kaanha enkilum\nShudhdhan Neeyey thulyan anyanilla engum\nAardratha sathyam shakthi onnilum\n\n4. Shudhdha! Shudhdha! Shudhdha! Sarvanaathaa Devaa\nSwargam bhoomi srishti sarvam ninne vaazhthunnu\nShaapadosham pokum kaarunhya Yehova\nDeva Thriyeka, bhaagya Thrithwamey", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0017": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0017-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0017-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Mannavaney mahonnatha Ninney njangalh vandikunnu\n    Eedharayil Neeyozhinjillaarumey -njangalh-\n    kkashrayamaai mèlilum Nee maathramey\n\n2. Daivadootha sainyam Ninney namikkunnu parishudhdha\n    Doshikalhaam njangalhathinenthullhu -orththaal-\n    Nintey naamam chollidaanum poraayé\n\n3. Mahaadeva! makkalh njangalh Thirumunbil vanhangunnu\n    Maaripolinnanugraham nalkenham -Sarva-\n    khedavum theerthu Nee njangalhkkaakenham\n\n4. Ninneppolor dhanamilla Ninneppolor sukhamilla\n    Ennennekum Ninmukhaththil vaazhuvaan -daasar-\n    kkanuvaadam thannu maarvil cherkkenham\n\n5. Ponnu Naathaa! ponnu Naathaa! Nin mukham kandaanandippaan\n    Swarggadeshaththennu vannuchernnidum -Loka-\n    Sankadangalhozhinjangu vaazhuvaan\n\n6. Bhakthanmaarey! raappakal naam Thirumunbil-aaraadhippaan\n    Ethravegam vaanaraajye poyidaam - Sarvva\n    Sammodavum labhichennum paartheedaam\n       (Muthampakkal  Kochukunju Upadeshi)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0018": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0018-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0018-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Varika suraadhipa Parama Paraa! Nin\nKarunhaasanam vazhiyaay sabhayil (2)\n\nOru manassodey nin thirubhavaney\nParichodadiyaar varunnathukaanh\n\n-Varika...\n\n1. Bhakthiyodadiyar Nin Thrippaadaththil\n    Praarthana cheithu varam labhippaan\n    Nithyavum nin parishudhdhaathma\n    Shakthi thannarulhaan bhajichcheedumbol\n-Varika...\n\n2. Thirumanassiney kurichochoru manassaay\n    Iruvaro moovaro varunnidaththil\n    Karunhayodey ezhunnarulhumannu\n    Thiruvaachaa arulhiya paramasuthaa\n\n-Varika...\n\n3. Vannadiyaarudey kanhmashavum\n    Thinmayasheshavum durmanassum\n    Onnodasheshavum neekkidenham\n    Ennum mokshey adiyaar nilpaan\n\n-Varika...\n\n4. Dootharudey sthuthiyil vasikkum\n    Neethiswaroopanaam Yehovaaykkum\n    Bhoothala Rakshaka Mashihaaykkum\n    Parishudhdhathamavinum sthothram\n\n-Varika...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(Moshavatsalam)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0019": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0019-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0019-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 2, "tune": 2, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0019-malayalam-1.jpg", "choir/KK-0019-malayalam-2.jpg"], "manglish": "Senayin Yehovaye! Nee\nVaanasenayodezhunna-\nllhenhamey shaalemil\n\nSeenayenna maamalayil\nVaanasenayodezhunna   -Senayin...\n\n1.Heenaraamee-maanavaril\nMaanasam kaninjaho\nMaanuvelaney thannoru\nPraanhanaayakaa Inneram..       -Senayin…\n\n2.  Shalomon panhinjathaam de-\nVaalayaththilannannu-\nkoolamodezhunna yisra-\nyelin Daivame! Inneram -\n      -Senayin...\n\n3. Naalu jeevikalhodoru\nNaalu mooppanmaar madhye\nMamahathwamodaho sim-\nhaasana sthanaayivaazhum       -Senayin...\n\n4.Yeshaya pravaachakan ka-\nndaalayaththilullhathaaya\nMechchamoduyarnnathaa m sim-\nhaasana sthaneyinneram\n      -Senayin...\n\n5.Aarhu chirhakullha sraapha-\ndoothasanghamaakave ya-\nangaarthu paattucholli sarva\nNaalhilum sthuthikkunnoru        -Senayin...\n\n6. Nèraay ninnaathmaavurachcha\nkurullhoru cholkalhaal nin\nAalayam chernnengalh paattu\npaadum-kettanugrahippaan       -Senayin...\n\n\n\n\n(Yusthus Youseph)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0020": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0020-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0020-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Parama Deva! Nin vilaasam\nArulh inneyramey\nkripa valharum theeramey (3)\n\n1. Kaarunhya sanaa! Prathaapa\n    sakala vandithaa!\n    Swar parama unnathaa (3)\n\n2. Suravara narar namichchuvaazhthum\n    Parama naayakaa!\n    Nal karunhadaayakaa (3)\n\n3. Unnathaththil ninnenneykaakkum\n    Oruparaapara!\n    Nal karunhayambaram (3)\n\n4. Naraka maranham akattisakalam\n    Adimaveendoru\n    than adimakondoru (3)\n\n5. Dinam dinam kaninjirangukengalhil\n    Neethisooryaney!\n    sarva jeevapaalaney (3)\n        (Mani John Kochukunju)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0021": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0021-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0021-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "All people that on earth do dwell\n- Psalms 100\n1. Bhoovaasikalh sarvarumé\nSanthoshamullha swaraththey\nKarthaavinnuyartheeduvin\nAnandaththodey vandippin\n\n2. Yahovaa Daivam ennumey\nNaam alla avan maathramey\nNammey nirmichchu paalichchu\nThan janamaai veendeduththu\n\n3. Than aalayé praveshippin\nAanandaththodey sthuthippin\nSankeerthanangalh paaduvin\nSanthoshaththodey irippin\n\n4. Than sneham nithyamullhathu\nThan kripa sthiramullhathu\nThan vaagdaththangalh okkeyum\nEppozhum thaan nivarththikkum", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0022": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0022-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0022-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Sarva maanusharey parannu – paadi\nSanthoshaththodey vandichcheeduveen\n\n1. Sevippin anandicchavaney geetham\nChèlodu paadiththan mun varuvin\nSarvalokanaathan Yahova – ithu\nChanthamodaarthu vandichcheeduvin\n\n-sarva...\n\n2. Nammey nirmichchavan Yahova – thanney\nNaamavanaadum janangalhumaam\nThanmahathwaththey paadi ningalh – innu\nThan grihavaathilkakaththuvarin\n\n\n-sarva...\n\n3. Naamakeerthanam paadiduvin! Ningalh\nNanniyodulh praveshichchiduvin\nNaathanaaya thriyeka Daivam – ethra\nNallavanennu chinthicheeduvin\n\n\n-sarva...\n\n4. Ethra kaarunhyashaali paran – sathyam\nEnnum thanikkullhathennarivin\nKristhanum thaathathmaakkalhkumey -nithyam\nKeerthiyundaaka halleluaameen\n\n\n-sarva...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(Moshavatsalam)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0023": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0023-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0023-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 3, "tune": 2, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0023-malayalam-1.jpg", "choir/KK-0023-malayalam-2.jpg"], "manglish": "Psalms 95\nVaruvin naam Yehovakku paaduka – raksha\nTharunna jeevapaaraykaarthiduka\n\nThirumunbil sthuthiyodaadaravaay chennu naamellaa-\nVarum sankeerthanangalhodorumichchaarthu ghoshikka\n\n-varuvin...\n\n1. Yahovayaayavan mahaa Daivam - avan\nSakala devakalhkum mèl raajan\nMahiyin thaanhidangalhavantey kaiyyil\nMahidaronnathangalhum thantey\nMahodadhi yumavantey vakayaakunnu, thaanathu\nPadachchithu karayeyum - mahaan kaikalh mananjithu\n\n-varuvin...\n\n2. Varuvin naam thozhuthu vannikkuka Dèva\nThirumun chennu naam muttukutthuka\nParan nammey padachchavanaakayaal thanney\nParan nammudey Dèvan aakunnu\nKaruththan mèchilin janam karaththinnaadukalh naam than\nSwaraththey ningalhinganu swarathodinnu kelhkuvin\n\n-varuvin...\n\n3. Porulh vivaadamaam meribaayilum artham\nPareekshayaakunna massaanaalhiley\nMarubhoovinkalumenna polavey - ningalh\nKadinamaakkaruth ullhamennentey\nKaraththin vanpravarthikalh marichcha ningalhinnachar\nDarshichaareyumenne parikshichangu shodhichu\n\n-varuvin...\n\n4. Enikku naalpathaandaa vamshaththodu – rasam\nJanichchillaayvarullhil thettunna\nJanavumen vazhiyariyaaththoru -mennu\nMozhinjnen swasthathayinkalaayavar\nAnhanjhulh pookayillennu chinaththodaanhayittu njaan\nDinamennum Thriyekaney vanhangivaazhtthidaama ammen\n-varuvin...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n            (Yusthus Youseph)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0024": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0024-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0024-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Yeshu sannidhi mama bhaagyam!\nKlèsham maatti mahaa santhosham nalkunna –\nYeshu...\n\n1. Shudhdhaathmaavanudinam ennullhil vasichenney\nPraarthippaan padipikkum nèrameppozhum –\n\n\nYeshu...\n\n2. Daiva vachanamathil dhyaanichcheeduvaa nathi\nRaaviley than paadam praapikkum nèram–\n\n\nYeshu...\n\n3. Paapaththaalashudhdhanaai theerum samayamanu-\nthaapa hridayamodey njaananhayumbolh–\n\n\nYeshu...\n\n4. Lôkachinthakalhaakum bhaarachchumadathi naal\naakulapettu thalharnnidunna nèram–\n\n\n\nYeshu...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n5. Dukhangalh hridayaththey muttum thakarththidumbolh\nokkeyym sahichcheedaan shakthi nalkunna–\n\n\nYeshu...\n\n6. Yaathoru samayamen andhathayathumoolam\npaathayariyaathey njaan valayumbolh–\n\n\n\nYeshu...\n\n7. Thakka samayamellaa muttum prayaasavum than\nmakkalhkku theerththu koduththeedunnôren–\n\n\nYeshu...\n\n8. Shathruvin pareekshayen nèrey vannidunnoru\nmaathrayil jayam nalki rakshichcheedunna–\n\n\nYeshu...\n\n9. Mannida mathilentey kannhadanjathin shèsham\nponnu lôkavaasaththil ennum ennekum–\n\n\n\nYeshu...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(T.D. George)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0025": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0025-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0025-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Nin Thiru mukha shobhayé dinam thorumey kaanhenhamey – Nin…\n\n1. Yeshuvey! Nin thanka-mukham Aashaadaasaneykumey - Dinam thorumey kaanhenhame\n  -Nin...\n2. Kandidumbôlh undenikku vènduvôlhamaashrayam - Dinam thorumey kaanhenhamey\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  -Nin...\n3. Ennilunharvundaho Nin kannhilnokkunnudaney - Dinam thorumey kaanhenhamey\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  -Nin...\n4. Yeshu jeevi-kkunnathaalee Daasan jeevichcheedumey - Dinam thorumey kaanhenhamey\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  -Nin...\n5. Shakthi ennil perukunnu nin shakthiyerumaaviyaal - Dinam thorumey kaanhenhamey\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  -Nin...\n6. Ullhamennil jwalichcheedum nin ullhin snehamorthangu - Dinam thorumey kaanhenhamey\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  -Nin...\n7. Paapasneham parithyajippaan paapahaari naathaney - Dinam thorumey kaanhenhamey\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  -Nin...\n8. Daivasneham perukeeduvaan divya daanamèkuka - Dinam thorumey kaanhenhamey\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  -Nin...\n9. Thèjomayanaam nin shobha thèjassodarulh Devaa - Dinam thorumey kaanhenhamey\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  -Nin...", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0026": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0026-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0026-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Aashisham nalkenhamey Mashihaayey\nAashisham nalkenhamey\n\n1. Eeshaney Neeyenye Aashrayamaarullhu!\nAashritha vathsalaney Anugraha maari ayakkanhamey!\n\n\n-aashi...\n\n2. Aagrahikkunnavar- kaayi Ninneythanney\nSheeghram Nee nalkeedumey Sandehamillorththithaa kenchidunnen\n-aashi...\n\n3. Aashrayam Nee thanney Daasaraam njangalhku\nVishrutha vandithaney! Ninneythanney sheeghram Nee nalkanhamey\n-aashi...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n4. Kaashinu polumee Daasarkilley vila\nMaashillaa vallabhaney Nin naamaththil daasarey kelhkenhamey\n-aashi...\n\n5. Raajakumaaraney Poojitha poornhaney\nSarva janeshwaraney Anaaratham kaaththarulhum paraney\n\n-aashi...\n\n6. Thejassinaal Nintey Daasareyaakey Nee\nAasharyamaai niraikka Nin naamaththey vaazhththi pukazhththiduvaan\n-aashi…\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n   (T.J.Varkey)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0027": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0027-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0027-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 2, "tune": 1, "kind": "CONTINUATION"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0027-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Anugrahakkadale ezhunnallhi varikayinn-\n\n\nAnugrahamadiyaaril alhavenye pakaraan\n\n\n\nPichalha sarppathe nokkiya manujarkk-\n\n\n\nOkkeyum anugraha jeevan nee nalkiye\n\n-anugraha…\n\n1. Ennilninnu kudicheedunnorh vayattil ninn-\nAnugraha jalanadhi ozhukummennarulhi nee\nPanthrandappostholan-maaril koodaadyamayi\nPenthekosthin naalhilozhukiya van nadhi\n\n-anugraha…\n\n2. Aathmamaari-koodaathengane jeevikkum?-\nDeshangal varandupoi daivame kaanhanhe!\nYovel pravaachakan urachcha nin vaagdaththam\nNjangalhilinnu nee nivarththiyakkeedanham\n-anugraha…\n\n3. Parishudhdha kaaryasthan njangalhil vannellaa-\nKuravukalh theerkkanham karunhayin nadhiye!\nVeettilum naattilum vazhiyilum puzhayilum\nEvarkkumanugraha-madiyangalhaayidaan\n-anugraha…\n\n4. Marupradesham paattodullasichaanandi-\n-chedanu  thulyamaayi sugandangal veeshanham\nPeeshon geehon nadhi hidhdhekkal fraaththathum\nMediniyil njangalkkekanam daivame\n\n-anugraha…\n\n5. Kurudanmaar kaanhanhe chekidanmaar kelhkanhe!\nMudanthullhor chaadanhe! Oomanmaarh paadanhe!\nVeendeduththorellaam kootamaayi koodi nin\nEthirelpin gaanangal ghoshamai paadanam\n-anugraha…\n\n6. Simhangal keraatha vazhi njangalkkekanhe!\nDushtamrigangalkku kaadukalhaakalle!\nRaajamaarge njangal paattodumaarppodum\nKurishinte kodikkeezhil jayathode vaazhanham\n-anugraha…\n\n7. Seeyon yaathrakkaare daivame orkkanhe!\nVazhimadhye avarkkullha sankadam theerkkannhe!\nVarumennarulhiya ponnukaanthaa! Ninte\nVaravinu thaamasam melilundaakalle\n\n-anugraha…\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n       (Muthampakkal  Kochukunju Upadeshi)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0028": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0028-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0028-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Vanneedenham Yeshu naathaa\nInneeyoga madhyé nee\nThannarulhka nin varanghalh\nNin sthuthi kondaaduvaan.\n\n2. Mannidaththil vanna naathaa\nPonnu thirumeniyé\nNanniyodithaa nin daasar\nvannukoodunney munbil\n\n3. Thaathaney kripaanidhey\nShreeyeshunaamam moolamey\nThannidenham aathmadaanam\nPraarthana cheitheeduvaan\n\n4. Vedavaakyanghalhey innu\nModamodulhkollhuvaan\nThaathaney thurakkayengha-\nllhullhaththey thrikaikalhaal\n\n5. Paapamokkey èttu chonnu\nMochanam labhichcheedaan\nPaapa bodhamèki inna-\nnugrahikka Daivamey\n\n6. Innu nin thiru vachanam\nGhoshikkum nin daasanum\nNinnanugraha niravin\nShakthiyé nalkeedenham\n(T.K. Joseph)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0029": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0029-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0029-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Varasundara paramandala\nParaneshu Naathaney!\n\nVannarulh swaamin!\n\nSthuthi mangalham jaya mangalham\nNinakkey Yahovayé\n\n2. Dharamandalam paramandalam\nSrishti cheitha Dèvaney!\n\n\nVannarulh swaamin!\n\n\n-sthuthi...\n\n3. Naradevaney Gurunaathaney\nNara raksha Karthaavey!\n\n\nVannarulh swaamin!\n\n\n-sthuthi...\n\n4. Pashukkoodathil muzhukaadathil\nNaranaaya Karththaney!\n\n\nVannarulh swaamin!\n\n\n-sthuthi...\n\n5. Nararkkaayoru beliyaaya Dè-\nvaney priya Karthaavey!\n\n\nVannarulh swaamin!\n\n\n-sthuthi...\n\n6. Murivanchinaal narupancha\nPaathakam theertha Karthaney!\n\nVannarulh swaamin!\n\n\n-sthuthi...\n\n7. Thava bhaktharin japam thaathan mun\nShubhamaakkum Karthaney!\n\nVannarulh swaamin!\n\n\n-sthuthi...\n\n8. Paramaasanam karunhaasanam\nVazhi nin sabhayithil!\n\n\nVannarulh swaamin!\n\n\n-sthuthi...\n\n       (Moshavatsalam)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0030": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0030-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0030-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Tune: This is the God we adore\n1. Anputhingum dayaaparaney\nImbamèrum ninpaadathinkal\nNin paithangalhadiyaarithaa\nKumbidunney anugrahikka\n\nVarika.. Varika.. Ee\nYo-ga madhyè\nChoriyanham nin aathmavaram\nParishudhdha paraaparaney\n\n2. Onnilereyaalhukalh nintey\nSannidhaanaththinkal varumbolh\nVannu chèrumavar naduvil\nEnnu chonna dayaaparaney           -varika...\n\n3. Ninnudey mahathwa sannidhi\nYenniyé njangalhk aasrayamaai\nOnnumillennarinjeeshaney\nVannithaa njangalh nin paadaththil -varika...\n\n4. Thirumunbil vanna njangalhey\nVeruthey ayachcheedaruthey\nTharanham nin kripaavaranghalh\nNiravaai paraney dayavaai\n         -varika...\n\n(P.V. Thommi)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0031": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0031-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0031-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "There shall be showers of blessing - E.L.Nathan\n1. Aashissaam maariyundaakum\nAnanda vaagdaththamey\nMelninnu Rakshakan nalkum\nAashwaasa kaalangalhey\nAashissaam maari\nAashisham peyyenhamey\nKripakalh veezhunnu chaari\nVanmazha thaa Daivamey!\n\n2. Aashissaam maariyundaakum\nVeendum nal unharvundaam\nKunnu pallhangalhinmèlum\nVanmazhayin swaram kèlh\n          -aashi...\n\n3. Aashissaam maariyundaakum\nHaa! Karthaa! Njanghalhkum thaa\nIppolh Nin vaagdaththamorthu\nNalvaram thanneeduka\n          -aashi...\n\n4. Aashissaam maariyundaakum\nEthra nanninnu peikil\nPuthrantey péril thannalum\nDaivamey! inneraththil\n         -aashi...\n\n  (Translation: Rev. T. Koshy)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0032": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0032-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0032-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Yeshunaadha neethi surya\nEkanham nin aathma daanam\nDaasarileesamayaththil naathaney\nSarva - maalozhichu divyadaanam nalkuka\n\n2. Innu nintey sannidhiyil\nVannirikkum njangalhey nee\nNintey divyaasheesham nalki paalikka\nSarva - maaya chintha doorey neeki kaakkuka\n\n3. Ithranaalhum ninkripayé\nVyarthamaakki theerthu poyé\nAththalellaam neekki nee kaithaanguka\nNintey – sathya bodham njangalhil nee nalkuka\n\n4. Aathma daathaavaaya ninné\nSwanthamaakki theerthiduvaan\nAathmadaaham njangalhil nee nalkuka\nSarva – swaartha chiththam doorey neeki\nkaakkuka\n\n5. Nintey sneham arinjittu\nNinney snehippathinaayi\nSneha heenar aayavaril vègamé\nNithya – sneharoopanaaya ninney kaattuka\n\n6. Nee pozhikkum thein mozhikalh\nNjangalhullhil aakkeeduvaan\nPaaram kothi nalkidenham Daivamé\nEllaam – cheithu nalla daasaraayi theeruvaan\n\n7. Nalla pankaay ullhathiney\nNjangalhellaam eduththeedaan\nNalla daanam adiyaarku nalkenham\nAarum – vyartham aayi poyidalley Daivamé\n\n (Muthampakkal  Kochukunju Upadeshi)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0033": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0033-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0033-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Revive thy work Lord\n\n-Albert Midlane\n1. Saannidhyam aakenham-\nKarthaaadi Karthaavey\nEe yogam innu kelkenham\nNin shakthi vaakkiney\nJeevan nalkidenham\nVandikkum neramey\nAashirvaadam nalkidenham-\nKaarunhya vaaridhey!\n\n2. Saanidhyam aakenham\nNin naamam vaazhattey\nNin sneham oro nenchakam\nJwalichchu veeshattey\n-jeevan...\n\n3. Saanidhyam aakenham\nNin vaakyam kelhkayil\nNin aashirvaadam nalkenham\nJeeva vishwaasaththil\n-jeevan...\n\n4. Saanidhyam aakenham\nNin aathma shakthiyum\nMahathwam Ninteythaakanham\nNjangalhkku rakshayum\n-jeevan...", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0034": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0034-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0034-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Devaa! Devaa! Thriloka Naathaa\nLôkôdhdhaaraka! Kristhô! Devaa\nDaasaraamengalhey kaaththu\nrakshikkanhey  -deva…\n\n2. Aazhimeethey nadanna Deva\nAnchappam kondayyaayiraththey\nAthishayakaramaai pôshippichchavaney\n\n\n\n\n-deva…\n\n3. Kaanaaviley kalyaanha virunnil\nShudhdha jalaththey veenjaakki theertha\nKarunhaanidhiye! Kaniyènham dinavum\n\n\n\n\n-deva…\n4. Maanavarey rakshacheivaan\nMulhmudi shirassil vahichchum kondu\nKurishathilèri jeevaney vedinja\n\n\n\n\n                -deva…\n\n5. Naathaa! Mamagathi neeye thaathaa!\nAarththajanangalhkkekaalamb ham\nNeeyenye aarullhu deena dayaalo\n\n\n\n\n\n      -deva…\n\n6. Nintey raajyam vègam varanhey\nNithyaananda môksham chèraan\nBhaktharaam daasarey\nanugrahichcheeduka -deva…", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0035": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0035-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0035-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 2, "tune": 2, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0035-malayalam-1.jpg", "choir/KK-0035-malayalam-2.jpg"], "manglish": "Yeshuvey ee sabhamel aashuvannaashisham thaa\nBahu aashayôdi daasar cheyyum yaachana kelhkenhamey\n1. Ninthiru vaakyamengum nalvelhivu kaattidunnu\nSanthatham kelhppavarkkum samrakshanhavumathaai pinney\nEnthu kondu paapa sheelam njangalhil neekkamilla?\n\n\n-yeshuve...\n\n2. Ninnudey paadukalhey nee ninachchenghalhudey\nMannava kèdukalhey maayichcharulenhamey thrikkanh\nOnnukoodey nôkkidukil uyirgunharaam njangalh\n\n\n\n-yeshuve...\n\n3. Paapamo alla nintey beliyathuthaan valippam\nKôpamo alla nintey gunham kripathaan valippam! mana-\nsthaapamullha rakshaakaraa thallharuthenghalhey nee\n\n\n-yeshuve...\n\n4. Thaathanum njanghalhudey thaathayum neeyallayo\nVèdavum njangalhudey bodhavum anganey thaan ippolh-\nMôdamaai nee thaathan munbil vaadichcharulh tharika\n\n\n-yeshuve...\n\n5. Makkalhaam njangalhinnu maduramodey paadi\nThakkamèninnu nintey sharanham thèdukayaal ini-\nIkkarey ninnakkarayil eththuvôlham thunhaikka\n\n\n\n-yeshuve...", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0036": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0036-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0036-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Jesus, the very thought of Thee\n1. Yeshuvey dhyaanikkumbolh njaan santhushta maanasan\nEttavum aanandam Avan ethra manoharan\n\n2. Hridayam athinneevannham maadhuryam èrunna\nYaathoru namamilley swar- bhoothangalhilum\n\n3. Priyam érunna naamamey Eeyulakil vannu\nSwantha raktham athaalenney veendaruma naathan\n\n4. Sourabhyamullha naamamey Paarin dukhangalhil\nAashwasamekunna naamam vishwasikkeppozhum\n\n5. Thannodullha samsarggam pol Innihaththil oru\nBhaagyanubhavam illathu Swarggam thanney noonam", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0037": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0037-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0037-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Yeshumaheshaney njaan chinthippathen\nullhaththin aanandamey\n\n1. Eeshanudey thirusannidhi chernnini\nVishramam cheithu thantey thirumukham\nKaanhmath athyaanandamey\n\n\n\n-yeshu...\n\n2. Vaana sainyangalhkkum maanusha jaathikkum\nOonamillaathey ninney varnhikkuvaan\nsaadhyamathaakayilla\n\n\n\n\n-yeshu...\n\n3. Maanusha rakshakaa! Ninnudey naamam pol\nVaanilum bhoomiyilum illey oru\nNaamam ninappathinu\n\n\n\n\n-yeshu...\n\n4. Ullham nurungiyorkkullha prathyaashayum\nNalla prasaadavum nee sarveshwaraa!\nsoumyathayullhavarkey\n\n\n\n\n-yeshu...\n\n5. Ethradayaaparan veezhunnavarkkeshu\nEthra nallagunhavaan thedidunna\nMarthya ganhangalhkku thaan\n\n\n\n-yeshu...\n\n6. Kandeedum maanavark enthoraahlaadam nee\nUndonaavum penayum varnnhikkuvaan\nAa nalla sandarbhaththey\n\n\n\n\n-yeshu...\n\n7. Yeshuvin sneham athenthennu cholluvaan\nAaswadichhorkkallaathey mattaarkkum a-\nsaadhyamaarinjeeduvaan\n\n\n\n\n-yeshu...\n\n(Rev. T. Koshy)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0038": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0038-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0038-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Shree Yeshu naamamey thirunaamam – ithu\nbhoolokamengum môtham nalkum naamam\n\n2. Paapikalhey rakshacheyyum divya naamam parithaapi-\nkalhkkaashwaasam nalkum thirunaamam\n\n3.Paapabhaaram neekkidum vishudhdha naamam - paapa\nBandhanam thakarththidunna sathya naamam\n\n4. Enniley paapangalhellaam theertha naamam – entey\nmantha budhdhi neekki shudhdhi cheitha naamam\n\n5. Mallanaam pishaachiney jayichcha naamam – entey\nallalellaam than shirassilètta naamam\n\n6. Jeevaney paapikalhkkaai chorinja naamam – puthu\njeevaney nalki aashwasippichcha naamam\n\n7. Nithya moksha paathaye thuranna naamam – thantey\nsathya bhaktharil pramodam nalkum naamam\n\n8. Akshayaathma maari chorinjeedum naamam – thantey\nvakshassil prajakalhey chumakkum naamam\n\n\n\n(T. J. Varkey)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0039": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0039-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0039-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Yeshu ennullha naamamey lokam\nEngum vishesha naamamey\n\nNaashamundaakum paapa-\nNaasham varuththaan para-\nmèshan jagaththil marthyu\nVèsham dharichchu vanna            –Yeshu…\n\n1. Munnam Gabriel vinhdoothan chonna\nMôkshadaayaka naamamey\nKanni Mariyam kèttu\nKaaththirunnu vilhichcha-\nMannidaththengum bhaagyam\nVaruththum vallabha naamam      –Yeshu…\n\n2. Aarkkum chollaakunna naamam engum\nAaradhippaanullha naamam\nPèikkum pèyinpadaikkum\nBheethi chèrkunna naamam\nMoorkha paapikalhkkum vi-\nmôksham nalkunna naamam        –Yeshu…\n\n3. Mannar chakravarththi- kalhum vaazhthi\nVannichcheedum mahanaamam\nVinnhin geethaththin naamam\nVèdaanthasaaranaamam\nPunhyam peruththa naamam\nBhoovil prashastha naamam         –Yeshu…\n\n4. Vinhmannum chèrtheedum naamam\njapam\nVinnhil kondaadunna naamam\nNanma nidhi para nin\nNyaayam neethi kripaikkum\nUnhmayaam saakshiyaayi-\ntuyarnnuthoongiya naamam         –Yeshu…\n\n5. Kalnenchudaikkunna naamam – mana\nkkaadaakey vettunna naamam\nEnnum puthiyathupol\nÈrey madhuranaamam\nThannil pala saarangalh\nDharichchirikkunna naamam          -Yeshu…\n       (Moshavatsalam)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0040": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0040-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0040-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Haa! koodi naamellaarum chèrnnu pukalh kondaadenham – swargga\nVaathilaakum Yeshu naathaney vaazhththippaadenham\n\n1. Vèdanappedum èzhakalhkkazhalu theeruvaan – vannu\nMèthiniyathil maanushyaavathaaram aarnnithaa\n\n\n-haa...\n\n2. Maanavar vaazhththi paadunna Karththanaaya Thaan – dushta\nmaanavan eedèruvaan oradimayaayithaa\n\n\n\n-haa...\n\n3. Aadaravattu bhoomiyil veriyaraam narar – mara\nnhaadhikalh ozhivathinnu thaanhu Dèvanum\n\n\n-haa...\n\n4. Sènakalhin adhipathi Avanennaakilum – nara\njeevaney meelhaanavan thannuyiriney vittaal\n\n\n-haa...\n\n5. Daarunha maranhaadhiye marichchamarththinaan – bhoo-\nmandalaththil ninnuyirththu vinnhileththinaan\n\n\n-haa...\n\n6. Paapikalhkku Pithaavinodirannu mochanam – nija\nPaadasevaka jananghalhey rakshacheyyunnon\n\n\n-haa...\n(Moshavatsalam)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0041": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0041-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0041-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Maanasamey shree Yeshuvey bhaja nee\nmathikettupôkaathey\n1. Mannava mannava-nunnatha naayaka\nNandananaam manu-vèlaney ennum\n\n\n-maana...\n\n2. Bèthalèm puriyathi – loru pashu shaaley\nYoodajayaayoru-naariyil janichchon\n\n\n-maana...\n\n3. Paaridarudey para-maadhikalh theerppaan\nKroorathayèriya vèdana-sahichchon\n\n\n-maana...\n\n4. Yarushalam nagariyi-luyiru vedinju\nOru kurishathila-angèri marichchôn\n\n\n-maana...\n\n5. Narakaarishtatha- theertthudaney mun-\nArulh pol moonnaam divasamuyirththôn\n\n\n-maana...\n\n6. Nararipu varaney-jayichchathighosham\nParamandalamathilèri-yiripp aan\n\n\n\n-maana...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(K.M.Varughese)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0042": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0042-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0042-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Naadhaa choriyenhamey - Nin kripa daasarinmel\nÈkidenham aashishamaari - Ezhakalhin naduvil\n\n1. Paadipukazhththidaan paapikalh njangalh\nPaavanamaam Nin parishudhdhanaamam\nVaanilum bhoovilum melaayanaamam (2)\nUnnathaneshu naamam\n\n-naadhaa...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n2. Praarthanacheivaan praapthiyé nalkaan\nKaaththirunneedaan kaazhchayekuka\nVishwasippaan aashrayippan (2)\nShakthi nalkeeduka\n\n-naadhaa...\n\n3. Unnatha Deva nin vachanangalh\nUllhiley kanhkalh ullhapol kaanhmaan\nUllhangalhey unharththeedanhey (2)\nSarva vallabhaney\n\n\n-naadhaa...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(John Philip, Ayathil)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0043": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0043-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0043-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Shree Yeshu naamam athishaya naamam\nEzhayenikkimba naamam\n\n1.Ellaa naamatthilum melaaya naamam\nBhakthajanam vaazhthum naamam\nEllaa muzhankaalum madangum than thirumunpil\nVallabhathwam ulhlha naamam\n\n\n\n-shree...\n\n2.Ennhamilla paapam ennilninnum neekkaan\nEnmel kaninja naamam\nAnyanenna melezhuththu ennekkumaai maaichuthanna\nUnnathantey vandyanaamam\n\n\n\n-shree...\n\n3. Bhoothabaaditharkum naanaa vyaadikaarkkum\nMochanam kodukkum naamam\nKurudarkum mudantharkum kushtarogikalhkum ellam\nViduthal nalkunna naamam\n\n\n\n-shree...\n\n4. Paapaparihaaram paathakarku nalkaan\nPaaridaththil vanna naamam\nPaapamatta jeevithaththil maathrukaye kaattithanna\nPaavanamaam punhyanaamam\n\n\n\n-shree...", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0044": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0044-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0044-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Yeshuvin naamam madhurima naamam\nInhayillaa naamam imbanaamam\n\n1. Paapaththin bhaaravum shaapavum neekkum\nParama santhosham ekidum naamam (2)\n\n\n\n-yeshu...\n\n2. Parimala thailampol Yeshuvin naamam\nPaarengum vaasana veeshidum naamam (2)\n\n\n-yeshu...\n\n3. Vaanilum bhoovilum melaaya naamam\nVaanavar vaazhthidum Yeshuvin naamam (2)\n\n\n-yeshu...\n\n4. Vaagdaththa makhilavum nalkeedum naamam\nAashritharkkaalamba daayaka naamam (2)\n\n\n-yeshu...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n5. Muzhankaalukalh ellaam madangeedum naamam\nEvarum orupol vanhangeedum naamam (2)\n\n\n-yeshu...\n\n6. Ethra mahaathbhutham Yeshuvin naamam\nParishudhdhan parishudhdhan parishudhdha naamam (2)\n-yeshu...\n\nSthothrageethangalh", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0045": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0045-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0045-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Naathaney en Yeshuvey! halleluyya – Amen (2)\n\n2. Thaathanaam en Daivamey! halleluyya – Amen (2)\n\n3. Maa parishudhaathmaavey! halleluyya – Amen (2)\n\n4. Daivamey Thriyenkaney! halleluyya – Amen (2)\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(Moshavatsalam)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0046": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0046-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0046-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Haaleluyya! -Haaleluyya! - Haaleluyya! - Aaamen\n\n1. Anpu thingeedum nal anantha Pithaavey!\n\nHaalèluyya! Haalèluyya! Haalèluyya! Aamen\n\n2. Kripa niranjeedum nal Kristhu Karthaavey\nHaalèluyya! Haalèluyya! Haalèluyya! Aamen\n\n3. Vishudhdhi nalkeedum nal Parishudhdhaathmaavey\nHaalèluyya! Haalèluyya! Haalèluyya! Aamen\n\n4. Thaatha Suthaathmaavaam Daiva Thriyèkaa\nHaalèluyya! Haalèluyya! Haalèluyya! Aamen\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(Moshavatsalam)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0047": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0047-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0047-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Senakalhin - paran Yehovaa\nParishudhan - Parishudhan\nParishudhan - Aamen\nThirumahathwam - niranjeedunnu\nPaarilengum - Haalèluyya\n\n2. Sarvashakthan paran Yehovaa\nParishudhan - Parishudhan\nParishudhan - Aamen\nIrunnavan thaan irikkunnavan\nVarunnavan thaan Haalèluyya\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(Moshavatsalam)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0048": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0048-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0048-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Yeshudevaa! Yeshunaayakaa! Shreeyeshu naadhaa!\n\n\nYeshudevaa! Yeshunaayaka!\n\n1. Daasarinnazhalozhichulhil - aanandamekum\nYeshuve! Kripayinnazhake!\nNaasha lokaththil manushyanaayudhicha meyvelicham\nVeeshumathi shobhayulloru - velhichamathin\nEeshane! Yeshu naayakane!\n\n\n\n-yeshu...\n\n2. Aayiramaayiram vaanavar - vanhangum pathi-\nNaayiram periluththamane!\nKaayameduthaatham paapamettathine maatuvaanai\nMaayamattullhoru kunjaadai mannhithil vanna\nmannavane ! yeshu naadhane!\n\n\n\n-yeshu…\n\n3. Paapanellanozhippathinai - pithaavil ninnum\nThaapamattorranhayinaale\nShobhanamai mudrayittullhoru padachatta neette-\n-ttappanishtam cheyvathinayi vannoru yeshu\nKristhane! Mahaa purohithaa!\n\n\n\n-yeshu\n\n4. Paathakanaakunna saathaane - jayippathinnu\nYoodakulashekharanaayi\nBethelemennoorathil daaveedinillam thannillullha\nKannimeri thannudarathil - vannupirhanna\nYeshumahaa raajaraajane!\n\n\n\n-yeshu\n\n5. Gnaanamattullhoru lokathi-nnirulhakatti\nVaanaraajyathin rahasyangalh\nMaanavarinnulhillakki deenamokke bhedamaakki\nHeenare cherthu suvishesham elhiyavarkku\nThanna yeshuve! Pravaachakaa!\n\n\n\n-yeshu\n\n6. Elhiya shishyarkkamalanaathmave - nalkuvaan swarga-\nSthalapithaavin valamamarnnone!\nPuzhuvathaayoradiyanu nin kazhalinhaththaarabhayamaanhe\nKaralhalinju kripayil nadaththi - nee varunneram\nKanakalokam cherthu kollhuka\n\n\n\n-yeshu\n\n(Yusthus Youseph)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0049": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0049-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0049-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Sthuthippin sthuthippin Yeshudevaney – Hallelu-yya paadi\nSthuthippin sthuthippin Yeshudevaney\n\n\n\n\nSthuthippin lokaththin Paapaththey neekkuvaan\nAdhipanaai vanna Daivakunjaadiney\n\n\n-sthuthi...\n\n1. Karunha niranja kannhullhonavan- Than janaththin karachchil\nKaralhalinju kèlhkkum kaathullhon -Loka paapa chumadiney\nShirassu kondu chumannozhippathinnu\n\nKurisheduththu gol-gothaavil pôyôney\n\n\n-sthuthi...\n\n2. Vazhiyum sathyavum jeevanumivaney - Avannarikil varuvin\nVazhiyum aashwaasamèkumey -Avan papa chumadozhichavan\nMayazhum manjum peyyumbolullhil kripa\nPozhiyumey mèghaththunhil ninnum paadi\n\n-sthuthi...\n\n3. Marichchavaril ninnaadyam janichchavan - bhoomi raajaakanmaarey\nBharichchu vaazhum èkanaayakan - Nammey snehichchavan thiru\nChôrayil kazhuki nammeyellaam shudhdhee\nkarichcha vishwastha saakshiyé ninachchu\n\n-sthuthi...\n\n4. Èzhu pon nilavilhakkukalh ullhil - nilayanki dharichchum\nÉzhu nakshathram valankaiyillum maarvil -pon kachcha poondum\nVaayilirumuna vaalhumagni jwaala-\n poley kannhumullha maanava makaney\n\n\n-sthuthi...\n\n5.Kaalukalhulayil kaachchippa –zhuppichcha nalla pichchalhaikkoththathum\nChèlodu mukhabhaava maadithyan shakthiyodu prakaashikkum\nPôleyum thala mudi dhavalhappanji\nPôleyu mirikkunna Daivaputhraney\n\n\n-sthuthi...\n\n6. Valharey vellhaththinnirachil kkoththathum shavakkallarayil ninnum\nVelhiyé marichcho ruyirththuvaruvaanaai - thakka vallabhamullhathum\nElhiya janam chevikkolhvathumaaya\nValiya gambheera shabdavumullhoney\n\n\n-sthuthi...\n\n7. Valiya Daivadoothantey shabdavum - Daiva kaahalhavum thantey\nVilhiyodidakalarnnu muzhangavey - vaanalokaththil ninneshu\nJwalikkum agnimeghaththil velhippedum\n\nKalangum dushtar thanmakkalhaanandikkum\n\n-sthuthi...\n\n8. Mannava mannanaakunna mashihaayé mahaasenayin karththaney\nMannhum vinnhum padachchavaney manuvèla - manu nandananey para\nNandananey Mary nandananey raja\nNandananey ningalh nanniyodu paadi\n\n\n-sthuthi...\n\n9. Halleluyya paadi sthuthippin Yeshuvey - Yeshu naamaththinu jayam\nAllalellaamavanakaleykkalhay umey – Yeshu raajaavinnoshannaa\nNallavanaameshu naathan varum, sarvva\nVallabhaa Yeshuvey vegam varanhamey\n\n\n-sthuthi...\n    (Yusthus Youseph)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0050": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0050-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0050-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Devanandanaa vandanam - Jeevanaathanaam\nDevanandanaa vandanam………..\nDevanandaney! Pi-thaavin valabhaagaththil\n\n\nMèvikondu dinavum - divyasthuthikalhelkkum\n-deva...\n\n1. Kanyaanandanaa vandanam - Bhoothaley vanna\nUnnathaadhipaa vandanam……….\nMannil duritham poonduzhannu parithaapappe-\ndunna Manujarekkaninju veendukondoru\n\n\n\n-deva...\n\n2. Ghôra sarppamaam saaththaantey - shirassu chatha-\nchchoru Naathaney vandanam……….\nKroorvèdanayèttu krooshil marichchuyirththu\nPaaram bahumaanam poondaarô-hanha maayoney\n\n-deva…\n\n3. Vèda kaaranha Karthaney! Sarvva lôkangalh-\nkkaathi kaaranhaa vandanam……….\nDootharkkum manujarin - jaathikku madhipanaai\nNeethiyôdey bharanham - cheitharulhunnavanaam\n\n-deva...\n\n4. Karunha niranja Karthaavey! Ashudhdhi neekkaan\nUrava thuranna srishtaavey……….\nDuritha mozhichchengalhey arikil vilhichchu kripaa\nVarangalh thanniduvaan Nin karalhalinjeedenhamey\n\n-deva...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n    (Yusthus Youseph)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0051": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0051-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0051-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Yeshuvine sthuthi nee en maname!\n\n\nYeshuvine sthuthi nee - kristhu\n\n1. Naashamilla swargavaasiyaam daiva\nNandananaam parameshwaranaaya\n\n-yeshu…\n\n2. Naakabhoo-naraka thriloka-srishtaanara\nDehikalhkkoru navalokamundaakkum\n\n-yeshu…\n\n3. Bethele janichu nasrethale valharnnu\nYerushalemarichchuyir-shreyassodu dharicha\n-yeshu…\n\n4. Paapikalkkarulh tharuvaaniha vasichu\nDeepavazhiye nararkaayiha thelhicha\n\n-yeshu…\n\n5. Bodhicha sakalavum saadhicheedanum\nModichu raksha sambaadicheedanum\n\n-yeshu…\n\n6. Vedavachanapporulh bodhamaavanum\nBaadhaka vairi nipaathanaavaanum\n\n-yeshu…\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(Moshavatsalam)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0052": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0052-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0052-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Sthothram Yeshu naathaney Manuvèlaney! Manuvèlaney! (2)\n\n1. Paathraheena-naakumenney Paarththu nin kayyaalanhachchu\nChèrththukondentey duritham - Theerthu rakshikkenhamey\n-stho...\n\n2. Vinnhilumee - mannhilum nee-Ennapôlaarullhaho!\nUnnathanaakunna Yeshu-Mannavaril mannaney!\n\n\n-stho...\n\n3. Ponnulôkam thannil ninnuvanna jeeva-naathaney!\nEnnapèkshaikkinnu chevithannu kètteedenhamey-\n\n-stho...\n\n4. Paaramazha lôduzhalum Paapiyaamenney vedinju\nDooravey pôyidaruthey Daavidin kumaaraney!\n\n\n-stho...\n\n5. Thaathaney! Ennaathaney ee Paathakar sankèthamey\nNeethiyôdey bhoothalam Vaanhiduvaan varenhamey\n\n-stho...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(Yusthus Youseph)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0053": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0053-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0053-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Shreeyeshu devaa! Sthuthi ninakku - athi-\n\n\nPreethiyodanudinam cheytheeduven\n1. Nithyavum doothaganhaadikalhaal bahu\nBhakthipoorvam sthuthi labhicheedunna\n\n-shree…\n\n2. Maanava vesham vannu dharichu apa-\nMaanam enikkayi sahichavanaam\n\n\n-shree…\n\n3. En duritham nimitham ninthiru ninham\nChinthi vanduritham ettavanaam\n\n\n-shree…\n\n4. Mrithyuve jayichathi-ghoshaththode - swarge\nShakthiyodakam pookku vasichcheedunna\n-shree…\n\n5. Annavasthraadikalh nalki enum - enne\nNanne sookshichu paripaalikkunna\n\n-shree…\n\n6. Rakshakaa! Thirunaamam keerthichidaan - enmel\nPakshamodarulka aashissukalh\n\n\n-shree...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(Daveed Issahak)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0054": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0054-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0054-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 2, "tune": 1, "kind": "CONTINUATION"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0054-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Akhilesha nandananu akhilaanda naayakanu\nAkhila gunhamudayoru parameshanu\nIhalokamathil manujamakanayi vannavanu\nSakalaadhikaaramullha manuvelanu\nJayamangalham nithya shubha mangalham (2)\n\n2. Durithaazhiyathil veenhu parithaapamoduzhalum\nNararodu peruthaaya karunha poondu\nKaralhalinju kanakathalamathil maruvin thaathanude\nThirumaarvu vittoru - manuvelanu\nJayamangalham nithya shubha mangalham (2)\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n3. Dharanhiyithilelhiyoru naranaayi - bethlem\nPuriyil thiruvavathaaram cheythavanu\nParichodu panthiruvarodu yooda nagarikalhil\nThirumozhikal pozhinjoru - manuvelanu\nJayamangalham nithya shubha mangalham (2)\n\n4. Kushtarogangalheyum pottiya kanhkalheyum\nMattu pala deenamulhoreyum\nMuttum sukhamaakki mrithyuvannorkalheyum\nPettennuyirppicha manuvelanu\nJayamangalham nithya shubha mangalham (2)\n\n5. Ghanapeedapoondavanu kaalvarhiyil marichavanu\nDinammunnil uyirthezhunnu vanna paranu\nKanakathalamezhunnu pithruvalamamarnnu madhyasthatha\nKanivodu cheyunna - manuvelanu\nJayamangalham nithya shubha mangalham (2)\n\n6. Kaahalhangal dhwanicheedave meghaagni jwalicheedave\nVegamodu doothaganham paanjuvarave\nLokaavasaanamathil meghangalhil kodi\nSooryanepollevarum manuvelanu\nJayamangalham nithya shubha mangalham (2)\n\n7. Shathruvaam saathane kettivarinjaazhaththil\nIttadachu mudrayathu veukkunnavanu\nIdharaye puthuthaakki bhaktharodingaayiramaandu-\nUththamamaai vaazhunna manuvelanu\nJayamangalham nithya shubha mangalham (2)\n\n8. Paramasutharaayorkkum paaridamadakkiyum\nParama shaalempuri paarithilirhakkiyum\nParama santhoshangalh paarithil varuththiyum\nParichodu vaazhunna - manuvelanu\nJayamangalham nithya shubha mangalham (2)\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(Yusthus Youseph)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0055": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0055-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0055-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Yeshu mahonnathanay ninakku\nSthothramundaaka enneykkumaamen\n\n1. Neecharaam njangalhey veendiduvaan\nVaana lokam vedinjodivannu\nThaanhunaraakruthi poondathiney\nKaanhuvaan nee kripa cheiyyenhamey\n\n2. Vaanasènaadikalhin sthuthiyum\nAanandamaam swarggabhaagyamathum\nHeenaraayidumee njangalhudey\nOonamakattuvaanaay vedinju\n\n3. Bhoothalam chutti nee sancharichu\nPaapikalheyarikey vilhichu\nNeethiyin maarggamellaam urachu\nVèdana yettavum nee sahichu\n\n4. Paapanivaaranhanaaya ninmèl\nPaapamashevuméttu kondu\nPaapa belikku nin chorachinthi\nPaarinmadhye maraththi marichu\n\n5 Eeyupakaaramentey manassil\nRaappakalorthu ninnodanhanju\nLoka yimbangalhey thallhiduvaan\nNee kripacheika dinam prathimel\n  (T.J. Varkey)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0056": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0056-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0056-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Vandanam Yeshu paraa Ninakkennum vandanam Yeshu para\nVandanam cheiyunnu ninnadiyaar thiru naamaththin aadaravaai\n\n1. Innu nin sannidhiyil\nAdiyaarkku vannucheruvathinaay\nThanna nin unnathamaam\nKripakkabhi vandanam cheitheedunney\n\n-vanda...\n\n2. Nin rudhiramathinaal\nPrathishtichcha jeeva puthuvazhiyaay\nNinnadiyaarku Pithaa\nVin sannidhou vannidaamey sathatham.\n\n-vanda...\n\n3. Ithra mahathwamullha\nPadaviyé ppuzhukalhkarulhaan\nPaathrathayethumilla\nNintey kripayethra vichithramaho\n\n\n-vanda...\n\n4. Vaanadootha ganhangal\nManohara gaanangalhaalsathatham\nOonamenyé pukazhthi\nSthuthikkunna vaanavaney ninakku\n\n-vanda...\n\n5. Mannaril mannavan nee\nManukoolaththinnu rakshaakaran nee\nMinnum prabhaavam ullhon\nPithaavinnu sannibhan neeyallayo\n\n\n-vanda...\n\n6. Neeyozhike njangalkku\nSuralokey aarullhu jeevanaadha\nNeeyozhike ihaththil\nMattarumillaagrahippaan paraney\n\n\n-vanda...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(P.V. Thommi)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0057": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0057-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0057-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Tune: I feel like singing\n1. Karthaaviney naam sthuthikka\nHey! Daivamakkalhey\nSanthoshaththil naam arpikka\nSthothraththin beliyé\nNaam sthothram sthothram Sthothram kazhikka\nSthothram sthothram naam sthrothram kazhikka\n\n2. Vishuddha sneha bandhaththaal\nOrey shareeramaai\nNaam chèrkkappettath- aakayaal\nChèruvin sthuthikkaai\n\n\n\n-naam...\n\n3. Pithaavu èkajaathanay\nNamukku thannallo\nHaa snèhaththin agaathamey\nNinney aaraayamo?\n\n\n\n-naam...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n4. Naam priyapetta makkalhaai\nVilhichchapèkshippaan\nThan aathmaavey achchaaramaai\nNamukku nalki thaan\n\n\n\n-naam...\n\n5. Ethen thôttam polithaa ôr\nThan vachangalhaam\nVishishta phalam sarvvadaa\nIshtam pol bhakshikkaam\n\n\n\n-naam...\n\n6. Ee lokaththin chinthaakulam\nDaivaashritharkkilla\nThan paithangalhin aavashyam\nThaan karuthum sadaa\n\n\n\n-naam...\n\n7. Karththaavin naamam nimiththam\nAneka kashtavum\nNèridumbozhum dhanyar naam\nIlloru nashtavum\n\n\n\n\n-naam...\n\n8. Ee vithakkunna kaalam naam\nChilappolh karayum\nPithaavo kannhuneerellaam\nthudachchukalhayum\n\n\n\n-naam...\n\n9. Than nithya raajyam nalkuvaan\nPithaavi nishtamaai\nThan mukhaththin munbaakey thaan\nNirththum than sthuthikkaai\n\n\n-naam...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(V. Nagal)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0058": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0058-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0058-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Sthothram shree manuvelane!\n\nMama jeevane! Maheshane!\n\n1. Paarthalaththil - parishrayamaai\nPaaril vanna naadhane!\nMama jeevane! Maheshane!  -sthothram…\n\n2. Aadipithaa-vothiyathaam\nAadi veda naadame!\nMama jeevane! Maheshane!  -sthothram…\n\n3. Maanavasammanithane!\nMaananeeya roopane!\nMama jeevane! Maheshane!  -sthothram…\n\n4. Saadaramo - doothaganam\nGeetham paadi vaazhtheedum\nMama jeevane! Maheshane!  -sthothram…\n\n5. Jeevakrupaa - jalam choriyum\nJeevasaara meghame\nMama jeevane! Maheshane!  -sthothram…\n\n6. Swantha raktham chinthiyenne\nHantha veendeduththathaal\nMama jeevane! Maheshane!  -sthothram…\n\n7. Marthyajanaam bhrithyanu nin\nNithya jeevanekiya\nMama jeevane! Maheshane!  -sthothram…\n\n8. Raajasuthaa! Poojithane!\nRaaja raajaneshuve!\nMama jeevane! Maheshane!  -sthothram…\n\n9. Thaavakamaam - naamamaho\nBhaavaneeyamaam sadaa\nMama jeevane! Maheshane!  -sthothram…\n\n(K.V. Simon)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0059": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0059-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0059-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 2, "tune": 2, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0059-malayalam-1.jpg", "choir/KK-0059-malayalam-2.jpg"], "manglish": "Sthothram cheyyum njan ennum rakshithaave\nMaathram vaazhthum njaanennum\n\n\n\nPaathramallathulhlha chelhlhaamadiyane\nPaarthivane! Ninkal chertha kripakkayi\n-sthothram…\n\n1. Mannavan daaveedin suthane!\nVannudicha mannanaam maanuvelaa (3)\nSannaahamodennum Sannidhou paaduvaan\nUnnathane! Enne Ninnilai kaakkenham\n\n\n\n\n-sthothram…\n\n2. Athishayamulhlhavane!\nAthiratta anugraha vaaridhiye (3)\nAdhipanaam yeshuve! Akhilesha nandanaa!\nAkhilarh naayakane! Akhilaanda karthaave!\n\n\n\n\n\n-sthothram…\n\n3. Adiyaane veendavane!\nAdimaye modiyil theerthavane (3)\nJadathil kudikollhum  Adiyaane ninnude\nKodikkeezhil naalhthorhum jayathode kaakkenham\n\n\n\n\n\n-sthothram...\n\n\n                (Mullassheri John Easow)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0060": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0060-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0060-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Sthothram enneshu paraa!\nNin naamathe\nMaathram  pukazhthunnu njaan\n\n1.Aarthikalh theerthenne\ncherthiduvaanayi\nPaarthalam thannil vanna Karthavine -\nMaathram pukazhthunnu njan\n\n\n\n\n\n-sthothram…\n2. Jeevane nee eni-\nkkai vedinjennude\nJeevane veendathine ninachu –\nNin naamam pukazhthunnu njan\n\n\n\n\n\n-sthothram…\n3. Paavanaloke en\njeevaneyum kondu\nRaappakal vaanhidunna Sarvesha!\nNin naamam pukazhthunnu njan\n\n\n\n\n\n-sthothram…\n4. Jeevane neeyennil\nraappakal nalki nin\nAaviyaal kaathidunna Kripaalo\nNin naamam pukazhthunnu njan\n\n\n\n\n\n-sthothram…\n5. Thaatha suthaathmana-\nnaarathavum sthuthi\nneethiyin suryane! Nee\nprakaashamai vaanhidukennil sadaa\n\n\n-sthothram...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(T.J. Varkey)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0061": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0061-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0061-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Sthothram Yeshuvey! Sthothram Yeshuvey! Ninney -\nMaathram nanniyodey ennum Vaazhthi paadum njaan\n\n1. Daasanaamentey\nNaashamakattaan\nNara vèsham aayavatharichcha\nDaiva Jaathaney\n\n-stho...\n\n2. Paapaththinudey\nShaapa shikshayaam\nDaiva kôpatheeyil ventherinja\nJeeva naathaney\n\n-stho...\n\n3. Shathruvaam enney\nNin puthranaakkuvaan\nEnnil chèrththa nin kripaikkanantham\nSthothram Yeshuvey\n-stho...\n\n\n4. Aarththikalh theertha\nKarunhaa samudramey\nNinney sthothram cheivaanenney ennum\npaathranaakkuka\n\n-stho...\n\n5. Jeeva naathaney\nDeva nandana\nNintey jeevanennnil thannathinaai\nSthothram Yeshuvey!\n-stho...\n\n6. Naasha lokaththil\nDaasanaamenney\nSalpra – kaashamaainadaththeedènham\nYeshu naathaney\n\n-stho...\n\n(P.V. Thommi)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0062": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0062-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0062-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 2, "tune": 2, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0062-malayalam-1.jpg", "choir/KK-0062-malayalam-2.jpg"], "manglish": "Yeshunaadha! Nin Kripaykkai Sthothramennekkum\n\n\n\n\nEeshane nin naamamente kleshamakattum\n - yeshu…\n1. Naashamayanayorennil\nJeevanarulhaan - van\nKrooshine vahichapa-\nMaanam sahicho...ru\n-yeshu…\n\n2. Paavanamaam neethiyil njaa-\nNennumirippan - ninte\nJeevaniloramshameni-\nKkekiyathaal\n\n-yeshu…\n\n3. Nin hridayam thannilenne\nMunkurhichappolh\nEn jananam thanneyum njaa-\nnennarhinjille\n\n-yeshu…\n\n4. Than jadashareeramaranham\nNimitham nee\nNin pithaavodennenira-\nppichathumoolam\n\n-yeshu…\n\n5. Ethrakaalam ninkripaye\nVyardhamaakki njaan\nAthra naalhumandhakaaram\nThannilirunnen\n\n-yeshu…\n\n6. Jeevalathayaaya ninnil\nNjan nilanilpaan - ninte\nJeevarasam ennilennum\nThannu paalikka\n\n-yeshu…\n\n7. Vishrama deshaththilee njaa-\nneththum vareykkum - ninte\nVishrutha kripakalhenne\nPinthudarenham\n\n-yeshu…\n\n(K.V. Simon)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0063": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0063-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0063-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Parishudhdha paraney sthuthi ninakku – sura\nLokam vittavaney sthuthi ninakku\n\nThirumanassaalee dharayil vannoney\n\nKarunhakadaley - sthuthi ninakku\n\n1. Periya shathruvinaal naraganhamaakey\nKarakandeeduvathi-nnariyaa they\nThirinju vazhi vedinju nadannuvalanjeedunna-\ntharhinju than thiru manam kaninjoney\n\n2. Neethiyin sooryaa nikhileshaa\nNin thrippaadamallaathoru gathiyèthô\nBhoothaladurithangalhakhila vum shirasil nee-\nChumannozhichchathiney njaan maravèno?\n\n3. Paapiyin belamey manuvèlaa\nThannil chaaridunnavarodanukoola\nKôpaththeeyathil veenhu muzhukaathey enney\nKaaval cheitheeduka dinam thôrum\n\n4. Periya shathruvinaal narakaagni - kkida\nVaruvathinnidayaay vannidaathey\nArumarakshakaney thirukripayaalenney\nParishudhdhanaakki nin padam chèrkka\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(T.J. Varkey)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0064": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0064-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0064-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Aadukalhkku vendi jeevane vedinjathaam\nDevaattinkuttiye! Ninakkanantha vandanam\n\n2. Kaaduneelhe odi aadaloduzhaneedum\nKunjaadukalkk-abhayamaam nin paadam vandanam\n\n3. Bheethi pokki aadukalkku mun-nadannu nee sam-\nPreethiyai nadatheedum kripakku vandanam\n\n4. Pachamechilum prashaanthathoyavum sadaa - nee\nVeezhchayenye tharunnathorthu vandanam\n\n5. Thaathaputhranaam thriyekadaivame - sar-\nvaathmanaa ninakkanantha keerthanam sadaa\n(T.J. Varkey)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0065": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0065-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0065-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Paramadayaalo! Paadam vandaname\nPaalayadevaa! Paadam vandaname\n\n1. Paadaaravindame-parane! Gathiye\nPaalayamaam parameshakumaara!-\nPaalayadevaa! Paadam vandaname\n\n2. Lokarakshaakara! Shokanivaaranhaa!\nAakulamaakave pokkum sarveshaa\n\n\n\n\n-paalaya…\n3. Aadhaaramattavarkk-aalambaname!\nAananda daayakane! Manuvela!\n\n\n\n\n\n-paalaya…\n4. Neethiyin sooryane! Karunhaakarane\nAadiyanaadiyen thaathanum neeye\n\n\n\n\n-paalaya…\n5. Thaatha suthaathmane! Parikeerthaname\nPaathamathil panhiyunnaham aamen\n\n\n\n\n-paalaya...\n(T.J. Varkey)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0066": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0066-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0066-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Tune: When Johnny comes marching home again\n\nJeevaney en jeevaney namo namo (2)\nPaapikalhkkamithaananda\nPradanaam kripaakara! - Nee\nVaa vaa vaanor vaazhthum naayaka – njangalhil vaa..\n\n1. Paapa naasha kaaranha namo namo (2)\nPaarithil naranaayudichu  Paraa paraporulhey! Nee\nVaa vaa vaanor vaazhthum naayaka – njangalhil vaa..\n\n2. Sarvaloka naayaka namo namo (2)\nJeevanatavaril kaninja-Niramaya varada - nee\nVaa vaa vaanor vaazhthum naayaka – njangalhil vaa..\n\n3. Jeeva jaala paalaka namo namo (2)\nDivya kaanthiyil shobhichandhatha Maattum bhaaskara - Nee\nVaa vaa vaanor vaazhthum naayaka – njangalhil vaa..\n\n4. Mannavendra saadaram namo namo (2)\nManu kulaththi neevaliya rakshanalkiya daayapara - Nee\nVaa vaa vaanor vaazhthum naayaka – njangalhil vaa..\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(T.J. Varkey)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0067": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0067-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0067-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Ennodullha Nin sarvva Nanmakalhkaayi njaan\nEnthu cheyyendu Ninak Yeshuparaa - ippolh\nEnthu cheyyendu Ninak Yeshuparaa\n\n2. Nanni kondentey ullham Nanney nirayunna\nSannaahamodey sthuthi paadidunnen – Deva\nSannaahamodey sthuthi paadidunnen\n\n3. Paapaththil ninnu enney  kôriyeduppaanaai\nShaapa shikshakalhetta Dèvaathamaja – mahaa\nShaapa shikshakalhetta Dèvaathamaja\n\n4. Enney anpodu dinam Thorum nadaththunna\nPonnidayan anantham vandanamey – entey\nPonnidayan anantham vandanamey\n\n5. Anthyam vareyummenney Kaaval cheitheeduvaan\nAnthikeyullha mahal shakthi neeyé – Naatha\nAnthikeyullha mahal shakthi neeyé\n\n6. Thaathan sannidhiyilen  Pèrkku sadaa paksha\nVaadam cheyyunna mama jeevanaatha – paksha\nVaadam cheyyunna mama jeevanaatha\n\n7. Kuttam koodaathey enney Thejassin munbaakey\nMuttum niruththaankazhivullhavaney – enney\nMuttum niruththan kazhivullhavaney\n\n8. Mannidaththil adiyan Jeevikkum naalhennum\nVandanam cheyyun thiru naamaththinu – Devaa\nVandanam cheyyun Thiru naamaththinu\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(P.V. Thommi)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0068": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0068-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0068-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Paramapithave! Vandanam - paahimaam deva\n\nParamapithaave! Vandanam…\n1. Suraloka senakalhaal - oru maathra ilhavenye\nThirunaamam vaazhtheedunnathorupollettiruneedum\n\n-parama…\n\n2. Sakaleshanaaya ninte - vilayerum vachanathaal\nAkhilam srishticha ninnil abhayam choleedunnaham\n\n-parama...\n\n3. Thiruveda velichamee - nararil prakaashipichu\nParipaalichirunidum - paramonnathanaakunna\n\n\n-parama…\n\n4. Durithavaaridhi neenthi - karakaanhaathuzhalunna\nNarare veendukolhvaanai - thirumakaneththunnoru\n\n-parama…\n\n5. Oruvanum nashikkathe - thirivinennallaippozhum\nArumayodarucheyvaan - paramaathmadaanam cheytha\n\n-parama…\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(T.J. Varkey)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0069": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0069-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0069-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Vaazhthuka nee maname - en parane -\nVaazhthuka nee maname…\n\n1.Vazhthuka than shudhanaamathe perththu\nPaarthivan thannupakaaratheyorthu\n\n-vaazhthuka...\n\n2. Ninnakrithyam paranokkeyum pokki\nThinnhamaai rogangal neekki nannakki\n\n-vaazhthuka...\n\n3. Nanmayaal vaaykkavan thripthiyethannu\nNavyamaakkunnu nin youvanaminnu\n\n-vaazhthuka...\n\n4. Makkalhil kaarunhyam thaathanennonham\nBhaktharil vaalsalyavaanavan noonam\n\n-vaazhthuka…\n\n5. Pullinu thulyamee jeevitham vayalil\nPoovennapolayyo pokunnu thulavil\n\n-vaazhthuka…\n\n6. Than niyamangalhe kaathidunnorkkum\nThannude daasarkkum than dayakaattum\n-vaazhthuka…\n\n7. Nithyaraajaavinorkkukil sarvva\nSrishtikalhum sthuthikkunna yahova\n\n-vaazhthuka…\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(K.V. Simon)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0070": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0070-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0070-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Paadi sthuthimaname! Paranekondaadi sthuthidinavum - parane\n\n\n\nAadukalhkkai thirujeevan vedinjoru\n\n\nKedilla devakunjaadine vaazhthi nee\n\n-paadi…\n\n1. Anthmilla dayavaan avanude santhathikalkku modaal\nChinthiyathaam thirurakthathinaalavan\nSanthaapam neekki santhosham nalkunnathinu\n\n\n-paadi…\n\n2. Mrithyuvine jayicha - nisthulyanaam karthaadhi karthanavan\nMarthyarkkamarthyatha nalki pramodamai\nSathyaathma daanam cheythoru dayaaluve!\n\n\n-paadi…\n\n3. Swargeeya gaathradharan - nararkku sanmaargam thuranna paran\nDukhangalhaake neekkidum sarveshwaran\nSwargamee bhoomiyillakkiya naadhanu\n\n\n\n-paadi…\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(P.V. Thommi)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0071": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0071-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0071-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Vandanam Vandanam naadha!\nNinte rakhshaykai\n\n- vandanam\n\n1. Unnathathil ninnum enne prathi\nMannil vanna naadhane\n-vandanam…\n\n2. Nanniyode innu ninte daasan\nVannikunne mannane\n-vandanam…\n\n3. Shathruvaaya enneyorthu ninte\nPuthranaakki theerthathaal  -vandanam…\n\n4. Ente naamam jeevapusthakathil\nCherthathine orthitha\n-vandanam…\n\n5. Enthumodam ente andarange\nSanthatham vilaseedunnu\n-vandanam...\n\n\n\n\n(P.V. Thommi)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0072": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0072-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0072-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Manuvelaa ninakku vandanam anantha keerthanam parane!\n\n\nKaninju nin manamurukienne nin kamaniyakkiyathorthu\n- manuvela…\n\n1. Orikkalum ninne pirinjirippathinenikku sangathiyaruthe ninte\nThirumukham kandenn-akamalaralinjeedunnu neethiyin kathire!\n\n-manuvela…\n\n2. Maranhavishathe ruchicha neeyenne maranhathilninnu vidarthi ninte\nParamaneethiyin avakaasham thannittamara lokathil kadathi\n\n-manuvela…\n\n3. Ethiriyin nukaththadiyodichenikathi swathanthratha nalki - ninte\nPuthu manassine dharichu santhatham vasippan vathichathorthu\n-manuvela…\n\n4. Karunha niranja karathaalenne nin karalhinodettamanhachu - nithyam\nAriganhangalhin sharanirakalhe akatti ashleshichidunnu\n\n\n-manuvela…\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(T.J. Varkey)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0073": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0073-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0073-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Paa-dum parama rakshakaneshuve! - daasan\n\nNinakku sathatham sthuthi - paa-dum\n\nVaadum paapiyamenne thedi vannavanekkond-\nAadi sthuthichu nrithamaadikkond-imbamode\n\n-paadum…\n\n1. Sankadangal akhilavum ninkalettu kondu\nShankakoodathe nee mama pankashokam theerppaan\nChankile choraye chinthi ninkalanhachu kondenne\nPon karathinaal thazhumen kanhavane njan ennum\n-paadum…\n\n2. Andhakaaralokathil ninn-andhanamenne nin\nAnthike anhachen manasanthaapam akatti\nChantham chinthunna ninnude swantharoopamaakkeeduvaan\n\nNin thiru jeevan pakarnnu santhatham nadathukayaal\n-paadum…\n\n3. Unnathan valamamarum mannavane! Ninnil\nNinnuyarum divyakaanthi ennil koode loke\nNanne shobhipathinaayi mannilenne vechathorthu\nNanniyalulham niranju sannahamode ninakku\n\n-paadum…\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(P.V. Thommi)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0074": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0074-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0074-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Vaazhthidunnu vaazhthidunnu vazhthidunnu njaan\nEn rakshakaney nanniyodey vaazhthidunnu njaan\n\n2. Maattin thozhuththil piranna maanya suthaney\nHeena vesham eduththa ninney vaazhthidunnu njaan\n\n3. Paathakarkkaai neethi vazhi ôthi thannoney\nPaaridaththil ninney orthu vaazhthidunnu njaan\n\n4. Kurisheduththu malamukhalhil nadannu poyoney\nThrippaadam randum chumbichippolh vaazhthidunnu njaan\n\n5. Kurishilèri marichuyarththu swarggey poyoney\nNithyam jeevikkunnavaney vaazhthidunnu njaan\n\n6. Dootharumaai meghavaahaney varunnoney\nVègam ninné kaanhmathinaai kaaththidunnu njaan\n\n7. Nin varavil munnanhiyil ninnidumey njaan\nVaazhthi vaazhthi ninnidumey nin varavinaai\n\n8. Ennu meghey vannu kaanhaam rakshakaney njaan\nNokki nokki kaaththidunney nin varavinaai", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0075": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0075-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0075-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Sarva loka srishtaavaakum sarvvaththinum Naathaa!\nSarva srishtikalhum vaazhthi vandikkum Maheshaa!\n\nVaazhththidunnu vaazhthidunnu nanniyodadiyaar\nKeerthikkunnu ghoshikkunnu aarththumôdamodey\n\n2. Ennhamillaa doothasangham vaazhthidunna Devaa\nKherbikalhum sraafikalhum pukazhththum Mahesha!\n\n-vaazhththidunnu…\n\n\n3. Vaanam bhoomi soorya Chandra nakshathraadikalhey\nMaanamaai chamachcha Deva! Naathaney! Mahesha!\n\n-vaazhththidunnu…\n\n\n4. Jeevanullha sarvaththinum bhakshanham nalkunna\nJeevanaathaa Deva Deva! Paahimaam Mahesha!\n\n-vaazhththidunnu…\n\n5. Vriksha sasyaadikalhkkellaam bhangiyey nalkunna\nAkshayanaam Deva Deva! Paahimaam Mahesha!\n\n-vaazhththidunnu…\n\n\n6. Gambheeradhwanam muzhukum vanpichcha samudram\nSaambratham Nin vaakkinangu keezhppedum Mahesha!\n-vaazhththidunnu…\n\n\n7. Oottamaayadikkum kodunkaattineyum Thantey\nShreshta karam thannil vahichchidunna Mahesha!\n\n-vaazhththidunnu…\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n8. Dushtaraakum janangalhkkum neethiyullhavarkkum\nVrishtiyum veyilum nalkum unnathaa! Mahesha!\n\n\n-vaazhththidunnu…\n\n9. Swargaththilum bhoomiyilum sarvva lokangalhilum\nSthothraththinu yogyanaaya keerthimaan Mahesha!\n\n-vaazhththidunnu…\n\n\n10. Moovulakam Nintey paadam thannil vanhangeedum\nNin mahathwam velhippedum aa dinam Mahesha!\n\n-vaazhththidunnu…", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0076": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0076-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0076-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Paahimamaam jagadeeshwaraa - bhakthapriyaa!\n\nKaaline panhiyunnaham…\n\nLokathilee drishyam kaanhum charaacharam\nAakave srishticha naadha! Jaya! Jaya!\n\n\n-paahi…\n\n1. Aakasham bhoomiyathum aho! Nallo-\n-rathidhya chandranmaarum…\nThungaabha poondidum nakshathra jaalavum\nBhangiyil srishticha naadha! Jaya! Jaya!\n\n\n-paahi…\n\n2. Uthunga shailangalum nadikalu-\n-methhum prabhaavamode…\nDehikalkkennum-upakaaramaam vannham\nAhantha! Srishticha naadha! Jaya! Jaya!\n\n\n-paahi…\n\n3. Srishti vilaasamitham - pukazhthuvan\nVishtapeyilloruvan…\nSrishtiyennallaho! Samsthithiyennathum\nShreshtamai cheythoru naadha jaya! Jaya!\n\n-paahi…\n\n4. Paapakoopaththil ninni-ttennne nithyam\nPaalaya! Karunhaalaya…\nAapathakhilavum sarveshaa! Pokkiyen\nThaapathe theerthu rakshika maam daivame\n\n-paahi…", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0077": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0077-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0077-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Devanu sadaa jaya mangalam shubham\n\nDevanu sadaa bhavathu mangalam…\n\n1. Vaanavum-ihalokavum-athilullhathakhilavum\nOonamenye srishticha thaathanam\n\n-devanu…\n\n2. Paapathimira neethimihiranaayanu saranham\nPoorthiyaakkuvaan vanna puthranaam\n\n-devanu…\n\n3. Paapavazhiye vittozhivathinai naranu sadaa\nPaapabodham nalkunnoraathmavam\n\n-devanu…\n\n4. Naakabhavanathinkal-akhilamarthyaranhayuvaan\nNannayichchikkum ekathrayiyaam\n\n-devanu…", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0078": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0078-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "AMBIGUOUS"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0078-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 2, "tune": 1, "kind": "CONTINUATION"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0078-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Tune: I will sing of my redeemer\n1. Enne veenda rakshakente\nSneham aarkkurakkkaam\nRaktham eeshan chorinjente\nKadam veetti elaam\n\nPaadume… jayageetham\n\nAayussin naalhennum\n\nYeshuvin mahaasneham\n\nEnnude nithyaanandam\n\n2. Nithyajeevan thannennulhil\nEeshan swabhaavavum\nSwanthaathmave pakarnennil\nNiravaam snehavum\n-paadume…\n\n3. Thaathan punchiri thookunnu\nThan makanaam enmel\nAbba! Pithaave! Ennangu\nEnvilhi inimel\n\n-paadume…\n\n4. Lokam keezhmel marinjaalum\nEnikilla bhayam\nThira marinjalachaalum\nYeshu en sanketham\n-paadume…\n\n5. Seeyon laakkai gamikkunnu\nAashrayicheshuvil\nKarthan sugantham thookunnu\nVaishamya vazhiyil\n\n-paadume…\n\n6. Yeshuve! Nin thirunaamam\nHa ethra madhuram!\nBhoovil illathinu thulyam\nChevikkinpa swaram\n-paadume…\n\n7. Doothanaavaal polumaakaa\nThan mahaathmyam chollaan\nIppuzhuvodundo ithra\nSneham athbutham than\n-paadume…", "qaStatus": "REVIEW", "qaIssues": ["NO_CLEAR_TUNE_START"]}, "KK-0079": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0079-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0079-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. En aathmaave! Vaazhthuka nee, ninnudey Karthaaviney\nThan upakaarangalh onnum - Ennumey marakkola\nNin akruthyangalh okkeyum - Santhatham mochichu nin\nRogamellaam maatti ninney Soukhyamaakkidunnu Thaan.\n\n2. Jeevaney naashathil ninnu - Veendeduthu ninney Thaan\nKaarunhyangalhaal kireeda dhaaranham cheyyunnavan\nNanmayaal naalhthorumey Nee unhmayil triptanaai nin\nYauvvanam kazhukanepol - Puthuthaakkunnu nithyam\n\n3. Sarvaththinumaai sthuthikka Daivamaam Pithaaviney\nKarthan nallon, Than karunha - Nithyamaayullhathathrey\nThannudey vazhikalhellaam - Unnatham ennaakilum\nThan priyamakkalhku sarvam - Nanmayaai vanneedumey", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0080": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0080-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0080-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Yeshunaayaka! Shreeshaa! Namo namo\nNaashavaaranhe! Swamin namo namo\nMoshapoojitha roopa! Namo namo\nMahee paatha!...\n2. Maanuvelane! Paahi namo namo\nMaanavasuthavarya! Namo namo\nDeenavalsala! Kristho namo namo\nDinamaake…\n3. Kushtaroga vinaasha! Namo namo\nThushti nalkumenneesha namo namo\nShishtapaalaka! Vande! Namo namo\nDivyapeeda…\n4. Panchapoopa pradaana! Namo namo\nSanjithaadhikapoonhyaa namo namo\n\nAnjithaananayuktha namo namo\nParameede....\n5. Aazhimel nadannone namo namo\nSheshiyattavarkkeesha! Namo namo\nOozhimel varum naadha! Namo namo\nThozhukaiyaay...\n6. Pesaha bhujichone! Namo namo\nChora neerviyarththone namo namo\nMeryaalabhishiktha namo namo\nMathimaane…\n7. Swasthikaavidhadehaa namo namo\nDustharakshana sheelaa namo namo\nShasthamasthuthe nithyam namo\n          Namo bahubhooyaal...\n(K.V. Simon)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0081": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0081-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0081-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Daivaththinu sthothram Daivaththinu sthrothram\nDaivaththinu sthrothram Innum ennekum\n\n-entey...\n\n2. Kaalvari malayil krushil marichchoru\nRakshakanu sthothram innum ennekum\n\n-entey...\n\n3. Paapa bhaarathil ninnenney rakshichchoru\nDaivaththinu sthothram innum ennekum\n\n-entey...\n\n4. Aathma shakthiyaaley ullham nirachchoru\nDaivaththinu sthothram innum ennekum\n\n-entey...\n\n5. Rogashayyayilen koodey irikkunna\nDaivaththinu sthothram innum ennekum\n\n-entey...\n\n6. Kshaamakaalaththenné Kshemamaay potunna\nDaivaththinu sthothram innum ennekum\n\n-entey...\n\n7. Drishti entemel vechchishtamaai nokunna\nDaivaththinu sthothram innum ennekum\n\n-entey…\n\n8. Oro naalhum entey bhaaram chumakkunna\nDaivaththinu sthothram innum ennekum\n\n-entey...\n\n9. Shathrukalh munbaakey mesheyorukkunna\nDaivaththinu sthothram innum ennekum\n\n-entey...\n\n10. Vankripayilenney inneyolham kaaththa\nDaivaththinu sthothram innum ennekum\n\n-entey...\n\n11. Ellaaroganghalkum nalla vaidyanaaya\nDaivaththinu sthothram innum ennekum\n\n-entey...\n\n12. Kannhuneer thoogumbol manasaliyunna\nDaivaththinu sthothram innum ennekum\n\n-entey...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(A.K. Kurien)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0082": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0082-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0082-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 2, "tune": 2, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0082-malayalam-1.jpg", "choir/KK-0082-malayalam-2.jpg"], "manglish": "Deva devanu mangalham\n\nMahonnathanam\n\nDeva devanu mangalham\n1. Devadootharaakaashe\nDivyageethangal paadi\nKevalaanandathode-\nMevi sthuthi cheyunne\n-deva…\n\n2. Sakala lokangalhile\nSarvaganhangalheyum\nSukhamudane chamachu\nSakala naalhum paalikkum\n-deva…\n\n3. Naraganhangalinnathi-\nDurithamozhippaanayi-\nThirumakane naranaai\nDharanhiyinkal ayacha\n-deva…\n\n4. Paapabodham varuththi\nPaapiye shudhamaakkaan\nPaavanaathmaave nalkum\njeevajalaashayamaam\n-deva…\n\n5. Aadaravodu thante\nVedavelhivu manu-\njaathikalhkkarulhiya -\naadinaadhanaakunna\n-deva…\n\n\n\n(Yusthus Youseph)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0083": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0083-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0083-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Tune: Glory to His name\n\n1. Paapaththin van vishaththey ozhippaan\nSaaththaan thannudey bela mazhippaan\nRakshakan eekshithiyil vannaal Yeshuvinu mahaththwam!\n\nYeshuvinu mahathwam! Mahathwam Yeshuvinu mahathwam\n\nKurishilavan marichen pèrkkaai - Yeshuvinu mahathwam\n\n2. Aashayatten sthithi thaanarinju\nEesha kôpaagniyil veenherinju\nVishudhdha ninham viyarppaai thirinju\n\n-Yeshuvinu mahathwam!\n\n3. Than mukha pankaja mathiladichchu\nMulhmudi thalayil vechchaanjadichchu\nMuthukine uzhuthathupol thakarththu\n\n-Yeshuvinu mahathwam!\n\n4. Krooshil kaikaalkalhey thaan virichchu\nKrooranmaar aanhi kalhathil tharachchu\nKodiya vèdana yenikkaai sahichchu\n\n-Yeshuvinu mahathwam!\n\n5. Chorinju than thiru ninham en beliyaai\nNurungi en paapaththaaleshuvin mei\nThakarnnu than hridayam en pèrkkaai\n\n-Yeshuvinu mahathwam!\n\n6. Yeshuvin sneha vishèsha mathin\nAashayam harichchaal enikkathu thèn\nShaashwatha bhaagyamenikkathinaal\n\n-Yeshuvinu mahathwam!\n\n7. Jeevaney Yeshuvinarppichchen\nSarvvavu mavannaayèlpichchen\nPaavanajeevitha maakanhamen\n\n\n-Yeshuvinu mahathwam!\n\n8. Maranham nèridumalhavil thaan\nSharanham thannudey maarvil njaan\nViravodanhayum kripayaaley\n\n\n-Yeshuvinu mahathwam!", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0084": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0084-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0084-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Ennalhum sthuthikanham naam naadhane\n\n\nEnnalhum sthuthikkanham naam…\n\n\nVandanam paadi mannam munkoodi\n\nMandathayakannu thirumunnilabhayamirunnu-\n\n1. Modamai koodukanaam paranu bahu modamai paaduak naam\nGeethaganham thedi naadhanu naam paadi\nNaadhanamavante thunaamame geethiyayi naadi-\n\nEnnalum…\n\n2. Shreshtathayin naayakanavan ninaykkil shishtagunhanaayakan\nSpashtam thirudaasarkkishtamarulhuvon\nKashtathayil ninnavare drishtanaayudharippavan-\n\nEnnalum...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n3. Thanne sthuthicheedunna janangal patham thannil pathichidunnu\nMannavamannanmar saamodam vaazhthunnu\nNanniyodavarevarumunnathane vanhangunnu\n\n\nEnnalum…\n\n4. Jeevikalhin naadhane! Jayam perukum devakalhin thaathane!\nJeevannurhavayaam jeevalokeshane!\nJeevaniyaluvaan swantha soonuve nalkiyavane!-\n\n\nEnnalum…\n\n5. Than naamakeerthanam naam thudarnnhu cheythillennum divyanandamaam\nUnnathan thannude sannidhou ninnu naam\nMannavane puthugaana vandanangalodanisham-\n\nEnnalum...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(K.V. Simon)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0085": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0085-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0085-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Parishudhdha Paraney Nirantharam sthuthippin\nPaadi than naamaam kondaadi kkumbiduvin\nThiru janangalhey! Unhareen than daasar\nThirumunbil vanhangeeduvin\n\n- enne..kum\n\n2. Naathanum namukku Thaathanum aayullha\nNalla Yahovaye ellaarum sthuthippin\nÈthum aayaasamenyey thanveettil\nÈkaney pukazhththeeduvin\n\n- enne..kum\n\n3. Nanmakkadaliney-chemmey naam sthuthichchaal\nNamukkathu mahima yennarinju kumbiduveen\nImmahaa padaviye naam ellaarum\nIshtaththodaacharikkaam\n\n\n-enne..kum\n\n4. Vaanavum paarum thaanathrey chamachchu\nVallabhan nallavan ellaariluyarnnon\nGnaanaththodey sthuthippin than pèril\nNalla keerththikalh koduppin\n\n-enne..kum\n\n5. Daiva Pithaavey! Divya Kumaara!\nDaiva Shudhaathma! Thriyèka Dèvèshaa\nSarvvakaalavum pukazhcha bhavaanu\nBhavikkenham! Halleluyya – Aa..mèn!\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(Moshavatsalam)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0086": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0086-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0086-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 3, "tune": 2, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0086-notation-3.jpg", "sourcePage": 4, "tune": 2, "kind": "CONTINUATION"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0086-malayalam-1.jpg", "choir/KK-0086-malayalam-2.jpg"], "manglish": "Sthuthi sthuthi Ninakke - ennum\ncholleeduvaan\nDoshachumadozhichu raksha thannavaney\nSthuthi sthuthi Ninakku\n\n1. Aathmavichaaram-illaathey kidannen\nArulhi unharcha bhavaan\nHaaleluiah! Haaleluiah!\n-sthuthi...\n\n2. Shaantham illaathey baadhichamanassil\nThannu santhosham bhavaan\nHaaleluiah! Haaleluiah!\n-sthuthi...\n\n3. Bhramichu njaan kidannen kripayodu neeye\nParashaanthi kalpichchu\nHaaleluiah! Haaleluiah!\n-sthuthi...\n\n4. Nanni santhosham, lajja, vismayam\nNanney nirayunnullhil\nHaaleluiah! Haaleluiah!\n-sthuthi...\n\n5. Erey pizhachu njaan Erey mochichu nee\nEnnum nin adima njaan\nHaaleluiah! Haaleluiah!\n-sthuthi...", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0087": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0087-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0087-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Rakshakane ninakku keerthanam anantham\n1. Thiruraktham chorichu thinmapetta enne nee\nParanu veendedutha maa pakshakripakalkkume!\n\n-raksha…\n\n2. Marichu njaan kidannen naarhi uruvazhinjen\nThrichuyirh shakthisukham thanna priyan yeshuve!\n-raksha…\n\n3. Kurudanai irunnen thottu kaazhcha thannu nee\nNiranja kushtapaapathe neekki shudhi nalki nee!\n\n-raksha…\n\n4. Neethi shudhibodham ninthiru nalroopam\nChethassil kalpichu thanna divya kripakkadalaam\n-raksha…\n\n5. Thirurakthathaalen thinma kuttam maayichu\nParajeeva pusthakathil ezhuthiyen naamam nee\n\n-raksha…\n\n6. Ini pizhakkathe ennum nadannee-daan\nKaninju ninnavi nithyam koode vasicheedanham\n\n-raksha…\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(Moshavatsalam)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0088": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0088-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0088-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Paadam vannikkunnen - thirukripa\n\nPaapikku dhaname!\n\n1. Paarithil thiruvedam\nArulhi bharikkum athbuthane!\nDaivasuthane! Kripaakarane!\nKristho! Thiru\n\n-paadam…\n\n2. Vaakkinnullhadangaatha\nMahathwa maalhunna mannavane!\nShakthimaane! Dayavaane!\nKristho! Thiru\n\n-paadam…\n\n3. Maanusharkkuyir nalkiya\nRakshakaa! Nayasheela!\nManuvelaa! Anukoola!\nKristho! Thiru\n\n-paadam…\n\n4. Paapam neekki shuddhaaviyaal\nUpadeshikkunnone!\nPunhyavaane! Gunhavaane!\nKristho! Thiru\n\n-paadam…\n\n5. Paadathil panhivore\nNithyavum paalikkunnone!\nSathyavaane! Nithyavaane!\nKristho! Thiru\n\n-paadam…", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0089": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0089-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0089-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Maanuvelin Sthuthiye paadiduvaan\n\nNaanhikkolaa maname -\n\n\nMaanuvel thanthiru maanase ettavum\n\n\nMaanahaani ninkkai sahichallo!\n\n-maanu…\n1. Senadootharkkavan thaan - sainyaadhipan vaanalokaadhipan thaan\nBhaanupolaakaashathinnu mel lokathil\nThaane shobhichavan thaanhu ninneprathi\n\n-maanu…\n\n2. Lokaalokangalhil thaan - vyaapichavan shokamillatha paran\nDaaham Dhukhangalhum - aere sahichu than\nDeham jeevan bali - cheythu ninne prathi\n\n-maanu…\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n3. Deepam jeevan vazhi thaan - sambaadyavum bhaavukavum avan thaan\nThaapam pareekshayum shaapam maashikshayum\nSarva vipathum sahichu ninne prathi\n\n\n-maanu…\n\n4. Anyarude sthuthi nee - chonnalapamaanamallo maname!\nThannethanne ninakkayi thannone nee\nEnnu bhakthya sthuthi cholkayallo neethi\n\n\n-maanu…\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(Moshavatsalam)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0090": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0090-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0090-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 2, "tune": 2, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0090-notation-3.jpg", "sourcePage": 3, "tune": 2, "kind": "CONTINUATION"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0090-malayalam-1.jpg", "choir/KK-0090-malayalam-2.jpg"], "manglish": "All hail the power of Jesus name\n- Edward Perronet\n1. Ellarum yeshunaamathe\nEnnekkum vaazhtheedin\nMannanai vaazhippin, doothar\n\n\nNaam vaazhtheen, vaazhtheen,\n\nVazhtheen, Vazhtheen, yeshuve!\n\n2. Yaagapeedathin keezhullha\nThan raktha saakshikalh\nPukazhtheeshaayin mulhaye\n-Naam vaazhtheen…\n\n3. Veendedutha yisrayelin\nSheshichor janame!\nVaazhtheedin rakshithaavine\n-Naam vaazhtheen…\n4. Bhoojaathi gothram aevarum\nBhoopane keerthippin!\nBahulaprabhaavan thanne\n-Naam vaazhtheen…\n5. Swarga sainyathodonnai naam\nSaashtaangam veenhidaam!\nNithya geethathil yojichu\n-Naam vaazhtheen…", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0091": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0091-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0091-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 2, "tune": 1, "kind": "CONTINUATION"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0091-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Praise Him Praise Him\n- Fanny J. Crosby\n\n1. Vaazhthin, vaazhthin Yeshu rakshakaney vaazhthin\nPaadin thantey athbhutha snehaththey!\nAarththeedunnu mahathwa Daivadoothanmaar\nkeerththippin than vishudhdha naamaththey\nThan makkalhey idayanpoley kaakkum\nthan kaikalhil vahikkunnu sadaa\n\nVaazhthin, vaazhthin, karththan maa mahathwam vaazhthin\nKeerthippin than vishudhdha naamaththey\n\n2. Vaazhthin, vaazhthin Yeshu rakshakaney vaazhthin\nPaapikalhkaai paadèttu marichchu\nKarththan paara nithya rakshayin prathyaasha\nkrushèriya Yeshuvey vaazhthideen\nKlèshamellaam sahichchathorthu sthothram,\ncheiveen, thantey athbhutha snehavum\n\n\n-vaazhthin...\n\n3. Vaazhthin, vaazhthin Yeshu rakshakaney vaazhthin\nVaanôr vaazhthin, hoshanna paaduvin\nVaazhunneshu rakshakan ennumennekum\nVaazhikka purohitha raajanaai\nLokaththeyum jayichchu varunneshu\nmaanam shakthi karththanullhathallo\n\n\n-vaazhthin...", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0092": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0092-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0092-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Sthuthi cheimanamey nithyavum nin jeeva naathaneshuvey\nIthupol swajeevan thannoraathma snehithan vèraarini\n\n-sthuthi...\n\n2. Maranhaadikaari aayirunna ghoranaam pishaachiney\nMaranhaththinaaley neekki mrithyu bheethi theertha naathaney\n-sthuthi...\n\n3. Bahumaanyanaam aachaaryanaayi vaanilavan vaazhkayaal\nBelaheenathayil kaividaathey cherthukollhum aakayaal\n\n-sthuthi...\n\n4. Dinavum manamey thathsamayam vankripakalh praapippaan\nAthi dhairyamaai kripaasanaththin anthikaththil chennu nee\n-sthuthi...\n\n5. Bahudootharuchcha naadamodey vaazhthidunna naathaney\nBelavum dhanavum gnaanamellaam sweekarippaan yogyaney\n-sthuthi...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(M.E. Cherian)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0093": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0093-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0093-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Manamey! Pukazhththeedu nee\nMahônnathan than mahima\n\n1. Marakkurishathil marippaanaai\nNara janmameduththu vanna than naamam manoharam\nAahaa than naamam manoharam\nMahaathbhutham than sneham\n\n\n-manamey...\n\n2. Behu vipaththukalhezhum bhoovil\nSnehakkaikalh neetteeyenne\nThaangum than naamam manoharam\nAahaa than naamam manoharam\nMahaathbhutham than sneham\n\n\n-manamey...\n\n3. Palakuravukalh vannaalum\nEnney thallhaathey kripayaal kaakkum than naamam manoharam\nAahaa than naamam manoharam\nMahaathbhutham than sneham\n\n\n-manamey...\n\n4. Oru nimishavum thalharaathey\nThiru maarvil vishramam thèdu than naamam manohoram\nAahaa than naamam manoharam\nMahaathbhutham than sneham\n\n\n-manamey...\n(M.E. Cherian)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0094": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0094-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0094-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Vandanam cheytheeduvin - Shree yeshuve\n\nVandanam cheytheeduvin - Nirantharam vadhanam\n\n1. Santhatham sakalarum santhosha dhwaniyil\nSthothra sangeetham paadi\n\n\n- shreeyeshu…\n\n2. Raajitha mahassezhum maamanusuthane\nRaaja sammanithane\n\n\n\n- shreeyeshu…\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n3. Kallarha thurhannu van vairiye thakarthu\nVallabhanaayavane\n\n\n\n- shreeyeshu…\n\n4. Nithyavum namukkullha bhaarangalhakhilam\nTheerthu tharunnavane\n\n\n\n- shreeyeshu…\n\n5. Bheethiyaam koorirulhakhilavum neekkum\nNeethiyin sooryanaakum\n\n\n\n- shreeyeshu…\n\n6. Paapamillatha than parishudha naamam\nPaadi sthuthicheeduvin\n\n\n\n- shreeyeshu…\n(M.E. Cherian)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0095": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0095-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0095-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Paaduvin sahajare! Koodovin kuthukarai\nTheduvin puthiya sangeethangale\n\n1. Paaduvin ponveenhakalheduthu\nSangeethangalh thudangeeduvin\nPaarilillithupoloru rakshakan\nPaapikalkk-aashrayamai\n\n\n\n\n\n-paaduvin…\n\n2. Desham deshamai thejassin suvishesha\nKaahalham muzhkkeeduvin\nYeshuraajan jayikkatte yeriho\nMathilukalh veenhidatte\n\n\n\n\n\n-paaduvin…\n\n3. Omanaputhupulariyil naam ini\nCherum than sannidhiyil\nKomalhamaam thirumukhakaanthiyil\nTheerum santhaapamellaam\n\n\n\n\n-paaduvin…\n\n4. Ee daivam innumennekkum\nNammude daivamallo\nJeevakaalam muzhuvan namme\nNalvazhiyil nadathum\n\n\n\n\n\n-paaduvin…\n\n\n\n\n(M.E. Cherian)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0096": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0096-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0096-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Paadum njaan yeshuvinu - jeevan povolham nanniyode\n\n1. Paadum njanennakathaaril anidinam vaazhum shreeyeshuvinu - oru\nKedum koodathenne paalikkum naadhane - paadisthuthikkumennum\n\n-paadum…\n\n2. Swanthajanamaaya yoodanmaare thallhi andathayil kidannu - bahu\nSanthaapathoduzhaneedum purhajaathi santhathiye veendone!\n\n\n-paadum…\n\n3. Kaattolivin shaakhayaayirunna ennil nallaphalam nirappam - avan\nVettiyinhachennenallorolivin tharu-vodanhachathu chinthichennum\n\n-paadum…\n\n4. Kanhmanhi polenne bhadramai nithyavum kaaval cheytheedamennum thante\nKannhu kondenne nadatheedaamennathum - orthadimodamode\n\n-paadum…\n\n5. Kaanthanivanathi modamode meghavaahanathil kayari - thante\nKaanthayod-ullasichaananthippanezhu-nellhunnathorthu kondum\n\n-paadum…\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(P.V. Thommi)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0097": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0097-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0097-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Paadum njan parameshanu sathatham - ente\n\n\nPaapamellaam pokkiyathaal - paadum\n\n1. Athrayumallasheervaadam okkeyum labhicheeduvaan\nAarthipoondu kaathirunna kaalamathinkal\nAarthiye theerthavane njan aarthughoshicheeduvaanen\nAarthiyarhinjavan thante vaarthayenikkekiyathaal\n\n\n-paadum…\n\n2. Dootharkkum koodavakaasham labhyamaakathullha raksha-\nDootharhiyichidaan bhagyam labhichenikku\nDoothaganham kaavalai thannanudinamenikkavan\nNoothanamaam doothukalhum oonamenye nalkeedunnu\n-paadum…\n\n3. Kashtathayo pattinhi-yupadravamo nagnathayo\nKashtametten-teshuvepolaakkeedunenne\nOttanekam sidhanmaarodothu chernnu ninnu sthuthi-\nChaarthiduvaanenne yogyanaakki theerthathorthu\n\n-paadum…\n\n4. Kaathirikkunnavane njan kandeeduvanente kanhkalh\nKothicheedunnadhikamai kuthukamode\nKaalamerhe chellum munpe kaahalha naadam kelhkuvaan\nKaathukalhum kothikunnu karunya vaaridhe! deva\n\n-paadum…\n\n5. Vaattavum maalinyavume ottumeshidaatheyullho-\nRuthamamaamavakaasham labhyamaakuvaan\nThittamaayittavanenne cherthidum manhiyarhayil\nPaattu paadum koottarumai kodi kodi yugam vaazhaan\n\n-paadum…\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(K.M. Scaria)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0098": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0098-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0098-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Vazhtheedumey Vazhtheedumey\nImmaanuvèley - En jeevakaalam\nEe kshonhithaley\n\n-Vazhthe...\n\n1. Doothar sthuthikkum naakavallabhan\nPirannu gôshaalayil\nBandhamazhichchu andhanenneyum\nBandhuvaakkiyathaal\nInnum- ennum- nannaai sthuthikkum\nNaathan Yeshuvey njaanee dharayil\n\n\n\n\n-Vazhthe...\n\n2. Paapakkadalil shaapakuzhiyil\nPidanjuneenthidavey\nPaapamakatti shaapam neekki\nMaarvilanhachchavaney\nKashtam- nashtam- sarvam èttu nin\nPinpey nin daasan nadanneedaamey\n\n\n\n\n-Vazhthe...\n\n3. Shathru thannudey agnisharangalh\nTheduththuvitteedukil\nNin aayudhangalh kaaththeedumenney\nPonnu naayakaney\nRaksha- sathyam- neethi chaarththu nee\nShakthanaakkidum sènaa naayaka\n\n\n\n\n-Vazhthe...\n\n4. Vaanamukilil dootha sanghamaai\nNaathan varumalhavil\nLôkam viraikkum lôkar bhramikkum\nNjaanannaarththeedumey\nNokki- nokki- kanhkalh mangunney\nIppolh vanneedum en praanhapriya\n\n\n\n\n-Vazhthe...\n\n(P.D. John)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0099": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0099-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0099-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Pukazhthin yeshuve pukazhtheen\n\nNaam raksha-kane ennum vazhthin\n\nPukazhtheen, pukazhtheen, pukazhtheen,\nVazhthi pukazhtheen\n\n\n\n\n\n-pukazhthin...\n\n1. Yeshuvin raa-jathvam nithyame, aadhipathyam santhathamaame\nSevikku-meyoru santhathi-varnhikkume-yavar-nin-neethi\nVarnhikkum, heenanum yeshuvin nanmayin ormaye\n\n\n-pukazhthin…\n\n2. Kripayum deerkha kshamayum mahaadayayum karunhayumullhon\nNallavan avan ellaavarkkum than pravrithikalhodum ellaam\nVanneedin vannippin yeshuvin snehamaam paade naam\n\n-pukazhthin…\n\n3. Aadyanum anthyanum vannyanum-aadijaatha-num ennum ananyanum\nSathyavum jeevanum maargavum nithyapithaavum ennude durgavum\nVilichon, vishwasthan veendum varunnava-navane\n\n\n-pukazhthin…\n\n4. Paapavum yaathoru shaapavum illini “aaye-rushalemil”\n“Shubhramaam jeevajalanadi-jayikkunnnor pankaam-jeeva vriksham”\nJayippin, irippin, kunjaattin swargasimhaasane\n\n\n\n-pukazhthin...", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0100": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0100-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0100-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Athishaya kaarunhya mahaadevaa maayoney Eesho!\nAayiram naavin varam thaa nin sthuthi paadaan\n\n1. Naayakaney! Rakshakaney nin kripaykkaayi - sthothram\nNaadarikey paadiduvaan nee thunhaykkenham naadhaa!\n\n2. Engum bahumaanamullha nin thiru naamam - Eesho!\nEn bhayangalh sankadavum neekkumennekum naadhaa!\n\n3. Imba sangeetham thirupèr paapikalhkkellaam - jeevan\nIllayennu vannavarkku Jeevan nin naamam naadha!\n\n4. Paapa kuttam shakthi yadhikaaravum neekkum Eesho!\nPaapiyaamen pèrku raktham vaartha nin punhyam - naadha!\n\n5. Nin swaraththaal kaazhcha kelhvi shakthi aarogyam - ellaam\nNishchayam paapikku kittum rakshakarthaavey naadha!\n\n6. Oomakalhey paadiduvin Andharey kaanhmin mahaa\nUnnathanaam rakshakaney vaazhthi kondaadin - nithyam\n\n7. Kodikalhaayidum swargga vaasikalhodum koodi\nPaadi Yeshunaama sthuthi njangalh kondaadum naadha!\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(Moshavatsalam)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0101": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0101-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0101-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 2, "tune": 2, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0101-notation-3.jpg", "sourcePage": 3, "tune": 3, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0101-malayalam-1.jpg", "choir/KK-0101-malayalam-2.jpg", "choir/KK-0101-malayalam-3.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Nithyavandanam ninakku sathyadaivame!\nSthothravum jayavum yogyam athyunnathane!\n\n2. Marthyakulathin srishtaave! Nithyapithaave!\nSathyavishwaasikalh cheyyum - sthothram ninakke!\n\n3. Ethrayo manoharam nin-krithikalhellaam\nChithramathi chithramiva - ethrayo shreshtam!\n\n4. Keroobukalh madhye vasikkum - sarvashakthane!\nUrhviyengum vyaapicheedum - ninkennum sthothram\n\n5. Maanavakulathin paapam - mochanam cheyvaan\nHeenamaam kurishin shaapam - theertha parane\n\n6. Thannil vishwasikkunnarkennekkum moksham\nThannarulhaan- unnathathil chernna parane!\n\n7. Sarva bahumaanam sarva mahathwam sthuthiyum\nSarveshvaranaaya yahovaykku thaan - aamen\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(Moshavatsalam)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0102": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0102-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0102-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Karunhaakaranaam parane! - sharanham\nKanivishaharane! Thirukripa sharanham\nKaatharulhka sharanham - thriyekaa\nKaralhalinjeedanhame - kripaalo\nArunhodayamarulh vadive sharanham\nAlpha omegaave! Sharanham\nArulhvaradaa! Sharanham thriyekaa!\nAashishamarulhanhame kripaalo!\nAdhipathi vedanaadha! Sharanham\nAadhikalh theerkkuka thaatha sharanham\nAthugunhane! Sharanham thriyekaa!\nAamayam neekkanhame kripaalo!\nSharanham - sharanham - sharanham naadha!\nThiru arulh chorikayi-\nThtharunham thaatha\nVaranham kripatharanham thriyekaa!\nDurithamakattanhame kripaalo!\nNithyaa! Suradevaa! Sharanham\nSthuthyan eeshomashihaa! Sharanham\nSathyaathman! Sharanham thriyekaa!\nPadhyam varamarulhka kripaalo\n\n\n\n\n(Daveed Issahak)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0103": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0103-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0103-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 2, "tune": 2, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0103-malayalam-1.jpg", "choir/KK-0103-malayalam-2.jpg"], "manglish": "1.Paradevaa swargge puradeva bahu-\nVaradevaa pankaharadevaa yeshu devaa!\n\n2. Paralokamvittu naraloke oru\nCherubaalan aaya parasoono! Yeshudeva!\n\n3. Aanandame paramaanandame - sadaa\nAanandame ninakke vandanam yeshu deva!\nNithyam\n\n4. Halleluyya pithaavinallelluyya ennum\nHalleluyya engum halleluyya - amen\n\n5. Aeloheem thirusuthan immanuvelinum\nEe lokam paralokam engum halleluyyah –\namen\n\n6. Shudhaathmaavinum nithyam halleluyyaa\nParishudhaathma devanennum halleluyya –\namen.\n       (Moshavatsalam)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0104": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0104-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0104-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Aadithya chandraadikalhe chamachavanu sthothram\nBodhichathellaam kshanathil thikachavanu sthothram\nAeden kaavil aadam havvayodum palavrindam\nModamudan srishticheytha naadhanennum sthothram\n\n2. Aadi manushyan chathivil aayathine kandu\nBheethi bhuvanathil ninnupovathinaaykkondu\nVaedaparan-neethi thikavaavathinai pandu\nKhedamozhippaan maranham jayichavanu sthothram\n\n3. Baalaganhame! Varuvin sheelamudan koodi\nKolahala vaanhikalhai haaleluyya paadi\nChelodu paadam vanangaan geethaganham thedi\nAeloheem pithaasuthanaathmavine sthuthippin\n\n4. Dootharellaam modamudan naadhanekkondaadi\nSaadaram simhasanathin naaluchuttim koodi\nThaathasuthaathmaakalhkku nalgeethangalhe paadi\nShwethavasthrangalh dharichu koodunnathu modi\n\n5. Shakthiyaal charaacharangalh okkeyum undaakki\nYukthiyaal tharaatharathil ethrayum nannakki\nBhakthiyay nadappathinu maargamonnundakki\nMukthiyil nadathunna thriyekanennum sthothram\n(Moshavatsalam)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0105": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0105-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0105-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Parama Pithaavinu sthuthi paadaam Avanallo jeevaney nalkeedunnu\nPaapangalhokkeyum kshamichcheedunnu Rôgangalhaakavey neekkidunnu\n-parama...\n\n2. Idayaneypol nammey thédi vannu Paapakuzhiyil ninnèttiyavan\nSwanthamaakki nammey theerthiduvaan swantha rakhtham namukkèkiyathaal\n-parama...\n\n3. Ammayepol nammey ômanichchu Apakadavèlhayil paalichchavan\nAahaara paaniyamèkiyavan Nithyamaam jeevanum nalkeedunnu\n\n-parama...\n\n4. Koodukalheykkoodey kkudilhakki Parakkuvaanaai nammey sheelippichchu\nChirakukalhathinmél vahichchu nammey Nilam parichaainaam nashichcheedaathey   -parama...\n\n5. Sthothram cheyyaam hridayangamaayi Kumbidaam avan munbilaadaravaai\nHalleluyya paadaam modamodey Avanallo nammudey rakshayin paara\n\n-parama...\n\n     (Chacko Kuruvilla)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0106": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0106-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0106-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Stuthichcheeduvin keerththangalh Devannu paadiduvin\nSthuthi uchitham manoharavum nallathumennarivin\n\n\nDevaadidevanee paaril vannu Paapiyé thèdi vannu\n\nVallabhanaai marichchuyarthu Jeevikkunnu namukkaai\n\n1. Thirukkarangalh niraththivechchu Thaarakangalh gaganey\nOrukkeeyavan namukku rakshaa Maarggamathinnu munney\n\n-devaa...\n\n2. Kandilla kannhukalhee Karunhayin karachalanam\nKètilla maanavarin kaathukalh Than vachanam\n\n\n\n-devaa...\n\n3. Dhyaanikkuvin than kripakalh Pukazhththuvin than kriyakalh\nMaanithanaam than naama Mahimakalh varnnhikkuvin\n\n\n-devaa...\n\n4. Thalamurayaayavan namukku Nalloru sankèthamaam\nPalamura naam paadiduka Paramanu sankeerththanam\n\n\n-devaa...\n\n5. Manam thakarnnôr- kkarulhumavan Kripayodey paricharanham\nDhanam sukham san-thoshamellaam Namukku Than thirucharanham\n-devaa...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n          (M. E. Cherian)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0107": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0107-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0107-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Njaanennum sthuthikkum en paraney thiru manusuthaney\nAananda gaanangalh paadippukazhththee njaanennum sthuthikkum\n\n1. Paapaththin shaapaththil ninnum entey\nPraanhaney kaaththavanennum\nPaaril thannanpinu thulyamillonnum\n\n\n-Njaanennum...\n\n2. Nalkiyavan rakshaadaanam thannil\nKandu njaan daivika gnaanam\nThan paada sèvayathenn abhimaanam\n\n\n-Njaanennum...\n\n3. Nirththuka enney vishuddhi\nThannil nithyavum èrivaruvaan\nKarththaney kaakkuka anthyamatholham\n\n\n-Njaanennum...\n\n4. Aayiram naavukalhaalum\nPathinaayiram vaakkukalhaalum\nHaa divya snehamavarnhyam aaraalum\n\n\n-Njaanennum...\n\n5. Nithyatha thannil njaaneththum – thantey\nSthuthyapaathangalh njaan muththum\nBhakthiyilaanandakkannheer njaan veezhththum\n\n-Njaanennum...", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0108": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0108-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0108-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Ennullhame sthuthikka nee parane than\n\n\nNanmakalhkai sthuthikkam sthuthikkam\n\n\nEnnantharangame anudinavum\n\n\nNanniyode paadi pukazhthaam\n\n1. Suralokasukham vedinju - ninne\nThedivanna idayan - thante\nDehamenna thirasheela chinthi thava\nMokshamaargam thurannu\n\n\n-ennullhame…\n\n2. Paaparogathaal nee valanju - thellum\nAashayillathalanju - paaram\nKaenhidumbol thirumeniyathil ninte\nVyaadhiyellaam vahichu\n\n\n\n-ennullhame…\n\n3. Pala shodhanakalh varumbolh\nBhaarangal perukidumbolh\nNinne kaathu sookshichoru kaanthanallo ninte\nBhaaramellaam chumannu\n\n\n-ennullhame…\n\n4. Aathmaavinaale nirhachu\nAanandamullhil pakarnnu\nPrathyaasha vardhippichu paalicheedum thava\nsnehamathishayame\n\n\n\n-ennullhame…", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0109": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0109-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0109-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Sthuthigeetham paaduka naam\nUyarththuka jayanaamam\n\n1. Sthuthikku yogyanavan\nSarvva shakthan Yehovayavan\n\nNammey snehichchu nammeyveendeduthu\nSwanthajanamaai theerththathinaal\n\n\n-Sthuthi...\n\n2. Rôgikku vaidyan Avan\nSarvva shakthan Yehovayavan\nSoukhyam nalki thaan – shakthiyèkidum\nEnnum aashwaasam pakarumavan\n\n\n-Sthuthi...\n\n3. Sènakalhin Naayakan\nSarvva shakthan Yehovayavan\nAvan mumbilum Avan pimbilum\nNammey jayaththodey nadaththeedumey\n\n\n-Sthuthi...\n\n4. Raajaadi Raajanavan\nSarvva shakthan Yehovayavan\nSthuthi sthothravum ellaa pukazhchayum\nAvanennennum aa-men\n\n\n\n\n-Sthuthi...", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0110": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0110-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0110-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 2, "tune": 1, "kind": "CONTINUATION"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0110-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1.Onnum illaaikayil ninnenney\nNinnudey chaayayil srishtichu\nNithyamaai snehichenney nintey\nPuthraney thannu rakshichchu nee\n\nNin mahaa kripakkaai\nNinney njaan sthuthicheedum\nennum (2)\n\n\n2. Ee lokaththil vanneshu entey\nMaalozhippaan sahichu bahu\nPeedakalh sankadangalh panka-\nppaadukalh neecha maranhavum\n-nin...\n\n3. Mochanam veendum jananavum\nNeecha paapi ennil vasippaan\nNinnaathmavintey daanavum nee\nThannu swargga anugrahangalhum -nin..\n\n4. Anna vasthraadi nanmakalhey\nEnnhamillaathenmel chorinju\nThinmakalh sarvaththil ninnenney\nKanhmanhi poley kaakkunnu nee\n-nin...\n\n5. Naashamillaath avakaashavum\nYeshuvin bhaagya sannidhiyum\nNeethiyin vaadmudiyathum\nNin makkalhku swarggey labhikkum -nin...", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0111": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0111-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0111-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 3, "tune": 2, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0111-notation-3.jpg", "sourcePage": 5, "tune": 3, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0111-notation-4.jpg", "sourcePage": 6, "tune": 3, "kind": "CONTINUATION"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0111-malayalam-1.jpg", "choir/KK-0111-malayalam-2.jpg", "choir/KK-0111-malayalam-3.jpg"], "manglish": "Praise my soul, the king of heaven\n\n1. Vaazhthen dèhi, swar Raajaney\nKaazhcha vekku, than paathey\nThannaal raksha, sukham, kshama\nninney pôlaar sthuthikkum\nSthuthi cholka (2)\nNithya raajaa sthuthi chol\n\n2. Pithaakkalh aapaththil cheitha\nKripakalhkkaai sthuthikka\nInnum aasheervaadikkunna\nYathaavaney sthuthikka\nSthuthi cholka (2)\nvishwasthathaapoornhanaai\n\n3. Pithaavaai Thaan nammey pôttum\nMarthyan mannhennariyum\nNammey thrikkaiyil vahikkum\nShathruvil ninnu kaakkum\nSthuthi cholka (2)\nVistheernnhamaam kripakkaai\n\n4. Than mukham kaanhum dootharey\nSthuthi cheivaan thunhaika\nSoorya chandraadi srishtiye\nKumbideen avan munbil\nSthuthi cholka (2)\nKripaaluvey sthuthikkaam", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0112": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0112-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0112-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "How sweet the name of Jesus sounds  - John Newton\n\n1. Yeshu naamam Ethra imbam\nKèlhppaan vishwsasikku\nEn dukham bhayavum pokum\nEn aalasyam neekkum\n\n2. Aathma murivin oushadham\nHridayé shaanthatha\nKsheenhikkunnorkku vishramam\nVishakkukil mannaa\n\n3. Aa paaramèl njaan panhiyum\nAa naamam paricha\nAazhamèrum kripaakadal\nAarkkum nal sankètham\n\n4. Yeshu Naathaa Ennidayaa\nEnnaachaarya guro\nEn jeevan, vazhi, anthamey\nEn sthuthi kèlhkkanhey\n\n5. Alhavatta Nin snehaththey\nNivarnnu ghoshikkum\nNin naamamaam punhyaswaram\nNishchayam en raksha\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nChristmas Geethangalh", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0113": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0113-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0113-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 2, "tune": 1, "kind": "CONTINUATION"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0113-notation-3.jpg", "sourcePage": 3, "tune": 2, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0113-notation-4.jpg", "sourcePage": 4, "tune": 2, "kind": "CONTINUATION"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0113-malayalam-1.jpg", "choir/KK-0113-malayalam-2.jpg"], "manglish": "Carol Sweetly Carol\n- F.J.V Alstyne\n\n\n1. Paadin inpa geetham Inneshu jaathanaai\nSadvishesha naatham Kondaadin lôkarkkaai\nPaadin inpa geetham Ippaaril engumey\nKèttu veendum geetham Paadanham vègamey\n\nPaadin inpa geetham\n\nPaadin innimbamaai\n\nSadvishesha naatham\n\nKondaadin lôkarkkaai\n\n2. Paadin inpa geetham Swarggeeya keerthanam\nPaadin jaatha môtham Rakshanhya kaaranham\nPaadin inpa geetham Mahathwam Karththanum\nShaanthi, preethi môtham Narakkundaaam ennum\n\n\n-paadin...\n\n3. Paadin inpa geetham Kristhavathaaranaalh\nKèlhkkunnengum naatham Manhiganhangalhaal\nPaadin inpa geetham Rakshanhya sanghamey\nDhyaanichchèrey geetham Paadidin uchchathil\n\n\n\n-paadin...", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0114": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0114-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0114-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Nararodathi sneham poondu Paaridam thannil vanneshu\nNaranaayavathaaram cheithu Naariyin soonuvaai-jayamaai\nDaivakumaaranaayi Raajakumaaranaayi\nBethelehemin goshala Neethisamburththiyaai varuvaan\n\n2. Jayamangalhamaaya vaartha Maayam koodaathey kondaadi\nBhaya bhakthiyathettam koodi Maalaakha-maarkoodi paadiyudan\nAattin koottangalh kaatthu Koottangalhaayi paartha\nAattidayarkkariveki pettennu raavil doothanidam\n\n3. ‘Nara rakshakanayinneshu Ningalhkaai pulkoottil vannu\nNaranaayavathaaram cheithu-pokuvin kaanhuvin vegamaho\nJeernhamaayullhoraada Poornhamallaathey choodi\nMaattinthozhuththathil kaanhaam Kaanhmaanaai poyikkumbiduvin’", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0115": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0115-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0115-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 2, "tune": 1, "kind": "CONTINUATION"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0115-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Christians awake salute the happu morn\n\n- John Byrom\n\n1. Kraisthavarey vandanakkunharin\nKri-sthu kanyaa jaatham cheithanaalhil\nBhaagyodayey athbhudam ee sneham\nAa-gocharamallo ithin marmam\nVaaney doothanmaar paadi ithaadyam\nMaanu – shyaavathaaram ghoshichchivar\n\n2. Kaaval kaakkum idayarum kèttu\nDaiva doothaswaram ‘bhayam venda\nNalla vaarththa-konduvarunnu njaan\nEllavarkkum ullhoru rakshakan\ninnu janichchu’ Daiva vaagdaththam\nOnnu polum pizhaykka nishchayam\n\n3. Dootha ganham aakasham muzhakkum\nGeetham paadi aarthu ‘Unnathaththil\nDaivaththinu mahathwam bhoomiyil\nDaiva-prasaadamullhorkku saamam’\nVeendeduppin sne-ham doothanmaarkkum\nPandey aashcharyam geethavumathu\n\n4. Aattidayar odi bethleminnu\nKuttiyaay pulthottiyil kandavar\nRakshkaney ammayodu koodey\nSookshmam doothavaakyam ennarinju\nSaakshichengum athbhuda kaazhchaye\nGhoshichchor aadyam Yeshuvey ivar\n\n5. Kristhumasmodam aattidayareypol\nPrasthaavikkaam sthothraswaraththodey\nNashtam theerkkum ee shishuviney naam\nThotteethottu krusholham nokkikaanh\nNishtayodey pin-chelka kripayaal\nNashta-swargam veendum praapippolham\n\n6. Geetham paadaam rakshyin-modaththaal\nDoothar madhye nilkaam jayam kondu\nInnu pirannavantey mahathwam\nMi-nnunnundallo nammuey chuttum\nNithyam paadum rakshapettor sthuthi\nNithyam-naam swarggeeya raajavinnu", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0116": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0116-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0116-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "While shepherds watched\n- Nahum Tate\n\n1. Aattidayar raathrikaaley\nKoottamaai paarkkaavey\nDaiva doothar vannirangi\nDivya shobhayodey\n\n2. Vendaabhayam ningalhkippolh\nLokaththinnorupol\nSantho-sham preethichernneedum\nVaartha cholvèninnu\n\n3. Inneebhoomau ningalhkaayi\nKristhuvaam rakshithaa\nBethlehemil jaathanaayi\nChihnamathinnithaa\n\n4. Thathrakaanhum Swarga shishu\nHeenamaam goshaalay\nJeernha vasthram moodi kaanhmu-\nSaadhuvaam paithaley\n\n5. Evam doothan chollum néram\nHaa! Vandootha sangham\nVannu – koodi bhoori shobha\nEngumey niranju\n\n6. Uracheithaar unnathaththil\nDaivaththinu paaram\nMaha-thwa mathyadhikamaai\nBhoomiyil shaanthiyum", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0117": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0117-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0117-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Athyalbhuthamey Athyalbhuthamey\nPaavana Dèvèshan\nSurapuramee nararudey pèr-kkaai vedinju\n\n-Athyalbhuthamey...\n\n1. Maattin shaalayil shishu avatharichchu\nAattidayar surar vaachakam kèttu\nKeettusheelakalhil Rajaney kandu (2)\n\n\n-Dèvèshan sura…\n\n2. Lôkôddhaarakan Yeshu janichchu\nLôkôlpaththikk-aadhaaramavan\nLôkaththin velhicham irulhiludichchu (2)\n\n\n-Dèvèshan sura…\n\n3. Poorvadigvaasikalh shaastrikalh moovar\nDooravey kandu thaaraka shobha\nKaaranham grahichchu kaazhchakalh vechchu (2)\n-Dèvèshan sura…\n\n4. Maanavanaathan neethiyin sooryan\nKanyaka suthanaai vishudhdhaamthajanaai\nManushyanaai theernnu vachanamaam Daivam (2)\n-Dèvèshan sura…\n\n\n5. Naathaa! Thaavakasannidhou njangalh\nAadaravodey vanhangeedunnu\nEe drisha sneham nithyam shlaaghyam (2)\n\n-Dèvèshan sura…\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n       (Rev. K.P. Philip)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0118": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0118-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0118-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Jaathanaai jaathanaainnu - lok rakshakaneshumashihaa-\nUnnathan than aaviyathaal - uruvay kanyaka maryil\nAthbutha shishuvine kaanhaan - vanhangeedaan -\nSthuthicheedaan orungeedaam vegam pokaam\n\nLokathin-prathyaasha avan maathram\n\n\nPaapathil-ninnudharippon aekan\n\nAapathil sthirasankethamavan\n\nDaivathin puthranu mahathwan sadaa -\n\n2. Poyidaam poyidaam namukku bethele janichu devajaathan\nAakashe udichuyarnna thaaram shobhichu naaluchuttupaadum\nMoovaraam shaasthragnanmaar kandu badhapettu\nPonnumoorukunthurukkam kaiyyilenthi\n\nRaajanmumbil kaazhcha veyppan poyi\n\nHerodaavin kottarathil chennu\n\nYoodaraa-jan janmam evide?\n\nChodichu-grahichu poyi kumbittu\n\n3. Paadidaam paadidaam ennum nithyaraajane pukazhtheedam\nAattidayar kettu suvaartha-karthaavam kristhu janichennu\nSwargathil doothaganham koodi - geetham paadi\nUnnathathil daivathinu haaleluyya\n\nBhoomiyil - daivapreethiyullorkku\n\nShaanthiyu-ndaakattennavar paadi\n\nSheelakalh-chutti pashuthottiyil\n\nKidakkum-kunjine kaanhmaan poyavarh\n\n\n\n(Rev. K.P. Philip)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0119": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0119-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0119-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 2, "tune": 1, "kind": "CONTINUATION"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0119-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Paaridam mangalha geethiyaal niranju\nPaarichcha aananda maadhuryam\nBethlehem aalayil divya paithaliney\nBhakthiyodey narar veekshichchu\n\n\nVaazhthunnu sanghamaay\nDoothanmaar vaanaththilimbamaay\n\nChernnidaam saadaram gaana manhdaley naam\n\nChèlezhum paadangalh vandikkaam\n\n2. Moovaraam nyupanmaar  Eththi ninnarikil\nMookamaay kaazhchakalh arpichchu\nNakshathra jaalangalh nokki punchirichchu\nNavya modarangam kaankayaal\n\n\n-Vazhthunnu...\n\n3. Swargeeya mahaathmyam vittuthaanhirangi\nSwanthamaam makkalhey rakshippaan\nJeernhamaam sheelakalh ithin saakshikalhaayi\nJeevichchu mathrukaparamay\n\n\n-Vazhthunnu...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(Stanly Hutton)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0120": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0120-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0120-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 2, "tune": 1, "kind": "CONTINUATION"}], "malayalam": [], "manglish": "1. Vaagdatha samboorthiyaayi thiruvavathaaram naranaai\nThiruvavathaaram eduthu narakuladevan -\nGoshaala thanniloru - pulthottiyil jaatham cheytha\nParishudha devaathmajane - anudinam paadi sthuthippin\nNaraganham koodi vannippin - thirumalar paadam\n\n2. Thaalolathaarattathine ketturangeedaan - maattidayil\nPallhikondidaan - aattidayaraal sthuthiyelpaan\nMaalakhamaar koodi paadidaan - thaarakathe kandarinjeedaan\nMannavarum kaazhcha nalkeedaan\n\n\n\nRaajaavaachaarya guru - sthaanathrayam aetulakil\n\nKanyasthree amma thante - nirmala karangalh thannil\n\nKanmashaharan paramalokathin naadhan shishuvai\n\nMaaviye naamam japichaal - evarkkum moksham\nNirantharam cherum soubhagyam\n\n\n- vaagdatha...", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0121": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0121-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0121-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Snehamam devaa! Swargeeya thaathaa!\nAhamahamaayavane!... yahove! Iha paripaalakane!\nBahulamaam kripayaal thiruhithamathinaal\nMahithale suthanethanna - deveshaa! Thava paadam kumbidunnen -thava\n\n2. Naariyiluruvai bethle janichu\nPaaride koorirulh neekkithannu - aarithu maalaakhare!-\nVeeranaam daivam neethiyin sooryan,\nIrunnavan vachanamai ni...thyakaale-\n\n\n\n-thava\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n3. ‘Unnathe mahathwam nararkku sampreethy\nMannide shaanthi’ ennumpaadunnu - vinnhile maalakhamaar-\nMannhile janathin paapangalhakhilam\nMannippan vannavanaaya naadha!\n\n\n\n-thava\n\n4. Praanhanaadha! Nee thaanhihe vannu\nKshoniye veendedutha maasneham kaanhunnu doshiyaam njaan-\nThaanhuvanhangi namichidunnadiyaan\nPaanhiyil thaangenhame…...kripaalo!\n\n\n\n-thava\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(Rev. K.P. Philip)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0122": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0122-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0122-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Raajaraaja daivaraajan - yeshu mahaa raajan thaan\n\n\nNeecha neecha maanavaril jaathanai bhavichinnaalh\n\n1. Raajanam daaveedin vamshe...jaathayaaya kanyakayil\nDaasaveshamodu vannu - jaathi paalanam cheyvaan\n\n-raaja…\n\n2. Bheethi maanusharkkakannu.... Mode poorthiyaakuvaan\nNeethiman mashiha vannu - mediniyil bethlehem\n\n-raaja…\n\n3. Kaananathilaadumecha… gnaanamattidayarodu\nVaanasena koodivannu… gaanamothu paaduvaan\n\n-raaja…\n\n4. Thaarakam than shobha kandu - dooradesharaajarum\nMooru ponnu kunthurukkam - kaazhcha vechu kaanhuvaan\n-raaja…\n\n5. Naariyil pirhanna deva-nere vedana sahichu\nPaaridathil vannu chathuyirthu vismayam param...\n\n-raaja…\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(Moshavatsalam)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0123": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0123-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0123-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 2, "tune": 2, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0123-malayalam-1.jpg", "choir/KK-0123-malayalam-2.jpg"], "manglish": "Athimangala kaaranhaney\nSthuthi thingiya pooranhaney! - Narar\nVaazhuvaan vinhthurannuzhiyil – piranna\nVallabha thaarakamey!\n\n\n\n1. Mathi mangiya njangalheyum Vidhi thingiyor thangalheyum Nintey\nmaa mahathwam divya shreethwavum kaattuvaan vanno vallabhaney\n\n\n-Athi...\n\n2. Mudi mannavar medeyeyum – mahaa unnatha veedineyum – vittu\nMaattidayil pirannaattidayar thozhaan Vannuvo ee tharayil\n\n\n\n-Athi...\n\n3. Thankakattilukalh vedinju pashu thottiyathil kidannu – paaram\nKaattum manjum prayaasangalhumèttu van kashtam sahichchuvo nee\n\n\n-Athi...\n\n4. Dushta pey ganham oduvaanum – shishtar vaay ganham paaduvaanum – ninney\nPinthudarnnavar thumbamenye vaazhaan Ettanin kolamitho?\n\n\n\n-Athi...\n\n5. Ellaa paapangalhum akalaan  deva varam labhippaan – ee nin\nPaangenye maanushya – pungavaa! Nin thirumenikku kandilayo\n\n\n-Athi…\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  (David Isaac)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0124": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0124-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0124-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Narar rakshapeduvaan thirujeevan\nvedivaan\nDharanhiyil yeshu devan\nVannaan vannaan… nenje dharanhi\n\n2. Vaanathin raajansenakalhkeeshan\ngnjaanasalguru naadhan\nVannaan vannaan - nenje dharanhi\n\n3. Daivapithavin divyakumaaran\nBhoovil than hitham chollaan\nVannaan vannaan - nenje dharanhi\n\n4. Mrithyu illathon nithyanumaayon\nMarthyanaai paaridathil\nVannaan vannaan - nenje dharanhi\n\n5. Shaapangal theerpaan - vaazhvengum\ncherppaan\nDevan manushyanaayi\nVannaan vannaan - nenje dharanhi\n\n6. Aashakku yogyan, Yeshu enpriyan\nMoshanaashangalh theerppaan\nVannaan vannaan - nenje dharanhi\n(Moshavatsalam)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0125": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0125-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0125-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Athbuthane! Yeshunaadha! Athynatha daivasuthaa! Swami! Bhavaan\nAdimayeppol pulkkoottil avatharichathathishayame naadha\n\n2. Aarkkum aduppan aruthaam aanandamokshamahima ellaam - bhavaan\nAakave vittinguvannu yaachakaneppoludicho? Naadha!\n\n3. Unnathaa! Maheshvarane ulkkarunha eriyathaalallo - bhavaan\nUllha prabhaavam vedinju pullilurangaan thuninju naadha!\n\n4. Ennhamenye doothasangom ennum ninne keerthichallo - swami! Bhavaan\nEngum vyaapi aayirikke enneppol jadam dharicho naadha!\n\n5. Odivanno! En nimiththam orthalinjorenmanamen swami! Bhavaan\nOru adimapol nilathil omanayillathe pallhikondo!\n       (Moshavatsalam)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0126": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0126-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0126-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Tune: Here we suffer\n\n1. Yeshu innu janichchu Daivam avatharichchu\nNammé rakshichcheedaan\n\nDaivaththinu sthothram Sthothram, sthothram, Sthothram,\nDaivaththinu sthothram - Naamellaarum paadenham\n\n2. Daavidintey graamaththil Bethlehem nagaraththil\nYeshu bhoojaathanaai\n\n\n\n\n-Daivaththinu...\n\n3 Daiva doothanmaar vannu Lokarod ariyichchu\nEe suvisheshaththey\n\n\n\n\n-Daivaththinu...\n\n4. Daivththinu mahathwam Marthyaril prasaadavum\nSamboornhamaai vannu\n\n\n\n\n-Daivaththinu...\n\n5. Yudanmaarakhilavum Shesham sarva janavum\nAikyamaayi paadenham\n\n\n\n\n-Daivaththinu...", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0127": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0127-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0127-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 2, "tune": 1, "kind": "CONTINUATION"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0127-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "When Christ was born\n\n1. Bethlehem nal nagariyil yeshu - kristhu janichanaalh\nDoothaganhangal ghoshichu - ‘unnathathil ma-ha-thvam’\n\n\nUnnathathil mahathvam - unnathathil mahathvam\n\nUnnathathil mahathvam - unnathathil mahathvam\n\n2. Aattidayar kandavaraam prabha chernna vaanaganham\nYeshu pirhannennu cholli - Unnathathil mahathvam\n\n3. Vedavaakyam chonnapole eva-reyum rakshicheedaan\nYeshu maharaajan vannu - Unnathathil mahathvam\n\n4. Nin kripa venham karthave! Ninmu-kham kaandennum swarge\nThirumumbil anpai paaduvaan - Unnathathil mahathvam", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0128": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0128-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0128-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 2, "tune": 1, "kind": "CONTINUATION"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0128-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "O Come all ye faithful\n\n1. Vishwaasikalhe! Vaa thushta maanasaraai\nVanniduka vaa, ningalh bethlehemil\nVaa, vannu kaanhmeen thrivishta paraajan!\n\n\n\nHaa! Vegam vannu paadeen\nHaa! Vegam vannu vazhtheen\nHaa! Vegam vannu vazhtheen - karthave\n\n2. Devaadhi maa devan shreeyeshu karthaavu\nEe loke vannudichu kanyakayil\nRaajaadhi raajan, srishtiyalla jaathan\n\n-Haa! …\n\n3. Maalaakhamaarodu melham koodu paadin\nSwarloka nivaasikalhe padin\nMahonnathththin daivaththinu sthothram\n\n-Haa!...\n\n4. Ee bhoomiyil jaathan prabhayerhum raajan\nEesho thamburaanu sthothram paadin\nPaarilullhore! Vandanam karettin\n\n\n-Haa!...", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0129": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0129-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0129-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 2, "tune": 1, "kind": "CONTINUATION"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0129-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Hark the herald angels sing\n\n1. Kelhkka dootha salswaram - kristhu jaatha ghoshanham\nBhoomou shaanthi santhosham - ameen paa-deen undaayi\nAanandippin marthyare - yaagamaai vaana doothar -\n\nKelhkka dootha salswaram - kristhu jaatha ghoshanham\n\n2. Vaane dootharaal ennum - maanyanaam ee kristheshan\nPaarththale kanyakayil - moorththiyaayi janichu\nMaanamaayi-ppaduvin - maanavaava-thaaraththe\nKlesham theerththu rakshikkum - eeshanam immanuvel\n\n-kelhkka…\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n3. Shaalemin prabho! Vaazhka vaazhka neethisurya! Nin\nShobha jeevan nalkume - roga shanthi sarvarkkum\nMaanamake vittaho marthya haagyam theduvaan\nMrithyuhaaram cheyyuvan jaathan aayi paaride\n\n\n-kelhkka…\n\n4. Yeshu! Lokamohithaa! Vaasamaka chethasi\nVegam aeka nalvaram - naaga shakthi pokkuvaan\nShaapadosham theerththu nee vaazhka! Vaazhka! Maanase\nPoornhmaaya vishwaasam  - daanam cheyka sarvadaa\n\n-kelhkka…", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0130": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0130-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0130-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 2, "tune": 1, "kind": "CONTINUATION"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0130-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Yeshuvin jananaththe naam - paadi santhoshikka\nAashayodu than daasar naam - aanandicheeduka\n\n\nYeshuvinnavathaaram… theerththu peyadhikaaram\n\nKooduka naam paaduka naam… bahu santhoshame\n\n2. Vaana denakalhkkeeshan thaan marthyare snehichu\nVaanavar gaanamodangalh - aake-yupekshichu\nHeenamaanusha vesham - poondu vannu santhosham\n\n-kooduka…\n\n3. Poornha manushya soonuvaai - parnhaka shaalayil\nJeernha vasthramanhinjonaai - mathru madiyathil\nKaanhum shishuvine naam - thaanhu vanhangeedenham\n-kooduka....\n\n4. Marthyare ellaam paapaththil ninnum rakshikkuvaan\nSathyavachanam lokaththil - marthyanaai vannaho\nBhootha ganhangalhaake - bheethi poondavarodum\nKooduka naam paaduka naam shathrukkalh thottu poi\n\n-kooduka…\n\n(P. V Thommi)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0131": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0131-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0131-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Mahiyil maanusha veshameduththu pulkkoottil maana-\nRahithanaai purhannoru manuvelaa!\nMathimukhi kulamanhi - manhiyaakum marhiyammi-\nNnaruma nannananaakum anukoola\n\n2. Thava mrithiyathu moolam kanivisham hanichone!\nCharanha neerajadwayam sharanhame\nVaranhamenikku thunha - tharanham durithahara!\nRudhiram nararkku vendi - chorinjonne!\n\n3. Suruchiravilochana! Sudhikula sukhakaraa!\nSumadhira thararoopa! Sura paala!\nSuravara! Sulalhitha! Sumamukha! Manasime\nSuchiram vilasiduka - sukrithaathman!\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nHosanna Njayarazhcha", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0132": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0132-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0132-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Marudivasam Mariyamakan Yerushalemil varunnundennu\nArinju behu janamavaney Ethirèlpaan purappettupoi\n\n2. Eeththapana kuruththôlakalh Cherththu kaiyyil ethirèttu\nCheerththamodam poondavaney Vaazhthi mahaanandaththodey\n\n3. Mannavanaam Daavidintey Nandananu Hoshanna!\nUnnathanghalhil Hoshanna! Ennattahasichchu cholli\n\n4. Karthaavintey Thirunaamathil Varum Israyelin Raajaavu\nVaazhthapettonaakayennu Aarthavar keerthichchidinaar\n\n5. Kazhuthakutti kanditteshu Kayariyathin mèlirunnu\nAruthu bhayam ninakkethum Parama seeyon malamakalhey\n\n6. Kandaalum ninmahipan Kazhuthakutti puraththu keri\nKondu varunnennezhutheettundathupol nivruththivannu\n\n7.Paramanodu koodey vanna Purushaaram mun nadannu\nMarichchavaril ninnavan Laazarintey naalaam dina munharththi\n\n8. Ennu saakshi pakarnirunnaa rennathu kettudan janangalh\nVannu mahaanandaththodey Mannavaney ethirettu\n\n9. Arisham poondu parishar thammil Paranju namukkoru phalavum\nVarunnillennu kandu lokam avanodithaa chernnu poyi\n\n10. Azhakiyoru manhavaalhaney! Kazha linhaye karuthi vanna\nAzhukiyaalhaam puzhu vaamenney Kazhuki Nintey kaanthayaaka\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(Yusthus Youseph)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0133": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0133-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0133-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Shaalemin adhipathi Varunnathiney – kandu\nSeeyon malayil baalar sthuthichcheedunnu\n\nKarthaavin naamaththil Varunnavanu sthuthi\nNithyam bhavikkattey Hoshaannaa amen!\n\n1. Kuttiyaam gardabhaththinmel Yeshu thamburaan - Upa\nDishtaraam shishyarod ezhunnarulhi vannu (2)\nvetti yangu pachchilakalh Yooda ganhangalh - palar\nrodukalh nedukey vaari vithari ninnu (2)\n\n\n-shaale...\n\n2. Lakshopalaksham doothar nirannu ninnu – thantey\nMokshaa sanaththin chuttum paadi vannu (2)\nRakshitharaam baalaganham koodidunnu – thanney\nRakshithaa vennaarththidunnu modithanney (2)\n\n-shaale...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n3. Kolaahalamaai Yeshu mahipathi thaan – bahu\nMaalokarodu Daivaalayaththil chennu (2)\nChèlodezhunnarulhi avan varavey – palar\nMélankikalhey vazhiyathil virichchu (2)\n\n\n-shaale...\n\n4. Koottamaai thiru Suthanu namellaarum – innu\nPaattukalh paadenham Thantey karunha kondu (2)\nKottenham thamburuvodum thaalhangalhodum - vazhi\nKaattenham palarum thanney sthuthichcheeduvaan (2)\n-shaale...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(Moshavatsalam)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0134": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0134-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0134-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "All Glory laud\nMaanam mahathwam sthothram Ninakku Rakshakaa!\nShishukalh Ninney vaazhthi Hoshaana aarththavar\n\n1. Israyel raajan Neeyè\nIshaayi vamshajan\nKarthaavin kristhu! Vaazhka\nVaazhthunnengalh Ninney\n-maanam...\n\n2. Maalaaha vrindam Ninney\nMèlokey vaazhthunnu\nMarthyarum srishti sarvvam\nkeerthikkunnengumey\n-maanam...\n\n3. Nin maarggey kuruththola\nAnkiyum ittavar\nYaachana, sthothram, nin mun\nEe janam arpichchu\n-maanam...\n\n4. Nin kashtanaalh mun yoodar\nPukazhththi paattinaal\nAthyunnathanaam Ninney\nvaazhthunninnengalhum\n-maanam...\n\n5. Kaikondu Nee aa sthuthi\nKelhkenghalh yaachana\nSarvva nanmayin naathaa\nKripaalo! Raajaavey!\n-maanam...", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0135": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0135-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0135-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Hoshanna! Mahonnathanaam Yeshu- mahaa – Raajanennum\nHoshanna Karthanudey vishudhdha naamaththil varunnavanu sadaa\n\n1. Yarushalem nagariyathil varunnu mahaa-Rajanennu\nArinjathinaal bahu janangalh orungivanna rachaneye ethirèlpaan\n\n2. Aanh kazhutha kuttiyinmèl aadakalhey virichchu shishyar\nAandavaney iruththikondu aadippaadi sthuthichavar nadanneedunnu\n\n3. Mèlankikalhey vazhiyil alankrithamaai palar virichchu\nMaalokar vazhineelhey shaalemin Adhipathiye vaazhthidunnu\n\n4. Kuruththola pidichchu chilar guruvaraney sthuthichcheedunnu\nMaranghalhil ninn-ilhankombukalh viravodu vetti chilar vithareedunnu\n\n5. Purushaaram asankhyamithaa niranirayaai nadanneedunnu\nOru manasso-dathikuthukaal arachana sthuthichchavar pukazhththeedunnu\n\n6. Parichôdu baalaganham Parishuddhaney pukazhththeedunnu\nPareesharellaam arisham poondu  parishramichchidunnathu mudakkeeduvaan\n\n7. Aarththa modaththodinnu naam vaazhtheeduka paarththivaney\nKeerththikka naam thiru naamam paarththalaththil anudinavum modamodey\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(P.V. Thommi)\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nKristhuvinte Peedanubhavavum Maranhavum", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0136": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0136-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0136-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Parama thanayanaakum\nYeshudèvanèttavum\nParibhramichchum valanjum-\nVyasanappettum thudangi\n\n1. Maranham vareyumentey\nDèhi mahaadukhaththil\nMaruvunnennodu koodey-\nNingalhunharnnirippin\n-parama...\n\n2. Ennavarôdu cholli-\nMunnôttalpam chennudan\nMannhil mukhamkavinnhu-\nVeenhu prarthihchaanèshu -parama...\n\n3. Kazhiyumen naalaanèram\nOzhinju neengippôkènham\nKazhiyumey Ninnaalellaam\nAbbaa! Pithaavey! Thaathaa! -parama...\n\n4. Ippaana paathramennil\nNinnu neekkikkollhuka\nAbbaa! Pithaavey! Pari-\nShudhdhanaakum Daivamey -parama...\n\n5. Ennaalum ennichchayin\nVannhamalla Pithaavey!\nNinnichchayin vannhamaa-\nkunnathu nallathennaal\n-parama...\n\n6. Vaanil ninnoru Daiva\nDoothanèshu Naathanu\nKaanhaai vannithanneram\nAvaney shakthippeduththaan -parama...\n\n7. Athyaasannasthithiyi\nlaayivaroralhavil\nAthyanthantha shraddhayodey\nPrarthichchaan Yeshudevan -parama...\n\n8. Thirumeniyil ninnaayo\nKarayillaaththa viyarppu\nTharayil veenhu valiya\nChôraththullhikalh pôley\n-parama...\n\n9. Ippaadukalhèlpathi\nnnippaapiyallo hèthu\nIppunhyaththinneedaamô\nIppuzhu ninnadima\n\n-parama...\n    (Yusthus Youseph)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0137": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0137-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0137-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Deveshaa! Yeshuparaa! Jeevaneni-kkaai vedinju\nJeevanatta – paapikalhku Nithya jeevan koduppaanaay nee marichcho?\n\n1. Gathashamana poovanaththil adhikabhaaram vahichchathinaal\nAthi vyathayil aayittum Thaathanishtam nadaappaanaai anusaricho?\n\n2. Annaasin aramanayil Mannavaa Nee vidhikkapettu\nKannanghalhil karangalh kondu  Mannaa! Ninney adichchavar parihasichu\n\n3. Peelaathos ennavanum vilamathichu kurishelppichu\nThalayil mullhaal mudiyum vachchu Palar pala paadukalh cheithu Ninney\n\n4. Belaheenanaaya neeyum valiya kolamaram chumannu\nThalayodida malamukhalhil  Alivillaathayyo yoodar nadaththi Ninney\n\n5. Thirukarangalh aanhikondu maraththodu chèrththadichchu\nIru vashaththum kurishitharaam Iru kallhar naduvil Nee marichcho Paraa?\n\n6. Kadina daaham pidichchathinaal kaadi vaangaan idayaayo?\nUduppukoodi cheetittu Udambum kuththi thuranno rudhiram chinthaan?\n\n7. Nin maranham kodentey van narakam Nee akatti\nNin mahathwam thèdiyini  en kaalam kazhippaan kripa nalkenhamey!\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(P.V. Joseph)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0138": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0138-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0138-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Ayyayyo! Mahaa aashcharyam ithayyo\nYeshudevan, priya naathan\nNilkunna bhaavaththey nokki...\nchintha cheiveen\n\n2. Puzhuvaam Peelaathosin munbilithaa\nPunhya naathan poornha Devan\nNilkunna bhaavaththey nokki …\n\n3. Aadupol anangaathey ponnudayon\nPaadu nèdaan nammey nèdaan\nNilkunna bhaavaththey nokki ...\n\n4. Thiruvulh irippenthithaarkariyaam\nDevaraajan bhoovin naathan\nNilkunna bhaavaththey nokki …\n\n5. Jagaththin paapa bhaaraththaal njarangi\nSwargga naathan ulhkalanghi\nNilkunna bhaavaththey nokki …\n\n6. Ninakkaay kelhkkakallaam paapi\nnenchey\nNirmalan thaan nithya Devan\nNilkunna bhaavaththey nokki …\n(Moshavatsalam)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0139": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0139-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0139-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Deva devanannanan - kurisheduthu\n\nPovathu kaanhmeen priyare\n\nKaavilundaaya shaapam - povanihathil vannu\nNovettu thalharnayyo! Chaavaanay golgodhaavil\n\n-deva…\n\n1. Paramapithavinude thirumaarvilirunnavan\nParamageethangal sada - parichil kettirrunnavan\nParamadrohikalhaakum - naranil karalhalinju\nSarvamahimayum vi-tturvviyinkal vannayyo!\n\n-deva…\n\n2. Kuttamavan kani-vatta paathakanaale\nOttapettu dushtaraal - ketti variyapettu\nDushtakaikalhaaladi - pettuzhutha nilampol\nKashtam! Than thirumeni - muttum uzhunnuvaadi\n-deva…\n\n3. Thirumukhaambujithamithaa adikalhaal vaadidunnu\nThirumeniyaake chora-thuduthude olikkunnu\nArikalhinnarishamo… kurhayunnillalpavume\nKurishil tharakkayennu - theruthere vilhikkunnu\n\n-deva...\n\n4. Karunha thellumillathe-arikalh chuzhannukondu\nShirassil mulhmudi vechu - thirumukham thuppi bhaara-\nKkurishingeduppichayyo - karayettidunnithaa kaal-\nVary malayinkal thanne kurishicheeduvaanayi\n\n-deva…\n\n5. Kuttamattavar paapa-ppettavan pol pokunnu\nDushtar koottam churannu - ettam pankam cheyunnu\nPettamaathangayyo - pottikkaranjeedunnu\nUtta naarimaar koottam - ethrayumalarhunnu-\n\n-deva…\n\n6. Ethrayum kanivullha - karthave! Bharthave! Ee\nChatha chellham paapime-lethra sneham ninakku\nKarthave! Nee ninte raajyathinkal varumbolee-\nBhrithyaneyum koodeyangorthu kondeedenhame-\n-deva...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(Yusthus Youseph)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0140": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0140-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0140-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Daivamey! En Daivamey!\nEnney Nee kaivittathu\nEnthinennimmaanuvel\nSanthaapal vilhichithu\n\n2. Sooryashobha maarippoi\nRaathri pôl madhyaanhamaai\nKristhu Naathan paapikkaai\nKrooshil thoongunnayyayyo!\n\n3. Nanma cheivaanôdiya\nNaathaa! Nin thrippaadangalh\nVan murivu kondoraanhi-\nyil pathinju thoongunnu\n\n4. Swasthamaakkum Yeshuvin\nThrikkaikalh randaanhiyaal\nMarthyapaapathin nimiththam\nChèrththaranju thoongunnu\n\n5. Paarakalh pilharkkunnu\nPaaridam kulungunnu\nKeeri thirasheelayum\nMèlil ninnum keezhattam\n\n\n6. Paapiye! Nin paapththaal\nPunhya Naathan Yeshu Thaan\nPaarinum paraththinum\nmadhye maraththil thoongunnu\n\n7. Nintey perkku chaakuvaan\nNilkunneshu krooshinmel\nThantey shaanthabhaavam kaanhka\nThaazhmayullhoraadu pol\n\n8. Nammudey srishtaavivan\nSarvvalôka Naathan Thaan\nNammudey paapam chumannu\nTheerkkunnayyo krooshinmel\n\n9. Mannavaa! En Yeshuvey!\nEnneyorththukollhuka\nNintey punhyaththil oramsham\nEntey rakshayaakkuka\n\n       (Moshavatsalam)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0141": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0141-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0141-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Veenhaal seeyon kumaari thaanhaal azhalaazhiyil\nPraanha naadhantey thirumeni krushinmel kandu veenhaal\n\nKaanhunnithaarayyo en praanha naathano krushil\nAanhimel thoongunnithennaananda mo?\nNjaanini pokunnithengo? Idam ethum\nKaanhunnillenikkayyo kaanhunilley\nMaanuvelaney enney thaaney vittunee poyo?\nMaanasaththinkalidi veenhey ennangalari.\n\n1. Mannaa! Kripaakkadaley ennullha murukunney\nEnney anpodu nokkidunna thaaley\nEnnil premaththeeyayyo nannaai jwalippikkum thri\nkkannhenthayyo thirumun vannu ninnum\nOnnu polum nokkaathey nannayadachchirikku\nnnennangaval cholliyum kannheer chorinjum kondu\n\n-veenhal...\n\n2. Aruma yodenney muththum thiruvaayil ninnozhuki\nVarunna thènum paalumaam parama bhojyam\nParipurnnhamai paidaaham Viravodozhichchennullhil\nparamaanandam tharumey parama kaantha\nAruma kaanthayulhventhu Thirumunnithaa ninnu nin\nThiruvaayadanjathenthenn alariyalari kondu\n\n\n-veenhal...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n3. Ennil vachchittullhoru ninnullhiley priyaththaal\nKannhey! Priyé en praavé ennu cholli\nEnnirukannanghalil vannu chumbanam cheithu\nennullhellaam kavarum vannhamayyo\nEnneyththangiththazhuku m ponnin karangalhayyo\nPonney! Krushil virippaan vanno sangathi ennu\n\n\n-veenhal…\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(Yusthus Youseph)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0142": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0142-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0142-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Vannen Kaalvari kurishathin arikey - nôkki\nNinnen en paapa beliyaayavaney\n\n1. Enneyprathi murinja Kaalkarangalh - ksheenam\nèrey sahichchathiru aruma jadam\nThannil thanney vyasanam Adakkiyathum – praanhan\nThaanaayi vittadivyanilayeyum njaan - kandu\n\n\n-vannen...\n\n2. Kandonennodu Thirusnehabali – Thiru\nKarunha neethiyum onnaai chernnavidham\nPandeyaagaththey paapaththin nimiththam cheivaan\nParudeesaayil niyogichchathin nivruthi - kandu\n\n\n-vannen...\n\n3. En pèrkku konda adi murivukalhum – kaayam\nEngum nurungi raktham ôdiyathum\nEn pèrkku vitta deerghashwaasangalhum – ellaam\nIppaapi ennum dhyaanichchiha vasippen - thaanhu\n\n-vannen...\n\n4. Ayyo! Paapaththin shiksha bhayankaramey – ini\nadiyan en Eesho! ninakkaayirippen\nMeyyaayen deham dehi aathmaavum – melaal\nVinayaththodey ninakkaai chelaviduven - paapi\n\n\n-vannen...", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0143": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0143-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0143-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Enthoranpithappane! Ee paapimel -\nEnthoranpithappane\n\n\nEndarkone! Nee ee chandaalha drohiyil\n\nKondoranpu parhayendunnathengane?\n-enthor…\n\n1. Anpolum thamburaane! Ninte mahaa anpullhoru makane!\nInpam nirhanjullha - ninmadiyilninnu\nThumbam nirhanja paarinkalayachathum\n\n\n-enthor…\n\n2. Kanhmanhiyaam ninmakan - poonkaavinkal veenhirnnathum\nPonnin thirumeni thannilninnu chora\nMannhil veenhathum ninkannhengane kandu?\n\n-enthor…\n\n3. Karunhayatta yoodanmaar - ninmakante thirumeniyaake naadha!\nKoradaavu kondadichuzhitha nilamaakki\nKurishippathinaai-kkurisheduppikkunnu\n\n\n-enthor…\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n4. Daaham vishappu kondu thalharnnu kaikaalkalh kuzhanjidunnu\nDehamazhalunnu dehiyuzhalunnu\nSneham perukunnee paathakanodayyo\n\n\n-enthor…\n\n5. Shathrukkal madhyekoode-pokunnitha-kuttamatta kunjaadu\nkashtam ! yerushalem - puthrikalh kandu maa-\nRathadichayyo vaa vittalarhidunnu\n\n\n-enthor…\n\n6. Karunha niranjavan than - kaikaalkalhe kurishil virichidunnu\nKarunhayatta dushtarkroora kaikalhaale\nKurishodu cherthaanhi vecheedunnaiyyayyo\n\n-enthor…\n\n7. Aakashambhoomi madhye - ninte makan ha ha thoongidunnayyo!\nKaalkarangalhude chorayozhukunnu\nVekunnu nin kopaththeeyinkal veenhavan\n\n-enthor…\n\n8. Daivame! En daivame! Enthu kondu kaivedinjathennenee\nEvamithaa ninte eka makan thante\nVaa vittalarhunnu nee kelhkkunnillottum\n\n\n-enthor…\n\n9. Chanku thurhannozhuki-yathaam rakthathinkalenne kazhuki\nPonkaram kondu nadathi puthushaale-\nMinkal cherkka yeshu-sankethame enne\n\n\n-enthor…\n\n10. Ippuzhuvineyithra snehippathippane enthullhu njan?\nIppinhyathinnadiyaanenthu cheyendu?\nAbba! Pithaave! Mahathwam ninakkennum\n\n-enthor…\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(Yusthus Youseph)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0144": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0144-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0144-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 2, "tune": 2, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0144-malayalam-1.jpg", "choir/KK-0144-malayalam-2.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Daivaththintey Ekaputhran\nPaapikalhey rakshippaan\nMaanushanaai paadupettu\nKurishinmel marichu\n\nIthra sneham, ithra sneham\nIthra sneham erivaan\nMaanushyerilenthu nanma\nKandu Nee Rakshakaraa!\n\n2. Paapikalhum drohikalhum\nAaya nara vargaththey\nVeendeduppaan ethra kashtam\nSahichchu Nee shaanthamaai\n-ithra...\n\n3. Nirmalanmaar bhujikkunna\nparaloka appam thaan\nPaapikalhku Jeevan nalki\nRakshikkunnee Rakshakan\n-ithra...\n\n4. Kripayaaley rakshapetta\nPaapiyaaya njaanithaa\nHridayaththil Daiva sneham\nErivaan vaanchikkunnu\n\n-ithra...\n\n5. Paapiyil pradhaani aayi-\nrunna enney rakshippaan\nShaapa mrithyuvetta ninney\nNithyakaalam vaazhthum njaan\n-ithra...\n\n       (V. Nagal)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0145": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0145-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0145-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Ninakkaai En jeevaney mara-\nkurishil vedinjen makaney\n\nDinavum ithiney marannu bhoovi nee\nvasippathenthu kanhmanhiyé\nVedinju Njaanentey paramamodangalh-\nakhilavum ninneykaruthi - nintey\nKadinapaapaththey chumannozhippathin-\nadimavesham Njaaneduththu\nParama Thaathantey Thirumunbaakey nin\nduritha bhaaraththey chumannum - Kondu\nParavashanaayi thalarnnen viyarppu\nchorathullhi polozhuki\nPeriyoru kurisheduththu kondu Njaan\nKayari kaalvari mukhalhil - Udan\nKaruththezhunnavar pidichchizhachenne\nKidaththi vankurishathinmel\n\nValichchu kaalkaram pazhuthinhayaaki\nPidichchirumbaanhi chelluththi - Ottum\nalivillaath adichchirakkiyen raktham\nTherippichchentey kanhmanhiyé\nParama daahavum vivashathayum\nkondadhikam thalharnna Entey - Naavu\nVarandu vellhaththinniranna neraththu\nthannath enthennu nee kaanhka\nKarunha illaathey padayaalhiyoru\nPeriya kunthamangeduthu - Kuththi\nthurannen chankiney athil ninnozhuki\nJalavum rakthavumudaney\nOrikkalum Entey parama snehaththey\nMarakkaamo ninakkorththaal - ninmel\nkaralhalinju njaaniva sakalavum\nsahichchen jeevaney vedinju\n      (P. V. Thommi)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0146": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0146-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0146-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Krushinmel krushinmel kaanhunnathaaritha\nPraanhanaadhan praanhanaadhan enperkaay chaakunnu\n\n2. Aathmaavey paapathin kaazhcha nee kaanhuka\nDaivathin puthran ee shaapathilaayallo\n\n3. Ithramaam snehaththey ethra naalh thallhi njaan\nEe mahaa paapathey Daivame orkalley\n\n4. Paapatthey snehippaan njaanini pokumo?\nDaivathin paithalaay jeevikkum njaanineem\n\n5. Kashtangal vannaalum nashtangal vannaalum\nKrushinmel kaanhunna snehaththey orkum njaan\n\n6. Shathrukalh nindayum dooshyavum chollumbol\nKrushinmel kaanhunna snehaththey orkum njaan\n\n7. Paapathin shodana bheemamaay varumbol\nKrushinmel kaanhunna snehaththey orkum njaan\n\n8. Aapaththin olhangal saadhuvey thallhumbol\nKrushinmel kaanhunna snehaththey orkum njaan\n\n9. Shathruthwam vardhichaal peedakal koodiyaal\nKrushinmel kaanhunna snehaththey orkum njaan\n\n10. Aathmaavey orkka nee ee mahaa snehaththey\nDaivathin Puthran ee saadhuvey snehichu\n              (Muthampakkal Kochukunju Upadeshi)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0147": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0147-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0147-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 3, "tune": 2, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0147-notation-3.jpg", "sourcePage": 4, "tune": 2, "kind": "CONTINUATION"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0147-notation-4.jpg", "sourcePage": 5, "tune": 3, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0147-notation-5.jpg", "sourcePage": 6, "tune": 4, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0147-malayalam-1.jpg", "choir/KK-0147-malayalam-2.jpg", "choir/KK-0147-malayalam-3.jpg", "choir/KK-0147-malayalam-4.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Immanuel Than chankathil ninnozhukum raktham\nPaapakkara neekumathil mungitheernaal aarum\nEn perkeshu marichennu njaan vishwasikkunnu\n\nPaapam ennil ninnum neekkaan raktham chinthi Yeshu\n\n2. Kallhan krushin uravayil kandu paapa shaanthi\nAvaneypol njaanum doshi kanden prathishaanthi\n\n\n-En perkeshu...\n\n3. Kunjaattin vilayeriya rudhirathil shakthi\n Veendukollhum Daiva sabha aakey visheshamaay\n\n-En perkeshu...\n\n4. Than murivin rakthanadi Kandathinu shesham\nVeendeduppin sneham than en chintha ennum ennum\n\n-En perkeshu...\n\n5. Vikkullhathaam entey naavu shavakuzhikkullhil\nMaunam aayaal en aathmaavu paadum unnathathil\n\n-En perkeshu...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  (Translation: Rev. T. Koshy)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0148": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0148-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0148-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 2, "tune": 2, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0148-malayalam-1.jpg", "choir/KK-0148-malayalam-2.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Sarvva paapa karakalh theerthu\nNararey rakshichcheduvaan\nUrvinaathan Yeshu devan\nchorinja Thiru rakhthamey\n\n2. Yeshuvodee lokar cheitha-\nthorkka ee poonkaavaney\nVedanayodeshu devan\nChorinja Thiru rakhthamey\n\n3. Kaattu chennaay koottamaayo-\nraadiney pidichchapol\nKoottamaay dushtaradichcha-\nppolh chorinja rakhthamey\n\n4. Mullhu kondullhor mudiyaal\nMannavan thiruththala-\naikkullhilum puraththumaayi\npaanja Thiru rakhthamey\n\n5. Neenda irumbaanhi kondu\nDushtaraa kaikaalhkalhey\nThondiya nèram chorinja\nRakshithaavin rakhthamey\n\n6. Vanchaka saaththaaney bandhich-\nandhakaaram neekkuvaan\nAnchu kaayangalh vazhiyaai\nVazhinja Thiru rakhthamey\n\n(Muthampakkal Kochukunju Upadesi)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0149": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0149-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0149-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 2, "tune": 2, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0149-notation-3.jpg", "sourcePage": 3, "tune": 3, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0149-malayalam-1.jpg", "choir/KK-0149-malayalam-2.jpg", "choir/KK-0149-malayalam-3.jpg"], "manglish": "Rock of Ages, cleft for me\n- A.M. Toplady\n1. Pilharnnoru paarayé\nNinnil njaan marayattey\nThuranna Nin chankiley\nRaktham jalam paapathey\nNeekki sukham nalkattey\nMuttum rakshikka enney\n\n2. Kalpana kaaththiduvaan\nOttum praapthanalley njaan\nVairaagyam eriyaalum\nKannhuneer chorinjaalum\nVannidaa paapanaasham\nNee thaan rakshikka venham\n\n3. Verum kayyaai njaanangu\nKrooshil maathram nambunnu\nNagnan njaan Nin vasthram thaa\nHeenan njaan nin kripa thaa\nMlechchanaai varunnithaa\nSwachchanaakku rakshakaa\n\n4. Ennilodunnee shwaasam\nVitten kanh mangum neram\nSwarloka bhaagyam chernnu\nNinney njaan kanhunnannu\nPilharnnoru paarayé\nNinnil njaan marayattey\n          (Rev. T. Koshy)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0150": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0150-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0150-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 2, "tune": 2, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0150-malayalam-1.jpg", "choir/KK-0150-malayalam-2.jpg"], "manglish": "When I survey the wondrous Cross\n- Issac Watts\n\n1. Mahathwa Prabhu maricha\nAashcharya krooshil nokki njaan\nEe loka laabha dambhangalh\nNashtam nindyam ennennhunnen\n\n2. Prashamsa onnu maathramey\nKristheshuvin mrithyu thanney\nChittimbakaaryam sarvvavum\nThan rakhthaththinaay vidunnen\n\n3. Thrikkaalkaram shirassil ninn-\nozhukunney sneham dukham\nIvayin bandham athbhutham\nMulhmudiyo athishreshtam\n\n4. Prapancham aakey nèdi njaan\nThyajikkilum mathiyaakaa\nEe divya snehaththinu njaan\nEnne muttum nalkeedenham", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0151": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0151-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0151-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Sodarare paapamaargam thedippokaathe\n\n\n\nThedippokaathe - vegam neduvin mukthi…\n\n1. Kallum mullhum aarnnidunna kaalvaryil kaanhmathenthu?\nMohapaasham neekkidunna sneharoopamo?\nSneharoopamo - mahaa thyaagadeepamo?\n\n-sodarare…\n\n2. Kaanhiyum karunhayenye paanhikalhilaanhi cherthu\nVankurishilettidunnu paathakar yoodar\nPaathakar yoodar - suralokapaalane\n\n\n-sodarare…\n\n3. Pattilham kalhembarathil koorthakuntham tharakkunnu\nPon makudam choodidenda than shirassathil\nThan shirassathil hantha! -mulhmudi choodi\n\n-sodarare…\n\n4. Mannidathil marthyavesham kaivarichu jaathanaaya\nKristhudevan paapikalhkkai than thirujeevan\nThan thirujeevan - hantha! Kaivediyunnu\n\n\n-sodarare…\n\n\n\n\nUyirththezhunelppu", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0152": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0152-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0152-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "The Strife is o’er - Tran (F Proft 8.8 8 4 with Alleluias)\n\nHallelu-yah Hallelu-yah Hallelu-yah!\n\n1. Kalaashichchu kadora pôr Karththaavu Thaan jayaalhiyaai\nKarthru sthuthi geetham paadin\n\n\n-Hallelu-yah\n\n2. Maranha sènakalhellaam Mannantey munbil ninnôdi\nMashihaaikku sthuthi paadin\n\n\n-Hallelu-yah\n\n3. Uyirththu Thaan moonaam dinam  Unnathanaai vaanhiduvaan\nUnharnnu paadin avannu\n\n\n\n-Hallelu-yah\n\n4. Nee ettathaam adikalhaal Ninnadiyaar swathanthraraai\nNin munbilennum paadidum\n\n\n-Hallelu-yah", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0153": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0153-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0153-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 3, "tune": 2, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0153-malayalam-1.jpg", "choir/KK-0153-malayalam-2.jpg"], "manglish": "Tune: Hallelujah, He is Risen\n\n1. Jayam jayam Yeshuvinu Divya rakshakan ithaa!\nChaavin kallarayil ninnu uyirththu halleluyyah\n\nJayam jayam halleluyyah! Vaazhka jeeva daayakaa!\n\nJayam jayam halleluyyah! Vaazhka jeeva naayakaa!\n\n2. Chaththa karmangalhil ninnum Yeshu nammey rakshichchu\nNammil jeevikkunnathinu Thanney Thaan prathishtichchu\n-jayam...\n\n3. Mruthyuvin bhayankarathwam neengi Than uyirppinaal\nNithya jeevantey imbangalh vannu suvisheshaththaal\n\n-jayam...\n\n4. Manhmayamaam ee shareeram aathma mayamaakuvaan\nKaahalham dhwanikkunnéram kalppichcheedum Rakshakan\n-jayam...\n\n5. Neduveerppum kannhu neerum Dukhavum vilaapavum\nNodi nèramkondu theerum Pinneyilla shaapavum\n\n-jayam...\n\n6. Jeevanullha Rakshithaavin  Koodey naamum jeevikkum\nEnnennekum Than Pithaavin Raajyaththil aanandikkum\n\n-jayam...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(V. Nagal)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0154": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0154-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0154-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Yeshukristhu uyirththu jeevikkunnu paralokaththil jeevikkunnu\nIhalokaththil Thaanini végam varum Raajaraajanaai vaanhiduvaan\n\nHaa halleluyyah jayam halleluyyah Yeshu Karthaavu jeevikkunnu\n\nYeshu Kristhu uyirththu jeevikkunnu para lokaththil jeevikkunnu\n\n2. Kollunna maranhaththin ghorathara - vishappallu thakarnnathaakayaal - ini\nThellum bhayamenye mrithyuviney nammalh vellu vilhikkukayaam\n      -Haa...\n\n3. Enneshu jeevikkunn aayathinaal njaanum ennekum jeevikkayaam - ini\nThanneyppirinjoru jeevithamillenikkellam enneshuvathrey\n\n      -Haa...\n\n4. Mannilallen nithya vaasamenneshuvin munnil mahathwaththilaam - ini\nVinnhil aa veettil chenneththunnanaalhukalh ennhi njaan paarththidunnu       -Haa...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(M.E. Cherian)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0155": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0155-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0155-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Tune: Savior, like a Shepherd\n\n1. Maranham jayicha Veera\nEn Karthaavaam Yeshuvey\nEntey maranhavum theerey\nVizhungiya jeevaney\nNintey jeevan ennilvenham\nVenda swantha jeevitham\nNee ennullhil vasikkenham\nEnnathrey en thaalparyam\n\n2. Lokaththinum paapaththinum\nKrushinmel njaan marichu\nJeevantey puthukaththinum\nUdan ninney dharichchu\nSwargaththilhippolen jeevan\nYeshu thaanen paarpidam\nUnnathangalhil ee heenan\nVaazhunnenthoraascharyam\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n3. Jeevavellham ozhukkunnu\nNanaikunnen hridayam\nPushpangalhaai pushpikunnu\nShaanthisneham aanandam\nIthen priyanullha thottam\nIthil nadakkunnu Thaan\nRavum pakalum than nôttam\nUndathinmel kaakkuvaan\n\n4. Nintey shakthi entey shakthi\nEllaattinum mathi njaan\nNintey shakthi entey bhakthi\nHa! Ninnil njaan dhanavaan\nEntey priyanenikkullhon\nAvanullhon njaanumaai\nKrushil swantharaktham thannon\nEnney vaangi thanikkaai\n\n5. Yeshu! En vishwaasakannhu\nKaathu sookshikkenhamey\nAthil iha loka mannhu\nVeenhumayakkaruthey\nSaathaan oro chinthakalhey\nEechakalhey enna pol\nAyachaal kanhpolhakalhey\nUdan nee adachukolh.\n\n6. Lokam venda onnum venda\nYeshu mathi enikku\nSaathaaney nee aashikkenda\nKondupo nin sambath\nKazhukan pol parakkunnu\nMelottentey hridayam\nBhoomi thaazhey kidakkunnu\nDoorey yathin ashudhdhi\n\n7. Yeshuvey Nee jeevikkunnu\nNjaanumennum jeevikkum\nNithya jeevan Ninnil ninnu\nEnnilennum ozhukum\nSwargathil Nee irikkunnu\nVegam njaanumirikkum\nSnehaththin sam-sarggathinu\nNintey koodey vasikkum\n(V. Nagal)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0156": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0156-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0156-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1.Inneshuraajanu-yirthezhunnett allèlu-yya!\nVan naasha shaapa chaavukalh jayichchallèlu-yya!\n\n\nMahaa santhoshamey! Mahaa santhoshamey!\n\nParaa para sutha neshunaathaney vaazhththippaaduvin\n\nJayageetham paaduvin - Jayageetham paaduvin\n\nPakalo nudhi chchiralhodi olhichchithaa vanniduvin\nMahaa santhoshamey! Mahaa santhoshamey!\n\n2. Daiva doothar kallurutti neekki vaathilil ninnu\naakaavalkaar marichcha varey poleyaai vannu\n\n-mahaa...\n\n3. Athi-raavil Pèthra Yohannanmaarôdi vannaho!\nShava kallaraikkullhil nôkki vishwasichchee dee naaraho\n-mahaa...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(Yusthus Youseph)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0157": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0157-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0157-malayalam-1.jpg", "choir/KK-0157-malayalam-2.jpg"], "manglish": "Jeevanaayakane manuvele! En-en-en-en\n\n1. Jeevakripayin nija viyarppuvellham ente\nMelozhichu paapathil ninnunharthi\nNaaviloru puthiya praarthanaye pakarnna\nVan - en-en-en-en\n\n\n\n\n-jeeva…\n\n\n2. Thannuyirinniripathaam rudhiram thanni-\nLlennumirikkushnham thannenikku\nEnnuyiril maruvum maranhavishamozhicha\nVan - en-en-en-en\n\n\n\n\n-jeeva…\n\n3. Vishudhi varumaarhu thannaathmaavenikku nalki-\nttashudhamaamirulhennil ninnakatti\nVishwasam prathyaasha snehamente hridayathil thanna-\nVan - en-en-en-en\n\n\n\n\n-jeeva…\n\n4. Uyirthu marhiyakku prathyakshamaaya po-lippaa-\npiyaamennulhil prathyakshamaayavan\nOzhukum sneham vaakkaallennullhamokkeyum kavarhnna-\nVan - en-en-en-en\n\n\n\n\n-jeeva…\n\n5. Thannude jadathodumasthiyodumonnaa-yenne\nEnnum piriyaathe vannham cherthukondavan\nThannullham thurhannu manamellamennodarhiyicha-\nVan - en-en-en-en\n\n\n\n\n-jeeva…\n\n\n6. Aadhikalhaalenne kaakkunnavan bhaksha-\nNhaadhikalh thanny nithyam pottunnavan\nNeethi vazhiyilenne nadathikkonduvarunna-\nVan - en-en-en-en\n\n\n\n\n-jeeva…\n\n7. Njanavanum avanenikkum swantham\nNjan avanozhike mattareyume-\nNoonamarhiyunnillavanenikkellaamaaya-\nVan - en-en-en-en\n\n\n\n\n-jeeva…\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(Yusthus Youseph)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0158": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0158-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0158-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Christ the Lord is risen today\n- Charles Wesley\n\nKristhu veendum jeevichchu - Haa-aaley-luyya\nShathru koottam thottithu - Haa-aaley-luyya\nMèl lokangalh paadattey -Haa-aaley-luyya\nBhoo-mi-sthuthi cheyyattey -Haa-aaley-luyya\nMurivèttu Thirukaal -Haa-aaley-luyya\nMrithyuvintey kayyinaal - Haa-aaley-luyya\nShathruvintey thalayé - Haa-aaley-luyya\nKristhu chathachchudaney - Haa-aaley-luyya\n\nKeezhlokaththin vaathilin - Haa-aaley-luyya\nThaakkol kitti prabhu thaan - Haa-aaley-luyya\nThurannittu vishudhdhar - Haa-aaley-luyya\nEzhunnettanekam pèr - Haa-aaley-luyya\nGhoshippin Than janamey - Haa-aaley-luyya\nVaazhththuvin Than naamathey - Haa-aaley-luyya\nKrishthu Yeshu Rakshakan -Haa-aaley-luyya\nEnnumey paraaparan - Haa-aaley-luyya\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nSwarggaarohanham", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0159": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0159-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0159-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Mahimaapathi mashiha-megha vaahanamathinmel\nJayaprabhaavathodaho! Swarga lokaththilezhunnaan\n\nBahudootha sainyangalh jayageetham paadunnu\n\n-mahi…\n\n2 .mahassuranabhothalangalh - megha vaahaanam kadannu\nBahunira doothaganhangalh punhya paadam kumbidunnu\nMahathwathin raajanu thurhannu swardwaarangal\n\n-mahi…\n\n3. Ethirettu doothasanghom modiyerum vinhpathiye\nAthighosha-seva cheythu keerthichaarthu paadi ninnu\nparamandalangalhil , palaraagam kelhkkunnu\n\n\n-mahi…\n\n4. Naraloka rakshakanai - deham naadhan poondirunnu\nKurishil thanne baliyaayi nalki ghoshathoduyarthu\nMaranhathe paapathe saathaneyum vennu\n\n\n-mahi…\n\n5. Iha lokathil parathil engum ekadhaa niranjum\nMahimaasanathilangu - vinnhil vaazhunneshu raajam\nGrahippanathyathbhutham jadam poonda daivathvam\n\n-mahi…\n\n6. Jayikkunnu rakshakarthan - paaril jaathikalhakhilam\nMayakkangalh vittu thanne - vaazhthi vannicheeduvolalham\nVijayathin melengum vilhangunnu naayakan\n\n\n-mahi…\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(Moshavatsalam)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0160": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0160-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0160-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Vaanalokathezhunnellhinaan shreeyeshu naadhan\n\n\nVaanalokathiezhunnellhinaan\nVaanalokathezhunnellhinaanolivu malayil ninnananamuyarthi\nShishyar vaanil nokki ninnidave\n\n\n\n\n-vaana…\n\n1. Vinnhulakaththil ninnirhangi - manujanaayi Vannu malguruvay vilhanghi\nChonnu shishyarodupadesham - nanma cheythu nadannariyichu suvishesham\nMannidathullhorkku chora chinni marichu maranham\nVennuyirhthu naalpathaam naalhinnilam vittu jayamai\n\n-vaana…\n\n2. Melkisedekkinte kramathil - purohithavelakku thante swantha rakthathe\nThrikarathankaththalhikayil - enthiya thinkal mukkiya viralullhavanaai\nIkkula paapamokkaykkum thakka parihaaram cheyvaan\nSwargamaam vishudhasthalam nokki mahaa purohithan\n\n-vaana…\n\n3. Thannil vishwasikkunnorkkayi-ttazhivillatha mandiramorukkuvaanayi\nEnnumavarodiripponai sathyaathmave pakarnnaverkku koduppanaayi\nUnnathan valabhaagathirunnu pakshavaadam cheythu\nThannudayorkku mochanam thannu rakshippathinayi\n\n-vaana…\n\n4. Senayin karthan parishudhan - ennu swargeeya senakalh sthuthichu paadave\nVaanamaarnna shishyar mukhathil - thirukadaksham veenhu vilhangave\nVaanavar saakshi nilkave - maanavar paapam neengave\nKaanhikalh kaazhchayil ninnu vaanameghathil marhanju\n\n-vaana…\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(Yusthus Youseph)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0161": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0161-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0161-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Mulhkireedathaal murhivetta yeshuvin thala\nModiyerhum maamahathwa makudam choodunnu\nJayamakudam choodunnu\n\n2. Swargathil mahaa uyarathil vaazhunnon athi\nShobhayodu maamahathwa raajaraajan thaan\nKarthaadhi karthan thaan\n\n3. Vaanalokathil paramaanandam thanne thiru\nMaamahathwam ingarinja bhaktharkkaanandam\nThirusnehamaanandam\n\n4. Kurishin lajjakalh tharum nithya bhaagyangalh bahu\nKodi kodi kaalam vaazhum swarga raajyathil\nThiruraksha nediyorh\n\n5. Pandu thaan petta-kashtapaadum maranhavum - nara\nPaapikalhkku nithyamoksha bhaagya kaaranham\nSuvishesha ghoshanham\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n           (Translation: Moshavatsalam)\n\n\nGunhadosham", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0162": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0162-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0162-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Deham mannhaakum mumbe thedikolh! Daiva-kripa\n\n\n\nLokavazhcha odungum kaalam vaazhuvaan\n\n\n\nEka rakshaakaranaam - yeshuve chernnukolhka\n\n-deham…\n\n1. Baalatha, komalhathvam - vaadum poovodu thulyam\nBalavum rakthathilhappum soukhyavum elaam\nPaaril aarhkkum urhappaan - paadullhathallayallo\n\n-deham...\n\n2. Rogangal angumingum dehathil paarthidunnu\nEkan kalpicheedumbolh ekamaayava\nVegam koodi njerukkum - pokum jeevan athinaal\n\n-deham...\n\n3. Chuttilum aapathukalh thuka bahuvaayingunde!\nThetti nilpaan ninakku sheshiyillayyo\nPattikolh nee parane - bhayannukolh neramellaam\n\n-deham…\n\n4. Kaazhcha mangidum mumbe - kaathadacheedum mumbe-\nKaayamengum tharichu maravikkum mumbe-\nBodham neengidum mumbe - bheethi pidikoodum mumbe\n-deham…\n\n5. Kroorapekkoottam vannu - kondupoyidum mumbe-\nGhorapaathalhatheeyil veenhu pom mumbe-\nKaarunhya karthan yeshu naadhane chernnukolhka\n\n-deham…\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n       (Moshavatsalam)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0163": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0163-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0163-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Paapikalhin rakshakan Thaan-\nIvan paadam vanhangidu nee\n\n1.Paapam shaapam theerpaan\nPaaril janichchoru\nDèva Sutha naakumèshu\nNaayaka nivanarika\n          -paapi...\n\n2. Aadi vachanamaai\nBhèdamenye ninnu\nMèdini yôdakhilavum\nModamaai chamachchathinavan     -paapi...\n\n3. Aadi pithaakalhkku\nÈka sharanhamaai\nSaadaram ninnoru divya\nDaana vasthuvaayathivan             -paapi...\n4. Divya belikalhkko\nravyaaja shakthiyaai\nBhavyamaayirunna nithya\nDivya vasthuvaayathivan\n          -paapi...\n\n5. Krooshil marichchathaal\nNaashamozhichchu than\nAashayam thelhinjudan pra-\nthyaashayin vazhi thurannaal           -paapi...\n\n6. Jeevanil pookènda\nVaathilaam thannilu\nDaavalaayaduppor divya\nJeevanil kadannidunnu\n          -paapi...\n\n(K.V. Simon)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0164": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0164-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0164-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Rakshithaaviney kaanhka paapi\nNintey perkallayo krooshinmel thoongunnu\n\n2. Kaalvari malamel nokku nee\nKaalkaram chernithaa aanhimel thoongunnu\n\n3. Dhyaana peedamathil kayari\nUllhiley kannhukalh kondu nee kaanhuka\n\n4. Paapaththil jeevikkunnavaney\nNintey perkallayo thoongunnee rakshakan\n\n5. Thallhuka nintey paapam ellaam\nKallhamethum ninaikkenda ninnullhil nee\n\n6. Ullham nee muzhuvan thurannu\nThallhayaam Yeshuvin kaiyilèlpikka nee\n\n   (T.J Varkey)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0165": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0165-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0165-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Manhmayamaam ee ulakil  Kaanhmathum maaya\nVan mahima dhanam sukhangalh Sakalavum maaya\n\n 2. Mannil nammalh jeevithamo Pulliney polèy\nInnu kandu naalhey vaadum Pookkalhey polèy\n\n\n-Manh...\n\n3. Dhaanyam dhanam laabham keerthi Haa! Nashtamaakum\nMaanya mithraraakey nammey Pirinjinim pôkum\n\n\n-Manh...\n\n4. Èzhu paththo èréyaayaal enhpathu maathram\nNeelhum aayussathu ninachchaal Kashtatha maathram\n\n-Manh...\n\n5. Loka marubhoovil marthyar Aashrayam thèdi\nShôka kodum veyililayyo Veezhunnu vaadi\n\n\n-Manh...\n\n6. Daiva makkalh namukku swarggam Haa! Swantha dèsham\nKèvalamippaaridamo verum paradèsham\n\n\n-Manh…\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(M.E. Cherian)\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nKristhuvinkalekkullha Kshanham", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0166": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0166-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0166-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Yeshuvinnarikil vaa paapi!\n\nEeshan nin durithangal\nmochikkum vegaal\n-yeshu…\n\n1. Paapathil kidannu nee\nNarakatheeyathil veenhu\nEriyathee nimisham nee\nVarika vaikathe\n\n-yeshu…\n\n2. Nin paapamakhilavum\nThan kannhinu mumbaake\nKaanhunnaayathinaale\nThaanhu nee vegam\n-yeshu…\n\n3. Paapikkashrayamaayi\nThaanllatheyillarum\nPaade chernnidunnore\nPaalikkunnoru\n\n-yeshu…\n\n\n\n4. Aanhippaadullha\nPaanhi neettiyum kondu\nKsheenhanmaare vilhikkunnu\nKaanhunnille nee!\n\n-yeshu…\n\n5. Onnukondumen chaare\nVannidum narare njaan\nNinnichu thyajikkayi-\nLlennu chonnoru\n\n-yeshu…\n\n6. Ninne nokkiyum kondu\nKannhuneer choriyunnu\nPinneyangu nee chiththe\nChinthicheedaathe\n\n-yeshu…\n\n7. Unnathan vilhi kettu\nPinnale varikayennaal\nPonnulokathilennum\nSammodaal vaazhaam\n-yeshu…\n\n  (T.J. Varkey)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0167": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0167-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0167-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Paramaanandamanubhavipaan\nVaruvin narare viranjodi - ningal\n\n2. Paramonnathaneshu ithaa!\nArikil varuvaanura cheythidunnu\n\n3. Paripaavanamee vachanam\nOru kaalathilum varikilla bhetham\n\n4. Paramonnatha vaakyamithaa\nshariyaayi ninnodaru cheythidunnu\n\n5. Varika thirusannidhiyil\nParamaarththamellaam paranjeeduka nee\n\n6. Oru maathrayum paartheedaathe\nVeruththettu parhanjozhinjidu-paapam\n\n7. Thiruchorayinaale ninte\nPeriyoru paapam kazhukeedumavan\n\n8. Pirhakotterhinjeedamennu\nParhayunnathine arinjeeduka nee\n  (T.J. Varkey)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0168": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0168-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0168-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Nassrayanaakum yeshu naa-dhan - daiva\n\n\nNannanan ezhunnarulheedunnu kripayodinneram\n\n\nNaashamundakkunna paapa naashangalakatti\n\nMaasuvishesha rakshaye mangalamai nalkeeduvaan\n\n-Nassr…\n\n1. Aanhi chertha paadangalhaal anpil nadako-ndu -\nAlivullhathiru kanhkalh chuttum nokkikondu\nKsheenamenye nanmacheyyum thrikarangalh neettikondu\nDevaneethi nivarthichu divya kripa-shobhayode\n\n\n-Nassr…\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n2. Paaparogangalkku thakka aushadhangal kondu\nPaavappettavarkku nalkaan nanma bali kondu -\nKopamillatha gunhavaan guruvaayudicha paran\nKodi lokangalhkku raajan karunhakkanhkalhullhavan\n\n-Nassr…\n\n3. Paapakushta rogikalhe pakshathodu nokki -\nPakshavaatham neekkum shakthi kaanhichidaan nokki\nShaapa kurudarkku kaazhcha chanthame nalkunnathinum\nChatha paapikalhkku jeevan shakthiyum arulhvathinum\n\n-Nassr…\n\n4. Pedi lajjayullhavare kadakkannhaal nokki -\nPizhacha maa paapikalhe alivodu nokki -\nVaadi nilkkum paapikalhe vilhichu karunhayode\nMahathwam raksha nalkeedan ezhunnarulhunnenpode\n\n-Nassr…\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n       (Moshavatsalam)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0169": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0169-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0169-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Paa-pee paranarikil varika nee-\n\n\nNinte durithamakattumavan -\n\n-paapee…\n\n\nDeenaril manassalivudayavanaamivane\n\n\nKandu ke-nhu pizha thaa-nhu paranjeeduka\n-paapee…\n\n1. Mahathwa simhaasanathe vedinju ninperkku\nBahuthwa senakalhude sthuthikalh marhannu\nIhathil naravadivu dharichelhiyavanayi\nMahathwam ninakku varuthuvathinnithu ninachu\n\n-paapee...\n\n\n\n2. Thala chaayicheeduvathinidam kidayaathe\nAlanju ninnude paapavalayarhuppaanai\nValiya daivam ninnodu balamai vaaducheedunna-\nThalivu kondallayo nin malinatha neekkumavan\n\n-papee…\n\n3. Alanju vazhi vedinju nadannalanjoro-\ndanhanju varunnathinu paranju vaikathe\nNiranja karunhayode paranjidunnippozhum nee\nMaranjidaathodivaa nin niranja paapamakattum\n\n-paapee…\n\n4. Periya paadukalhettu karunhaye kaatti\nThiruninham chorinju ninnude kadam veetti\nArikil varunnavere anhappaan thrikaram neetti\nMaruvinnorakhilesha-nnarikil vaa thinma vittu\n\n-papee…\n\n5. Elhiyavarodu thirukkarunhakalh thonni\nThelhiyichu vishudha vazhiyunnupadesham\nKalhiyallinnithu ninte manathalhiril pathikki-\nllazhiyaa bhaagyam labhikkumathinu samshayamilla\n-papee...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(T.J. Varkey)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0170": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0170-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0170-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 2, "tune": 1, "kind": "CONTINUATION"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0170-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Tune: There’s a glorious kingdom\n\n\n1. Njaan cheitha paathakam enganey pom paapa-\nNaashakan evideyundey?\nShreeyeshu rakshakan paapikalhkaayi krooshil\nPraanhaney vittillayyo\n\n\nKodum paapiyenney rakshippaan rakshippaan\nKodum paapiyenney rakshippaan rakshippaan\n\nThiru thalayil Avan mulhmudi dharichchaan\n\nKodum paapiyenney rakshikkaan\n\n2. Lokaththin paapikalh moksham chèraan Avan\nKannhuneerozhukki yallo\nDaahikkunna narar jeevayaattil daaham\nTheerppathinaai varattey\n\n\n\n-kodum...\n\n3. Paapiyaa mennude paapamorthu mana-\nsthaapaththodey vannappolh\nKallullham neekki Than aathmaavinaal en\nUllham thrippaadey cherththaan\n\n\n-kodum...\n\n4. Ethu paapikalhkkum raksha nalkaan Avan\nPraapthanaam Karthanallo\nPaapathey veruththu  Karththanil nee nambu\nMoksham chèraam ninakku\n\n\n-kodum...\n\n5. Ithrabhaagyam thanna Yeshuvinu prathi\nNjaanenthu kodukendu-entey\nPoornha shakthiyodey Thannaamaththey ennum\nvaazhthipukazhththeedumey\n\n\n-kodum...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n          (John Easow: Malabar)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0171": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0171-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0171-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 2, "tune": 1, "kind": "CONTINUATION"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0171-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Jesus is tenderly calling\n- Fanny J Crosby\n\n1. Melveettil enneshu ha! Snehamai vilhikkunnu vilhikkunnu\nSneha prakaasham vittakonnanai doore pokunnathenthu!\n\n\nNee-innuvaa nee innu vaa\n\nKri-sthuhaa snehamaai vilhikunnu innuvaa\n\n2. Ksheenichone yeshu swasthamaakkum vilhikunnu - vilhikkunnu\nPaapabhaaram kondu chelluka nee aattukayilla ninne\n\n-nee…\n\n3. Kaathu nilkkunneshu nee innuvaa! Ninne kaathu nilkunnu he!\nPaapavum kondu thirumumbil vaa! Thaamasikkaathe nee vaa\n-nee…\n\n4. Shredhikkeshuvin madhyastha shabdam nee shradhikka nee shradhikka\nVishwastharkkeshuvin aanandavum kittume innu kelhkka\n-nee…\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n           (Translation: Moshavatsalam)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0172": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0172-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0172-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Art thou weary\n- Trans. J.M. Neale\n\n1. Nee ksheenichcho, Nee valanjo, Vyaakulappetto?\nEnkal vishramikkennèshu Chollunnu\n\n2. Thaan naayakanaakil Thantey lakshyam enthaakum?\nPaatham kai vilaavukalhil paadukalh\n\n3. Raajaavinenna pôlundo raajamudiyum\nMudiyundu sookshmam thanney mulhmudi\n\n4. Than pin chennaal thaanihaththil tharunnathenth?\nMahaadukham mahaayathnam maa klèsham\n\n5. Ennum thannil pattichèrnnaal enthundavanil?\nDukham theernnu yathnam neengi swarpraapthi\n\n6. Enney chèrppaan njaan yaachichchaal Enney thallhumo?\nIllillaakaasham bhoomiyum pôyaalum\n\n7. Bhadram chèrnnu nithyam paarththaal bhaagyam labhyamo?\nVishudhdha vaakyam chollunnu ‘labhyamaam’", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0173": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0173-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0173-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "What a friend we have in Jesus\n- Joseph Scriven\n1. Enthu nallor sakhi Yeshu! Paapa dukham vahikkum\nEllaam Yeshuvodu chennu Cholleedumbolh Thaan kelhkum\nNombaramerey sahichchu Samaadhaanangalh nashtham\nEllaam Yeshuvodu chennu Cholleedaaika nimiththam\n\n2. Kashtam shodhanakalhundo Evvidha dukhanghalhum?\nLèshavum adhairyam venda Chollaam Yeshuvodellaam\nDukham sarvvam vahikkunna Mithram mattaarumundo?\nKsheenhamellaam ariyunna Yeshuvodu cholleedaam\n\n3. Undô bhaaram vaishamyangalh Thumbangalhum asankhyam\nRakshakanallo sanketham Yeshuvodariyikkaam\nMithrangalh nindikkunnundô? Poi cholleshuvodellaam\nUllham kayyil Eeshan kaakkum angundaashwaasamellaam", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0174": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0174-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0174-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 2, "tune": 1, "kind": "CONTINUATION"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0174-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Where is my wandering boy?\n- R. Lowry\n1. Maruthalikkum makaney!  ee raathri nee evidey?\nNeeyenn-omana paithalum en priya puthranum\nEe raathri nee evidey? ee raathri nee evidey?\n\nhaa! Ninney njaan ethra snehikkunnu!\n\nEe raathri nee evidey?\n2. Nin maathaavanthikey ninnu praarthichcha praayaththil\nNin manam ethra nirmalam! Nin mukham maadhuryam!\n\n\n-ee raathri...\n\n3. Munkaalam pôley ninney njaan kaanhmaan kothikkunnu\nAnnu nin jeevan shudhdhavum nin veetil bhaagyavum\n\n\n-ee raathri...\n\n4. Alanju pôkum makaney! Ninney njaan thèdunney\nVaishamyamellaam kondu vaa! Vathsalaa nee vègam\n\n\n-ee raathri...", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0175": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0175-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0175-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 2, "tune": 2, "kind": "AMBIGUOUS"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0175-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Odivaa kripayaam nathiyarikil – nintey\nmalinatha neekkaan paapi\nOdivaa kripayaam nathiyarikil\n\n1. Thèdi ninney kaanhmaanèttam\nVaadi vazhannavannullham -\nÔdivannu paadukalhangèttu kurishil\nNèdi nintey raksha Yeshu\nMôdiyoduyirththu Pithaa-\nvôdirunnu madhyasthanaa-\naikkenhapèkshikkunnu vegam       -odivaa...\n\n2.Ashudhdhikalhozhichchu nin\nAkruthyangalhakatteedaan\nVishudhdhiyinnuravayeththuranna maarvil\nKulhichu nee anudinam\nVelhuppinchchankiye pinney\nKudichcheedil thadichchu nee\nVishudhdhanaai valharneedum      -odivaa...\n\n3. Parishudhdhaathmaavu nintey\nMaranhaavasthaye kandu\nKaralhalinjarikil vanneduththu ninney\nThirujeevan oothi ninnil\nMaruroopamaakki ninney\nThirusnaanam nalkiyavan\nParishudhdhanaai nadaththum      -odivaa...\n\n4. Sathyamaam thiruvachanam\nShuddhivaruththidum ninney\nShuddhiyin vazhiyathil nadaththum vachanam\nNithyam nintey paadangalhkku\nSathyavelhichcham thannittu\nShuddhathayin shuddhasthala\nThhetthuvôlham thunhachcheedum  -odivaa...\n\n5. Shuddhiyinnalankaaraththil\nShuddhimaanmaarey sthuthippin\nShuddhathayil vasikkum Yahovaye ningalh\nNithyam nithyam valharnnu naam\nShuddhathayil muthirnnu paa-\npaththey nashippichcheedukil\nKristhuvil jeevichcheedumnaam     -odivaa...\n(M. Mathen)", "qaStatus": "REVIEW", "qaIssues": ["AMBIGUOUS_TUNE_STRUCTURE"]}, "KK-0176": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0176-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0176-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 2, "tune": 1, "kind": "CONTINUATION"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0176-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Have you been to Jesus\n\n- E.A. Hoffman\n\n1. Shuddhikaai nee Yeshu sameepay poyo?\nKulhicho kunjaattin rakthathil?\nPoornhaashrayam ee nimisham than kripa\nthannil vachcho shudhdhiyaayo nee?\nKulhicho kunjaattin\n\nAathmashudhdhi nalkum rakthathil?\n\nHimam pol nishkalankamo nin anki?\n\nKulhicho kunjaattin rakthathil?\n\n2. Anudinam rakshakan pakshaththo nee\nShudhdhiyaay nadannidunnathu?\nKrusheriya Karthanil ninakkundo?\nVishramam naazhika thorumey   -kulhicho...\n\n3. Karthan varavil nin anki shudhdhamo\nEttavum venhmayaay kaanhumo\nSwarpuraththil vaasam cheitheedaan yogya\nPaathramaay theerumo annalhil  -kulhicho...\n\n4. Paapakkara etti anki nee neekki\nKunjaattin rakthathil kulhikka\nJeevaneer ozhukunnu ashudhdharkaay\nKulhichu shudhiyaayiduka\n -kulhicho...\n\n  (Translation: Rev. T. Koshy)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0177": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0177-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0177-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Pinnaale varika kurisheduththen\n\n\nPinnaale nee varika ninne verhuththen\n\n\nPinnaale nee varika!\nPinnaale nee varika peyaadum chinthavittu\n\nInneram maayalaabham ellaam upekshichu nee\n\n-pinnaale…\n\n1. Ennil aashrayikka ennil anpu vekka\nEnnude aathmasahaayam kettu kolhka\nMannil guruvai vannen mahathwa karthaavu njaane!\nOnnum vidaathe thadam oronnum nokkikkonden\n\n\n-pinnaale…\n\n2. Paapa pareeksha bhayamenye jayikka\nThaapam ninnna himsakalh sarvavum sahikka\nRaappakal paranodu ramichu japichu kolhka!\nKopam vedinjellaarkkum - gunham cheykathu neevaayi\n\n-pinnaale…\n\n3. Chintha neeyenudetheu chethassi darikka\nSwantha jadechchakalh jayichozhicheeduka\nAntham chinthichu ninne - akhilam verhuththirikka\nSanthatham thudarnnu vaa - sakala thalangalhilum\n\n-pinnaale…\n\n4. Sukhamillathidathum - durkhada sthalathum\nAkathu khedippaan ekanaai nee ninneedilum\nPakalullha velhichathum bhramamekum iruttilum\nThukayoden thadam kandu sookshichu nadannente\n\n-pinnaale…\n\n5. Dheeranaai varika chernnu pinvarika\nPaaram santhushtanai parasyamai varika\nVerhe kaanhunnavare vilhichukooti varika\nVerhe kootarodellaam sneham kaanhichu konden\n\n-pinnaale…\n\n6. Paapiyaayaalum pakachonaayalum\nThaapiyaakathe nee vaa dayayodu vilhichen\nPaapikalhe rakshippaan parama kanaanil cherppaan\nShaapam chumannu theerthen samayam poyidum mun\n\n-pinnaale…\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n       (Moshavatsalam)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0178": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0178-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0178-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Vilayèriya kaalam azhikkaruthey Vilayèriya kaalam (2)\n1. Valiya dhanaththeykkaalhumMahima keerthiyékkaalhum\nPalabhaagyangalheykkaalhum Paaril ellaatteykkaalhum\n\n\n-vila...\n\n2. Vinhkripa nèduvaanum Vinayam sambaathippaanum\nVinhprasaadam labhichchu Vilhangi shobhichchidaanum\n\n\n-vila...\n\n3. Mochanam neethi mana Swasthatha vishudhdhiyum\nNeechappaapi labhichu Nirantham prakaashippanum\n\n\n-vila...\n\n4. Ullham puravum maari Unnatha divya shôbha\nThellum sandèhamenye Thelhinju vilhanguvaanum\n\n\n-vila…", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0179": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0179-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0179-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 2, "tune": 1, "kind": "CONTINUATION"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0179-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "When upon life’s billows\n- J. Oatman Jr.\n\n\n1. Loka shoka saagarey nee mungumbolh\nAakula paathravaanaai nee theerumbolh\nKarthan varshippikkum anugrahangalh\nEthra ennu chinthichettam modikka\n\nÈthra modamundinnèrathil\n\nDaivaththin karunhayorkumbolh\n\nUllasikka bhaaravaahiye\n\nEeshan èttam karuthunnu ninakkaai\n\n2. Praapanchika chinthayaal valayunno\nKrooshuvahippaanèttam prayaasamo\nSandeham vènda nee kaanhum aashwaasam\nInnèram rakshakan paadam chèrneedil\n-ethra…\n\n3. Nashwaramaam dhanaththey nee\nkaanhumbolh\nLèsham vishaadam asooyayum vènda\nShaashwatham nin swargaththiley nikshepam\nYeshu vaagdaththam cheithallo ninakkaai\n-ethra…\n\n4. Kallolathulyamaam allal vanneedil\nThellum bheethivèndallo manathaaril\nKarthan nalkum aashissukalh ôrththèvam\nSwargam chèrum nèram varey modikka\n-ethra…", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0180": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0180-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "AMBIGUOUS"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0180-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "There is life for a look\n\n-A.M. Hull\n\n\n1. Jeevanundaam èka nottaththaal krushinkal\nJeevanundaam ippolh ninakku\nPaapi nokki nee raksha praapikkuka\nJeevaney thannoru Yeshuvil\n\nNô-kki-jeevikka\nJeevanundaam èka nôttaththaal krushinkal\n\nJeevanundaam ippolh ninakku\n\n2. Yeshuthaan nin paapam vahichchittillaaikil\nEnthinupaapavaahakanaai\nThan mrithyu nin kadam veettaikilenthinu\nPaapanaasha rakthamozhukki\n\n\n-nokki...\n\n3. Prarthana kannheerum aathmaavey rakshikkaa\nRaktham thaan rakshikkum aathmaavey\nRakthaththey chinthiyoreshuvil nin paapam\nSaadaram vekkuka neemudaa\n\n\n-nokki...\n\n4. Cheyyendathaayini onnumillenneeshan\nChonnathaal samshayam neekkuka\nKaalaththikavinkal prathyakshanaayavan\nVèlaye poornhamaai thikachchu\n\n\n-nokki...\n\n5. Yeshuthaan nalkunna nithyamaam jeevaney\nAashu nee saamôdam vaanguka\nNinnudey neethiyaam Yeshu jeevikkayaal\nVannidaa mrithyu ennarika\n\n\n-nokki…", "qaStatus": "REVIEW", "qaIssues": ["NO_CLEAR_TUNE_START"]}, "KK-0181": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0181-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0181-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Vanneeduveen yeshupaadam cherneeduvin\n\n\nPaapathe vittodeeduvin\n\nVaruvinnareyum orunaalhum njaan\n\nThallhukayillennurachu yeshu\n-vanneedu…\n\n1. Paapathin shambalham maranhame\nAthu ninne nashippikkume\nDaivakripayo kristhuvil nithya-\nJeevanaanhennu vishwasichittu\n-vanneedu…\n\n2. Innu nee marichaalengu pom?\nDaivakopoam neengiyo?\nNinakkai yeshu kurishil mari-\nchchuyirthezhunnallhi mahimayil\n\n\n\n\n\n-vanneedu…\n\n3. Maranhame ninayaa nerame-\nAthu ninne sandhikkume\nMarichor daivaputhrante shabdam\nKettu jeevikkum neramaayallo\n\n\n\n\n\n-vanneedu…\n\n4. Ithaa njan vegam varunnuvennu\nYeshuraajan arulhiyallo\nYeshuve! Vegam meghathil vannu\nNithya raajyathil cherkka njangalhe\n\n\n\n\n-vanneedu…", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0182": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0182-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0182-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Jeevitha yaathrakkaara Kaaladikalh engottu\n\nNaashaththin paathayo Jeevantey maargamo\n\nLakshyam nin munpil enthu?\n\n1. Anpin roopi Yeshu Naathan ninney vilhikkunnilley\nPôkalley nee andhanaayi loka soubhaagyam thèdi\nPonnin chiraku ninakku meethey\nKarththan virichathu kaanhunnilley\nSooryanin thaapamo ghôramaam maariyo\nNinney alattaa en ponmakaney\n\n\n\n-jeevitha….\n\n2. Vaishamyamaam mèdukalhil enganey nee kadakkum\nEnganey nee Yôrdaanintey akkarey chennu chèrum\nNin thônhiyil Karthan Yeshuvundo\nNin naavil prarthanaa gaanamundo\nPuththan gaanaalaapam paadi sthuthikkuvaan\nHriththidey swargeeya shaanthiyundo\n\n\n-jeevitha….\n\n3. Vishwaasaththin thônhi thannil pôkunna yaathrakkaaraa\nPaaraakkettil thattaathey nee akkarey chenneedumo\nOlhangalh erunna saagaraththil\nJeevitha thônhi alanjaadumbolh\nAarundu kaithaangaai aaru sahaayikkum\nKappiththaan Yeshu allaathey ninney\n\n\n-jeevitha….\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(O.C. Alexander)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0183": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0183-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0183-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Jeevithapaatha engottennorkka\nJeevante naayakan nin koode undallo\nAlanju pokuvaan anuvadikkayilla\nNallidayan aalayil cherthidum\n\n\nNin vazhikalh nee bharamelpichidu\n\n\nPokendum paatha kaanhikkum sarvadaa\n\n\nSathyavum jeevanum maargavumonne\n\n\nIdarhaathe poka vishwaasa paathayil\n\n2. Vishaala vaathil naashathin paatha\nJeevante maargam njerukkamullhathu\nKadannu poyidaam naayakan pinpe\nEthidume vaagdatha naadathil\n\n\n-nin…\n\n3. Neethiyin paathayil gamanam cheytheedil\nNyaayathin vaakkukalh nin naavil vanneedum\nUcharicheeduvaan dairyam pakarneedum\nUdharikka snehathin aathmaaval\n\n\n-nin…\n\nRakshithaavinte Vilhi", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0184": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0184-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0184-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Thanayaa! Ninnude perkkayi-ttenude chora\n\n\nBali cheythaayathine orkka!\n\nVinayathaal nee narakatheekanalil veezhuvaarhaayi\n\nManassode jeevan - ninakkai thannu veendille?\n\n-thana…\n\n1. Ithine karutheedaathe maayaamohathaal\nMathikedaai nadaneedaathe\nChathiyanaam pishaachine - athi dooreyakattaanjaal\nPathiyum nee narakathil athinillethume maatam\n\n\n-thana…\n\n2. Ithinu thulyamaayentho nee thanneedum paapee!\nKuthukamodithu chinthikka\nAthirattullhoru modam akame thannathinaayi\nPathiyaamennude paade varika nee madiyaathe\n\n\n-thana…\n\n3. Duritham njan palathumettu nin durithangalh\nShirassil njan chumannu theerthu\nKaruthukinnithine nee - aruthu samshayamethum\nViruthu vaanguvaanai nee - kurishum kondu sheekfram vaa\n-thana…\n\n4. Varumoro njerukkam bhoomou nee athinaale\nParithapichirunnidaathe\nMaranha naazhikayolham - irikka vishwasthanaayi\nTharuven jeevakireedam - athinu samshayikkenda\n\n-thana…\n\n5. Dinavum nee maricheedanham - ennil jeevippaan\nVinayam nee dharichidenham\nAkame njan valharenham - purhame nee nashikkenham\nKrhaye njan kalhayumbolh bhramicheedenda neeyethum\n-thana…\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(T.J. Varkey)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0185": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0185-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0185-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Ayyo paapi! Nee en - paadu kaanhuka!\nPaathakam nee cheythaal nee - paadu njan petten!\n-ayyo…\n1. Paramaanandam njaan - vittu ninmoolam\nPerum kaattinnulh njan - vannu ninmoolam\nKeerhiya vasthram puthchen - paarinnudayon\n\n\n\n\n\n-ayyo…\n\n2. Naramaathavin chol-keezhadangi njan\nOru yaachakan pol jeevanam cheythen\nAere vishappum daahavum - aettu ninmoolam\n\n\n\n\n\n-ayyo…\n\n3. Idikondente mei - ninte paapathaal\nAdi kondere njan ninte doshathaal\nKettukhalh thozhikalhkkumo - attamillalo!\n\n\n\n\n\n-ayyo…\n\n4. Irumbaanhiyaal en - kaikalh novunne!\nIrupaadanhalho-raanhimelaaye\nKaralhilum kuntham kadannu - choriyunne raktham\n\n\n\n\n\n-ayyo…\n\n5. Ninte paapathaal njan - novunneevannham\nNinte perkkallo njan thoongunneevannham\nNinte paapathinu vendi - njan adikonden\n\n\n\n\n\n\n-ayyo…\n\n6. Paarhakalh polumen paadu kaanhunne\nPaaram njettunne - kanh - neerozhukunne\nDheeranaai nee enne nokki thala kulukkaathe!\n\n\n\n\n\n-ayyo…\n\n7. Kunnanpeyode nee - chernnu nilkaathe\nEnne krooshinmel nee veendum thookkathe\nNinnude perkkullha shiksha ennilaayithaa!\n\n\n\n\n\n-ayyo…\n\n\n(Moshavatsalam)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0186": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0186-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0186-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "I gave my life for thee\n\n- F. R. Havergal\n\n1. En jeevan Njaan thannu\nEn raktham chorinju\nNinney veededuppaan\nNee ennum jeevippaan\nEn jeevan Njaan thannu\nEnthu thannenikku?\n\n2. Deergha kaalam pôki\nDukham kashtangalhil\nAanandamôkshaththin\nArhanaai theeraan nee\nEthra shramichu Njaan\nEnthu cheithenikkaai?\n\n3. Vitten Pithrugruham\nThèjassoththaasanam\nDhaathriyil alanju\nDukhichchum thanichum\nEllaam nin pèrkkallo\nEnthu cheithenikkaai?\n\n4. Paadenthu Njaan pettu\nPaathakar kayyaaley\nNaavaal avarnhyamaam\nNaasham ozhinjithey\nPaadèrey Njaan pettu\nPaapi enthèttu nee?\n\n5. Swargaththil ninnu Njaan\nSoujanya rakshayum\nSneham mochanavum\nSarva varangalhum\nKondu vannillayo\nKondu vannenthu nee?\n\n6. Ninnaayusenikkaai\nNee prathishtikkinney\nLokavum verukka\nModikka thaapaththil\nSarvavum veruththu\nRakshakan koodey vaa.\n\n\n(Translation: Rev. T. Koshy)\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nParishudhdhaathmaavu", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0187": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0187-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0187-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Varika nalvarangalhey Nee tharika Aaviye -\nShubha karunha vaapiye! (3)\n1. Thava janaabhishèkaththin sugandha thailamey\nDivya snaana thailamey (3)\n2. Praavu pôleyo dehanajwaala pôleyo\nKathirolhivu pôleyo (3)\n3. Vaazhka! Manassin durvichaaram aakey maattuvaan\nGunham èriththèruvaan (3)\n4. Paapakkadalin aazham kanda paapi njaan ayyo\nEnnil kôpiyaathayyo! (3)\n5. Dôshachchelhiyil muzhukivaazhum dôshi njaanayyo\nGunha dôshi Neeyallo (3)\n6. Prakruthi kondu vikrathamaaya hridayam maaruvaan\nNava hridayam aakuvaan (3)\n7. Irulh akannennakamathinkal velhivanhayuvaan\nVèdaththelhivunharuvaan (3)\n8. Sathya dharma neethi maarga murakalh aakuvaan\nKripa valharey nalkuvaan (3)\n  (Mani John Kochukunju)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0188": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0188-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0188-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 2, "tune": 1, "kind": "CONTINUATION"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0188-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Vannaa-va-si-kka! - devaathmaave! Nee\n\n\n\nVannaa-va-si-kka! -\n\nVannaavasikka vegam - ninnude maa kripayaal\n\nInneeyadiyaatinme-lunnathathinkal ninnu\n\n\n-vannaa...\n\n1. Karthaavin bhrithyarh penthi-kosthu perunnaalhinkal\nOthangorumayode - praarthichirikkunneram\nAettavum shakthiyullha - kaattottam polavarh mel\nEthi aavasicha po-lee daasariluminnu\n\n\n-vannaa…\n\n2. Karthaavarulhi cheytha-vaarthakalhellaamavarh\nUlhkkaambinkalormma va-ruththikkoduthu nalla\nShakthiyodeshuve pra-sidhapeduthippaanai\nAgninaavaalavrme-lannu vannapolinnu\n\n\n-vannaa…\n\n3. Annalhil moovaayiram aathmaakkalhinmel shakthi\nNannai jwalippicheshu-than naamathinkal cherthu\nPinneyangayyayira-thinmeloumoru naalhil\nNannai prakaashicha po-linneeyadiyaar melum\n\n-vannaa…\n\n4. Akkaalam thottu divya-shakthiyaal thirusabha\nUlhkaambil bhakthiyaai paa-likkapedunnathu pol\nIkkalathilum ninte prethyeka deepthimoolam\nIkkoottatheyum paalichiduvaanaikkondippolh\n\n-vannaa…\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n         (Rev. T. Koshy)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0189": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0189-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0189-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Aathmaave! - vanneeduka………. Vishu-\n\n\n\nDhaathmaave! Vanneeduka…..\n\n1. Aathmaave! Vegam vannennathipaapanga-lhaake neeyorppikkuka - njan\nAayavayorththu alarhi kkaravathinnayi thunhacheeduka\n\n\n-aathma…\n\n2. Kephaavin kannhuneereppolhozhukumen Kannhil ninnum daivame! -nin\nThrippadathinkal veenhi-ppolhapekshikkunnippaapiye veedolla\n\n-aathma…\n\n3. Kallaam manassine thallithakarkka nin Chollale vegamayyo dinam\nVellhakkuzhiyaakkikkollhuka ennirukannhukalhe vegam nee\n\n-aathma…\n\n4. Yeshu kurishil maricha swaroopamen Maanasam thanil dinam\nrakaashippathinu thunhakka daivame! Leshavum thaamassiyaa\n\n-aathma…\n\n5. Ninne ethra thavanha dukhippichiri-kkunnu mahaa paapi njan - ninte\nPonnamupadesham thallhikalhanju njan thannishtanai nadannen\n-aathma…\n\n6. Nigalham durmoham avishwaasam vanchana pakayenniva ozhichu - en\nAkame vishwaasam prathyaasha snehangalhe vegam thanniduka nee\n-aathma…\n\n7. Appostholarilirhangiya vannham-ippolhaakasham pillharnnu - nee\nEppaapimelirangi hridayam thannil eppozhum vaanheeduka\n\n-aathma…\n\n8. Jeevajalame! Kaninjanpodennil nee Mevaathirikkumenkil - nithya\nChaavinnirayaayidum mahaa paapi njan daivame! Kaividolla\n\n-aathma…\n\n9. Chollikkoodaatha njarakkangaodathi Vallabhan munpillayyo - ee\nChellhaamenikkayapekshippathinu nee thellum thaamasikkola\n\n-aathma…\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(Yusthus Youseph)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0190": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0190-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0190-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Vishudhaathmaave! Varika doshiyaam en nejil vasikka!\nNin hitham ethra arinjaalum paapame\nNithyam cheythidunnu njan - enmel\nNee kadaakshikenham allenkil paapi njan\nNithya chaavinnirayaam\n          -vishu…\nPaapiyaamen moolam paadupetten yeshu\nPaaril marichathine - pala\nPraavashyam paapimarhannu maa paapangalh\nPakshamai cheythu poyen             -vishu…\nJeevanundennoru naamame ullhennil\nJeevanille parane - bhavaan\nKaivittaal paapi njan chaavanidayaame\nKopichupo-karuthe\n\n          -vishu…\n\nNinnodapakshichu vandanam cheyvaanum\nNin sathyam kelhpathinum - maannyam\nEnnil palappozhum - vannupoye, kshama-\nThannu nee vanneeduka\n          -vishu…\nEe loka maayayil kaalam kazhichu njaan\nMel lokathe marhannen - ini\nAaloka kaaryangalh chinthippathinu nee\nAagraham thanneeduka\n          -vishu…\nKallu polullha en vallatha nenjine\nNallavanhamurukki - ullha\nVallaatha chinthakalh neekki ennullhil nee\nPallhikondeedanhame\n          -vishu…\n\n\n\n          (Rev. T. Koshy)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0191": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0191-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0191-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Maa parishudhaathmane! Shakthiyerhum daivame!\n\n\nVannu rakshikkenhame vegame\n\n1. Paapiyaamennil nyaangalh paalichunhartheeduka en\nPaapavazhikalh kaanhikkuka - vegame - paapavazhukalh…\n-maa…\n\n2. Paapabodham nalkuka nee neethinyaaya theerppineyum\nPakshamodingorma nalkuka - vegame - pakshamoding…\n-maa…\n\n3. Yeshuvodu cheruvaanum sathyam grahicheeduvaanum\nEnne aakarshichaduppikka - vegame - enne aakarshi…\n\n-maa…\n\n4. Nalla jeevashwasavum moksha bhaagya mudrayathum…\nNalkuka veendum jananavum - vegame - nalkuka veendum…\n-maa…\n\n5. Parishudhanaakkukenne - padippikka daivahitham\nParane! Vazhi nadathenne vegame - parane! Vazhi....\n\n-maa…\n\n6. Balaheenatha varumbolh thunhachaashwassippikkenne\nParalokaanandam kaattuka - vegame - paralokaanandam…\n-maa…\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n       (Moshavatsalam)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0192": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0192-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0192-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Penthikosthin Vallabhaney Ezhunnarulhka\n\nNin daanam yaachikkunna Nin daasarinnullhaththil\n\n\nChinthum theejwaalayoththa Thiru prasannathayôdey\n-penthikosthin…\n\n1. Vishwaasam sneham aashayum agathikalhkku\nMèlil ninnayakkenhamey\nNin shwaasam illa enkil nirjeeva roopam njangalh\nNee thaamasichcheedalley shakthi pakarnneeduvaan\n-penthikosthin...\n\n2. Pèrallaathonnumillayyo! Nilakalhellaam\nPizhachcha pamaanamaayayyo\nOro manassukalhum oro nilathirinju\nOru mana menna shakthi ozhinjupôyallo Swamee!\n-penthikosthin...\n\n3. Kallaaya nenchukalhellaamurukki mana\nkkaadellaam vettikalhaka\nEllaa vanchanakalhum illaathey aakkenhamey\nÈvarkkum anuthaapam anugrahaththôdarulhka\n\n-penthikosthin...\n\n4. Paapaththinnuravakalhey adachchennullham\nPaavanamaakkeedenhamey\nThaathpparyaththodey njangalh Yeshuvey pinthudaraan\nSathya kristhavaraayi kaakkanham adiyaarey\n\n-penthikosthin…\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n       (Moshavatsalam)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0193": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0193-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0193-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 2, "tune": 2, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0193-malayalam-1.jpg", "choir/KK-0193-malayalam-2.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Shuddha shuddha Karthaa! Dèva! Jeeva daayakaney\nChiththa shuddhi nalki Enney rakshikkinneramey\n\n2. Vaasam cheikennulhil Dèvaa! paapa bôdham nalka\nNaashamaai ppokaaivaanenney paalichchidenhamey\n\n3. Sathyaathmaavey! Vaayennullhil nithyavum nee paarkka\nKristheshuvin mudra ennil pathikka nee ippolh\n\n4. Snehaadi phalangalh ennil aavaa nadikamaai\nSnehavaaney! Thunhaikkenham heena paapiyenmel\n\n5. Thaatha sutha shuddhaathmaavey! Naatha! Threeyekaney!\nThaa nin kripaa varangalhey nin seva cheitheedaan.\n\n\n          (T.K. Youseph)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0194": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0194-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0194-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Ennullhilennum vasichcheeduvaan swarga\nMandapam vittirangi – vanna\nUnnathanaam thankapraavey neevannennil\nennumadhivasikka\n\n2. Thankachirakadi ethranaalh kettittum\nShanka koodaathey Ninney – thallhi\nSanketham njaan koduththanyarkkennorthitha\nsankadappetteedunnu\n\n3. Karththaney ethra anugrahangalh ayyo\nNasthamaakki ee vidham - innum\nKashtatha thannil valayunnu njaanithaa\nthattiyunharththanhamey\n\n4. Shoonyavum paazhumaaithallhiyathaamee nin\nMandiram thannilinnu - Deva\nVannu paarthu shudhdhi cheithu nin veetttintey\nnindayakattenhamey\n\n5. Jeevithaminnum shariyaayittillayyo\nJeevippikkum Karththaney - vannu\nJeevanum shakthiyum snehavum thannenney\njeevippichcheedenhamey\n\n6. Shakthiyin simhaasanamathileri\nVasikkunna Yeshuraajan - ennil\nShakthiyodevannu vaanhidum nèraththil\nShakthanaai jeevikkum njaan\n\n7. Ennalankaara vasthram dharichcheedum\nnjaan\nInnu muthal Daivamey - melaal\nEnnilashudhdhanum chèlayillaaththonum\nchernnuvarikayilla\n\n8. Ee vidhaththil paripaalikkappettidaan\nDaivaathmaavey vannennil – ennum\nAavasichchu Thava thèjassaalennudey\nJeevan prashobhippikkaa\n(Rev. T. Koshy)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0195": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0195-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0195-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Paavanaathma daanam parkarnneedènham Dèva\nDaasaril nanney niravôdeedinamathil\nAathma daanam divya vaagdaththadaanam\nArulhuka kripayôdey paraaparaney\n\n1. Saakshikalhaayi rakshakan naamam\nPakshamôdennum kondaadeeduvaan\n\n-paavana...\n\n2. Peedakalh vannaal aadalkoodaathey\nMôdiyodèshuvey paadiduvaan\n\n\n-paavana...\n\n3. Pattinhi, daaham, nagnatha, ninda\nÈthinum shaktharaai mèviduvaan\n\n\n-paavana...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(K.C. Elias)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0196": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0196-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0196-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Penthicosthin shakthiye ayaykka daivame - nin\nSwantha daasarkettam - jeevan labhyamaakuvan\n\n2. Lokam than vashatthillaakki nin janagnalhe - aathma -\nDaahamullha daivamakkalhethra durlabham\n\n3. Naama maathramaai janam thirinju haa vibho - bahu-\nKemamaayittundu baahyamaaya karmangalh\n\n4. Kedupatti nin sabhakkithaake naadhane - divya\nChoodu leshamillayennathathre sankadam\n\n5. Praanha naadhane! Ayaykka ninte aaviye - theere\nPraanhanatta nin sabhayunharnnu jeevippaan\n\n6. Neekkuka bhayam sakala samshayangalhum - nin\nBhaagya vaasathaale ullham swargamakkuka\n\n\nDaivavachanam", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0197": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0197-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0197-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Parishudhaathmaave-ippolh Eeyadiyaar mel\nKaralhalinju vannu  Varam nalkeedenhame\n\n2. Penthikosthin naalhil  Swantha apposthalarmel\nChanthamodirhangi vanna  Parishuddhathmave\n\n3. Nalla daanangalkkudaya Vallabhane nee\nSwarlokathil ninnirhangi Varika njangalh mel\n\n4. Vannu Varaprasaadangalh Ellaavarkkumelum\nThannittaashirvaadathodayacheedenhame", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0198": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0198-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0198-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 2, "tune": 2, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0198-malayalam-1.jpg", "choir/KK-0198-malayalam-2.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Nin Thiru vachanaththil ni-\nnnathbhutha kaaryangalh\nChanthamaai grahippathinnu\nNinthunha nalkeeshô!\n\n2. Andhakaara raajanentey\nChintha kalakkaathey\nKaanthaa nin chinthayenniltha-\nnnaadyantham paalikka\n\n3. Sathya vachanaththil ninnu\nNithya jeeva vaakyam\nChiththey pathippichcheeduka\nShudhdhaathma Naayaka\n\n4. Vishwaasaththodennullhil nin\nNishwaasa mozhikalh\nNishchayamaai kalarnney ni-\nkkaashwaasa mundaavaan\n\n\n\n\n(T.J. Varkey)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0199": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0199-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0199-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Nalladevane! Njangalh ellavareyum\nNallathaakki nin ishtathe cholleedenhame\n\n2. Pachamechilil njangalh maenjiduvaanaai\nMechamaam aaharathe nee nalkeedenhame\n\n3. Andhakaaramaam ee lokayaathrayil\nBandhuvaayirunnu vazhi kaatteedenhame\n\n4. Imbamerhiya nin anpullha swaram\nMumbe nadannu sadaa kelhpikkenhame\n\n5. Vedavaakyangalh njangalhkkaadayamaavaan\nVedanaadhane! Ninte gnaanam nalkuke\n\n6. Santhosham sadaa njangalh chinthayil vaazhaan\nSanthoshathe njangalkkinnu daanam cheyyuke\n\n7. Thaathanaathmanum priya nithyaputhranym\nSaadaram sthuthi sthothram ennum chollunnen – amen\n\n(Mullasseril John Easow)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0200": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0200-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0200-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Daiva vachaname divya vishesham\nSarvadaa modamode - athil\nDaivame! Nokkuvaan kannhenikkekuka\nJeevadaaya parane!\n\n1. Koorirulhin vazhipokkanu nallapra-\nKaasham thelhichu kaatti - sadaa\nNere than vazhu nadathidum manhivilha-\nkkethiha lokamathil?\n-daiva…\n\n2. Mediniyil dhanadhaanyam niranjullha\nbhandaarashaalayethu - aathma\nPaidaahamerhivalanjeedunnorkkoru\nBhedamenye koduppaan\n-daiva...\n\n3. Swargapuram nokkiyaathra cheyyunnavar-\nkkokkeyumullhahaa - nalla\nYogyanaam mithrathe thettukoodaathangu\nKootikkoduppathenthu\n-daiva…\n\n4. Undoru vrikshaththin phalameppozhum\nKundithanaam paapiyil-mahaa\nIndalakatti santhosham kodutheedu-\nnnethathu lokamathil?\n-daiva…\n\n5. Paapathaal nonthu valanjittum rogikku\nVaidyanaameshuvine! kaatti\nRaappakal koodirunnaashwaasa vaakkukalh\nChollikkoduppathenthu?\n-daiva…\n\n6. En vazhikkullha manhivilhakkum - sadaa\nJeevante bhojanavum - nalla\nJeevatharuvin sukhamekum phalamethum\nNin vachanam parane!\n -daiva…\n\n(Rev. T.J. Andrews)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0201": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0201-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0201-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 2, "tune": 1, "kind": "CONTINUATION"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0201-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Sing them over again to me\n\n- P.P. Bliss\n\n\n1. Yeshuvin thirupaadathil Irunnu kelhkka naam\nThante vishudha vaakyathil  Nammude jeevanaam\nYeshuvin suvishesham  Divyamaam upadesham\n\n\nKelhkkuka naam kaakkuka naam\n\n\nJeevante vaakyangalh\n\n2. Daivavachanam jeevanum Shakthiyum aakayaal\nAathmarakshayundevanum ullhathil kaikondaal\nAathma maranham maarhum neethiyilavan vaazhum\n-kelhkkuka…\n\n3. Andhanu kaazhcha nalkuvaan vachanam meergamaam\nSathyathil athu kaakkuvaan swarggathil daanamaam\nOzhiyuvaan nithyanaasham kaalinoru prakaasham\n-kelhkkuka…\n\n4. Sathya daivathin bhakthanmaar vachanam kaakkayaal\nSalpravarthikku shakthanmaarh aakunnu naalhkkunaalh\nDaivamukha prasaadam nithyam avarkkaahlhaadam\n-kelhkkuka…\n\n5. Lokavum avasaanikkum vaanavum illaathaam\nDaivavaakku pramaanhikkum bhakthano nithyanaam\nVaattam maalinyam naasham illaaththoravakaasham\n-kelhkkuka…\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n           (Translation: V. Nagal)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0202": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0202-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0202-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Madhuram madhuram manoharam nal\n\n\nThenilum madhuram thiruvachanam\n\n1. Meltharamaam pon athinodathulyam\nThankavum athinodu samamalla\n\n- madhuram…\n\n2. Paathayil shobhitha deepamathayi\nKoorirulh aake akattidum\n\n\n- madhuram…\n\n3. Ariyodu poruthaan arikil maruvum\nShariyaam udavaalh athunoonam\n\n- madhuram…\n\n4. Ripuvaam paambin damshanamettu\nmarichorkkellamuyirekum\n\n\n- madhuram…\n\n5. Vazhiyarhiyaathe uzhalum marthyanu\nThelhivaai maargam velhivaakum\n\n- madhuram…\n\n6. Aathma vishappaal valayunnorhkku\nBhakshanhamakum mannayithu\n\n- madhuram…\n\n7. Adhvanikkum manujarkkakhilam\nAashwasathinnurhavidamaam\n\n- madhuram…", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0203": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0203-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0203-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Tune: How I praise thee\n\n1. Daivamey Nin arivaaley - Hridayam niraikkukey\nJeevanaam Nin kripayaaley - Aathmakkanh thurakkukey\n\nDaiva jnjaanam shreshta daanam\nBhakthan sathya sambaththum\n\nVaanchikkenham kenchidenham\n\nKristhuvinkal kandeththum\n\n2. Oru baalan thantey paatha Nirmalam aakkeeduvaan\nKaruthènham Nin pramaanham - Kèttu kaaththu sookshippaan\n-daiva...\n\n3. Thèdiyôru Shalomonum Ee nikshèpam darshaney\nNèdi Karthan suprasaatham Kèttu than rahasyaththey\n\n-daiva...\n\n4. Daiva bhaktharkadisthaanam Sathyaththin prakaashanam\nJeeva shakthi athin daanam Phalam divya swaathanthryam\n-daiva...\n\n5. Nadakkumbolh idaraathey Gnaanam kaalkalh sookshikkum\nKidakkumbolh kaividaathey Chuttum kaaval ninnidum\n\n-daiva...\n\n6. Mannhum ponnum neengippokum Kannhin moham neengumey\n\nVinnhin daanam athma gnaanam Nila nilkkum ennumey\n\n-daiva...\n\n7. Daivamey Nin velhippaadin Aathamaavingu nalkukey\nNin prakaasham avakaasham Aakkuvaan thannarulhka\n\n-daiva...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(V. Nagal)\nAnuthaapam", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0204": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0204-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0204-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 2, "tune": 2, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0204-malayalam-1.jpg", "choir/KK-0204-malayalam-2.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Paapi njaan mahaa paapi njaan paraa Yeshu Naathaa! Swaamee!\nKôpichcheedalley Daivajaathaney - Yeshu Naathaa! Swaamee!\n\n2. Naavinaal manam kriyayaalumey - Yeshu Naathaa! Swaamee!\nNin virôdhiyaai paapi njaan Paraa - Yeshu Naathaa! Swaamee!\n\n3. Neethi nôkkiyaal bheethiyèrunney - Yeshu Naathaa! Swaamee!\nHèthuvingilley vaathichcheeduvaan - Yeshu Naathaa! Swaamee!\n\n4. Njaan cheyyaaththoru thinmayingilley Yeshu Naathaa! Swaamee!\nPinthiriyalley en Paraa! Paraa! Yeshu Naathaa! Swaamee!\n\n5. Thinmayallaathey nanmayingilley - Yeshu Naathaa! Swaamee!\nNanma thinmayaal theernnu pôkunney - Yeshu Naathaa! Swaamee!\n\n6. Chinthichchen ullham venthu theerunney - Yeshu Naathaa! Swaamee!\nEnthu njaan cheithen en Paraa! Paraa! - Yeshu Naathaa! Swaamee!\n\n7. Annu kallhanu daththamaam kshama - Yeshu Naathaa! Swaamee!\nInnee paapikkum thanneedenhamey - Yeshu Naathaa! Swaamee!\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n8. Nee vediyalley  paapiyaamenney - Yeshu Naathaa! Swaamee!\nPôvathinoru paathamattilley - Yeshu Naathaa! Swaamee!\n\n9. Enney môchichchaal thanney Nin kripa - Yeshu Naathaa! Swaamee!\nNanney shôbhikkum nanma daayaka - Yeshu Naathaa! Swaamee!\n\n10. Kaalam pôkunney maalil chaakum mun - Yeshu Naathaa! Swaamee!\nChèlôdey kripa cheitheedenhamey - Yeshu Naathaa! Swaamee!\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(Moshavatsalam)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0205": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0205-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0205-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Paraney thrikkada kannhaal nokkanhamey - entey\nPaapa dukhamokkeyum theerkkenhamey\n\n1. Sthiranallaaththa enney vediyaathey njaan\nCheitha kuttam onnum nee orkaathey\n\n2. Aadiyanthamillaaththa Sakalèshaa sathyam\nAlhavathillaaththa - nithya vaasa\n\n3. Maayaa valayil pettu kudungaathey- loka\nVaazhvil mayangimanam kalangaathey\n\n4. Adiyaninnarulh cheitheedarutho! nintey\nAdimaikku neeyenye gathi ètho?\n\n6. Vanchaka manassiney maattenhamey- entey\nNenchakam nee puthuthaakkenhamey\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(Thomas John)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0206": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0206-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0206-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Shreedevaattin kuttiye! Thiru-\nPaathamentey sharanham\n\n1. Jeevaney ninthiru punhya raktham enye\nPaapi njaan rakshapedaan – vérey\nAavathillaaikayaal sarvamoopékshichchu\nPaapiyithaa! Varunnen\n\n\n\n\n-shree...\n\n\n\n2. Bhaaram chumakkunna paapikalhey bhavaan\nChaarathu vanneeduvaan- Thiru\nKaarunhyaththaal vilhichcheedunnathôrththippolh\nPaapiyithaa varunnen\n\n\n\n\n-shree...\n\n3. Kaattudey ôdiya aadiney nèduvaan\nThèdi nee vannathinaal – paapa\nKaattil ninnodi maashreshtam idayaney\nPaapiyithaa varunnen\n\n\n\n\n-shree...\n\n4. Paapikalhey rakshacheivathinaayi Nee\nShaapamrithyu sahichcha – divya\nSneha kaarunhyaththey chinthichchu dhairyamaai\nPaapiyithaa varunnen\n\n\n\n\n-shree...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n5. Onninaalum anguchèrnna adiyaarey\nMannan Nee thallhukayil – ennu\nchonnathumoolamee – thinma niranjamaa\nPaapiyithaa varunnen\n\n\n\n\n-shree...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(Moshavatsalam)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0207": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0207-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0207-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Enthu cheyendu njan\n\n\nEn jeevanaadha\n\n\nChintha kalangiyuzhalunnu thaatha\n\n\nEnthu cheythidendu njan\n\n1. Ithra naalhaayittum ithiri polumen\nChiththamathu gunhappettittillayo!\n\n-enthu…\n\n2. En punyangalh thiru mumbillarhappai\nThanmburaane! Kaanhapettittallayo!\n\n-enthu…\n\n3. Neethiyennhi swa-neethi thannil chaari\nPaathakanaai naasha paathayil poyayyo!\n\n-enthu…\n\n4. Maranhathil vereduththerhiyaykayaalayyo!\nMaranhavishamennulh-maruvinnayyo\n\n-enthu…\n\n5. Onnumilla ennil ennarhinjappolh\nMannane! Nin paadam thannil veenhidunnen\n-enthu…\n\n6. Nin valankai kondu enne pidichu nin\nPonnulokam thannil enne nadathuka\n\n-enthu…\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(Yusthus Youseph)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0208": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0208-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0208-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Kumbidunnenen jeevanaadhanaam - devaadhi devaa!\nNin paadapeedathinkal paapi njan\n\n-devaa-\n\n2. En dukham thirumunnil cholluvaan theerekkazhivillathente\nNenjadaykkunne naavu thaazhunne\n\n-deva-\n\n3. Viduvicheedukennarikil ninnu-cheru  paithalaamenne\nKadinapporil njan thalharnnirikkunne\n\n-deva-\n\n4. Nyaayavidhiyil kettaruthayyo - ee ksheenhanamenne\nNyaayamenikku naayaka! Neeye\n\n\n-deva-\n\n5. Enthappa! Doore maarhipokunnu? - vegamanhanju varika nee\nVenthu neerhumennullhil dairyam thaa\n\n-deva-\n\n6. Daivaraajyathil panthi cherthenne - pottiposhippikkayen\nDevaa nin paade veenhu kezhunne!\n\n-deva-\n\n7. Vandanam ninakkennum thaathane - nin pon chevi thurha-\nNnennapeksha nee vegam kelhkkanhe\n\n-deva-\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(Yusthus Youseph)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0209": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0209-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0209-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Jeeva naayakanaakum-eshuve - paapiyaakumen yaachana\nKopiyaathe nee kattarulhka - daaveedu raajante nandanaa! -\n\n2. Aadaravatta paapi njaneshu - naadhane en sankethame!\nBhoothalathinkal nee allaatheni-kkadaravaayittarulhu? -\n\n3. Appane! Paapi veenhu kookunnu - thripaadam thunhayennayyo!\nIppathakante sankadam kelhkkaathappurham thirinjeedalle! -\n\n4. Paapiyennenne chollukil neeyum - paapiye thediyallayo\nBhoovil vannu nin jeevan vittathu paapikalhin sankethame\n\n5. Ullham neerhi varunna paapiye - thallhumo kripaakkannhane\nUllhangalharhinjeedunnoneye-nnullhu neettile kaanhuka\n\n6. Thallha thaan marhaneedumo cheru-pillhaye, kanivullhone!\nThallhayenne marhakkillum - ponnu thallhayaam nee marhakkumo?\n\n7. Paadathil veenha paapiye thiru-paadathaa; methicheedumo?\nPaadathil veenha paapiyaam sthreekku-modathe koduthillayo?\n\n8. Saathaanayavanullhil theeyambi - aettavum choriyunnathaal\nAettavum thalharneedunnenithaa - Aettavum kanivullhone -\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(Yusthus Youseph)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0210": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0210-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0210-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Yeshuve! Karunhaasanappathiye\n\n\nNattam thiriyum enne veendukolh\n\n-yeshu\n\n1. Bhoothalathil neeyozhinju daasan enikkaadaravu\nKandathilla ha! Sakala mandalaadhipa! -\nChethassil kripayundaakki naasham anhayaathe kaathu\nChiththa chanjalam adakki cherkkasalbuddhi varuththi\n-yeshu\n\n2. Vairiyaam pishaachinodum kaayamohaadikalhodum\nPorithil madangi adipettupoyi njaan -\nAdimaye lokarkkozhichorudaya thamburaane! Nalla\nIdayane! Orezhayodaam adiyane kanhpaarkkanhame\n-yeshu\n\n3. Ennhamatta paapangalh njan cheythavayaake porhuthu\nPunhyavaan ekane! Enne punhyanaakkenham\nNinnadima aayidumorunnathi enikkundaavan\nNinnadivanhangi nithyam vandanam cheytheedunnu njan  -yeshu\n\n4. Nallavarulakil aarum illa neeyozhinju sarva\nVallabhathvamulhavan nee allayo devaa-\nKollharuthaathullhennil thallhi neekki ninnudaya\nNalla nalla daanangalhaal ullhalankarikka ente\n\n-yeshu\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n        (Mani John Kochukunju)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0211": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0211-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0211-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Daivamey sneha roopaney\nEnney nee thallheedalley\nSanthaapaththaal vilhikkunnen\nDoshiyey rakshikkanhay\n\n2. Nintey sneham-arinjittum\nNinney snehichilley njaan\nThannishtanaai nadannupoi\nNeekenhay en paapaththey\n\n3. Ee lokaththin sukhangalhey\nThedippoi njaan aarthiyaal\nSwarloka bhaagyam pinthallhi\nBhoshathwam njaan kaanhichchu\n\n4. Sathyamallatha vaakkukalh\nShankayenye othi njaan\nNeethiyallatha kriyakalh\nDaya koodaathey cheithu njaan\n\n5. Ashudhdhamaaya chinthakalh\nMalinamaaya kaazhchakalh\nAshudhdhamaakki maanasam\nAndhamaakki kankhalhey\n\n6. Mohangalh saadhichchiduvaan\nKoushalam prayogichchu\nMahaanennu niroopichchu\nNindaa paathra maayippoy\n\n7. Mathimarannu nigalhichchu\nSukhangalh peruki vannappolh\nAthin phalaththaal veenhupoi\nLajjikunni neechan njaan\n\n8. Kashtathakalh dhaaralham njaan\nChuttupaadum kandittum\nOttum kaarunhyam illaathey\nSwaartham maathram nivarththichchu\n\n9. Ippozhithaa Nin paadaththil\nKumbidunnee ézha njaan\nUlhpooviney shudhdhi cheithu\nJeevippikka doshiye\n\n(Rev. K.P. Philip)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0212": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0212-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0212-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Yeshuvey! Karunhaasanaa! Mahaa\ndôshi njaanayyo\nKripa thonnanhamayyo!\n\n1. Neechanaamen durithangalhey\nNôkkanhamithaa – koodey\nPaarkkanhem sadaa\n-yeshuvey...\n\n2. Periyasaaththaan arishaththodu\nPeriyamaaripol asthram\nChoriyunnentey mèl\n-yeshuvey...\n\n3. Jadaththinmôham kaduththa vairi\nAduththanhayunnu – nripa\nodukkanhaminnu\n\n-yeshuvey...\n\n4. Dushtalôkam ninnil ninnum\nVittakattunna – kripa\nkittanhamininnu\n\n-yeshuvey...\n\n\n5. Lôkam jadam pishaachu\nValharey kèducheyyunnu –kripa\nThèdunnen innu\n\n-yeshuvey...\n\n6. Kadina paapachumaduneekkum\nKarunhayullhavaa – kripa\nTharanham nallavaa\n-yeshuvey...\n\n7. Dushta sheelamennil ninnu\nVittakattanham – puthu\nSrishti yaakkanham\n\n-yeshuvey...\n\n8. Parishudhaathmaavaaya Daivam\nVannu paarkkanham enney\nEnnum kaakkanham\n-yeshuvey...\n\n9. Nintey raajyamthannillenney\nKaaththukollhanham – ennum\nchèrthukollhanham\n\n-yeshuvey...\n\n(Yusthus Youseph)\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nPrathishta", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0213": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0213-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0213-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Anpin roopi Yeshu naatha! Nin ishtam ennishtam aaka\nKurishil thoongi marichchavaney! Enney thèdi vannavaney\n\n\n-anpin...\n\n2. Mrithyuvintey thaazhvarayil njaan thellum bhayapedilla\nPaathaalhaththey jayichchavaney! Ninnil nithyam aashrayikkum\n\n\n-anpin...\n\n3. Enthu njaan Ninakku nalkum, veendeduththa Daivamey\nEzhayaayi njaan kidannu enney thèdi cherththavaney\n\n\n\n-anpin...\n\n4. Jeevano maranhamatho èthaayaalum sammatham thaan\nKushavan kaiyyil kalhimanhpol guruvey enney nalkidunney\n\n\n-anpin...\n\n5. Rogam, naasham, ninda, dushi, verhey enthu vannaalum\nVaazhum Yeshu paadaththil njaan, muththam cheyyum avantey paadam\n-anpin...", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0214": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0214-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0214-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Tune: More about Jesus\n\nE.E. Hewitt\n\n1. Yeshuvey poley aakuvaan\nYeshuvin vaakku kaakkuvaan\nYeshuvey nokki jeevippaan\nIvaye kaamkshikkunnu njaan\n\nUrappikkenne en naathaa\n\nNiraykkayenne shudhdhaathmaa\n\nKristhan mahathwaththaaley njaan\n\nMuttum niranju shobhippaan\n\n2. Shaishava praaya veezhchakalh\nMoshayaalullha thaazhchakalh\nNeekkuka ellaam Naayaka\nEkuka Nin sampoornhatha\n\n\n\n\n\n-urappikkenne...\n\n3. Praarthanayaal eppozhumnjaan\nJaagarichchu poraaduvaan\nNintey sahaayam nalkuka\nEntey mahaa purohithaa\n\n\n\n\n\n-urappikkenne...\n\n4. Vaagdaththamaam niksheypam njaan\nAakeyen swantham aakkuvaan\nPoornha prakaasham Rakshakaa\nPoornha vishwaasaththeyum thaa\n\n\n\n\n-urappikkenne...\n\n\n\n\n5. Bheeruthwaththaal anekarum\nTheerey pinmaari khedikkum\nDheeratha nalkukeshuvey\nVeeranaam saakshi aakkuka\n\n\n\n\n-urappikkenne...\n\n6. Vaangukayalla uththamam\nThaangukayerey shudhdhamaam\nEnnum ninnodu koodey njaan\nEnnhuvaan gnaanam nalkanham\n\n\n\n\n-urappikkenne...\n\n7. Thèduvaan nashtam aayathum\nNèduvaan bhrashtam aayathum\nKannhu neer vaarkkum sneham thaa\nVannu nin agni kaththikka\n\n\n\n\n\n-urappikkenne...\n\n8. Kashtathayilum paaduvaan\nNashtam athil kondaaduvaan\nShatkthi arulhka Naathaney\nBhakthiyil poornhaan aakkuka\n\n\n\n\n-urappikkenne...\n\n9. Yeshuvin koodey thaazhuvaan\nYeshuvin koodey vaazhuvaan\nYeshuvil nithyam cheruvaan\nIvayey kaamkshikkunnu njaan\n\n\n\n\n-urappikkenne...\n\n(V. Nagal)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0215": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0215-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0215-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 2, "tune": 2, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0215-malayalam-1.jpg", "choir/KK-0215-malayalam-2.jpg"], "manglish": "Neeyozhikey neeyozhikey Aarumillesho!\nSnehamayamey vishudhdhi neethiniravey  -Nee...\n\n\n1. Neeyen raksha neeyen bandhu nee enikkaasha\nNee en swanthamaayi vannathen mahabhaagyam\n-Nee...\n\n2. Ennum engum Yeshu nee ennodu koodavey\nAnnirunna shakthi kripa yodu vaazhunney\n\n-Nee...\n\n3. Jeevanèkaalh nee valiyon aakunnenikku\nBhoovilarivaan ninakku thulyam mattilley\n\n\n-Nee...\n\n4. Thannu sarvvavum enikku vèndi neeyallo\nNinnaruma naamam adiyaanu samastham\n\n-Nee...\n\n5.Mangalamey en dhanamey kshema daathaavey\nBhangamillaa bandhuvey mahaa shubhavaaney\n\n-Nee...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(Moshavatsalam)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0216": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0216-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0216-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Snehamaameshuve snehame nirhavaai!\nSneham ninmozhi kriyayumellaam sneham sarvavume\nSnehicheshu en chorayil kazhuki\nSnehamaam thaathanu enne aachaarya raajanaakkiyallo!\n\n2. Iyyulakaadhipan-kanh kurudaakki\nAayathaal bhangi roopavumillathaayi nee enikku\nDaivaathmaavennude kaazhchaye nalki\nDevasuthanappolh ente kannhinu kaouthakumaai vannu\n\n3. Daasavesham poonda - devakumaaran\nYeshudevaa! Vishwaasikalhkku nee vilayerhiyavan!\nAayirangalhude aayirangalhil\nAthi soundaryavaanaakumeshu devan neeyallayo!\n\n4. Neeyallathaarullhu swargamaam loke!\nNeeyallathilla bhoovilaarum njan ichchikkathakkavan\nHaa! Manoharan nee maadhuryavaan nee\nHaa! Mahaa shudhanennude paapam - aake neekkiyavan!\n\n5. Nirhavaaya kripa - poornhamaam sneham\nNeethiyulkrishta shreshtathakalhodullhatheshuve! Nin\nEn srishtaavivan thaan en karthaavivan thaan!\nEnne srishtichu rakshichu nithya jeevan thannathivan\n\n6. Sarva naamangalkkum - sarva vasthuvinum\nSarva srishtikkum melai ninne njan snehicheedum naadhaa! -\nSthothrameshuvinum thaathanum sthothram\nSthothramennashwaasa pradanume - amen halleluyyaa-\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(Rev. T. Koshy)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0217": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0217-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0217-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Mahathwa prabhu maricha van kurishey paarththen\nIhaththin laabham uyarcha - heena mennennhunnen\n\n2. En paran Yeshu marichcha thennum njaan kondaadum\nInpa mingullhava vitten Yeshu raktham nèdaan\n\n3. Khèdam anpum than murivu thôrum ozhukunnu\nVèdana mulh than mahathwa van mudiyaakunnu\n\n4. Divya paksham nèduvaan en jeevan dèhiyeyum\nSarvva swaththineyum elpikkunnu njaan enneyum\n\n5. Èka Karththaavaam Kristhuvin kurishathu maathram\nDèhiyullha kaalam ellaam enmahathwa sthothram\n\n\n\n(Moshavatsalam)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0218": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0218-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0218-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Swantham Ninakkini njaan\nYeshu Devaa! - Paapa\nbandham neekkennil ninnen\npriya Naathaa!\n\n1. Santhoshamennu pèyin\nVazhi nadannen\nAthu chathivey-nnunharnnu\nNinnodaduththu vannen\n\n2. Imbam paapam\ntharumey-nnarinju cheithen\nAthu erey thumbam\nthannathaal bhayannu vannen\n\n3. Lokam thunhaikkumennu\nChernnirunnen\nAthil ottum\nsthirathayillaanjodi vannen\n\n4. Kaayam balam sukhavum\nKaruththil vechchèn\nIthin kaazhcha-yanithyamenni\nthaa varunnen\n\n5. Dèham jeevanum Nin mun\nkaazhcha vechchèn\nIni cheivèn Ninthirumanam\npoley ennum\n\n6. Shakthi praapthi dhanavum\nKaacha vechchèn\nThiru santhosham nèduvaan\nnjaa-naduththu vannen\n\n7. Thaangi nadaththenham\nrakshaa Karthaavey –\npaaram thalarhni-thaa\nvannidunnen Dayavaaney\n\n\n\n       (Moshavatsalam)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0219": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0219-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0219-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Yeshuvin swanthamathre njaan\ninnum ennum\nYeshuvin swanthamathre njan\n\n1. Naazhika ithu muthal\nNaadhaa nin kanivaale\nNaashaka vazhi vedinjen\nYeshu naadha!\n\n-yeshu…\n\n2. Putthan jeevanenikku\nDatthamaayen naadhanal\nNithyamenikku sukhame!\nKripayaale\n\n\n-yeshu…\n\n3. Shaanthamaamennaathmaave\nKaanthanaam ninnul ninnu\nHantha! Pirippanonninnum\nkazhiville-\n\n\n-yeshu…\n\n4. Ennude gaanamini\nMannava mannaneesho!\nNinnude mahathwathinaai\nmaathramennum\n\n-yeshu…\n\n5. Swargamenikkullhathu\nBhaagyamenikku nithyam\nSwarga dootharen snehithar\nkripayaale\n\n\n-yeshu…\n\n6. Sathya samaadhaaname\nNithya santhoshamallo\nKarthanenikku swanthame\nkripayaale\n\n\n-yeshu…\n\n7. Putthan jeevanenneshu\nKarthannodu chodicchen\nDatthamaayallo enikku\nKripayaale\n\n\n-yeshu…\n\n8. Ente hridayamithaa\nNinte mumbil vekkunnen\nNinte chinthayenikkarhulh\nKripayaale\n\n\n-yeshu...\n\n(Rev. T.J. Andrews)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0220": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0220-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0220-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "I am coming to the Cross\n- W. McDonald\n\n\n1. Njaan varunnu krushinkal\nSaadhu, ksheenan, kurudan\nSarvvavum enikkechchil\nPoornha raksha kaanhum njaan\n\n\nSharanham en Karthaavey\n\nVaazhththapètta kunjaadey\nThaazhmayaai kumbidunnu\nRakshikka enney ippolh\n\n2. Vaanchichchu ninney yethra\nDôsham vaanhennil yethra\nImbamaai chollunneshu\nNjaan kazhukeedum ninney\n\n\n\n\n\n-sharanam...\n\n\n\n\n3. Muttum njaan tharunnithaa\nBhooni kshepam muzhuvan\nDèham dèhi samastham\nEnnèkum nintethu njaan\n\n\n\n\n\n\n-sharanam...\n\n4. Yeshu vannennaathmaavey\nNirakkunnu poorthiyaai\nSukhamennum poornhamaai\nMahathwam kunjaadinnu\n\n\n\n\n\n\n-sharanam...\n\n5. Ennaashrayam Yeshuvil\nVaazhththapetta kunjaattil\nThaazhmayaai kumbidunnu\nRakshikku nnippolheshu\n\n\n\n\n\n\n-sharanam...\n\n          (Rev. T. Koshy)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0221": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0221-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0221-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Murhivetta kunjaade nin rudhiramozhunnoru\nUrhavayathil neeyenne - kazhukenhame\nPaapakkarhaye neekkaan thurhanna urhavayilen\nPaapamakhilam pokki - kazhukenhame!\n\n2. Nin murhivil marhanju paarkkilen vedanakalh\nNeengi sukhamaakum nee - kazhukenhame\nKoodekkoode paapathaal - veezhunnu ksheenhathayaal\nPaadupedunnu shakthi nalkenhame!\n\n3. Shakthanaakum karthane! - Neeyennullhil vannente\nShakthiheenatha neekki - vaanhiduka\nAdavaakkennullhamathil verhaarum neeyenniye\nKadakkaathaakki nee mudra - pathikkenhame!\n\n4. Ninnude snehavadu enmel pathinjathangu\nNannaai vilhanguvaan nee thunhaykkenhame!\nJeevan sukham balavum - nannaai labhikkume nin\nMaarvil vaasam cheyyunnorkkennekkume\n\n\n\n\n\n          (Rev. T. Koshy)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0222": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0222-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0222-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 2, "tune": 1, "kind": "CONTINUATION"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0222-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Tune: Down in the valley with my Savior\n\n- W.O. Cushing\n\n1. Thetti njaan kaanhaathey Pôyoraadu pôlayyo!\nChutti paaram kaadaakey Naathanillaathey\nVittu nin vazhikalh kalpanakalh enniva\nPattu en hridayam ghora krithyaththaal\nShudhdhamaakka enney yaakamaanam\n\n\nShudhdhanaam Yeshuvey! Nintey rakthaththaal! (2)\n\n2. Dushtaraaya kallhar kayyil pettavaneypôl\nDushtaraakum pèi ganhaththaal chuttapettaho\nKashtathayil veenhuzhalum èzhayaamenney\nThrikkaraththil ènthi swasthamaakkuka\n\n\n\n-shudhdha...\n\n3. Nallidayanaakumentey ponnukaanthaa! Nin\nVallabhaththaa lullhalinjuthèduka enney\nShakthanaakkukaakamaanam ksheenhanaamenney\nKettukayen paapa murivukalhey\n\n\n\n\n-shudhdha...\n\n4. En aathmaavey! Ullhilkhèdikkunna thenthinu\nThantey jeeva nèkiyôn thaan ninney vidumô\nThaan chumannu kondupôkum swargga seeyonil\nThan vilhikèttu sannidhou chellukil\n\n\n\n\n-shudhdha...", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0223": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0223-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0223-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Tune: Lead kindly light\n\n1. En daivame! Nadaththukenne nee, enneravum\nPaarinnirulh athude swarge njan cherum vare\nNin thrikkaikalhaal ee bhooyaathrayil\nSarvadaa enne thaangidenhame!\n\n2. Nin kalpanakalh nimisham prathi lankhichu njan\nShudhaaviye sadaa en doshathaal dukhippichen\nNeethiyil enne nin mumbil ninnu\nChchedikkaathe nin kripa nalkuka!\n\n3. Ennathma dehi deham samastham aelppikkunnen\nNin kaikalhil kshanham prathi enne innu muthal\nVedavakyam paathayil koode\nVishudhaathmaavu nadaththenhame!\n\n4. Njan mannhaakunnu ennorkkunnone onninaalum\nEe pappiye upekshicheedaathe anpodu nee\nSarvashakthiyullha nin snehathaal\nSwargaththilekkenne aakarshikka!\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(V. Nagal)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0224": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0224-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0224-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Sevicheedum ninney njaan - En Yeshuvey!\nSevicheedum ninney njaan\n\n1. Jeevan enikkaayi Krushil vechchu thannen\nJeevaney veendeduththa Praanha naatha!\n\n-sevicheedum...\n\n2. Dèham dèhi aathmam Èkamaaythannu ninney\nSnehamaay sèvacheivaan Thaa nin kripa\n\n\n-sevicheedum...\n\n3. Paapam vedinjullha Paavana jeevitham\nPaapaharaa njaan cheivaan thunhaikkenham\n\n-sevicheedum...\n\n4. Ninkannhaa lenney nee Vazhi nadaththenham\nNin karaththaa lenney nee thaangidenham\n\n-sevicheedum...\n\n5. En hridaya mithaa Mannavaneshuvey\nNinnaaviyaal niraikkaa Nin sevaikkaay\n\n\n-sevicheedum...\n\n6. Lokam jadam pishaa-chodu por cheithu njaan\nNin kodikkeezhil ninnu jayam kollhum\n\n\n-sevicheedum...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(T.K. Youseph)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0225": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0225-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0225-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 2, "tune": 2, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0225-notation-3.jpg", "sourcePage": 3, "tune": 3, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0225-malayalam-1.jpg", "choir/KK-0225-malayalam-2.jpg", "choir/KK-0225-malayalam-3.jpg"], "manglish": "Nintey hitham poley enney\nNithyam nadaththeedenhamey\nEntey hitham poley alley\nEn Pithaavey, en Yehovay\n-ninte...\n1. Imbamullha jeevithavum\nÈrey dhanam maanangalhum\nThumba matta soukhyangalhum\nChodikkunnilley adiyaan\n-ninte...\n\n2. Nèru nira-ppaam vazhiyo?\nNeenda nadayo kurutho?\nPaaram karanjodunnatho?\nPaarithilum bhaagyangalho -ninte...\n\n3. Andhakaaram bheethikalho\nAppaney prakaashangalho?\nEnthu nee kalpichcheedunno\nEllaam enikaashirvaadam\n           -ninte...\n\n4. Èthu gunham-ennarivaan\nIlla gnaanam ennil Naathaa!\nNin Thiru naamam nimiththam\nNeethi maargaththil thirichchu           -ninte...\n\n5. Agni mègha thoonhukalhaal\nAdiyaaney ennum nadaththi\nAnudinam koodey irunnu\nAppaney kadaakshikkukey\n           -ninte...\n\n       (Moshavatsalam)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0226": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0226-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0226-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Daivahitham anusarikkunnathu sarva belikalheykkaalhaho!\nEttam nallaaradhanayathu poley mattupaasanayillanoonam\n\n\n\nKarthaney..poornhamaai chintha vaakku kriyayaalumey\n\n\nSanthatham ninney anusarichcheedaan nin thunha nalkenikku sadaa\n\n2. Yeshu rakshakan Daiveshtam athinnu krushiley maranhaththolhavum\nAnusarichchu avaney sathatham anusarikka en manamey\n\n\n-kartha...\n\n3. Vedavaakyanghalh ellaadivasavum shodana cheithu vishudhdhamaam\nDaivahitham sarvakaaryangalhilum cheivorkellaam shubham sarvadaa..\n-kartha...\n\n4. Anusaripporku Daivam thannaathma daanaththey nalkunnu niravaai\nSarva vairikalheyum jayichchavar jeevanil vaanhidunnu sadaa\n\n\n-kartha...\n\n5. Anusarikkunnor Daivamakkalhaai dinavum kripayil valharum\nDaivaththodu chodicheedunnathellaam sarvadaa labhikkum avarkku\n\n-kartha...\n\n6. Pushtiyullha gothambukondavarey mrishtamaai poshippikkumavan\nPaarayil ninnullha thèninaal dinam thorumey thriptharaakum avar\n\n-kartha...", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0227": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0227-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0227-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Have Thine own way\n\n1. Ninnishtam Dèvaa aayidattey\nNjaano manh paathram nin karaththil\nNin paadaththil njaan kaaththirikkum\nNinnishtam pôl nee maattukenney\n\n2. Ninnishtam pôley aakanhamey\nNin sannidhou njaan thaanhirikkum\nNin vachanamaam thannheerinaal\nEnney kazhuki shudhdhi cheika\n\n3. Ninnishtam pôley aakanhamey\nEnnullham novum vèlhayilum\nNin karam thottu thaalolikken\nKarththaavé njaanum shakthanaavaan\n\n4. Ninnishtam pôley aakanhamey\nEnnishttarenney thallhiyaalum\nNjaan kaividilla yennu chonna\nNaathaa! Nin vaakken thaashwaasamey", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0228": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0228-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0228-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Tune: Loved with everlasting love\n\n1. Aathma dehi dehaththey - Kaazhchayaai vakkunnithaa\nNin munbil njaan, Yeshuvey - ennum ninvaka aavaan.\n\nPeedaththinmel enney njaan, vachchu theekaai kaakkunnu\n\n\nKaaththu kaathirikkunney Thee irangaan nokkunnu\n\n2. Yaaga peedathil Naatha - Njaan samastham Nin swantham\nNinteythaai kaaththiduka - Kulungaathen vishwaasam\n\n\n-peedath...\n\n3. Yeshuvey en rakshaka nin - naamam enaashrayam\nRakshakkaay nokkunnithaa - Nin mozhi en sharanham\n\n\n-peedath...\n\n4. Paapathinadhikaaram - thannil ninnu vittu en\nAngangalhey nin karam - Thannil elpichchidunnen\n\n\n-peedath...\n\n5. Daiva seva cheivaanum - jayamodu paapaththey\nKaalkeezhil methippaanum - Thrikkaiyyil elpikkunney.\n\n\n-peedath...", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0229": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0229-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0229-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Swargeeya Pithaavey Nin Thiruhitham\nSwargaththiley poley Bhoovilaakkanhey\nNin hitham cheithônaam Nin Suthaney poley\nInnu njaan varunney Nin hitham cheivaan\n\n\nEn Daivamey Ninnishtam cheyyuvaan\nVanneedunney Njaan innu modamaai\n\nEntey ishtam onnum Venda priyaney\n\nNintey ishtam Ennil poornhamaakkanhey\n\n2. Nanmayum poornha prasaadavum ullha\nNin hithamenthennu njaanariyuvaan\nEn manam puthukki maaridunney nithyam\nNindya maanheneekki loka laavanhyam\n\n\n-en daivamey...\n\n3. Njaanavunullham kayyilirikkayaal\nAarum illenikku dôsham cheiyyuvaan\nInnenikku vannu nèridunnathellaam\nThan hitham aanhennu njaanariyunnu\n\n\n-en daivamey...\n\n4. Yeshu Kristhuvin shareera yaagaththaal\nUllha ishtaththil njaan shudhanaai theernnu\nDaiva ishtam cheithu vaagdaththam praapippaan\nPoornha sahishnhutha Èkanhey priya\n\n\n-en daivamey...", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0230": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0230-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0230-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Kurisheduththen Yeshuviney\nAnugamikkum njaananthyam varey\n\n1. Bhaarangalh nèridumbolh\nKarangalhaal thaangidunnu\nMaranhaththin thaazhvarayathilumenney\nPiriyaaththa maadhurya nalla sakhithaan\n-kurisheduththen...\n\n2. Avanenney arinjeedunnu\nAvaniyil karutheedunnu\nAavashya bhaarangalh anhanjeedumbolh\nAvalambamaayenikkavan maathramaam\n-kurisheduththen...\n\n3. Maaridum manujarellaam\nMarannidum snèhitharum\nMaattamillaaththavanen Manuvel\nMahimayil vaazhunnu innumenikkaai\n-kurisheduththen...\n\n4. Theeranham paarilen naalh\nThirupaada sèvayathaal\nChèrum njaan oduvilen priyannarikil\nArumayodavanenney maarodanhaikkum\n-kurisheduththen...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(Charles John)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0231": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0231-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0231-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Ellaam angey mahathwaththinaai\nEllaam angey pukazhchaikkumaai\nTheernneedenhamey priyane\nThirunaamamuyarnnidattey (2)\nEllaam angey mahathwaththinaai\n\n1. Snehaththiludey ellaam kaanhuvaan\nSnehaththil thanneyellaam cheyyuvaan\nEnnil nin swabhaavam pakarènhamey – divya\nThèjassaalenney niraikkenhamey\n\n\n\n-ellaam...\n\n2. Aathmaavin shakthiyodey jeevippaan – aathma\nNalvarangalh nithyavum prakaashippaan\nAathma naayakaa nirantharamaayenni-\nlaathma daanangalh pakaranhamey\n\n\n-ellaam...\n\n3. Nintey pèril njangalh cheyyum vèlakalh\nThiru naamavum dharichchu cheyyum kriyakalh\nBhoovil njangalhkalla vaanavaney\nAngey vaazhvinaai maathram theeranhamey\n\n-ellaam...\n\n4. Vakratha niranja paapa lokaththil\nNee vilhichchu vèrthirichcha nin janam\nNintey ponnu naama mahathwaththinaai\nDinam shobhippaan kripa nalkanhamey\n\n\n-ellaam...", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0232": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0232-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0232-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Lead Kindly Light\n\n\n- Cardinal J.H. Newman\n\n1. En deepamey! Ee andhakaaraththil nadaththenney!\nÈrunnirulh veedum dooraththayyo nadaththenney!\nKaakkuken paadam chôdikkunnilley doorey kaanhmaan oradi pôrumey\n\n2. Nadaththenney ennithuvarey njaan yaachichilley!\nKandavazhi njaan nadanney Innô nadaththenney!\nMôdi njaan thèdi shanka koodaathey-dambhiyaayen, ôrkkalley mun kaalam\n\n3. Inneyôlham paalichcha Daivamey! Raapôvôlham\nKaadum mèdum van kadal ivayil nadaththenney!\nNjaan snehichchathaam doothar punchiri veendum kaanhum njaan aa prabhaathaththil", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0233": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0233-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0233-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 2, "tune": 1, "kind": "CONTINUATION"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0233-notation-3.jpg", "sourcePage": 3, "tune": 2, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0233-malayalam-1.jpg", "choir/KK-0233-malayalam-2.jpg"], "manglish": "My Jesus I love Thee\n\n\n- W.R. Featherston\n\n1. En Yeshu en priyan enikkullhon Nee\nNin pèrku vediyunnu paapollaasam\nEn kaarunhya veendeduppu raksha Nee\nEppolh snehichcho (njaan)  (3)\nAayathippolh thanney\n\n2. Njaan snehikkunnu Nee mun snehichchenney\nEn mochanam vaangi Nee kaalvariyil\nNjaan snehikkunnu mulhmudiettathaal\nEppolh snehichcho (njaan)  (3)\nAayathippolh thanney\n\n3. Njaan snehikkum jeeva maranhangalhil\nNjaan jeevikkum naalh ennum vaazhthum ninney\nEn gaanam anthya vaayu pokumbozhum\nEppolh snehichcho (njaan)  (3)\nAayathippolh thanney\n\n4. Anantha pramodamodey swargaththil\nVanhangikkondaadum Ninney ennekum\nNjaan paadidum minnum mudivachchangu\nEppolh snehichcho (njaan)  (3)\nAayathippolh thanney\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(Rev. T. Koshy)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0234": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0234-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0234-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Take my life and let it be\nF.R. Havergal\n\n1. Sweekarikken jeevaney\nNinakkaayenneshuvey\nOroshwaasaththôdum njaan\nChollattey halleluyyaa\n\n2. Sweekarikken kaikalhey\nCheivaan sneha kriyayey\nKaalukalhum ôdanham\nNee vilhichchaal thalkshanham\n\n3. Sweekarikken naaviney\nSthuthippaan Pithaaviney\nSwaram adharam sarvvam\nNilkunnu nin doothinaai\n\n4. Sweekarikken karnhaththey\nKèlhppaan nin marmmangalhey\nKannhinaai prakaasham thaa\nNinney kaanhmaan sarvvadaa\n\n5. Sweekarikken budhdhiyé\nGrahippan nin shudhdhiyé\nMana shakthi kèvalam\nninakkaayeriyanham\n\n6. Sweekarikken hridayam\nAthu nin simhaasanam\nNjaan alla en raajaavey\nNee athil vaazhenhamey\n\n7. Sweekarikken sambaththum\nEntey ponnum vellhiyum\nVènda bhoomiyil dhanam\nEn nikshèpam swarggaththil\n\n8. Sweekarikken Yeshuvey\nEnneyththanney Priyaney\nEnnannèkum Ninakku\nEnney njaan prathishtichchu", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0235": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0235-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0235-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Lôkamaam gambheera vaaridhiyil\nVishwaasa kappalil ôdiyittu\nNithya veedonnundavidey eththi\nKarthanôdu koodey vishramippaan\nYaathra cheyyum njaan krooshey nôkki\n\n\nYudhdham cheyyum njaan Yeshuvinaai\n\n\nJeevan vechcheedum rakshakanaai\n\n\nAnthyashwaasam vareyum\n\n2. Kaalam kazhiyunnu naalkalh poyi\nKarththaavin varavu sameepamaai\nMahathwa naamaththey keerthippaanaai\nShaktheekarikka nin aathmaavinaal\n\n\n-yaathra...\n\n3. Poorva pithaakalhaam apostholar\nDooravey darshichchee bhaagya dèsham\nAakayaal chèthamennennhi laabham\nAnyarennennhi ee lokamathil\n\n\n\n-yaathra...\n\n4. Njerukkaththin appan njaan thinnennaalum\nKashthaththin kannhuneer kudichennaalum\nDèhi dukhaththaal kshayichchennaalum\nEllaam prathikoolam aayennaalum\n\n\n-yaathra...\n\n5. Jeevan Enneshuvil arppichittu\nAkkarey naattil njaaneththeedumbolh\nShudhdha palhunkin kadal theeraththil\nYeshuvin ponmukham muththidum njaan\n\n\n-yaathra...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(Annamma Mammen)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0236": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0236-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0236-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Just as I am\n\n-C. Elliott\n\n1. Enikkaai chinthi nin raktham\nIlli thallaa thoru nyaayam\nIppozhum nin vilhi ôrththu\nDèvaattin kutti! varunnen\n\n2. Vividha samshayangalhaal\nVichaara pôraattangalhaal\nVipaththil akapettu njaan\nDèvaattin kutti! varunnen\n\n3. Daaridyarishtan kurudan\nDhana soukhyangalh kaazhchayum\nDaanamaai ninkalh labhippaan\nDèvaattin kutti! varunnen\n\n4. Enney nee kaikondeedumey\nEn pizha pôkki rakshikkum\nEnnallo nin vaagdaththavum\nDèvaattin kutti! varunnen\n\n5. Agôcharamaam nin sneham\nAgaadha prayaasam theerththu\nAyyo nintey ninteythaavaan\nDèvaattin kutti! varunnen\n\n6. Aswaira snehaththin neelham\nAazham uyaram veethiyum\nAaraanjarinjangorkkuvaan\nDèvaattin kutti! varunnen\n\nVishwasam", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0237": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0237-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0237-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 2, "tune": 2, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0237-malayalam-1.jpg", "choir/KK-0237-malayalam-2.jpg"], "manglish": "Yeshu en adisthaanam aashayavanilathrey\nAashwasathin poornhatha yeshuvil kandey njaanum\n\n1. Ethra madhuramavan naamamenikku paarthaa\nOrthu varunthorumen aarththi maanjupokunnu\n\n-yeshu en...\n\n2. Dukham daaridryamennivaykkundo shakthiyenmel\nKaikku pidichchu nadaththikondu pokunnavan\n\n-yeshu en...\n\n3. Rogamenney pidichchen deham kshayichchalumey\nVegam varumen Naathan deham puthuthaakeedaan\n-yeshu en...\n\n4. Paapaththalennil vanna shaapakarakalh maatti\nShobhithaa neethivasthram aabharanhamaai nalkum\n-yeshu en...\n\n5. Vambichcha lokaththira kambam theeruvôlhavum\nMunbum pinbum aayavan anpodenney nadaththum\n-yeshu en...\n\n6. Lokamenikku vairi lokamenney thyajichchaal\nShokamenthenikkathil ethum bhayappedaa njaan\n-yeshu en...\n\n7. Vekkam than manhavaatti aakidum enney enna\nVaakkundenikku thantey neekkamillathinottum\n\n-yeshu en…\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(Rev. T.J. Andrews)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0238": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0238-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0238-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Tune: Mid pleasures and palaces\n\n1. En Yeshu en sangeetham en balam aakunnu\nThaan jeevantey kireedam enikku tharunnu\nThan mukhaththin prakaasham haa ethra madhuram\nHaa! Nalloravakaasham entethu nishchayam\n\n2. En Yeshu en sangeetham en balam aakunnu\nEnikku vipareetham aaya kaiyezhuththu\nThan krooshin Thiru raktham maayichchu kalhanju\nShathrutha theerththu swargam enikku thurannu\n\n3. En Yeshu en sangeetham en balam aakunnu\nEn hridayaththin khèdam okkey thaan theerkkunnu\nEn vazhiyil prayaasam njerukkam sankadam\nVarumbolh nallaashwaasam yeshuvin maarvidam\n\n4. En Yeshu en sangeetham en balam aakunnu\nThan nithya snehamkondu enney snehikkunnu\nThaan thudangiya vèla ennil nivarththikkum\nThan krishnamanhi pôley enney kaaththukollhum\n\n5. En Yeshu en sangeetham en balam aakunnu\nThan varavu sameepam neram pularunnu\nDivya mahathwaththodey thaan velhipettidum\nEe njaanumavanôdu koodey prakaashikkum\n\n\n\n\n(V. Nagal)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0239": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0239-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0239-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Tune: Like a river glorious\n\n1. Kristhuvintey daanam ethra madhuram\nPoornha samaadhaanam poornha aanandam\nEthrayo visthaaram ullhor nathi pôl\nVarnnhikkuvaan aazham naavinilla chol\nEntey adisthaanam athu Kristhuvil\n\n\n\nPoornha samaadhaanam undipaarayil\n2. Pandu entey paapam manasaakshiye\nKuththi ee vilaapam theernnathenganey?\nEn vishwaasakkannhu nôkki krushinmel\nEllaam theerththu annu en Immaanuvel\n\n\n-entey...\n\n3. Karththan ullham kaiyil maranjirikkey\nPèyin soothram ennil muttum veruthey\nMallan aayudhangalh ellaam pottipôm\nIlla chanchalangalh dhairyamo paaram\n\n\n-entey...\n\n4. Bhayam samshayangalh theerey neenguvaan\nEthra vaagdaththangalh thannittundu thaan\nAthil oru vallhi illaathaakumo?\nPôkayillor pullhi saaththaaney! Nee pô!\n\n\n-entey...\n\n5. Buddhimuttu kashtam peruki vannaal\nEnikkenthu nashtam njaan Karththaavin aalh\nYeshu thaan en swantham entey raajaavum\nEnikkullha amsham atharedukkum?\n\n\n-entey...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(V. Nagal)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0240": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0240-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0240-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 2, "tune": 1, "kind": "CONTINUATION"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0240-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Tune: Safe in the arms of Jesus\n\n1. Onnum bhayappedenda! Nee vishwassikkennil\nOro nimishavum nin aayussin kaalathil\nNjan cheytheedunnathu nee arhinjeedaaykilum\nNinnarikil varuvaan njan thaamasikkilum\n\n\n\nOnnum bhayappedenda! Nee vishwasikkennil\n\n\nOro nimishavum nin aayussin kaalathil\n\n2. Lokaandhakaarathoode nee sancharikke nin\nKaal vazhuthida ninte nithya prakaasham njaan\nVellhangalhilkoode nee pokunna nerathil\nPralhayangalh ninmeethe kavinjozhukumbolh\n\n-onnum…\n\n3. Aakashavum bhoomiyum ozhinjupokilum\nEn vaakkukalh ozhinjupokaa orunaalhum\nNjaan innaleyum innum ennekkum njan thanne\nkaividukayilla njan orikkalum ninne\n\n\n-onnum…", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0241": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0241-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0241-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Nearer my God to Thee\n- Sarah F. Adams\n\n1. Ninnoden Daivamey njaan cherattey\nNin krooshu njaan vahikkennaalumey\nEn geetham ennumey ninnoden Daivamey!\nNinnoden Daivamey njaan cherattey\n\n2. Daasan Yaakobeppol raakaalaththil\nVan kaattil kallinmel urangukil\nEn swapnaththilumey ninnoden Daivamey!\nNinnoden Daivamey njaan cherattey\n\n3. Nee enney nadaththum paatha ellaam\nVinh eththum ènhipôl prakaashamaam\nDoothar vilhikkunney ninnoden Daivamey!\nNinnoden Daivamey njaan cherattey\n\n4. Unharnnu njaan ninney sthuthichcheedum\nKal thalayinhaye Bethelaakkum\nEn thumbaththaalumey ninnoden Daivamey!\nNinnoden Daivamey njaan chernnidum\n\n5. Aakaasha maarggamaai mahonnathey\nParannu pôkilum santhoshamey\nEn geethamennumey ninnoden Daivamey!\nNinnoden Daivamey njaan chernnidum\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(E.I. Jacob, Kochi)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0242": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0242-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0242-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Tenderly guide us\n\n1. Snehaththin idayanaam Yeshuvey\nVazhiyum sathyavum nee maathramey\nNithyamaam jeevanum Daivaputhraa!\nNeeyallaathaarumilla\n\n\n\nYeshu! Naathaa! Njangalhkku neeyallaathaarumilla\n\n\nYeshu! Naathaa! Neeyallaathaarumilla!\n\n2. Paapikalhkaay valanjalanjathum\nAadukalhkaay jeevan vedinjathum\nPaadukalh pettathum aar naayaka!\nNeeyallaathaarumilla\n\n\n\n-Yeshu...\n\n3. Neekkiduvaan ellaa paapaththeyum\nPokkiduvaan sarvva shaapaththeyum\nKopaagniyum keduththeedaan karthaa\nNeeyallaathaarumilla\n\n\n\n-Yeshu...\n\n4. Arivaan Swarga Pithaavineyum\nPraapippan vishudhdhaathmaavineyum\nVeroru vazhiyumilla naatha\nNeeyallaathaarumilla\n\n\n\n-Yeshu...\n\n5. Sahippaan en buddhiheenathayum\nVahippaan en mahaaksheenhathayum\nLaalhippaan paalippaan Daivaputhraa\nNeeyallaathaarumilla\n\n\n\n-Yeshu...\n\n6. Sathya vishwaasaththey kaathiduvaan\nNithyam nin keerthiye paadiduvaan\nBhrithyanmaaril kripa thanneeduvaan\nNeeyallaathaarumilla\n\n\n\n-Yeshu...\n\n7. Daivmahathwaththil thaan varumbolh\nJeeva kireedaththey thaan tharumbolh\nAppozhum njangalh paadidum naatha\nNeeyallaathaarumilla\n\n\n\n-Yeshu...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(V. Nagal)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0243": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0243-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0243-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Yeshu mathiyeni kkeshumathiyeni\nkkeshumathiyé nikkennèkum – En\nYeshumaathram mathiyenikkennèkum En (2)\n\n1. Èthu nèraththumen bheethiyakatti\nsammodamôdey nithyam kaakkuvaan\nsammodamôdey enney nithyam kaakkuvaan (2)\n-Yeshu...\n\n2. Ghôravairiyôdu pôriduvathinnu\nDheerathayenikku nalkuvaan nalla\nDheerathayenikku nithyam nalkuvaan (2)\n\n-Yeshu...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n3. Kshaamam vasanthakalhaaley lôkamengum\nKshèmamillaathaayi vannaalum njaan\nKshèmamillaaththavanaayi theernnaalum njaan (2) -Yeshu...\n\n4. Lôkaththilenikku yaathonnumillaathey\nVyaakulappedèndi vannaalum - njaan\nVyaakulappeduvaanida vannaalum njaan (2)\n-Yeshu...\n\n5. Yeshu ullhathinaal kleshippathinaayi\nLèshamidayilla nishchayam – lava\nLèshamidayilla athu nishchayam lava (2)\n\n-Yeshu...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(P.V. Thommi)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0244": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0244-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0244-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "What can wash away my sin\n\n\n-Robert Lowry\n1. Paapakkadam theerukkuvaan\nYeshuvin raktham maathram\nPaapa bandham azhippaan\nYeshuvin raktham maathram\n\nShree Yeshu Kristhuvey!\nDaivaththintey kunjaadey\n\nRakshikkunnu paapiyé\nNin thiru raktham maathram\n\n2. Veendeduppin vilayaai\nYeshuvin raktham maathram\nPunhyamillaa paapikkaai\nYeshuvin raktham maathram           -shree...\n\n3. Daivaththodu nirappum\nYeshuvin raktham maathram\nVèreyilla yôjippum\nYeshuvin raktham aathram\n         -shree...\n\n4. Saaththaaney aar jayikkum?\nYeshuvin raktham maathram\nThee ambiney keduththum\nYeshuvin raktham maathram          -shree...\n\n(Translation: V. Nagal)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0245": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0245-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0245-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Ente sambathennu cholluvaan verheyillonnum\nYeshu maathram sambathaakunnu…\n\nChaavine vennuyirhthavan vaanalokamathil chennu\n\nSaadhuvenne orthu nithyam thaathanodu yaachikunnu\n-ente...\n\n1. Krooshil maricheeshanen perkkaai - veendeduthenne\nSwargakanaan naattilaakkuvaan\nPaapam neengi shaapam maarhi mrithyuvinmel jayameki\nVegam varaam ennurachittaamayam theerthaasham nalki\n-ente…\n\n2. Thante perkkai sarva sambathum - yaagamaai vacchi-\nTtennannekkum thannil premamaai\nThante vela cheythu kondum ente krooshu chumannittum\nPraanha priyan sevayil en aayussellaam kazhicheedum\n\n-ente…\n\n3. Nalladaasan ennu chollunaalh thante mumbaake\nLajjithanaai theernnupokaathe\nNanniyoden priyan mumbil premakannheer chorinjeedaan\nBhaagyamerhum mahothsava vaazhchakaalam varunnallo\n-ente…\n\n4. Kunjaadakum ente priyante seeyon puriyil\nChennu cheraan bhaagyamundenkil\nLokamenne thyajichaalum dehamellaam kshayichaalum\nKleshamennil leshamillatheeshane njan pinthudarum\n\n-ente…\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n5. Ente desham idhdhareyalla anyanaai saadhu\nHaamin desham vittu pokunnu\nMelilerhushalemenne cherthu kollhvaanorungi than\nShobhayerhum vaathilukalh enikkaayittuyarthunnu\n\n-ente…\n\n6. Ente raajavezhunnellhumbolh thante mumbaake\nShobhayerhum raagniyaayi than\nMaarvilenne cherththidum than ponnumaarvil mutthidum njaan\nHaa! Enikee mahaabhaagyam daivame nee orukkiye\n\n-ente…\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(Muthampakkal Kochukunju Upadeshi)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0246": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0246-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0246-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "En rakshakanaameshuvey\nEnney dayayodu kaaththu\nEnney Daiva bhakthiyil valharththi\nNannaakkeeduka\n\n\n1. Paapa samudraththilayyo\nPaari luzhanneedunnayyo\nPaalaka! en chiththam shudhdhamaakki\nPaalichcheeduka\n\n-En...\n\n2. Kanmasha parihaaraartham\nChinthiya thiru rakthaththaal\nKaarunhyaththaalmaam kazhukidèva\nshudhdheekarikka\n\n-En...\n\n3. Ninnaaley soujanyamaayi\nSambaadithamaam rakshayil\nEnneyavakaashiyaakkikkolhka\nkripaaswaroopaa\n\n-En...\n\n4. Vèda pramaanhaththil ninnu\nVègam njaanathbhuda kaaryam\nSaadaram kaanhmaanen kanhkalh\nNaathaa! Thurakkenhamey!\n-En...\n\n5. Vyaaja vazhiyil ninnenney\nVègam neeyakatti nintey\nVèda pramaanhaththey kripayodey\nnalkeedenhamey\n\n\n-En...\n\n6. Maayaye nôkkaathey vannham\nEntey kanhkalh nee thirichchu\nMahalgurô nin vazhiyilenney\nnadaththenhamey\n\n\n-En...\n\n7. Bhoolôka vaasam kazhichchu\nSwarlôkaththey njaan praapichchu\nKollhuvaan vèndunnathellaamenney\nkaanhikkenhamey\n\n\n-En...\n(Rev. T. Koshy)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0247": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0247-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0247-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Neeyallo njangalhkullha\ndivya Sambaththeshuvey\nNeeyallaathilla bhoovil\naashrayippaan aarumey\n1. Neeyallo njangalhkkaayi\nMannidaththil vannathum\nNeecharaam njangalhudey\nPaapamellaam éttathum (2)  -neeyallo...\n\n2. Kaalvari malamukha-\nlhéri nee njangalhkkaai\nKaal karam chèrnnu thoongi\nMarichuyirèkiya (2)\n-neeyallo...\n\n3. Annannu njangalhkkullha\nthellaam thannu pôttunnon\nInnummenum koodeyunden\nullha vaakku thannavan (2) -neeyallo...\n\n\n4. Shathruvin agniyasthram\nShakthiyodey thirkunna\nMaathrayil jayam thannu\nKaaththu sookshichcheedunna -neeyallo...\n\n5. Janakanudey vala\nmamarnnu Nee njangalhkkaai\nDinam prathi pakshavaadam\nCheithu jeevichcheedunna (2) -neeyallo...\n\n6. Lôkaththil njangalhkkullha\nthellaam nashtamaakilum\nLôkakkaar nithyam dushi-\ncheedilum ponneshuvey (2) -neeyallo...\n\n7. Nithya jeeva mozhikalh\nNinnilundu paraney\nNinney vittittadiyangalh\nEngupôyi vasikkum\n\n -neeyallo...\n(P.V. Thommi)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0248": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0248-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0248-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Entey Daivam mahathwaththil aardravaanaai jeevikkumbolh\nSaadhu njaanee kshonhi thannil klèshippaan - èthum\nKaaryamillen entey ullham chollunnu\n\n2. Vaishamyamullhèthu kunnum njaan karèri nada kolhvaan\nRakshakanen kaalukalhkku vègamaai -theernen\nPaathayil njaan maanineppol ôdidum\n\n3. Aaru menikkillenno njaan ékanaayi theernnuvenno\nMaanasaththilaadhi poondu khedippaan -saadhu\nAndhanaayi theernnidalley Daivamey!\n\n4. Entey nithya snehithanmaar daiva dootha sanghamathrey\nIppolhavar Daiva munbil sévayaam -enney\nKaaval cheithu shushrooshippaan vanneedum\n\n5. Dukhithanaai odippoyi njaan marubhoovil kidannaalum\nEnney orthu Daiva doothar vanneedum -éttam\nSneha choododappavumaai vanneedum\n\n6. Naalhaye konden manassil lavalesham bhaaramilla\nOro naalhum Daivamenney pôttunnu - thantey\nKaikalhil njaan dinam thorum chaarunnu\n\n7. Kaakkakalhey vichaarippin vithayilla koiththumilla\nDaivam avaikkaai vèndathèkunnu -lilly\nPushpangalhkkum Avan shôbha nalkunnu\n\n8. Patmos dweepil èkanaayi njaan vasichchaalum bhayamilla\nSwarggam thurannentey Priyan vanneedum - mahaa\nDarshanaththaal vivashanaaiththeerum njaan\n\n9. Haa! Maheshaa Karuneshaa! Ponnu Thaatha! Neeyenikkaai\nVéndathellaam daya thonni nalkumbolh -entey\nDèhi vrithaa kalangunnathenthinaai\n\n        (Muthampakkal Kochukunju Upadeshi)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0249": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0249-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0249-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Ente daivam swargasimhaasanam thannil\nEnnil kaninjenne ortheedunnu\n\n1. Maathaapithaakkalhum veedum dhanangalhum\nVasthu sukhangalhum karthavathre\nPaithal praayam muthalkkinnevare enne\nPottipularthiya daivam mathi\n\n2. Aarum sahaayamillellaavarum paaril\nKandum kaanhaatheyum pokunnavar\nEnnalenikkoru sahaayakan vaanil\nUndennarhinjathilullaasame\n\n3. Nalloru thaathan pithaavillaathorkkavan\nPettammayekkavinj-aardravaanum\nVidhavaykku naadhanum saadhuvinnappavum\nEllarkkumellaamen karthaavathre!\n\n4. Kayunna kaakkakkum vayalile rosakkum\nBhakshyavum bhangiyum nalkunnavan\nKaattile mrigangalhaattile mathsyanga-\n-lhellaam sarveshane nokkidunnu!\n\n5. Kodaakodi golhanmaarellaam padachava-\nNellaattinum vendhathellam nalki\nSrishtikalhkkokkeyum-aanandadaayakan\nDushtanmaarkkettavum bheethikaran!\n\n6. Kalyaanashaalayilenne vilhichente\nSanthaapamokkeyum theerthidum naalh\nSheekhram varunnente kaanthan varunnenni-\n-lullaasamai bahukaalam vaazhaan\n\n7. Lokam vedinjente swargeeya naadine\nKaanhmaan kothichu njaan paartheedunnu\nAnyan paradeshi ennentemelezhu-\n-ththennaal sarvasvavum entethathre\n\n        (Muthampakkal Kochukunju Upadeshi)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0250": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0250-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0250-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 2, "tune": 1, "kind": "CONTINUATION"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0250-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "O Happy Day\n\n\n- P.P. Doddridge\n\n1.En Rakshakaa! en Daivamé! Ninnil aaya naalh bhaagyamey\nEnnullhathin santhoshathtey ennum njaan keerthicheedattey\n\n\nBhaagyanaalh! Bhaagyanaalh Yeshu en paapam theertha naalh\n\nKaathupraarthikkaaraaki thaan! Aarthu ghoshikaaraaki thaan\n\nBhaagyanaalh! Bhaagyanaalh Yeshu en paapam theertha naalh\n\n2. Vankriya ennil nadannu Karthan entey, njaan Avantey\nThaan vilhichchu njaan pinchennu sweekarichchu than shabdaththey\n-bhagya...\n\n3. Swastham illaatha manamey, karthanil nee aashwasikka\nUpekshiyaathey avaney, Than nanmakalh sweekarikka\n\n\n-bhagya...\n\n4. Swarpuram ee karaarinnu Saakshi nilkun en manamey\nEnnum ennil puthukkunnu nanmudra nee shudhdhathmaavey\n\n-bhagya...\n\n5. Soubhaagyam nalkum baandhavam vaazhthum jeeva kaalam ellaam\nKristheshuvil en aanandam paadum njaan anthyakaalaththum\n\n-bhagya...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(Translation: Rev. T. Koshy)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0251": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0251-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0251-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 2, "tune": 1, "kind": "CONTINUATION"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0251-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Blessed Assurance\n\n- Fanny J. Crosby\n\n1. Yeshu en swantham halleluyya\nEnnudey bhaagyam chollikoodaa\nPazhayathellaam kazhinjupoi\nKandaalum sarvvam puthiyathaai!\n\nEnikku paattum prashamsayum\n\n\nDaiva Kunjaadum than kurishum\n\n2. Yeshu en swantham halleluyya\nTheernnu en andhyam neengi raavum\nIruttin paasham aruththu thaan\nJeeva prakaasham kanhunnu njaan!\n\n-enikku...\n\n3. Yeshu en swantham halleluyya\nThuranna swarggam kaanhunnithaa\nPaapam thaan neekki rakthaththinaal\nDaiva kunjaakki aathmaavinaal\n\n\n-enikku...\n\n4. Yeshu en swantham halleluyya\nEe snehabandham nilkum sadaa\nMaranhaththôlham snehichchu thaan\nNithyathayôlham snehikkum njaan\n\n\n-enikku...\n\n5. Yeshu en swantham halleluyya\nNintey sambaadyam njaan rakshakaa\nNee en karththaavum snehithanum\nJeevadaathaavum sakalavum\n\n\n-enikku...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(Translation: V. Nagal)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0252": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0252-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0252-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Shreeyeshu naayakaa! Nin paadaaravinda-morthu\nPaaril vasicheeduvaan kripacheyka!\n\n2. Theeraatha paapatheeyil oraathe njan pathichu\nPaarathe neerhidunnu gathiyenye\n\n3. Gambheera saagarathin meethe nadannappozhum\nPaadam nananjeedaatha parameshaa\n\n4. Raagaadhi doshangalkkai paanhi tharhachathaalen\nAathmaave raksha cheytha karunheshaa!\n\n5. Van mala poleyullha thinma vahicha mrithyu-\nVakthrathillandorenne karaketti\n\n6. Lokam vedinju deham naatam pidichirunna-\nLaasare jeevipicha jagadeeshaa!\n\n7. Klesham sahicha devaa! Krooshil maricha naadhaa!\nCherkkanhamenneyum than thiru maarhvil\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(P.C. John)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0253": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0253-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0253-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 3, "tune": 2, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0253-malayalam-1.jpg", "choir/KK-0253-malayalam-2.jpg"], "manglish": "Jesus, Love of my soul\n\n- Charles Wesley\n\n1. Yeshu en aathmasakhey! Nin maarvil njaan chèrattey\nEe lokamaam vaaridhou thirakalh uyarunney\nGhoramaam kôlh shaanthamaai theerum varey rakshakaa\nEn jeevaney kaakkuka Nin anthikey bhadramaai\n\n2. Vèrey sankethamilley enikkaashrayam Neethaan\nNaathaa! Kaivediyalley kaaththu rakshikkaa sadaa\nKarththaa Nee en aashrayam thrippaadam en sharanham\nNin chirakin keezhennum chèrththu sookshichidenham\n\n3. Kristho! En aavashyangalh ninnaal niravèrunnu\nÈzhakalh niraashrayarkaadhaaram neeyakunnu\nNeethimaan nee nirmalan mahaamlèchchan njaan muttum\nPaapi njaan maa paapi njaan kripa sathyam nee muttum\n\n4. Kaarunhya varaannidhey kanhmasham kazhukuka\nNithya jeeva vellhamen chiththam shudhdha maakattey\nJeevannuravaam naathaa! njaanèrey kudikkattey\nEnnullhil uyaruka nithya kaala mokkavey\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(Translation: Moshvatsalam)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0254": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0254-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0254-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Kunjaattin Thiru rakthaththaal njaan shudhdhanaai theernnu\nThan chankiley shudhdha rakthathaal njaan jayam paadidum\nMahathwam Rakshakaa! Sthuthi ninakkennum\n\nChettil ninnenney Nee veendeduththathinaal\n\nSthuthikkum Ninney njaan aayussin naalhellaam\n\nNanniyôdadi vanhangum\n\n2. Aarppodu Ninney ghôshikkum ee Seeyon yaathrayil\nMunpôttu thanney ôdunnu en viruthinaayi\nLabhikkum nishchayam en viruthenikku\n\nShathrukalh aarumey kondupôkayilla\n\nPraapikkum annu njaan Raajan kayyil ninnum\n\nDoothanmaarudey madhyaththil\n\n3. En bhaagya kaalamôrkkumbolh ennullham thullhunnu\nEe lôka sukham thallhi njaan aa bhaagyam kandappolh\n\nNithyamaam raajyaththil annu njaan paadidum\n\nRaajan mukham kandu ennum njaan ghôshikkum\nRakthaththin phalamaai vaazhumey swarggaththil\n\nKôdi kôdi yugangalhaayi\n\n4. Manôharamaam seeyonil njaan vègam chèrneedum\nEn klèshamaakey neengippôm avidey eththumbolh\nNithyamaam santhosham praapikkum annu njaan\n\nEn shathruvinathu eduppaan paadilla\nAanandam koodidum saanandam paadidum\n\nShreeyeshu Raajan munpaakey\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(M.K. Varughese)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0255": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0255-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0255-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 2, "tune": 2, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0255-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Daivaththin raajyam snehaththin raajyam\nYeshu Raajan ghoshichcha nal\nVaarththa ningalh ôrththeeduka -Daivathin...\n\n1. Swargeeya raajyam\nswaayaththamaakkaan\nBhaagyamullhôr than yôgyathayarulhi\nMaargaththeykkaatti môkshaththey nalki\n\n\n\n\n    -Yeshu...\n\n2. Daridraathmakkalh praapikkum raajyam\nKarayunnavarkku labhikkumaashwaasam\nKarunhayullhavarkku-Karunha labhikkum\n\n\n\n\n     -Yeshu...\n\n3. Nirmalahridayam Daivaththey kaanhum\nSoumyathayullhor bhoomiyil vaazhum\nThaazhmayullhavarkko uyarcha labhikkum\n\n\n\n\n      -Yeshu...\n\n4. Ramyathayulhavaakkunnor shresthar\nNaama mavarkku Daivaputhranmaar\nNanma nimiththam peedakalh ulhavaam\n\n\n\n\n       -Yeshu...\n\n5. Dushikkunnavarkkaai prarthichcheeduka\nPazhikkunnavarey anugrahichcheeduka\nDweshikkunnavarkku gunham cheitheeduka\n\n\n\n\n       -Yeshu...\n\n6. Kuravukalhellaam sammathichchaakil\nKarunhayin Naathan môchanam nalkum\nMaruroopamaakkum nava Jeevan nalkum\n\n\n\n\n        -Yeshu...\n\n(Rev. K. P. Philip)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0256": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0256-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0256-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Yeshu aarilumunnatha naamennaathma sakhaavavaney\nThaai marakkamenkilum enney marakkaa snehithaney\nEvarumenney kai vedinjaalum\nYeshu thaan ennarikil kaanhum\nEthu khedavum theerum njaan thiru maarvil chaaridumbol\n\n2. Enney thedi vinh nagaram vittuzhiyil vannavaney\nEntey paapa shaapamakattaan jeevaney thannavaney\nEnthinum haa! Than thirusneha\nPaashabandha mazhikkuvaan kazhiyaa\nthennu mennum njaaniniyavanilum avaniniyennilummaam\n\n3. Maanasamey chaaruka dinavumee divya snehithanil\nDhyaanam cheiyyukka than thirusneha madhurima santhathavum\nEthu khedam varikilum patharaa-\nthéshuvil ninnashrayam karuthi\nAnthyaththolham poruthuka kurishinnuththamanaam bhadanaay\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(M.E. Cherian)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0257": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0257-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0257-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Yeshudevaa! En yeshudevaa-! Paapikkashrayam neeye!\n\n\nKarunhaanidhe! Sanketham neeya-llaa-thille-\n\n-yeshu…\n\n1. Marichavare-ppole paapakoope veenhupoya aadamin santhathiye - nee\nMarichavare - jeevippippan vanno-ne\nKurishil nee marichittu thiruchora chorinjone!\nMariyammin suthane! Nee sharanham\nPorhukka en paapamellaam\nNirhakka nin jeevashakthi\nIrikka-nee-hridayathil\n\n\n-yeshu…\n\n2. Athikadinam pala pareekshakalh erhidunnu-\nVeezhaathe sookshikka naadhaa!\nAthirillathe adharmmam perukunnu\nAthirppukalh vardhikkunnu balamnalka rakshithaave!\nNeethimaanaakum karthaave kaniyanhe!\nShathruganham krudhichaalum\nMithrangalh upekshichaalum\nSthothrathode jayicheedaam\n\n-yeshu…\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(Rev. K.P. Philip)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0258": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0258-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0258-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Daivameyethrayagaadhamaho ninte\nDivya vichaaranhakalh - orkkil\nEvvidhamathile divyarahasyangalh\nChovvodarhinjidunnu\n\n2. Vaanavum bhoomiyumaazhavumoru pol\n Vaanharulhunnu sadaa mahaa-\nGnaanamodavaye ninmahathwathinnaai\nNee nadaththidunnaho\n\n3. Nin priyamakkade nanmayillekkaai\nAmbiyalum parane - elaam\nImbamodonnaai vyaaparicheedunnu\nThumbamavarkku vridhaa\n\n4. Mottinu kaippuruchikkilumaayathu\nPotti vidarnnidumbolh athu\nKaattumathin maadhuryaakrithiyum thenin\nKattayumundakame\n\n\n5. Shikshayilum bahukashtatha thannilum\nAkshayanaam parane - nint e\nRakshayin madhuram ruchikkamaayathu\nNishchayameeyenikku\n\n6. Enthinu pongivarunnoru kaarhinaal\nChintha thalharneedunnu - varam\nChinthidumaarhathu poorhnamathorththaal\nSanthoshameyenikku\n\n7. Ethra karuthoriruttilumee njan\nKarthane nin valankai - kanden\nAtthaladakkimanosukham enppozhum\nEthidaame parane\n\n8. Mannane ninnude vankriyaye njaan\nOnnine kandudane - mahaa\nMannanai vidhicheyyaathirippanaai\nThanneedenham kripaye\n\n(Rev. T.G. Andrews)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0259": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0259-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0259-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Paadipukazhththidaam Deva Devaney puthiyathaam kripakalhodey\nInnaléyum innum ennum maaraa Yeshuvey naam paadipukazhththaam\n\nYeshu enna naamamey ennaathamavin geethamey\n\nEn priya Yeshuvey njaan ennum vaazhththi pukazhththeedumey (2)\n\n2. Ghora bhayankara kaattum alayum kodiyathaai varum nèraththil\nKaakkum karangalhaal chèrththu maarvanhachcha snèham nithyam paadum njaan      -yeshu...\n\n3. Petta thallha kunjiney marannaalum njaan marakkaa enna vaarththayaal\nThaazhthi enna thankaraththil vachchu jeeva paathey ennum ôdum njaan\n        -yeshu...\n\n4. Bhoomiyengum pôyi saakshi cholluvin ennurachcha kalpanayathaal\nDèham dèhiyellaam onnaai chèrnnu priyannaayi vela cheyyum njaan\n        -yeshu...\n\n5. Yorddaan sama manashodanayilum thaanhuveenhu pôkaathey\nAarppin jaya dhwaniyodum kaaththu paalikkunna snehamaashcharyam\n        -yeshu...", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0260": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0260-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0260-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Sukha kaalathilum dukha velhayilum\n\n\nAkalaatha nal snehithane\n\n\nYeshuve thirupaadathil kaathirikke\n\n\nEnthumodam hridantham varum\n1. Paapa lokathin shaapa doshangalh\nPaade neekkaanai vanningu rakshakan\nSambhramaththilum samshayathilum\nSankadathilum prathyaasha nalkunnon\n\n\n-sukha…\n\n2. Aethu nerathhum eka chinthayaal\nAevarum chernnu - sthothrangalh arppikkaam\nBhakthi paalikaam - shakthi praapikaan\nMukthi nedidaan - parishuddhane thedaam\n\n-sukha…\n\n3. Hrithhidangalhaam kaivilhakkukalh\nKaththi shobhippaan - karuthenham ennhaye\nNidramaatennham - aa bhadra deepangalh\nNithyam minnenham - manhavaalhanethumbolh\n\n-sukha…", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0261": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0261-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0261-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Tune: Christ is all to me\n\nEnnum nallavan yeshu ennum nallavan\n\nInnaleyum innum ennum anyanallavan\n1. Bhaaram ullhil neridum neramellaam thaangidum\nSaaramillennothidum than maarvilenne chertthidum\n\n2. Sambhavangalh kelkkave kambam ullhil cherkkave\nThamburante thiruvachanam orpikkum polaakave\n\n3. Ulaka veyil kondu njaan vaadi veezhaathoduvaan\nThanhalenikku nalkeeduvaan valabhaagathayundu thaan\n\n4. Raavilum pakalilum chelodu than paalanam\nBhoovileni-kkulhathinaal maalinilla kaaranham\n\n\n\n\n(T.K. Samuel)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0262": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0262-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0262-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Thunhayenikkeshuvaam kuraviniyillathaal\nAnudinam Than nizhalin maravil vasichchidum njaan\n1. Avanentey sankèthavum avalambavum kôttayum\nAvani yilaakulaththil avan mathiyaashrayippaan\n\n-thunha...\n\n\n2. Pakayentey kanhikalhilum pakarunna vyadhiyilum\nPakalilum raavilum Thaan pakarnnidum kripa mazhapol\n-thunha...\n\n3. Sharanhamavan tharum than chirakukalhin keezhil\nParichayum palakayumaam paramanippaaridaththil\n-thunha...\n\n4. Valamida maayirangalh valiyavar veenhaalum\nValayamaai ninnenney vallabhan kaaththidumey\n\n-thunha...\n\n5. Aakula vèlhakalhil aapaththu naalhukalhil\nAagatha naamarikil aashwasippichcheeduvaan\n\n-thunha...\n\n(M.E. Cherian)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0263": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0263-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0263-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Kripayèrum Karthaavilen vishwaasam\nAthinaal hridiyenthu nallaashwaasam\nDurithangalh nirayumee bhoovaasam\nKripayaal manoharamaai\nKripa kripa yonnenn aashrayamaai\n\n\nKripa kripa yonnen aanandamaai\n\n\nVairikalh vannaalum ethiruyarnnaalum\n\n\nKripa mathi yennaalhum\n\n2. Belaheenathayil nalla belamèkum\nMarubhoomiyilaananda thanhalaakum\nIrulh paathayilanudina molhinalkum\nKripa yonnennaashrayamaai\n\n\n\n-kripa kripa...\n\n3. Entey thaazhchayil avanenney orthallo\nGhôra vairiyin belamavan thakarthallo\nThantey kaikalhil avanenney chèrthallo\nSthothra geetham paadidum njaan\n\n\n-kripa kripa...\n\n4. Prathikoolangalhanavadhi vannaalum\nAnukoolamenikkava nennaalhum\nThava jeevaney thannava ninimèlum\nKripayaal nadathhumenney\n\n\n\n-kripa kripa...", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0264": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0264-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0264-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Yeshuvey en praanha naayakaa\nJeevanenikkekiyoney\nEn sankadangalharinjentey van kadangalh theerthentey\nKannhu neer thudachallo Nee\n\n2. Paapiyaai njaan jeevichchappolh\nPaatha thetti ôdiyappolh\nPaalakan Nee thèdi ee paathakan adiyaaney\nPaavana maarggey chèrthallo\n\n\n\n-yeshuve...\n\n3. Enney Ninnil dhanyanaakkuvaan\nVannithaa ennullhil Raajanaai\nThannitho Nin neethiyum divyamaam santhoshavum\nNithyamaam samaadhaanavum\n\n\n\n-yeshuve…\n\n4. Bhaaramenye jeevikkuvaan\nEn bhaaramellaam chumannavaney\nAashrayam Nee maathramen aashayil prakaashamey\nAashisham Nin kaarunhyamey\n\n\n\n-yeshuve...\n\n5. Vannidum Njaan athi vègaththil\nEnnurachchu pôyavaney\nVannu Nin mahimayin raajyamathil chèrkkuvaan\nAashyaal njaan kaaththidunney\n\n\n\n-yeshuve...", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0265": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0265-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0265-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Jeevantey uravidam Kristhuvathrey\nNaavinaalavaney naam ghoshikkaam\nAvanathrey en paapaharan\nThan jeevanaalenneyum veendeduththu\n1. Thaazhchayilenikkavan thanhalèki\nThaangiyenney veezhchayil vazhinadaththi\nThudachchentey kannhuneer pon karaththaal\nThudikkunnen manam Swarga santhoshaththaal\n\n-jeevantay...\n\n2. Karakaanhaathaazhiyil valayuvorey\nKarunhaye kaamshikkum mrithapraayarey\nVarikavan chaaraththu bandhitharey\nTharumavan kripa manashaanthiyathum\n\n\n-jeevantay...\n\n3. Namukku mun chonnathaam vishudhdhanmaaraal\nAlankruthamaaya Thiruvachanam\nAnudinam tharumavan puthushakthiyaal\nAnubhavikkum athisanthoshaththaal\n\n\n-jeevantay...\n\n\nAashwaasam", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0266": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0266-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0266-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Tune: O weary heart there is\n\n1. En aathmaavey nee dukhaththaal\nVishaadikkunnathenthinaai?\nVannidum veendeduppin naalh\nKaaththiduka Karthaavinaai\n\nNee kaaththirikka Karthaavinaai\nNee kaaththirikka Karthaavinaai\nKarththaavinaai eppozhum -\nkaaththirikka\n\n2. Nin sneha prayathnamellaam\nVruthaavil ennu thônniyaal\nNee ôrthukolh than vaagdaththam\nKandeedum neeyum koiththin naalh\n\n\n\n\n-Nee kaa...\n\n3. Karththaavo dakannodiyaal\nNin ôttam ellaam aalasyam\nThannodu koodey nadannaal\nEllaa adhwaanam maadhuryam\n\n\n\n\n\n-Nee kaa...\n\n4. Nin kannhuneerin prarthana\nThaan kèlhkkaathirikkunnuvo\nVishwaasaththintey shodana\nIthennu marannupôyo\n\n\n\n\n\n\n-Nee kaa...\n\n5. Nee snehikkunnanèkarum\nKarththaavil urangidumbolh\nUyirkkum avarèvarum\nEnnorththu aashwasichchu kolh\n\n\n\n\n\n-Nee kaa...\n\n6. Nin bhakthiyinkal ksheenhippaan\nPareeksha perukunnundo\nNin shakthi aavarththikkuvaan\nDivya vazhi yonnundallo\n\n\n\n\n\n\n-Nee kaa...\n\n7. Veenhidum nalla veeranmaar\nYuvaakkalhum vilapikkum\nKarththaavey kaaththidunnavar\nThan nithya shakthi praapikkum\n\n\n\n\n\n-Nee kaa...", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0267": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0267-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0267-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 2, "tune": 1, "kind": "CONTINUATION"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0267-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "I am not ashamed to own\n\n-Isaac Watts\n\n1. En Naathaney éttucholvaan\nLajjikkayilla njaan\nThan krushinpam vaak thèjassum\nCholli keerththikkum njaan\n\nKrushinkal Krushinkal\nSal prakaasham kanden\nEn manôbhaaravum neengippoi\nVishwaasaththaal kitti\nkaazhchayumappolh\nSanthatham njaan bhaagyavaan thanney\n\n\n\n2. Yeshunaamam njaan ariyum\nAthonnen aashrayam\nVaraan niraasha lajjakalh\nThaan sammathichcheedaa -krushinkal...\n\n3. Thanney pol than vaakkum sthiram\nNjaan elpichchathiney\nNannaai vidhinaalh varey thaan\nBhadramaai sookshikkum\n-krushinkal…\n\n4. Pithaa munbileeppaapiye\nAnnaalh thaan ettidum\nPuthushaalemil enikkum\nSthaanam kalpichcheedum -krushinkal...", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0268": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0268-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0268-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Psalms 121\n\nNjaan entey kannhukalh uyarththeedunnu\nEn sahaayam evidey ninnu varum\nEn sahaayam aakaashavum bhoomiyum srishtichcha\nYehovayinkal ninnallo\n\n1. Nintey kaal vazhuthuvaan sammathikkayilla\nNinney kaakkunnavan mayangukayumilla\nAvan mayangukilla avan urangukilla\nIsraayèlin paripaalakan\n\n\n-njan...\n\n2. Yehova nintey paripaalakan\nYehova valabhaagey ninakku thanhal\nPakal sooryanenkilum raathri chandranenkilum\nNinney yaathonnum baadhikkayilla\n-njan...\n\n3. Yehova ninney paripaalikkum\nNintey praanhaneyum avan paripaalikkum\nNintey gamanaththeyum aagamanaththeyum\nInnum ennekum paripaalikkum\n\n-njan...", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0269": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0269-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0269-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Yeshu en abhayakèndram\nMaattamillaa snehithan\nSthothram sthuthikalhkku yogyan\nVaazththum ninney ennum njaan\n\n1.Vyaakulangalh nèrittaalum\nBhaaramullhil vannaalum\nRôgiyaayi theernnennaalum\nYeshuvil njaan chaaridum\n-yeshu...\n\n2. Enney shudhdheekarichcheedaan\nBaala shiksha nalkiyaal\nThaathanu nanni karèttum\nHalleluyyaa paadum njaan           -yeshu...\n\n3. Yeshu raajanenney chèrppaan\nMèghaarudanaai varum\nAakulangalhillaa naattil\nChèrumswarggaveettil njaan          -yeshu…\n     (P.K. Sam)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0270": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0270-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0270-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Enikethu nerathilum - enikethidangalhilum\nAvan maathramaashrayame - Avan eka naayakane (2)\n\n1. Avanente sankethavum - avanente kottayumaai (2)\nAvan chirakil - enikkabhayam (2)\nAvan maathramen abhayam\n\n\n-eni…\n\n2. Marubhoo prayaanhangalhil - maranhatthin thaazhvarayil (2)\nAvanoruvan enikkidayan (2)\nPiriyaattha nallidayan\n\n\n\n-eni…\n\n3. Vazhi maarhi nadaneedumbolh - vazhi kaanhaa thuzharheedumbolh (2)\nAvan vachanam -enikku dinam (2)\nManhi deepamen vazhiyil\n\n\n\n-eni…\n\n4. Karthanente santhoshavum - karthanente sangeethavum (2)\nAvan kripakalh - avan dayakalh (2)\nDinam thorum en sthuthikalh\n\n\n-eni...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(Koshy Thalackal)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0271": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0271-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0271-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Mahimayezhum paramesha! - paahimamaam yeshumaheshaa!\n\n1. Nisthula sneha saagarame! Haa\nPrasthaavyame thirunaamam - kristho! Nee thaan en vishraamam\n-mahi…\n\n2. Kaarmukil bheekara-maai varum neram\nKaanhmatho niyamathin villonnayathil theerumen bhaaram\n\n-mahi…\n\n3. Nin mukha kaanthiyen mlaanatha neekkum\nNin madhuraamritha vachanam - khinnatha yaakave pokkum\n\n-mahi…\n\n4. Sangathiyillilha - keeduvaan sneha-\nChangalayaal theerumaarho-denneyanhiyichathu moolam\n\n-mahi…\n\n5. Thaavaka sannidhi chernnathikaale\nJeevanil nirhanjezhunelkkum - paavana chinthakalhaale\n\n\n-mahi…\n\n6. Krooshile rakthamen jeevanaadhaarame\nNaasha lokam vedinjodaam aashayo-deshuve nedaam\n\n\n-mahi…\n\n7. Palhunku kadal theeraththirunnu njaanente\nKalhankamatteshuve kaanhum - vilhangum vishwaasaththaalodum\n-mahi…\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(E.I. Jacob)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0272": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0272-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0272-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Aashritha valsalaneshu maheshane!\n\n\nShaashwathame thirunaamam -\n\n1. Nin mukhakaanthi ennil nee chinthi\nKanmashamaakeyakatti en naayaka!\nNanma valhartthanhamennum\n\n\n-aashri…\n\n2.Paavana hridayam ekuka sadayam\nKevalam loka sukhangalh vedinju njan\nThaavaka thripaadam cheraan\n\n\n-aashri…\n\n3. Apakadam nirayumee jeevithamaruvil\nAakulamillen nanmayezhumarikil\nAgathikalhkkaashrayam tharikil\n\n\n-aashri…\n\n4. Kshanhika maanhulakin mahimakalharhikil\nAnudinam nin padathaarinhathiriyukil\nAnantha santhoshamundoduvil\n\n\n-aashri…\n\n5. Varunnu njan thaniye enikku nee mathiye\nKarunhayin kaathale! Vediyaruthagathiye\nThirukripa thranhamenpathiye!\n\n\n-aashri…\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(M.E. Cherian)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0273": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0273-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0273-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Tune: Christ is all to me\n\nEllaam Yeshuvey Enikkellaam Yeshuvey\nAllalèrum ee ulakil ellaam Yeshuvey\n\n1. Aayanum sahaayanum snehithanapaayahan\nNaayakan enikkanpaarnna gnaanamanhavaalhanum\n-ellaam...\n\n\n\n\n2. Thantha, thallha jaathi janam snehithar bandhukkalhum\nSanthosha sakala yoga sampoornha bhaagyavum\n-ellaam...\n\n3. Aavalil aashwaashavum raathriyil en jyothissum\nVèvalaam kidakkayil kaikandathaam oushadhavum\n-ellaam...\n\n4. Bodhaka Pithaavumen pôkilum varavilum\nAadaravu kaattidum koottalhiyum en thôzhanum\n\n-ellaam...\n\n5. Anhiyum aabharanhavum asthiyum sambaadyavum\nThunhayaalhiyum rakshakanum en priya madhyasthanum -ellaam...\n\n6. Vaana jeeva appavum aashayum en kaavalum\nGnaanageethamullaasavum nôttavum kondaattavum\n-ellaam...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(D.T. Niles)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0274": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0274-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0274-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Holy spirit, faithful guide\n- M.M. Wells\n\n1. Aathmaavam vazhikaatti\nEnne sadaa nadathi\nKondupokum vanatthil\nKoode saavadhaanatthil\nKsheenhare santhoshippin;\nThan imbamozhi kalhppin\nSancharee! Nee koodevaa\nCherkkam ninne veettil njaan\n\n2. Ullham thallharnnettavum\nAashayatta neravum\nKrooshin raktham kaanhichu\nAashwaasam nalkeedunnu\nShudhaathmavin prabhayil\nNjaanolhikkum neratthil\nShathru shalyamonnume\nPedikkenda engume\n\n\n3. Sathyasakhi thaan thanne\nSarvadaa en sameepe\nThunhakkum nirantharam\nNeekkum bhayam samshayam\nKaattugra madikkilum\nIrulh kanattheedilum\n‘Sancharee! Nee koode vaa\nCherkkaam ninne veettil njan’\n\n4. Aayushkaalatthee nantham\n Chernnaarthi poonda neram\nSwarga chintha maathrame\nAekammennashrayame\nThaan mathram aa neratthum\nEnne aazham kadatthum\n‘Sancharee! Nee koode vaa\nCherkkaam ninne veettil njan’\n\n(Translation: Rev. T. Koshy)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0275": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0275-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0275-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Anugrahatthinadhipathiye! Anantha kripaa perum nadiye!\nAnudinam nin padam gathiye@ adiyanu nin kripa mathiye!\n\n2. Van vinakalh vanneedukil valayukayillen hridayam\nVallabhan neeyennabhayam Vanneedumo pinne bhayam\n\n3. Thannuyire paapikalkaai thannavanaam neeyiniyum\nThallheedume ezhayenne? Theerumo nin snehamennil?\n\n4. Thirukarangalh tharunna nalla shikshayil njan patharhukilla\nMakkalenkil shaasanakalh snehathin prakaashanangalh\n\n5. Paaridamaam paazhmanhalil paarthidum njan nin thanhalil\nMaranhadinam varumalhavil marhanjidum nin maaridatthil\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(M.E. Cherian)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0276": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0276-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0276-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Kaanhunnu njaan Yaahil\nEnikkaashraya maayoru shaashwatha paara\n\n1. Susthira maanasa nevanumen Yaahil\nAashrayam vaikkukilanudinam naathan\nKaaththidu mavaney nal swasthathayôdey\nPaarthiva navan thirukkarangalhilennum\n\n\n\n-kaanhunnu...\n\n2. Cheikayillavan nammalh paapaththinoththapol\nPrathiphalamarulhunnillakruthyangalh ganhichchu\nVaanamee bhoovil ninnuyarnnirippathupol\nParan daya bhakthanmèl valiyathu thanney\n\n\n-kaanhunnu...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n3. Odikku killavanèttam chathanjathaam ôda\nKeduththukillavan thiri puka vamikkukilum\nNadaththum than vidhi jayam labhikkum naalh vareyum\nThalharaatheyavan bhoovil sthaapikkum nyaayam\n\n-kaanhunnu...\n\n4. Vazhuthidaathavanenney karangalhil kaaththu\nNirththum than mahimayin savidhaththil naathan\nKalhanka mattaananda poornhathayodey\nBhavikkattey mahathwa mangavanennu maammen\n\n-kaanhunnu...", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0277": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0277-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0277-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Onneyullheni-kaananda-mulakil\nYeshuvin sannidhi-yanhayuvathe\nAnneram mama maanasa-khedam\nOnnaaya-kalum veyilil himam pol     -onne…\n\n2. Maanam dhanamee mannin mahimaka-\nllhonnum shaanthiye nalkaathe\nDaaham perukum thanheerozhike\nLokam verhe tharikillarhika            -onne…\n\n3. Neerthodukalhil maaneppolen\nMaanasa meeshanil sukham thedi\nVattaa jeevajalatthin nadiyen\nVarhumaiyakatti nirvrithiyarulhi        -onne…\n\n4. Than bali vediyil kurikilum meevalum\nVeedum koodum kandathupol\nEn balamaamsarveshwaranil njaan\nSaanandamabhayam thedum sathatham\n         -onne…\n\n5. Kannheer thaazhvarayundenikkanavadhi\nMannil jeevithapaathayathil\nEnnaalum bhayamenthinennarikil\nNannayavan kripamazha pol chirikil\n         -onne…\n\n(M.E. Cherian)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0278": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0278-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0278-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Kurishin nizhalil thala chaaichanudinam\nVishramichcheedunnadiyaan-vishra\n\nKurishin snehaththanhalil\n\nKripayin sheethala nizhalil\n\nPraanhapriyanté thrikkazhalil\n\nKaanhunnabhaya mennazhalil\n\n\n\n\n-kurishin...\n\n1. Paapabhaara chumadeduththavashanaai\nThalharnnoren jeevithamé\nThalharnnoren jeevitham kurishin\nNizhalil shaanthi kandathinaal\nThalharaathini vaanavirivil\nChirakadichuyarnnidaam varavil\n\n\n\n\n\n-kurishin...\n2. Sneham nirayum thirumozhi\nshravichchumal\nKlèsham marannidum njaan\nThirumozhi yaanandanaadam\nThènilum madhuram than vèdam\nTharumenikkanantha sammotham\nTheerkkumen maanasakhedam\n\n\n\n\n\n      -kurishin...\n\n3. Èthu ghôra vipaththilum bhayannidaa\nThavanil njaan aashrayikkum\nAvanilennaashrayamennaal\nAvaniyilaakulam vannaal\nAvashathayanhayukilennaal\nAvan thunhayarulheedum nannaai\n\n\n\n\n\n      -kurishin...\n(M.E. Cherian)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0279": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0279-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0279-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Enikaayorutthama sambatthu\nSwargaraajyathil orukkunnathaal\nIni lokathe snehicheeduvaan\nOru kaalathum pokayilla njaan\n\n\nEnte aayussin dinamokkeyum\n\nNinne maathram njaanini sevikkum\n\nEnte praanhanaayaka-neshuve\n\nNinte sneham neeyenikkekidanhe\n\n2. Ezhayaakunnorenne snehicha\nNinte snehamethrayo aashcharyam\nEnte paapashaapangalh neekki nin\nThirujeevanaal enne nirhachallo       -ente…\n\n3. Ente dehavum thiru aalayamaai\nNinte aathmaave enikkekiyathaal\nThirunaamatthin mahathwathinaai\nIni jeevippaan kripanalkuka\n-ente\n\n4. Priyan thejassil velhippedum naalhil\nNjaanum thejassin munbil nilkkuvaan\nEnte dehavum dehi aathmaavum\nSamboornhamaai samarppikkunne   -ente…", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0280": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0280-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0280-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Yahovadaivamaam vishuddha jaathi naam\nAvanavakaashamaam  janam naam\nParadeshikalh naam bhaagyashaalikalh\nIthupoloru jaathiyundo?\n\n1. Aapatthil nammude divyasankethavum\nBalavum daivam oruvanathre\nAakayaal paaridamaakeyilhakilum\nNaam ini bhayappedukayilla\n       -yahova…\n\n2. Avaneethalatthil apamaanam namu-\nKkavakaasha-mennorthidenham\nAvanaai kashtatha elkukil thejassil\nAnantha yugam vaanhidum naam\n       -yahova…\n\n3. Nira nira nirayaay anhiniraneeduvin\nKurishin padayaalhikalhe\nJaya jaya jaya kaahalham ootheeduvin\nJayaveeranaam yehsuvinnu\n\n       -yahova…", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0281": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0281-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0281-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 3, "tune": 2, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0281-notation-3.jpg", "sourcePage": 4, "tune": 2, "kind": "CONTINUATION"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0281-malayalam-1.jpg", "choir/KK-0281-malayalam-2.jpg"], "manglish": "He leadeth me\n\n- J.H. Gilmore\n\n1. Karthan enney nadathunnu\nEthra bhaagyam swargaaaashwaasam\nEllaattilum evideyum\nThan kai thanney nadaththunnu\n\nNadaththunnaan Nadaththunnaan\nThan kaiyyaalmaam nadaththunnaan\nThan pingaamiyaayidum njaan\nThan kaiyyaal maam nadaththunnaan\n\n2. Athi dukkha madhyaththilum\nEthan bhaagya niravilum\nShaanthaththil thaan van kaattil thaan\nThan kai thanney nadaththunnu    -nadath...\n\n3. Karthanin kaipidikkum njaan\nPashchaathaapa pedaa pinney\nEnnamshaththil thripthipedum\nEn Daivan thaan nadaththunnu     -nadath...\n\n4. Lôkey entey vèla theerthu\nNin kripayaal jayam nèdi\nMrithyukaalam pèdikkaa njaan\nYorddaanil nee nadaththunnu        -nadath...", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0282": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0282-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0282-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 2, "tune": 1, "kind": "CONTINUATION"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0282-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Safe in the arms of Jesus\n\n-Fanny J. Crosby\n\n1. Yeshu kaiyyil maa swairyam than maarvilen kshemam\nThan snehatthanhalilen dehimevum swastham\nDootha swaram veeshunnu Thejoveedhuyude\nPalhunku kadalinmel inpa geethamode\n\n\n\nYeshu kaiyyil maa swairyam than maarvilen kshemam\n\n\nThan snehatthanhalilen dehi mevum swastham\n\n2. Yeshu kaiyyil maa swairyam aakula viheenam\nLoka pareeksha paapam drohichidaa noonam\nDukhathin varalhchayum, samshayam bhayavum\nNeengi sukhamanhayum swathanthryam modavum\n\n-yeshu…\n\n3. Prema sanketham yeshu en perkkuyirh vittu\nPoorvika paarhamelen sthaanam nallurhappu\nKshaanthiyil njaan nilkatte raathri kazhivolham\nPrabhaatha shobha swarnnha-theeratthudippolham\n\n-yeshu…", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0283": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0283-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0283-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "O Christ in Thee my soul hath found\n\n1. Ariyaaththa samaadhaanam kurayaaththa môtham\nPandanèkar kandapôley – kandey! Njaan Kristhuvil\n\nKristhuvallaathenney yaarum thripthanaakkaa ippolh\n\nNithya santhosha jeevitham Kristhuvil njaa kandey!\n\n2. Potta maravikalhil neerpottanaai njaan thèdi\nKudikkuvaan kuninjappolh pottichirichchava\n\n\n-kristhu...\n\n3. Sundaranaam Ninney kaanhmaan kannhukalhkkaai kaazhcha-\nKripayaal kittum naalhvarey paapam en môthamaai\n\n-kristhu...\n\n4. Vishwasthanaam Ninney vittu vishramam thèdi njaan\nNinney kadannu pôkumbolh pidichchu Nin sneham\n\n-kristhu...", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0284": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0284-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0284-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Dukhatthinte paanapaathram kartthavente kaiyyil thannaal\nSanthoshattho-dathu vaangi halleluyyaa paadeedum njaan\n\n2. Doshamaayi-ttonnum enno-dente thaathan cheykayilla\nEnne-yavan adichaalum avanenne snehikunnu\n\n3. Kashta nashtameri vannaal bhaagyavaanai theerunnu njaan\nKashtametta karthaavodu koottalhiyayi theerunnu njan\n\n4. Loka sukhamenthu tharum aathmakleshamathin phalam\nSoubhagyamullhaathma jeevan kashtathayil varddhikkunnu\n\n5. Jeevanathin vambu venda kazhchayude shobhavenda\nKoodaratthin moodi pole krooshin nirham maathram mathi\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n6. Ullhilenikkenthu sukham thejasserhum kherhoobukalh\nKoodaratthi-nakatthund shekkinaayum undavide\n\n7. Bhakthanmaaram sahodararh vilhakkupolkoode undu\nPraarthanayin dhoopamundu mesha mel entappamund\n\n8. Praakaratthilente mumbil yeshuvine kaanhunnu njan\nYaagapeedamavanathre ennumente rakshayavan\n\n9. Dinam thorum puthukkunna shakthiyennil pakaruvaan\nSwachcha jalam vechittullha pitthallha tthottiyumundu\n\n10. Lokathe njaan orkunnilla kashtanashtamorkkunilla\nEppollhente karthavine onnu kaanhamenneyullhu\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(Muthampakkal Kochukunju Upadeshi)\n\n\nMokshaanandam", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0285": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0285-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0285-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 2, "tune": 1, "kind": "CONTINUATION"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0285-notation-3.jpg", "sourcePage": 3, "tune": 2, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0285-malayalam-1.jpg", "choir/KK-0285-malayalam-2.jpg"], "manglish": "Tune: My Jesus I Love Thee\n\n1. Vishudhdhar koottam rakshakanu chuttum\nNinnu thangalh sneharathnam chudikkum\nNèram aa mahaasanthushta samoohey\n\n\nEnneyum kaanhumo?.................(3)\n\nChollen manamey\n\n2. Daivam than vishudhdhar kannhu neerellaam\nThudaikkumannaalhil enikkishtaraam\nChèrkkapetta vishuddharodu koodey\n\n-enneyum...\n\n3. Veenhakalhey dharichchudan than munbil\nSanthosha paripoornharaai uchchaththil\nThanney ennum sthuthikkunnavarodey\n\n-enneyum...\n\n4. Kunjaadin rakthaththil kazhukapetta\nVellhanilayankikalhey dharichu\nMahaashobhithamaayullha samoohey\n\n-enneyum...\n\n5. Kayyil kuruththo lakalhey pidichchu\nMahaaraksha nammudey Daivaththinnum\nKunjaadinum ennaarkkum koottarodey\n\n-enneyum...\n\n6. Sthuthi mahathwam gnaanam shakthi sthothram\nNammudey Daivanennellaa doothanmaarum\nThan munpil kavinhuveenhaarkkum kaaley\n-enneyum...\n\n7. Maranhaththolham nee vishwasthanaayaal\nThan chollôrththu prayaasam nee sahichchaal\nKoodeyiruththum thaan ninney appozhey\n\n-enneyum...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(P.I. Pulikkodan)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0286": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0286-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0286-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 2, "tune": 1, "kind": "CONTINUATION"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0286-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Haa! Ethrabhaagyam undenikku orkkukillennullham thullhidunnu\nNjaninnu paadi aanandikkum njaanennumeshuve sthuthikkum\n\n\nHaa! Ente bhaagyam ananthame - ithu soubhagya jeevithame (2)\n\n2. Lokatthil njano heenanathre - shokameppozhum undenikku\nMeghatthileshu vannidumbolh enneyanpodu chertthidumbolh\n\n-Haa…\n\n3. Daivatthin raajyamundenikkai - daivakunjaadum shishyarumai\nVishuddhar koottam chernnirikkum - panthiyil cherhnnu njan bhujikkum\n-Haa…\n\n4. Kannhuneerelaam thaan thudakkum - varnha visheshamaayudikkum\nJeevakireedamen shirassil karthan vecheedunnaa-sadassil\n\n-Haa…\n\n5. Venh nilayangkalh dharichu - pon kuruttholakalh pidichu\nDaivakunjaadine sthuthichu - paadum njaanannumaanandichu\n\n-Haa…\n\n6. Haa! Ethrabhaagyam undenikku - varnhippaan thraanhiyillenikku\nMahathwabhaagyam thanneyithin - samayathilonnum illihatthil\n\n-Haa…\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(P.V. Thommi)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0287": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0287-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0287-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Tune: The great physician\n\n-W.M. Hunter\n\n1. Eppozhum njan santhoshikkum en yeshu ente gaanam\nElladavum aaghoshikkum en rakshakante daanam!\n\n\nYeshuve! Nee swargatthil ente naamam ezhuthi\n\nAarum edukkaatha ee bhagyam en santhosham!\n\n2. Nin raajyatthi-noranyanaai bhoomiyil njan uzhannu\nNee vannathaale dhanyanai praveshanam nee thannu\n\n-yeshu…\n\n3. Mahathwamullha rakshakaa nee thanne swarga vaathil!\nSwargeeya geethangalh ithaa! Dwanikkunnente kaathil\n\n-yeshu…\n\n4. En naamam maaychu kalhavaan pishaachinaal asaadhyam\nEn yeshu shakthan kaatthidum than rakthathin sambaadyam\n-yeshu…\n\n5. Mrithyuvin naalh sameepichaal ingilla klesham thaapam\nEn jeevan kristhan aakayaal marikkayaalum laabham\n\n-yeshu…\n\n6. Than nyaayatheerppu kelhkkumbolh anekar bhramicheedum\nEnikko yeshuraajan chol nithyaanandam nalkeedum!\n\n-yeshu…\n\n7. Santhoshame! Santhoshame! En daivathinnu sthothram\nEn jeevanaam en yeshuve! Neeyum sthuthikku paathram!\n-yeshu…\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(V. Nagal)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0288": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0288-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0288-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Aanandamundenikk-anandamundeni-kkeshu mahaaraaja sannidhiyil\n\n1. Lokam enikkoru shashwathamallennen sneham niranjeshu cholleettundu\nSwarloka naattukaarkkikshithiyil pala kashtasankadangalh vanneedunnu\n\n2. Kartthave! Neeyente sankethamaakayaal ullhil manaklesham leshamilla\nVishwasakkappalil swarpuram cheruvaan chukkan pidikkanhe - ponnunaadha!\n\n3. Ennaathmaave! Ninnil chaanchalyamenthinu - baakhaayin thaazhvara yaathrayithu\nSeeyon puri thannil vegam namikkettheettaananda kannhuneerh veezhtheedaame!\n\n4. Koodaara vaasikalhaakum namukkingu - veedenno naadenno cholvaanenthu?\nKaikalhaal theerkkaatha veedonnu thaathan thaan meethe manukkai vacchittundu\n\n5. Bhaaram prayaasangalherhum vanadesha-tthaakulaathmaavil vannedukil\nPaaram karunhayullheeshan namukkaittettam kripa nalki paalichidum\n\n6. Kartthave! Nee vegam! Vanneedanhe njangalh-kkorthaaleekshonhiyil mahaadukham!\nEnnalum nin mukha shobhayathin moolam santhosha kaanthi poondaanandikkum\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n        (Muthampakkal Kochukunju Upadeshi)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0289": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0289-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0289-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "There is city bright\n\n-Mary A S Deak\n1. Shobhitha pattanham paapa doshangalhkku\nPraveshamilla praveshamilla yaathorashudhikkum\n\n2. Rakshakane! Vannen kunjaade kenjunne\nKazhukiyenne rakshichu kaakkanhe!\n\n3. Karthaa NIn shakthiyaal shudhiyil kaatthenne\nNin priyapaithal nin priyapaithal aakkenham - neeyenne\n\n4. Veendedupporhkkullha angiyanhanju njan\nKuttamattonaai kuttamattonaai swarpuram cherum njan", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0290": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0290-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0290-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 2, "tune": 1, "kind": "CONTINUATION"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0290-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "When the trumpet of the Lord shall sound\n\n- J.B. Black\n\n1. Karthrukaahalham yugaanthya kaalathil dhwanikkumbol\nNithyamaam prabhaatha shobhithatthin naalh\nPaarthale rakshapetto-rakkare koodi aakashe\nPerh vilhikkum neram kaanhum en perum!\n\n\nPerh vilhikkum neram kaanhum! Perh vilhikkum neram kaanhum!\n\nPerh vilhikkum neram kaanhum! Perh vilhikkum neram kaanhum! En perum\n\n2. Kristhanil nidrakondoree shobhitha prabhaathatthil\nKristhashobha dharippanuyirtthu than\nBhakthar bhavane aakashamappurham koodidumbolh\n\n-perh…\n\n3. Karthan perhkku raapakal adhwaanam njan cheythingane\nVaartha njan chollidatte than snehatthin\nPaarthalathil ente vela theerthi-jeevithaanthyathil\n\n-perh…", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0291": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0291-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0291-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "There is a land a sunny land\n1. Bhaagya raajya monnundathil vaana shobha nithyam\nSaayaahnam angundaakilla athin suryan yeshu\n\n\nKrooshine-vahikkil naam kireedam dharikkum\n\nSwarloke naam paarkkumbol bhagyarajyathtthil nithyam\n\n2. Ijjeeva-yaazhikkakkare samaadhaana naattil\nVan kaattellaa madangunnu angu venham nidhi\n\n\n-krooshine…\n\n3. Mahathwa veedumonnundu swargeeya mandiram\nIhe naam snehichor namme ethirelkkumathil\n\n\n-krooshine…\n\n4. Vegam marhayumee lokam vittu bhaagya loke\nMinnum sainyathe chernnedaan naam vaanchikkunnennum\n-krooshine…", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0292": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0292-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0292-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 2, "tune": 1, "kind": "CONTINUATION"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0292-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "There is a Home eternal\n\nH.R. Palmer\n1. Nithya veedonnu-ndathu - shobha sundaram\nThathra swarga bhagyam - moodapedaaraaval\nVasthra shudharaam doothar - paadum simhaasane mun\nEnnu ninne njan kaanhum? Sundara mandirame!\n\nSundaraveede! Shobhitha veede!\n\nYeshuvin nalveede! Shobhitha mandirame!\n\n2. Nithyam aa mandirathil - pushpangalhunde!\nSthothram paadi baalar yeshuvin naamathil\nSimhaasanam chuttumai - nithyam sthuthi muzhakkum\nEnni ninne njaan kaanhum? Sundara mandirame!\n\n-sundara…\n\n3. Rakshithar koottathil njan - swargathil cherum\nKristhu raksha, ennil - mrithyu bhayamilla!\nVegam ninne njan kaanhum - shobha simhaasanathil\nAnnu ninne njaan kaanhum - sundara mandirame\n\n-sundara…", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0293": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0293-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0293-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Yerushale-men imba veede\nEppolh njan vannu cherum\nDharanhiyile paadum kedum\nEppolh ingozhiyum -\n\n1. Bhaktharin bhagya thalame!\nParimalha sthalam neeye!\nDukham vichaaram prayathnam\nNinkalangille!\n\n-yeru…\n\n2. Raavum andhakaaram veyil\nSheethavum angille\nDeepa thulyam shudhrangu\nShobhichidunne\n\n-yeru…\n\n3. Rathnangalhallo ninmathil\nPonnum maanhikyangal!\nPanthrandu vaathilukalhum\nMinnum muththalo\n\n-yeru…\n\n4. Yerushalemen imbaveede\nEnnu njan vannu cherum!\nParama raajaavin mahathwam\nArikil kandidum!\n\n-yeru…\n\n5. Shreshta nada-kkavukalhum\nThttangalhum elaam\nKaattu vaaninhayillaatha\nKootamarangal\n\n-yeru…\n\n6. Jeevanadi imba shabdam\nMevi athiloode\nPovathum eeraarhu vriksham\nNilpathum modi\n\n-yeru…\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n7. Dootharum angaarthu sadaa\nSwaramandalam paadi\nNaadhane kondaadidunna\nGeetham maa modi\n-yeru…\n\n8. Yerushalemin adhipaneesho\nThirumun njan sthuthi paadaan\nVarum vareyum arikil bhavaan\nIrikkanham naadha\n\n-yeru…", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0294": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0294-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0294-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 2, "tune": 1, "kind": "CONTINUATION"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0294-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Raajan munpil ninnu naam\nKandeedum than soundaryam\nHalleluyya - Halleluyyaa\nDoothanmaarkku thulyaraai\nVaazhum naam santhushtarai\nHalleluyyaa - Halleluyyaa\n\n\nRaajan mumbil ninnu naam\nKandeedum than soundaryam\n\nKeerthikkum than mahathwam\nHalleluyya vegaththil\nRaajan mumbil nilkkum naam\n\n2. Raajan mumbil ninnu naam\nNeekkum porin aayudham\nHalleluyya - Halleluyyaa\nTheernnu yuddhyaabhyaasavum\ntheernallo prayaasavum\nHalleluyya - Halleluyyaa\n\n3. Raajan mumbil ninnu naam\nPraapikkum than vaagdattham\nHalleluyya - Halleluyyaa\nNaam pithaavin raajyathil\nvaazhum nithya thejassil\nHalleluyya - Halleluyyaa\n\n4. Raajan mumbil ninnu naam\nshobhikkum nirantharam\nHalleluyya - Halleluyyaa\nTheernnu balaheenatha\ntheernnu sarva ksheenhatha\nHalleluyya - Halleluyyaa\n\n5. Raajan mumbil ninnu naam\npraapikkum nithyaanandam\nHalleluyya - Halleluyyaa\nNithyajeevan imbangalh\nthejassin kireedangalh\nHalleluyya - Halleluyyaa\n\n6. Raajan mumbil ninnu naam\ncheyyum sneha samsarggam\nHalleluyya - Halleluyyaa\nEllaa daivamakkalhum\nennum onnai vaanhidum\nHalleluyya - Halleluyyaa", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0295": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0295-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0295-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Ethra Ethra shreshtam! Swarga Seeyon\nethra ethra shreshtam\n\n\nKarthan vaanhidum simhaasanavum nalla\n\n\nKeerthanangalh paadum dootharin veenhayum\n\n\nSthothrageethangalh paadunnavarh naadavum\n- Ethra…\n\n1. Panthrandu vaathilikalh-\nkkaduththozhukunnu palhunku nadi\nMinnum navaratnam pol\nveedhiyellaam minni thilhangeedunnu\nMuththugopurangalh shreshtamaakum vannham\nshudhaponnin theruveedhi mahaachitram\nChollikkoodathullha thejassudikkunna\nvallabhan pattanham nee\nKaanhumneram allalellaamozhiyum\n          -ethra…\n\n2. Jeevanadi swachchamaai\nozhukunnu simhaasanathin munnil\nJeevavriksham thazhachee-\nraarhu vidha jeevaphalam tharunnu\nSwargaseeyon thannil suryachandranmaarum\nshobhayerum nalla deepangalhum venda\nDaiva thejassathine prakaashipichu\nKunjaadathin vilhakku\nDivyakaanthiyengum vilhangidunnu\n\n\n\n\n           -ethra...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n3. Dootharh chuzhannu nilkke\nAasanaththil daivamakkalhirikke\nDaiva makkalh naduvil\nThejassode daiva kunjaadirikke\n Krobakalh sraaphakalh - pathrangalhaal\nParhannathyunnathan-mun alankaaramaai\nsthuthi\nNithyam cheyyunnathumaayullha kaazhchakalh\nEthra ethra imbam!\nManoharam! Ethra ethra shreshtam!\n\n\n\n\n           -ethra...\n\n4. Halleluyyaa geetham\nPaadiyaadum dootharkodaanukodi\nVallabhane sthuthichu\nVannicheedum sraaphaganham valhare\nShudhan shudhan parishudhan- maa-kunjaadu\nNithyam nithyam ninakkennumaa-\nshabdamaai\nOthupaadum daivadoothar kodanukodi\nKinnara naadamodum\nPalathara geethangalh paadeedunnu\n\n\n\n\n          -ethra…", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0296": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0296-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0296-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "There’s a land that is fairer than day\n- S.F. Bennet\n1. Shobhayerhum naadonnundathu\nKaanhaame doore vishwaasathaal\nThaathan vaasam  namukkorukki\nNilkkunnundakkare kaathaho\n\n\nVegam naam chernnidum\n\nBhangiyerhiya aa theeraththu (2)\n\n2. Naam aa shobhana naattil paadum\nVaazhthappettorude sangeetham\nKhedham rodanamangillallo\nNithya soubhaagyam aathmaakkalkku\n         -vegam naam…\n\n3. Snehamaam sargga thaathanude\nSneha daanathinum naalhkkunaalh\nVeezhchayenye tharum nanmakkum\nKaazhchayaayi naam sthothram paadum\n         -vegam naam…\n\n    (Translation: K.V. Chacko)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0297": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0297-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0297-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Aarivarh aarivarh - nilayanki\ndharicha ivaraarh\n\n\nAllayo aerhiya upadrava-\nmathil ninnu vanna manujarivarh\n1. Ankikalh kunjaattin - thiru\nchankathil - ninnozhukum\nThankchorayil kazhuki avarh nannai\nAnkikalh velhippichaho\n-aarivarh…\n\n2. Aakayaal avarh iniyum - daiva-\nSimhaasanathin munnil\nAakave irunnu thannaalayaththil raa-\nPpakalavarh seva cheyyum        -aarivarh...\n\n3. Simhaasanasthaneeshan vaasa\nMaakumavarh nadavil\nDaaham vishappumilla veyilchoodumilla\nSukham avarhkennum - aho-      -aarivarh…\n\n4. Jeevaneerurhavakalhkku vazhi\nJeevanaayakan nadaththum\nDaivam thudacheedum kanhkalhilninnu\nAvarude kannhuneerh thaan       -aarivarh…\n\n          (Rev. T. Koshy)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0298": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0298-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0298-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Swarga bhaagyam ethra yogyam aarkku varnnhikkaam\n\nAthin bhaagyam orkkum thorum enikkaashayerunne\n\n1. Paapalokaththil kidannu paadupedunna – eni-\nKkeppozhente mokshaveettil chennu-chernneedaam\n\n2. Mumpe mumpe poyidumpol bhaagyamullavar-manni-\nlullha kashtathakal neengi svasth-araayavar\n\n3 Loka-sambandha-bhavanam vittu poyennal- mokshe\nKaikalhaal theer-kaaththa-veettil paar-thidaamallo\n\n4 Randinaal njarangi-njanum vaanji-cheedunnue-aathma-\nVendeduppaam puthra-santhosha-thi-lethuvaan\n\n5 Ingu pedum paadukal-kkaa-shvaasam praapippaan-ente\nMangalha-moksha-purathil-eppozethum njaan\n\n6 Praavinepol randu chirha-kundennaakil njaan-\nSheeghram ethum parhannte manhavaalan sannidhau\n\nSuvisheshavela", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0299": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0299-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0299-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Modham! Athi modham! Modham hey! Vaagdaththa kaalam\nSaadara manhanjeedunnaho\nJaathi bhètha vaadam theernnu - Jaathi kalhonnaayidunnu\n\nYooda jaathiyum muthirnnu - Jaatha modham paadidunnu\n-modham...\n\n1. Annu kaana nangalh pookkumey - Seeyontey makkalh\nNanniyodey paadiyaarkkumey\nAnnu suvishesha kkodimannidey jayam kondaadi\nUnnatha maayannu janam sannidhipaadi vasikkum\n\n-modham...\n\n\n2. Annu seeyonil ninnundaakum - aagnyaa vishesham\nMannida mellaa mathu kèlhkkum\nMannavar manthri prajakalh - enniva rellaam varilum\nOnnu pôlaa vasichcheedum - vannu sathyaanugrahangalh\n-modham...\n\n3. Kaattu paambo doththu - mèlhikkum kuttikalh ennaal\nVaatta mundaakayillethumey\nKaattu pulikalhu maattin - koottavu monnichchu mèyum\nNaattilellaa nanmakalhum - pushtiyaayi vardhichcheedum\n-modham...\n\n4. Vaalhu kunthangalh kkillaavashyam - kozhukkalhaakki\nChaalu pôkkaa naakkumaayava\nNaalu dikkum samaadhaanam chaalavey parannirikkum\nVaalhey dukkayillaarumey - chèlukèdi llonninumey\n\n-modham...\n\n5. Aaleluyya geetham paadumey - Yerushalemum\nAaleluyya raagam paadumey\nAaleluyya vaanaththilum - aaleluyya bhoomiyilum\nAaleluyya maalaakhamaar - chollumey! manusharellaam\n-modham...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n        (Mani John Kochukunju)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0300": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0300-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0300-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Sowing in the morning\n\n1. Vithachcheeduka naam swargaththintey viththaam\nKristhan suvishesham hridayangalhil\nAathmamaari peyyum Daiva kripa cheiyyum\nTharum koyththineyum thakkakaalathil\n\nKoiththu kaalaththil naam santhoshichchum\n\nKattakal chumannum konduvannidum (2)\n\n2. Vithachcheeduka naam snehaththin adhvaanam\nOru naalhum vyartham alla aakayaal\nEnnum praarthichcheedin velayil ninneedin\nViththu nanachcheedin kannhuneerinaal\n\n-koiththuu...\n\n3. Vithachcheeduka naam vardhanayedaivam\nNalkum sarvaneram than van shakthiyaal\nVénalkaalam varsham kaattu sheetham ushnham\nCheiyyum Daiva ishtam bhuminilkum naalh\n-koiththuu...\n\n4. Vithachcheeduka naam thadassam anèkam\nSaaththaan kondennaalum than vairaagyaththaal\nThalharnnu pokaathey snehavum vidaathey\nNilka ksheenhikkaathey Kristhan shakthiyaal\n-koiththuu...\n\n5. Vithachcheeduka naam vithekkunna kaalam\nAvasaanichcheedum ethravègaththil\nIppolh vithakkaathey irunnal koyyaathey\nRakshakan munbaakey nilkum lajjayil\n\n-koiththuu...\n\n6. Vithachcheeduka naam divya samaadhaanam\nMulhachcheeduvolham shoonyadeshaththil\nMarubhoomi kaadum uthsavam kondaadum\nParvathangalh paadum Daivathejassil\n\n-koiththuu...\n(V. Nagal)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0301": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0301-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0301-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 2, "tune": 1, "kind": "CONTINUATION"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0301-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Tune: To the work to the work\n\n- Fanny J Crosby\n\n1. Velakku velakku\nDaivadaasanmaarh naam\nKristhan kaanicha paatha\nNaam pinchellanham\nIngu vaazhuvaan alla\nshushroosha cheyvaan\nIhathil pirhannu\nswarga raajavu thaan\n\n\nYathnikka - yathnikka\n\nTheduka - theduka\n\nAashikka - Praarthikka\n\nKarthaavu varum vegaththil\n\n2. Velakku velakku\nChuttum nokkuka naam\nEngum vaazhum asathya-\nththe pokkuka naam\nSarva srishtiyum yeshuve\nkaanhum vare\nUyarthiduka naam\nsathyamaam kodiye\n-yathnikka…\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n3. Velakku - Velakku\nDaivadrohangalhum\nVyaajamaargangalh\nnaashaththin mohangalhum\nDaiva bhoomiyil\nvardhikkumee - samaye\nSwasthatha yogyamo\nkristhan daasanmaare\n-yathnikka…\n\n4. Velakku - velakku\ninnu rakshayin naalh\nEnkilum nithyavum\npaapa shikshakalhaal\nAayiram aayiram\nnashicheedunnithaa!\nRakshippaan rakshippaan\nEn sahodara! Vaa\n\n-yathnikka…\n\n\n5. Velakku velakku\noro kashtangalhum\nParihaasangalh\nhimsakalh nashtangalhum\nSahichum vahichum\nkondadhwanikka naam\nEnnaal njaam kristhuvin\nsathya sevakaraam  -yathnikka…\n\n6. Velakku velakku\nPinne swasthathayum\nKarthan daasaraam naam\nnithyam aasvadikkaam\nEn santhoshathilekku\npraveshikkuka\nEnnu thaan arulhi-\ncheyyum halleluyya\n-yathnikka…\n\n(V. Nagal)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0302": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0302-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0302-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Must I go empty handed\n\n    -C.C. Luther\n\n1. Verum kayyaay njaan chellumo? Rakshakan sannidhiyil\nOtta naalhin seva polum kaazhcha vekkaathey munbil\n\nVerum kayyaay njaan chellumo rakshakan munbil nilpaan?\n\n\nOru dehi polu millaathenganey vanhangum njaan?\n\n2. Rakshakan veendeduththathaal mrithyuvey bhayamilla\nVerum kayyaay thanney kaanhmaan undenikettam bhayam\n\n-verum...\n\n3. Paapam cheithu naalh kazhichchathudhdharichchida amenkil\nRakshakan paadaththil kaazhcha vechchupayogichchidaam\n\n-verum...\n\n4. Shudhdharey vegamunharnnu pakal neram yathnippin\nRaathrivarum munbey thanney aathmanèttam cheithidaan\n\n-verum...", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0303": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0303-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0303-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Suvishesham athu jayikkumey\nAthu jayikkumey Ennum\njayikkumey suvishesham\n\n1. Pokuvin ningalh En suvishesham\nÔthiduvaanaai lôkamashèsham\nYeshu Naathan ee sandesham\nÈkukayaal pôka naam          -suvishesham...\n\n2. Kaalvari malayil kaivanna vijayam\nKaahalha naatham muzhakki sammodam\nYerihovinu nèreyullha\nPôrinaayi pôkanham\n          -suvishesham...\n\n3. Prathinidhi sèva thudaruka nammalh\nPrathiphalam ithinundadhikam annaalhil\nPraanha naathanaai namukku\nPraanhanum koduththidaam\n          -suvishesham...\n\n(T. K. Samuel)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0304": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0304-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0304-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Engum pukazhththuvin suvishesham Haa-\n\n\nMangalha jaya jaya sandesham\n\n1. Narabhojikalhe narasnehikalhaam\nUththama sodararaakkum\nVimala manohara suvishesham\n\n-haa mangalha…\n\n2. Ajnjaanaa-ndhathayaake akattum\nVinjaananakkathirh veeshum\nVedaanthapporulh suvishesham\n\n-haa mangalha…\n\n3. Bheekara samara samaakulamaakum\nBHoomiyil bheethiye neekkum\nShaanthi sandaayaka suvishesham\n-haa mangalha…\n\n4. Vimalajaneshuvil vasicheedukil\nviduthalanaamayan-arulhum\nVijaya dhwaniyee suvishesham\n\n-haa mangalha…\n\n5. Kripayaalethoru paathakaneyum\nPaavana shobhithanaakkum\nPaapa nivaaranha suvishesham\n\n-haa mangalha…\n\n6. Nashikkum loukika janathinu heenam\nNamukko daivika njaanam\nKurishin vachanam suvishesham\n\n-haa mangalha…\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(M.E. Cherian)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0305": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0305-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0305-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Suvishesha ghoshanhame - suthan yeshuvin kalpanaye\n\nDaivasnehaththin vachanavume-avan rakshayin kshanhamathume\n\n1. Nammalh paapangalh nimiththame - Yeshu bhoomiyi!  vannathume\nKrushu tholhil chumannathume - rudhiramathu chorinjathume\n\n-suvi…\n\n2. Paapa bhaarangalhaalume—paaril kleshangalhaalume\nPaatha vittihe uzhalunnore—priyan Yeshuvin arikil vaa\n\n\n-suvi…\n\n3. Theru veedhikalh vazhikalhilum—malakal thaazh-varakalhilum\nThiru vachanam muzhakki naam—paran vaakkinnu valayirrakkaam\n-suvi…\n\n4. Mazhayo veyilo puzhayo—matha bhedam enna pazhiyo\nKannheeril naam vithachcheedukil koitheedumathavan  naalhil\n\n-suvi…\n\n5. Ellaa jaathi jangalhume—Nalla raajane vanhangeedume\nAllalellaam-akanneedume - Hallelujah naam paadeedume\n\n-suvi…", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0306": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0306-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0306-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Padam padam urrachchu naam krrooshumenthi  pokanham\n\nJeevanenkil Jeevan vechchu Bharatham naedeedanham\n\n1. Paapa thanthra badharaam bharatheeya sodare\nPaapa bhaaram neekkidum Yeshuvinkal odi vaa\n\n\n-padam…\n\n2. Swathanthra maargaam labhyamam kristhuvinte shakthiyaal\nSwathanthram-innu ghoshikkaam bhaarathaththil engume\n-padam…\n\n3. Jeevane thyajichathaam rakthasaakshi Sankaththil\nAayudhaththe aenthi naam aayodhanam Cheitheedanham\n-padam…\n\n4. Cheruveen sakhaakalhe kooduvin yuvaakkalhe\nKrisththu naadhan porinaai odi odi kooduvin\n\n\n-padam...\n\n5. Snehaththin irippidam thyaagaththin vilhanilam\nRakshayin sankethavum yeshuraajan thanneyaam\n\n-padam…\n\n6. Kristhu eka naayakan kristhuvinte shakthiyaal\nLabhyamaakum-evarkkum thante por cheitheeduvaan\n\n-padam…\n\n7. Peetakalh naduvilum paalanam cheitheedunna\nPaavan-aathma-daayakan paarileshu naayakan\n\n\n-padam…", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0307": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0307-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0307-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Koiththund-adhikam velayunderre\nPovathinaayini Aarullhoo ?\nChuduchora-chinthum veera yodhaakkalh\nKristhuvinaay-irrangeedatte !\n\n1. Aayirangalh ithaa aazhaththil veenhu\nAandu kidannee-dunnu\nShanthi arulhum snehaththin kodiyaal\nNedaam bharathaththe - naam - nedam\n\n\n-Koiththu...\n\n2. Nira nira nirayaayi anhi-nirannu\npovatte krooshin veerar\nSeyeeril ninnu kelhkkunna shabdam\nRaathrri-enthaayaho ? - oh - raathri enthaayaho\n\n-Koiththu…\n\n3. Vishramam ilia kannhuneer maathrram\nAadhaaram nammalhkkivide\nKannheer thudakkum kaalam varunnu\nNaadhane kaanhumpolh - naam - naadhane\n\n-Koiththu...\n\n4. Thannallo enikkaai than rakthamaake\nEnthu njaanekidum thanikkaai\nLokaanthyam vare than saakshi-athaavaan\nNalkeedunn-enne njaan - ha - nalkeedunnenne\n\n-Koiththu…\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(P.D. John)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0308": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0308-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0308-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Yeshu paran vaanhee-dum Engum mahaa raajanaayi\n-yeshu…\n\n1. Yeshu paran vaanheedum Yeshu ennum vaanheedum\nEe surya chandranmaarum Theere illaathe poyennaalum\n-yeshu...\n\n2. Vaan karakalhin melum Vailiya raajyangalhmelum\nMaalokar evarmelum - doore Dweepaa-ntharangalhmelum\n-yeshu...\n\n3. Ethu jaathikalh melum Neethi paalanam cheyyum\nSarvva kulangalh melum Paaril sakala bhaashakkaar melum\n-yeshu…\n\n4 Raajar prabhukkalh chakrra-Varthikalh sakalarum\nRaajaathi raajan mumpil Veenhu vanhangi kumpittu niikkum\n-yeshu...\n\n5. Sathya suvisheshaththin Saadhu kalpana pole\nSakala raajaakkanmaarum Cheiyyum neethi vasichidum engum  -yeshu…\n\n6. Kuttham shikshakalhilla Gunham allaathonnum illa\nKondaadum lokarellaam Yeshu eka chakrravarththiyaam\n-yeshu...\n\n7 Sandhya-yushassukalhil Sakala deshaththullhorum\nSangeetham yeshu paaril Paadi vandanam cheiyum ennum\n-yeshu…\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(Moshavatsalam)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0309": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0309-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0309-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Yeshu naadhan jayikunnu - Haalelujah\nIha lokam muzhuvanum - Haalelujah\n\n1. Ororo raajyangalhil suvishesham odi niranjeedunnu Haalelujah…\nAerepperaandu thorrum chernnidunnu Yeshuivn naamathil Haalelujah\n\n2. Peyin Maargangalh-engum kshayicheedunuu pedichchodunnu saaththaan Haalelujah\nShreeyeshu maargam-engum balappedunnu thiriyunnu Lokatharil Haalelujah\n\n3. Jaathibhedangalh palathum neengidunnu Jayikunnu snehakkodi Haalelujah\nPaathakangalh paarilninnu kurranjidunnu Phalikkunnu suvishesham Haalelujah\n\n4. Aalayangalh uyarunnu yeshuvinnu aaraadhanayerrunnu Haalelujah\nNaalupaadum vigrahangalh veenhidunnu naasha vazhi adayunnu Haalelujah\n\n5. Valharnnu nirranjeedunnu raajyam Mangunnu peyin raajyam Haalelujah\nVilhangunnu divyashakthi-yadhikaaram Mediniyil dinam dinam Haalelujah\n(Moshavatsalam)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0310": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0310-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0310-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Jayikkume suvisehsham lokam jayikkume!\n\n\nPeyude shakthikalh nashikkume!\n\n\nSakala lokarum yeshuvin naamaththil\nvanhangume thala  kunikkume\nAthu bahu santhoshame!\n\n1. Kooduvin - sabhakalhe! Vannu paaduvin\nyeshuvin keerththi kondaaduvin\nSuvishesham chollaan oduvin\nnidra vittunharnneeduvin manam\nOththelaarum ninneeduvin vegam\n\n\n-Jayi…\n\n2. Idikkanham peyin kotta naam idikkanham\nJaathi bhethangalh mudikkanham\nSnehathin kodi pidikkanham\nYeshuraajante suvishesha kodi\nGhoshathoduyartheedenham vegam\n\n-Jayi…\n\n3. Marichhcu thaan namukku mokshaththe varuththi thaan\nVelhichcha maargaththil iruththi thaan\nElhiya kootare uyarththi thaan\nYeshu naadhante rakshayin kodi\nGhoshathoduyarththidenham nammalh\n\n-Jayi...\n\n4. Chelavideen sukham balaththeyum chelavideen\nBuddhi njnaanaththeyum chelavideen\nVasthu sampaththukalh chelavideen\nYeshu raajante mahimayin kodi\nAevarum uyartheedenham nammalh\n\n-Jayi...\n\n5. Yogyame-ithu nammukkathi bhaagyame\nRakshithaavinte vaakyame\nSwarggalokaro-daikyame\nYeshu-raajyaprasiddhikkaayi naam\nAevarum prayathnicheedenhame\n\n\n-Jayi…\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(Moshavatsalam)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0311": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0311-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0311-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Jesus shall reign\n\n-Isaac Watts\n\n1. Aadithyan udichcheedunna\nDèshangalhil ellaam Yeshu\nAntha millaaththoru raajyam\nSthaapichchu vaazhum ennèkum\n\n2. Naanaa dèshakkaarellaarum\nThan snehaththin sthuthi paadum\nPaithangalh koodey ghoshikkum\nVisheshamaam than naamaththey\n\n3. Yaachanakalh sthothramellaam\nThan naamaththil uyarnneedum\nNaanaa janam vanhangeedum\nRaajaadhi Raajan Karthaney\n\n4. Vèdana klèsham paapavum\nPôkum ashèsham ennekum\nSwaathanthryam bhaagyam poornhatha\nEllaavarkkum labhichcheedum\n\n5. Lôkar varattey than munpil\nSthuthi sthothraththodu koodey\nMèl loka sainyam paadattey\nBhoomi cholleedattey ‘Aaamen’", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0312": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0312-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0312-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Sathyathinte paathayil snehaththin kodiyumaai\n\n\nSaakshikalh samoohame munnerridaam\n\n1. Aeka naadhan yeshucin jethaakalhe\nEkaathmaavin balam dharikkuvin\nShuddharaakuvin shaktharaakuvin\nGhoranaaya shathruvodu poraaduvaan\n\n2. Aathmaavin sarvaayuddhangalh naam dharikkanham\nVishwaasamaam parichayenthanham\nArakku sathyavum neethi kavachavum\nRakshayin shirasthravum anhinjorunganham\n\n3. Thinmakalh namukku neridendathundu naam\nNanmakalhaal jayam varikkanham\nPaapathodu naam poraadanham\nPraanha thyaagatholham ethirthu nilkkanham\n\n4. Shathruvodethirkkuvaan jayam neduvaan\nAathmaavin shakthi sambharikkuvaan\nUpavassikkanham praarthikkanham\nIdavidaathe sthothraththil jaagarikkanham\n\n\nVishudhdha Samsargam", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0313": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0313-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0313-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 2, "tune": 2, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0313-malayalam-1.jpg", "choir/KK-0313-malayalam-2.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Manassodey shaapa maraththil thoongiya-manuvela! Daivajaathaa!\nNinakkee vedana varuththivechchathee neechan njaanayyo\n\n2. Paramaneethi en durithaththalenne-arivaan ninnoru nèram\nParaman Nee athaalariyappettidaan-irangi vannallo\n\n3. Malapoley shaapam-jwalichchirangiya nilaththin paathakam moolam\nAlinju Nee shaapam-thalayil kondeedaanvalima vittallo\n\n4. Nanniketta ee nararey Naraka jwaalayilninnu nèdaan\nMannava! Thiru-ponkuruthi nee chinthi ninnallo\n\n5. Daivakopaththil darshanam vittupaapi njaanolhi-chcheedaan\nSarva lokaththin naayaka nin- vilaavum veendallo\n\n6. Marichchavarkkamruthaai Nin dehaththey-nurukkiyo jeevanaathaa\nMurinjudanja nin-thirumeyyin raktham chorinjallo! Paaril\n\n7. Arishta paapi nin thiru punhyangalhil sharanham vachchuvannayyo\nThiru prathimayaakka gathiye kripa niranja Karthaavey\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(Moshavatsalam)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0314": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0314-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0314-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Ponneshu narar thirubeli maranham ninappaan\nThannaa noru niyamam athishayamey\n\n-ponneshu...\n\n2. Ponnaaya thiru jadam nararkku vendi nurukki\nOnnodey thiru raktham chorikkumennum\n\n-ponneshu...\n\n3. Appam onneduththavan japichu nurukki nalki\nThrippaadam thozhunna thannudey shishyarkkey -ponneshu...\n\n4. Kaasaayil draakshaarasam pakarnnuyarththiyarulhi\nEesho than rakthamatheynnakaththirippaal\n-ponneshu...\n\n5. Maahaathmyam athinanavadhi yundu rahasyamey\nÈkan pôkunnu beli kazhivathinaai\n\n\n-ponneshu...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(Moshavatsalam)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0315": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0315-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0315-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Snehavirunnanubhavippaan - sneha\nDaivamakkalhellaavarum kooduvin jayam jayam nammukkey!\n\nPakathingi loka makkalh\nPala kulam jaathikalhaay pirinju naalhkkunaalh\n\nParanodethirkkunnu\n\n1. Namukkoru Pithaavu thanney\nNamukkevarkkum jeevan arulhidunnathum daivaathmaavu thanney\nNamukkeka rakshakanam (2)\nNamukkevarkum koodiyirippathini swargam onnu thanney\n\n-sneha...\n\n2. Namukkeka bhojanamey\nNamukkevarkum nizhal, velhichaththunhathum Yeshu naayakaney\nVazhi vathil snehamonney (2)\nKristhu vidhi chollunneram namukkellaavarkkum valaththubhaagamonney -sneha...\n\n3. Sneha kurithottidenham naam\nNiyamamitheshuvin jananghalkkevarkkum niyamichcheshu paran\nPaka pèyudey kuriyaam (2)\nParanerey sankadam kopavum varum pinhangum lokarodey\n\n-sneha...\n\n4. Kristhan thiruchintha dharippin\nKurisheduththu thaazhmayodavan pinchelluvin thirukripa labhippan\nEkamanasoddey japippin (2)\nAvasaanaththolhavum nilaninneduvin varam bhaagyam namukkey\n-sneha...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(Moshavatsalam)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0316": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0316-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0316-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Mannaayé bhujikka! Jeeva appamaam\n\nMannaayé naam bhujikka…divya mozhiyaam\n\nMannaayé naam bhujikka\nMannaayaam Yeshuvey naam modamodey bhujikka\n\n\nEnnekum jeevichchu nithyaanandam labhyamaakaan-\n1. Naasha valayil naam aashayattoraay\nVaasam cheiyyaathey shreeyeshuvey nambuka\nKrushil pathikka kanhkal kaarunyavane kaanhmaan\nMaashaapa mellametta maanuvel chonnapoley\n\n-mannaye...\n\n2. Enne thinnunnavan ennaaley jeevikkum\nEnnilerpaapi vishwasam vachchidukil\nEnnum jeevikku mavanennum vishakkayilla\nEnnum daahikkayilla ennuchonna yeshuvaam\n\n-mannaye...\n\n3. Jeeva pithaavenne bhuvinkalayachchu\nJeevichcheedunnathum thaathan moolamallo\nEnne bhujippavanumavannham njaan moolamaay\nUnnatha jeevanundaamennu chonna naathanaam\n-mannaye...\n\n4. Ennil vishwasikka ennil nee jeevikka\nEnnudey aathmaprakaasham kaikollhuka\nIruttil nadakkayilla idari veezhukayilla\nMarikkilum jeevichcheedum ennil vishwasippaan\n\n-mannaye…\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(Rev. T. Koshy)\n\nVivaham", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0317": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0317-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0317-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Paraneshuve karunhaa nidhe varamekuka dampathikalh-\n\n-kkarulhenhame krupaye dinam prathi maari pol deivajaathaa\n\n1. Eaden kaavilaadam havvaye vaazhththiya sarvesha ee samayam\nEe dampathikalhin kaikalhe thammil cherththu vaazhththeedenhame\n-Para...\n\n2. Thava  daasaramivarai-kamathyamode vasichcheduvaanum\nAvasaana kaalamanhanjeedum vare preethiyil mevathinum\n\n-Para…\n\n3. Paramaaviyaalivare nirakku mahonnathane! Dinavum\nThirunaama keerthi sadaa ninachu thangalh vasicheeduvaanum\n-Para…\n\n4. Paraneshu than priyayaai thirusabhaye varichchaayathinaai\nMaranham sahichathu polee daasan than pathniye cherththu kolhvaan   -Para…\n\n5. Thava saadiyaamivalhum anusaricheedenham nithyavum than-\nDhavane purasaarrayum abrahaamine ennapol modamode\n\n-Para…\n\n6. Pala maattavum marrivum niranja loke ivar nithyavum nin\nAlivettam ullhavayaam chirrakadi chernnu sukhippathinum\n\n-Para…\n\n(Rev. T.J. Andrews)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0318": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0318-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": [], "manglish": "Tune: ‘Guide me O Thou Great Jehova’\n\n1. Kripayullha thriyekane! Ippolh nee varenhame!\nNinte kripayaal ivare anpodu nokkenhame\nKadaakshikka (2) Ee vadhu varanmaare!\n\n2. Aadimuthal vivaahaththe niyamicha karthaave\nSalbhakthi, shaatham snehathe Ee purushanum sthreekkum\nNee koduththu (2) Ivare yojippikka\n\n3. Santhosha vaazhcha kaalathil daivathe bhayapettu\nSanthaapa thaazhcha kaalathil bhakthiyil sthirapettu\nJeevikkenham (2) Anthye swargge chernnidaan", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0319": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0319-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0319-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "‘The voice that breathed o’er Eden’\n- J. Keble\n1. Aadya vivaaha naalhil aedenil dhwanicha\nAa mangalyaasheervaadam innum kelhkkunnithaa!\n\n2. Kraisthava dampathimaar thammil cherum neam\nVishuddhanaam thriyekan than kripa choriyum\n\n3. Santhaana soubhaagyavum Sneham vishwaasavum\nLoka shakthikkasaadhyam neekkanaikya bandham\n\n4. Pithaave! Nin saanidhyam venhamee sandarbhe\nAadamin havvaa pole ee kaanthayaakatte\n\n5. Rakshakaa Ezhunellhi yojippikkivare\nDeerkhakaalam santhosham chernnu vasicheedaan\n\n6. Vishiddhaathmaave! Vannu aasheervadikka nee\nSwargga manhavaalhanu manhavaattiyepol\n\n7. Ivar thangalh kireedam vechangu nin paade\nKristhan manhavaattiyaai Soubhaagyam cheratte", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0320": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0320-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0320-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Yeshu naayakaa! Vannaalum thannaalum varam\n\nYeshu naayakaa! Vannaalum\n\n\nAasheervaadam aekukinnee daasar karam cherum neram\n-yeshu…\n\n1. Thalparaa kripaasanaa mahathwakril prathaapaa\nAthbhuthakaraa kripaye cheyka daya cheyka\n\n\n-yeshu…\n\n2. Sundarathvam chernnamun kalyaanha manhveettil\nChennarulh nee cheytha daya pole anpole\n\n\n-yeshu…\n\n3. Daasan eliyaasarum vishwaasamodu peshum\nVaachaka pramaanham nijamaayi vashamaayi\n\n\n-yeshu…\n\n4. Uththama sanmaarga nerri bhakthi suvishwaasam\nNithya samaadhaanam uttukaappaan ivarh paarppaan\n\n-yeshu…\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n5. Mangala murhikalhil vilhangi gathiyaavaan\nSangath ivaruththi sukham cherkka jayam cherkka\n\n-yeshu…\n\n6. Nithya shubha shobhanamodeddhishayilum peruki\nPuthra sukhamodivar vasippaan sukhippaan\n\n\n-yeshu…\n\n(Mani John Kochukunju)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0321": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0321-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0321-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 2, "tune": 1, "kind": "CONTINUATION"}], "malayalam": [], "manglish": "Psalm 128\n\n\nYehovaye bhayapettu, avante\nVazhikalhil nadakkunna aevanum bhaagyavaan\nNinte kaikalhude adhvaana phalam nee thinnum\nNee bhagyavaan, ninakku nanma varum\n\n1. Ninte bhaarya ninte veetinakathu Phalapradamaaya munthirivallhipoleyum\nNinte makkalh ninte meshakku chuttum  Olivuthaikalh poleyum irikkum\nYahova bhakthanaaya purushan Ingane anugrahikkapettavanaakum\nYahova seeyonil ninnum ninne anugrahikkum\n\n2. Ninte aayushkaalamokkeyum nee Yerushaleminte nanmaye kaanhum\nNinte makkalheyum nee kaanhum Yisraayelinmel samaadhaanam undakatee\nPithaavinum puthranum parishuddhaathmaavinum mahathwamundakatte\nAadiyinkalum ippozhum ennekkum ullhaprakaaram thanne Amen\n\nDukhasamayaththekkullha Prarthana", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0322": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0322-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0322-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Manuvel mannavane! - parane\n\n\n\nManuvaai vannavane!\n\n\n\n\nManuvele ninmana-malinjarikil\n\n\n\n\nVarika vaikaathe - parane -\n\n-manu…\n\n1. Karunhayinudayode - ennathi duritham kaanhenhame\nParavashanaayidunnayyo! En paathakamathinaale - parane!\n\n-manu…\n\n2. Appanum ammayumaayenikku eppozhuthum neeye\nUlhparithaapam kandukaninjee alpanu thunha cheyka - parane!\n-manu…\n\n3. Perumazha polagneyaasthram nararipoovaam saaththaan\nTheruthere aeyyunnayyo ennil karalhalinjeedenhame - parane!\n\n-manu…\n\n4. Sharanham neeyallathadiyanu oruvanumillayyo\nMaranham vareyum arikilirunnu paripaalikkanhame - parane!\n\n-manu…\n\n5. Ninne vittittingadiyaanengu poyeedum?\nKanhmanhi pol ninne njaan nokkum ennarulh cheythone parane!\n-manu…\n\n6. Arikil varaaykil nee ente maranham vaneedum\nKarunhaavaaridhe! Vannente karalhu thanhuppikka - parane!\n\n-manu…\n\n(M. Mathen)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0323": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0323-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0323-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Aaru sahaayikkum? Lokam thunhakkumo?\nJeevan poyidumbolh aashrayam aarullhu?\n\n2. Snehithanmaar vannaal chernnarikil nilkum\nKleshamodellaarum kannhuneer thookeedum\n\n3. Jeevante naayakan dehiye chodichaal\nIllillennothuvaan bhoothale aarullhu\n\n4. Bharya makkalh bandhu mithrarumanthyathil\nKhedam perukeettu maarviladikkunnu\n\n5. Aevanum, thaan cheytha karhmangalhkkoththapol\nSheekhramaai praapipaan lokam vittedunnu\n\n6. Kanhkalhadayumbolh kelhvi kurayumbolh\nEn manhavaalhaa! Nin krooshine kaanhikka\n\n7. Yeshumanhavaalhaa! Sakalavum mochichu\nNinnarikil nilpaan yogyanaakkenhame!\n\n9. Ponnu karthaave! Nin thankarudhiraththaal\nJeevitha vasthraththin venhmaye nalkanhe!\n\n10. Yordaante theeraththu njan varum neraththu\nKaalkalhe vegam nee akkare aakkanhe!\n(Muthampakkal Kochukunju Upadeshi)\n\nShavamadakkam", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0324": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0324-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0324-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "‘Hush blessed are the dead’\n1. Kristhanmel chaari than hasthe vishramicha\nKarthaavil mrithanmaar nithyam bhaagyavaanmaar\n\n2. Kaanhaathe snehicha - praanhanaam yeshuve\nUnhmayil thelhivaay kaanhmaathathre bhagyam\n\n3. Vallatha prayaasam illa naditheere\nPulin mechil sthale nal idayan meykkum\n\n4. Pakalathe veyil - paathiraa sheethavum\nVyaakula dukhavum illavarkkinimel\n\n5. Avarude sneham - swaram santhoshavum\nKaanhkayilla njangal kurhe naalhekkini\n\n6. Pirinja priyarkkai njangalh - dukhikkumbolh\nKannhuneer choricha karthaa kshamikkanhe,\n\n7. Mrithyuvennezhunna - kristhan naadam avarh\n‘Santhoshippin’ ennu anthya naalhil kelhkkum", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0325": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0325-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0325-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 2, "tune": 2, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0325-malayalam-1.jpg", "choir/KK-0325-malayalam-2.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Samayamaam radhathil njan swargga yaathra cheyunnu\nEn swadesham kaanhmathinu bhadhappettodeedunnu\n\n\nAake alpa neram maathram ente yaathra theeruvaan\n\n\nYeshuve! Ninakku sthothram vegam ninne kaanhum njan\n\n2. Ravile njan unharumbolh bhagyamullhon nishchayam\nEnte yaathrayude anthyam innalekkaalh aduppam\n\n-aake…\n\n3. Raathriyil njan daivathinte kaikalhil urhangunnu\nAppozhum en radhathinte chakram munnottodunnu\n\n-aake…\n\n4. Theduvaan jadaththin sukham ippolh alla samayam\nSwantha naattil daivamukham kaanhkayathre vaanchitham\n-aake…\n\n5. Bhaarangalh koodunnathinu onnum venda yaathrayil\nAlpam appam vishappinu swalpa vellham daahikkil\n\n-aake…\n\n6. Sthalam haa mahaavishesham phalam ethra madhuram\nVenda venda bhoo pradesham alla ente paarpidam\n\n-aake…\n\n7. Nithyamaayorh vaasa sthalam enikkundu swarggathil\nJeeva vrikshaththinte phalam daiva parhudeesaayil\n\n-aake…\n\n8. Enne ethirelpaanaayi daivadootharh varunnu\nVendumpole yaathrayaakki puthushakthi tharunnu\n\n-aake…\n(V. Nagal)\n\nPallhi Prathshta", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0326": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0326-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0326-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 2, "tune": 2, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0326-malayalam-1.jpg", "choir/KK-0326-malayalam-2.jpg"], "manglish": "Paralokaadhipane! - parane!\n\n\nVaranham thirubhavane…\n\n\n\n\nParane kripayaal thirumandiraththil\n\n\n\n\nIrangi aavasikkanhame parane\n\n\n-para…\n\n1. Paraththilum bhoomiyilum ithenye paralokangalhilum\nOruvidham nirhanju onnilumadangaa-thunnathannyavane - parane\n\n-para…\n\n2. Adiyaarkkee aalayathe labhippaan ida varuththiya nadha!\nAdimakalh ninne adithozhuthidunne angeekarikkanhame - parane\n\n-para…\n\n3. Thirukripa thirubalam dayayum thirumahimayum kshamayum\nParichodu parane! Arulheeyaalayaththil nirhachuvecheedanhame - parane\n-para…\n\n4. Sthuthi japam thirudhyaanam prasangam ithumuthal nin bhavane\nAdhika bhakthiyodum shradhdhayodum nadappan ithil adhivassikanhame parane -para…\n\n5. Neethiye dharichavaraai nin daasar ninthiru seva cheyvaan\nNee dayayode nithyamee sabhayil nin kripa pakarenhame - parane\n\n-para…\n\n6. Anuthapicheeduvaanum mochanam anubhavicheeduvanum\nManassamaadhaanam palarh labhippaanum kanivaai ee samayam parane\n-para…\n(Moshavatsalam)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0327": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0327-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0327-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Tune: The Church’s one foundation\n\n1. Karththave! Varenhame\nNinmakkalh madhyathil\nAashisham nalkenhame\nee avasaraththil\nEe puthu daivaalayam\nnin naama keerthikkaai\nPrathishtikkunnu vayam (njangalh)\nnin daasan moolamaai\n\n2. Ee aalayathe nannai\nshudhdheekarikkanham\nNIn nirantharavaasam\nkarththave! Aakkanham\nNee ithil sadaa mevi\naasheervadikkenham\nNin makkalhin uthavi\nennum nee aakenham\n\n3. Ee aalayalam aakanham\npraarthanaa nilayam\nPaapikalhkkundaakanham\nmaarhiya hridayam\nNin vachanam kelhkanham\nnin makkalh eppozhum\nShudhdhiyil valharenham\nshobhippaan appozhum\n\n4. Ee aalayathil nithyam\nnin sthuthiponganham\nNin naamam sadaa sthuthyam\nmaanasa mohanam\nMel lokaththil nin doothar\nnin naamaththil sthuthi\nPaadumpol ingum bhakthar\nchollenham samsthuthi\n\n5. Ee aalayam swarggaththin\nvaathil aayidenham\nIngu vishudhdhaathmaavin\naasheer varsham venham\nEe vaathilkal nin makkalh\nninne villikkumbolh\nNee kettu nin varangalh\nnalki vaazhtheedappolh\n\n6. Nin vishuddha samsarggam\ningundaakanhame!\nNin makkalhkkullha swargam\nnee thanne daivame\nNin makkalh ninnodum nee\nnin makkalhidume\nSamsargam ingu cheyka\nkarthaa! Ennekkume\n\n7. Ee aalaye naalh thorhum\nninmakkalh vardhichchu\nThingidenham elaarum\nbhedangalh varjjichchu\njaathikalhin samooham\nchernningu sarvadaa\nPukazhthanham nin naamam\nsanthoshamaai pithaa!\n\n\nYaathra geetham", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0328": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0328-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0328-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 2, "tune": 1, "kind": "CONTINUATION"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0328-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "God be with you till we\n\n1. Kaanhum varey ini naam thammil\nKoodey irikkattey Daivam\nThan divya nadaththippaaley-\nKaaththu paalikkattey! ningalhey\n\n\nIni naam, ini naam\nYeshu mun chèrum varey\nIni naam, ini naam\nChérum varey paalikkattey thaan!\n\n2. Kaanhum varey ini naam thammil\nThan thiru chirakin keezhil\nNalki ennum divyamannaa\nKaaththu paalikkattey ningalhey\n-ini...\n\n3. Kaanhum varey ini naam thammil\nThan thrikkarangalhil ènthi\nAnarthangalhil koodeyum\nKaaththu paalikkattey ningalhey\n-ini...\n\n4. Kaanhum varey ini naam thammil\nSneha kodiyathinkeezhil\nMrithyuvinmel jayam nalki\nKaaththu paalikkattey ningalhey\n-ini...", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0329": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0329-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0329-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Anugrahaththodey ippolh ayakka adiyaarey Yehovaaye\nManassalivudaya mahonnatha paraney vandanam Ninakkaamen!\n\n2. Karunhayinnaasanaththil ninnu - kripa adiyangalh mel\nVaranham ellaayppozhum irikkenham raappakal vandanam Ninakkaamen!\n\n3. Thirusamaadhaana vaakyam adiyaar sthirappedaan arulhka ippolh\nArumayerum vedamarulhiya paraney Halleluyya aamen!\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(Moshavatsalam)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0330": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0330-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0330-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Tune: Abide with me\n\n1. Yehova nintey paripaalakan\nNin gamanaagamanangalhilum\nSookshikkum raappakal kshanham prathi\nSarvva doshangalhil ninnum ninney\n\n2. Yehova nintey paripaalakan\nPakal aadithyanum raathri chandranum\nNinney upadravikkaa lèshavum\nThaan ennum chirakin keezhil kaakkum\n\n3. Yehova nintey paripaalakan\nMèl snehakkodi keezhil nithyamaam\nThan bhujangalh iru bhaagaththum nin\nMunbil chuttilum undu than kaaval\n\n4. Yehova nintey paripaalakan\nNin hridayam manassum aathmaavum\nDeham jeevan adharam kanh kai kaal\nKshèmaththodey kaakkum avan kaiyyil\n\n5. Yehova nintey paripaalakan\nKannhin krishnamanhi pol ennumey\nIhaththil ninney sookshichchathin pin\nMahathwaththilekku kaikondeedum", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0331": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0331-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0331-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "‘Children of the heavenly king’ J.Cennic\n\n1. Swarga Raaja puthrarey\nYogya sthothram paaduvin\nYaathrapôkumbolh thanney\nYeshuviney sthuthippin\n\n2. Daivaththinkalèkku naam\nAashayodey pôkunnu\nMun vishwaasikalh ellaam\nIprakaaram nadannu\n\n3. Bhaagyamullha koottamey\nGhoshichchangaanandippin\nPaapa lôkam pôkattey\nSwarggamoksham praapippin\n\n4. Pèdikkenda vègaththil\nNingalh Daivaththey kaanhum\nYeshu Kristhu ningalhey\nJayaththodey rakshikkum\n\n5. Vazhi kaanhikkenhamey\nManassodey njangalhum\nPriyam ullha Yeshuvey\nNinney anugamikkum", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0332": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0332-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0332-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "‘Blest be the tie that binds’ - J. Fawcett\n\n1. Kristhuvin snehaththil\nchiththangalhin bandham\nVaazhthapettathaakattengalh\nhrithinaikyavume\n\n2. Priya pithrumumbil\nnaam yaachikkunnithaa\nBhayam prathyaashaa-kaamkshakalh\nonnu thaan njangalhkku\n3. Thaapa bhaara jaalam\nvahikkum naam thammil\nVaarkunnu kannheeranyonyam\nsahathaapamode\n\n4. Verpaadinkalundaam\nvedana maanase\nChiththaikyaththaal paarthu veendum\ncherthanhakkapedum\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nShishu gaanangalh", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0333": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0333-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0333-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Varuvin cherhu paithangalhe\n\n\nGuruvaam yeshu arikil\n\n\nThirivin thiru vachanangalhil\n\n\nMaruvi perukeeduvin\n\n1. Baalyakaalamathethra vegaththil marhayum nirham kurhayum\nChirakaalavum nila ninnidaa narakkum jara anhayum\n\n-varu…\n\n2. Innu kanda gunhangalhokkeyum mangi mangi marhanju pom\nSundaram bahu bhangi shakthiyum onninonnu kurhanjupom\n-varu…\n\n3. Ethrayo pala baalakarh manodukhamaai marichillayo\nAthrayo chila beethikalh dinam adukkum namukkillayo!\n\n-varu…\n\n4. Vedavaakyangalhaake naam mahaa geethavaakyamaai paaduvaan\nVedanaadhanaam yeshu thannil naam modamaayathu theduvaan -varu…\n\n5. Snehamaayathu poondittallayo mashihaa iha marichaan\nSnehamaayathu kondittallayo thirurakthathe chorichaan!\n\n-varu…\n   (Abharanam Habel)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0334": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0334-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0334-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Yeshuve-ppolaavaaneni-kkaashathaanethreyo soumyan\nShaanthasheelan thante vaakku saanthi cherkkum santhaapikkum\n\n2. Yeshuve-ppolaavaaneni-kkaasha japa thalparan thaan!\nAekanaai pithaavine malamel sadaa kandavan thaan\n\n3. Yeshuve-ppolaavaneni-kkaasha than virodhikalhkkum\nYeshu daya vittonnume peshiyilla cheythumilla!\n\n4. Yeshuve-ppolaavaneni-kkaasha nanmayaavolhavum!\nCheythavanivanennenye cholluvaanillarum - thanne\n\n5. Yeshuve-ppolaavaaneni-kkaasha maathram poraayallo!\nYeshuve daya chorinjen aasha poorthiyaakkenhame!\n        (Mani John Kochukunju)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0335": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0335-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0335-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Kristhumumbol vannaalaarthi naasthiyaamallo - ente\n\n\nKristhu mal praayabalare cherththu kondallo\n1. Chiththaththinaanandam arulhum aththal akattum - ente\nNithya kaavalaayirunnu kaaththu kollhum thaan\n\n\n-kristhu…\n\n2. Kristhu ennapeksha kelhkkum kristhu snehikkum - enne\nKristhu en paapam chumannu mrithyuvekkonnu\n\n\n-kristhu…\n\n3. Yeshu en kayyeppidichu naashamillaaththa - nalla\nDeshamathinu nadaththum naashamozhikkum\n\n\n-kristhu…\n\n4. Thathrabhaagya paithangalhodothu venhamyaam - chithra\nVasthra dhaariyaayi vaazhaam nithya kaalavum\n\n\n-kristhu…\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n5. Akshayaananda pradamaam moksha raajyaththil - ente\nRakshithaave supramodam veekshanham cheyaam\n\n-kristhu…\n        (Mani John Kochukunju)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0336": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0336-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0336-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Baalarakunna njangalhey Yeshu Thamburaan kaiyilelkanham!\nBaalaraakunna njangalhkkum Kripa thannu mokshaththilaakkanham!\n\n2. Swarga raajyaththil vannu Njangalhum bhaagyashaali kalhaakuvaan\nThakka paathayilaakkanham Yeshu Thamburaan kripayonninaal\n\n3. Pandu Thaan bhoovil vanna Kaalaththu baalareyanhachenna pol\nInnum baalarey cherkkuvaan Karam neettanhey kripa nalkanhey\n\n4. Baalanmaar palar lokam vittu Nin maarvil cherunnu nithyamee\nBaalanmaareyum orkkanhey Nintey aashwaasa sthala vaasaththil\n\n5. Enthu njangalhaal cheivathinningu saadhya maamathinnappaney\nShakthiyum nalki budhiyum nalki rakshakaa! Vazhi kaattanhey!\n\n6. Ponnu Naayakan vaana meghaththil vannu makkalhey cherkkumen-\naashayodey Nin makkalhaai njangalhangu chèrumaarakkanham\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n        (Muthampakkal Kochukunju Upadeshi)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0337": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0337-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0337-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "‘Gentle Jesus meek and mild’ - C. Wesley\n1. Shaanthanaakum Yeshuvey paithalaamenney nôkki\nEnnil kanivu thônni Ennil koodikollhuka!\n\n2. Ninney thèdi vanneththum enney chèrthu rakshikka\nNintey raajyam thanniley enikkidam tharika!\n\n3. Imbamaai nôkki vègaal enney kayyil anhaikka!\nNin priya paithalaavaan shudhdhi cheika innenney\n\n4. Sneham thingum Yeshuvey paithalaamenney nokki\nKripa thônni rakshichu moksha bhaagyam nalkanhey!", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0338": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0338-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0338-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Ecclesiastes 12\n1. Srishtaaviney baalyakaalathil Orkkukaa baalakaa!\nIshta kaalam pôkum Kashta kaalam vannu chèrum\n\n2. Annu nintey shobha mangumey Lôka sukham pômey\nOnninu melonnaai sankadangalh vannu koodum\n\n3. Kaavalkaaraa kaikalh ksheenhikkum kaalkalh viracheedum\nVaathilaakum kannhin kaazhchayillaathaayippokum\n\n4. Pallumellaam melley pôyidum Illaathaakum ruchiyum\nUllhilullha theeyum poi Dahanam shaanthamaakum\n\n5. Koormathayullha nin karnhangalh Theernneedum manthamaai\nKaarmègha thulya kaarkoonthalum panjipôlaakum\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nSankeerthanangalh", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0339": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0339-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0339-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Thiruchchevi chaayikkenhame daridranaamen\nKarachilum nee kettidenhame\n\nParaththin dootharin paattukalh\n\nPeruththa modamaai kettidum\nPeruththuyarnna kristheshuve\nNiranja sankadamaakayaal  -thiru…\n\n1. Sharanhamennu nin mun veezhunnen\nParane enne\nOrikkalum nee kaivediyalle\nOro dinavum\nIrunnu njan karanjeedunnithaa\nThurhannu njan parhanjeedunnithaa\nUrukkamullha en naayakaa\nPorhukkuken pizhayaakave            -thiru…\n\n2. Nilavilhikkunen adiyan\nNee kelhkkenhame!\nValiyavanaamen thamburaane!\nNilayillayyo!\nAlayuvaan nin adiyane\nAkale odicheedaruthe\nSthalathil vannen japaththinu\nPhalam nee kalpichidenhame           -thiru…\n\n3. Ninakku thulyam daivangalhille\nNin kriyayellaam\nNinachcharhuvaan budhimaanille\nMannavaneesho\nManassalinjeedenham paraa!\nAnugrahicheedenham paraa!\nAnardha naalhaayithe paraa!\nNinakkabhayam veezhunnithaa        -thiru…\n\n4. Peruththu paapavyaadhiyennullhil\nNin nanmakalhkku\nOrikkalum njan yogyanallayyo\nEn rakshithaave\nPeruththa thinmayaalithaa\nVaruththamullhoradiyane\nNirhuththi nin mun varum vare\nKaraththinaal thaangeedenhame      -thiru…\n\n(Mosha vatsalam)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0340": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0340-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0340-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Psalm 96\nPaaduvin sakala bhoomiye\nDevanu puthiya paataayi\nPaaduvin  naadhanu paadi\nNaamam vaazhthuvin! Naalhthorum thante\nRakshaye ningalh - aartharhiyippin\n1. Jaathikalh arhivathinu than mahimaye\nSakala janangalhodum than\nAthishayangalhum vivarippin enthennaal\navan valiyavan\nAettavum sthuthikkettavan vaana-\nBhoothalangalhe naadhanu ningalh  -paadu\n2. Jaathikalh thozhunna devakalhokkeyum\nAsaththakalh thanna - daivamo\nChamachavanaakaashangalhe\nBhayangaran devanmaarekkaalh\nUnnathan thirumunnil vaanavum\nMinnum prabhayumennumundennu  -paadu\n3. Shakthiyum azhakum vishudhdha-\nsthalathundu\nJanangalhin kudumbangalhe!\nKoduppin devanu mahimaye\nKoduppin devanu shakthiye\nNaadhanu thunaama mahima\nNaalhthorhum ningalh nalkinalki\n-paadu\n4. Kaazhchaye eduththavan mathilakangalhil\nChennavan mumbil vachudan\nVIshudhiyin alankaaraththil\nDevane thozhutheeduvin\nSakala bhoomiye! Thirumunnil ningalh\nNadunguvinavan bhayangaranennu  -paadu\n5. Vaanavan - vaazhunnathinaaloozhiyum\nIlhakaathe sthirappedunnaho!\nNeraai naayakan janangalkku\nnyaayam vistharicheedumennu\nJaathikalhodu modamaai parha-\n-njeeduvinaadi naadhanu ningalh\n-paadu\n6. Vaanangalh Santhoshikkayumoozhiyum\nAanandikkayumozhiyum\nAthin nirhavodu koodave\nMuzhangeedukayum cheyatte\nEllaa vayalilulhathokkeyum\nUllasikkatte nallathaayittu\n\n-paadu\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n7. Annaho!  Kaattile maramokkeyum\nAarthidum devathirumumbil\nDevan varunnu bhoomiye\nNyaayam vidhippaan varunnithaa\nNeethiyiloozhiyengum jananga-lheyum\nVidhikkumunhmayil thanne\n\n-paadu\n\n8. Jayam jayam - parama thaathanu jayam jayam\nParama suthanu jayam jayam\nParamaathmaavinu jayam jayam\nThriyeka devanu jayam jayam\nJayam jayam yeshu naamathinu jayam\nJayamaamen jayam-aamenaamenennu\n-paadu\n    (Yusthus Youseph)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0341": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0341-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0341-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Psalm 1\n\n\nManujanivan bhaagyavaan\nManujanivan bhaagyavaan\n\nVinayaam dushtarinnalochanayil\nnadakkathullha\n\n1. Thirinju paapikalhude\nvazhiyil ninnidaatheyum\nParihaasikalhin peeda-\nththirunnidaatheyumullha\n         -manu…\n\n2. Thanathishtam devavaakkil\ndinavum vachathil ninnu\nManassilellaa neravum\nninachu dhyaanam cheyunna         -manu…\n\n3. Aatarikathu  nattu\nvaattam illaykkillaathe\nAetta kaalathu kani\nkaaykkum vrikshaththodoththa        -manu…\n\n4. Cheyyunnathellaam avan\nmeyyaayi saadhikkum dushta-\nKkayyarh paattikalhayum\ntheeya pathirpol thane\n         -manu…\n\n5. Nallorh vazhiye sarvva\nvallabhanarhiyunnu\nVallaaththa dushtar vazhi\nelaam nashichu pokum\n         -manu…\n\n6. Athinaal dushtanmaar nyaaya\nvidhiyinkalum paapikalh\nEzhunettidaa neethiyu-\nllhavarin sabhayinkalum\n         -manu…\n\n7. Kristhu naamame jayam\nkristhu naamame jayam\nKristheshu naamathinu\nennum jayam jayame\n         -manu…\n\n\n\n\n    (Yusthus Youseph)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0342": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0342-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0342-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Psalm 68: 26-29\n\n\nEe paramadevanaho namukku\nParithraanhaththinnadhipan mara\nnhaththil ninnozhivu karthanaamakhilam\nShakthi nin thirukaraththilundanisham\n-Ee…\n\n1. Naadhanathe - thannarikalhin\nVan thalayethakarkkum pizhachu nadakkunnavante mudikalh\nMoodiyanerhukaye thanne mudikkum\nAadinaadhanura cheythaananisham\n\n\n-Ee…\n\n2. Ninkaal chorayil chavittiduvaan\nNinnarikil ninnu nin naaykkalhude naavinaaswadippaanum\nBaashaan deshamathil ninnu njan thirippichoaazhi-\nyaazhaththu ninnarikalhe varuththum\n\n\n-Ee…\n\n3. Kandu nin sanchaaramivarh\nEn paranaamarachan vishudhdha sthalathu nadakkunnathine\nMunnil paadunnavarh pinnil meettunnavarh\nChernnu thappadikkum kannimaarhnaduvil\n\n-Ee…\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n4. Yisraayelurhavilulha ningalhanugrahippin -\nsakalajagathin pathiye sabhayil\nShathrumeladhikaariyaam cherhiya benyameen-\navidam thannilundanisham\n\n\n\n\n-Ee...\n\n5. Angavare karakettunna\nYoodajana prabhukkalh sebuloon prabhukkalh naphthaali prabhukkalh\nAeki ninte balameki naadhan adiyaarkku\ncheythurhappikka nee sathatham\n\n\n\n-Ee…\n\n6. Shree yerushalemilulha nin mandiram nimiththam\nAracharh ninakku bhayannu thirumul-\nKkazhcha konduvarum yeshuvinu jayam\nYeshuvinu jayam yesuhvinu jayam\n\n\n-Ee…", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0343": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0343-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0343-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 2, "tune": 2, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0343-malayalam-1.jpg", "choir/KK-0343-malayalam-2.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Yaahenna daivam en idayanaho\nYaathoru kurhavumillenikkiniyum\nPachchappul purhaththenne kidaththunnavan\nNishchala jalam enne kudippikunnu\n-yaahenna…\n2. Santhathem ennullham thanhuppikkunnu\nThan thiru paathayil nadaththunnenne\nKoorirulh thaazhvara athil nadannaal\nSaaramillenikkoru bhayavumilla\n\n\n\n\n\n-yaahenna…\n3. Unnathan ennodu koodeyundu\nThannidunnaashwaasam than vadikol\nEnikkoru virunnu nee orukkidunnu\nEnnude vairikalhin naduvil\n\n\n\n\n\n\n-yaahenna...\n4. Shirassine akhilavum anudinavum\nPooshunnu sourabhya thailamathaal\nEnnude paanapaathram dinavum\nUnnathan karunhayaal kavinjidunnu\n\n\n\n\n-yaahenna…\n5. Nanmayum karunhayum ennaayussil\nUnhmayaay thidarneedum dinavumaho\nSwarggeeya aalayam thannile njan\nDeerkha kaalam vasikkum shubhamaai\n\n\n\n\n-yaahenna…\n(E. V. Varughese)\n\n\nUnharvinaayullha Vaanjcha", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0344": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0344-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0344-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Jeeva naayakaa! Jeeva naayakaa\n\n\nJeevanattathaam sabhayil jeevanoothuka\n1. Lokamithaa paapam kondu nashichu pokunne - ee\nLokamahimayil muzhuki marhannu daivathe\n\n\n-jeeva…\n\n2. Loka jeeva rakthathinnu chumathalapettor - ayyo!\nLoka maayayil kidannang-urhangunne kashtam\n\n\n-jeeva…\n\n3. Anthya kalpana anusarichu kollhuvaan - oru\nChinthapolumilla sabha thannilinnaho\n\n\n\n-jeeva…\n\n4. Penthikosth-aathmaavine aayakka daivame! ee\nChinthayatta njangalhe nin saakshiyaakkuka!\n\n\n-jeeva…\n\n5. Shakthi vaneedumbolh loka paridhiyolavum - nin\nSaakshi aakumennuracha polarulka nee\n\n\n\n-jeeva…\n\n6. Jeevayaaviyaal kaththikka nin sabhayathil - ketta-\nPaapikyaayittullham neerhum sneha moorthiye\n\n\n-jeeva...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(Rev. T. Koshy)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0345": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0345-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0345-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Parama thaathante valamamarunna parama valsalaa\n\n\nParama valsalaa! Nin -\n\n\nKuruthi kondu veendeduththa janaththin duritham kaanhuka\n\n1. Bahu janangalhin naduvil ninnu nin saakshi chonnavar\nSaakshi chonnavar - ninte\nMahathwa naamathe dushippaniha van moolamaayallo\n\n-parama…\n\n2. Parama snehaagniyerinjanudinam aanandichchavar\nAanandichchavar - ithaa\nPeruththa vyaakulam pidichaho manam thanhuththu pokunne!\n-parama…\n\n3. Baliyay sarvvavum thirupaadathinkal kaazhcha vechchavar\nKaazhcha vechchavar - ippolh\nBalipeedaththil ninnnakale maarhi kondazhinju pokunne!\n-parama…\n\n4. Aettam jwalichu velicham kodutha nin janamithaa\nNin janamithaa - pala\nKaattin shakthiyaalanhanjirundu koorirulhaay theernnithaa\n-parama…\n\n5. Suvisheshakaril palarilum naadhaa! Veshameyullhe\nVeshameyullhe! aathma\nJeevan nin janangalhil dinam thorhum kurhanju pokunne!\n-parama…\n\n6. Ee vidham janam jeevicheedukil nashichu pokume! (2)\nNinte jeeva vachanamayachu janaththil jeevan nalkuka\n\n-parama…\n(P.V.Thommi)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0346": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0346-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0346-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Unharnnezhunnelkka thirusabhaye!\nManhavaalhan varuvaan neramaayithaa\nDurkhada samayam varummennullha\nSathya pravachanam nivarthikkunne\n\n2. Varggeeya malsaram perukeedunnu\nNirjjeevanmaarayi marthyar theerunnu\nParaspara vairam perukeedunnu\nLoka snehitharaaithan janangalhum\n\n3. Lokamengum kshaamam kaalhumagnipol\nVegamaai padarnnu janaththeyellaam\nVyaakula samudramathil mukkunnu\nAarh pidichu kayattum ee samayaththil!\n\n4. Akramam peruki varunnu bhoovil\nMlechcha bimba seva nivarnneedunnu\nPaaridamadakki vaazhum bhoopanmaar\nAakave virhachu vibhramukkunnu\n\n5. Karthruseva cheythu porh nadaththuvin\nVriththikedukalje dooreyaakkuveen\nKarthruvaasa soukhyam aaswadikkuvaan\nPuththanaaya naajye vannu vaazhuvin\n\n6. Kallhane pole thaan varum vegaththil\nVellhayuduppinmel challha pattalle\nVellha simhaasanam thanilirikkum\nVallabhan kunjungalh thanne sthuthikkum\n(Aleyamma Oommen)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0347": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0347-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0347-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Seeyone nee unharnezhunelkkuka\nShaalem raajanithaa varuvaarhaayi\n\nSheela gunhamullha sneha swaroopan\nAaakasha meghaththil ezhunnelhi varume\n\n1. Pakalullha kaalangalh anhanjanhanju poi\nKoorirulh naalhukalh aduththaduththe\nJhaduthiyay jeevitham puthukki ninneedukil\nManhavaalhanodu naam marhuroopamaakum\n\n\n\n\n-seeyon…\n\n2. Anthya samayangalh aduththupoi priyare\nSwanthamenneshuve saakshikkuvin\nAndhakaara prabhu velhippedum mumbe\nSanthosha raajyaththil chernnidume naam\n\n\n\n\n-seeyon…\n\n3. Bhoomandalangalh ulanjilhakidunnu\nVaanangalh aakave nadungidunnu\nPremamattullha nin saadhukkalh karalhil\nKhedam poondingu veenhuzhalunnu\n\n\n\n\n-seeyon…\n\n4. Sainyaththin shakthiyaal raajyangalh aakave\nThakarnnudanjeedunnu dinam dinamaai\nSainyaththin shakthiyaal onnilumalle\nAathma balathaal jayam neduka naam\n\n\n\n\n-seeyon…\n\n5. Thiru sabhaye nin deepangalhennume\nSurya prabha pol vilhangeedatte\nMahithan than thejjassil azhunnellhi varumbolh\nUdalode priyane ethirelppaan pokaam\n\n\n\n\n-seeyon…", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0348": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0348-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0348-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 3, "tune": 2, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0348-malayalam-1.jpg", "choir/KK-0348-malayalam-2.jpg"], "manglish": "Yeshu mahesha! Deenadayaalo\n\nKaniyanham paapikalhil nirantharam\n\n1. Èzhakalhin pizhayaakave-pôkki\nVaazhanham ee yôgam-nirantharam\n\n2. Sannidhibodham nalkuka Paraney!\nNinnadipanhivôril -nirantharam\n\n3. Ninthiru naamam keerthanam cheivaan\nChinthuka varamadhikam -nirantharam\n\n4. Ninthiru vachanam phalapradamaayi\nVithaikkukinnadiyaaril -nirantharam\n\n5. Vachanam shravichcheedum nin priya makkalh\nAnuthaptharaayidanham -nirantharam\n\n6. Aathmaabhisheka praaptharaai ninvara\nDaanangalh varikkanham -nirantharam\n\n7. Nin suvishesham naadukalhakevan\nJayadhwani muzhakkeedanham -nirantharam\n\n8. Snehaswaroopaa! Nin snehaththin daardyam\nGrahichcheedaan varamarulhka -nirantharam\n\n9. Neethiyim sooryaa nin thejassaalennudey\nAadikalhakattidenham -nirantharam\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nRakshithaavinte Vilhi", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0349": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0349-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0349-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "‘Hark my soul it is the Lord’ – W-Cowper\n\n1. Kelhkka en aathmaave!\nYeshu manassalinju\nChodikkunnu he paapee\nSnehikkunno nee enne\n\n2. Aadiyinkal njaan thanne\nThiranjeduththu ninne\nAadyam ninne snehichu\nPinne ninne rakshichu\n\n3. Petta thallha kunjine\nmarhakkunnathengane?\nAvalh ninne marhaneedilum\nninne ennum njan orkkum\n\n4. Ninne ente mahathwam\nvegaththil njan kaanhikkum\nEnnaal aayathin mumbe\nninne shudhdhi aakkanham\n\n5. En simhaasanaththinmel\nvegaththil nee irikkum\nNjan veendeduththa paapee!\nSnehicheedunno - enne?\n\n6. Ente sneham karththave\nethumilla enkilum\nKripayaalathine nee v\nardhdhippikkumaarhaaka", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0350": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0350-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": [], "manglish": "‘Pass me not’\n\n- Fanny J. Crosby\n\n1. Pôkalley kadanenney nee priya Yeshuvey\nMattullhorey darshikkumbolh nôkkukenneyum\n\nYeshu naathaa! Ennapèksha kèlh\n\n\nMattullhorey darshikkumbolh\nnôkkukenneyum\n\n2. Nin kripaasanaththin munbil veenhu kenchunney\nEn vishwaasam ksheenhikkumbolh Nee sahaayikka!\n\n-yeshu...\n\n3. Nintey raktham maathram entey nithya sharanham\nNintey kripayaaley maathram ennudhdhaaranham\n\n-yeshu...\n\n4. Jeevanekkaalh èrey nannu neeyen Karthaavey!\nBhoomi swargam thannilum Nee maathram aashrayam\n\n-yeshu...\n\n\nDaivakripa", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0351": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0351-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0351-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Daiva kripa manoharame - ente\n\n\nPraanha naayakan enikku cheyyunna kripa manoharame!\n\n1. Kodum paapiyaayirunna - ente\nKadina paapangalh mochanam cheytha kripa manoharame!\nShathruvaayirunna enne - ninte\nPuthranaakki nee theerththa nin kripa ethra manoharame!\n-daiva…\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n2. Pala peedakalhethirthu - varum\nKaalamenikku sahishnhatha tharum kripa manoharame!\nBalaheenan-aakumennil - karalhalinja-\nnudinam thaangidum kripa ethra manoharame!\n\n\n-daiva…\n\n3. Naasha lokam thannilenne - salpra-\nKaashamaai nadaththidum nin kripa ethra manoharame! -\nArisanchaya naduvil - enne\nThiruchirakullhil marhachu kakkunna - kripa manoharame!\n-daiva…\n\n4. Chathi niranja lokamathil - ninte\nPuthujeevanil njan sthithi cheyvaan kripyadhikam nalkenhame\nParishramaththinaale-yonnum ennaal\nParamanaadhane kazhikayilla nin kripa choriyanhame!\n\n-daiva…\n(P. V. Thommi)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0352": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0352-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0352-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Kripa kripa kripa thanne kripayude paithal njan\nKripayaalen hridayaththe kavarnnu rakshaakaran\n\n2. Prathikoolangalhe neekki athimodam hridaye\nSathatham thannidunnennil kripayaal-athyunnathan\n\n3. Nithyanaaya rakshakante rakthathaal maam kazhuki\nPuthranaakki nithyajeevan maathra thorhum tharunnu\n\n4. Halleluia halleluia daivamaam thriyekanu\nHalleluia halleluia halleluia vandanam\n(Rev. T. Koshy)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0353": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0353-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0353-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Daiva kripayil njaan aashrayichchu\n\nAvan vazhikalhey njaanarinju\nAnugamichcheedum avanudey chuvadukalhey\n1. Iha lôkamo tharikilloru\nSukhavum mana shaanthiyathum\nEntey Yeshuvintey thiru sannidhiyil\nEnnum aanandam undenikku\n\n-daiva...\n\n2. Manovèdana pala shodhana\nMama jeevitha paathayathil\nMaaraa thèridumbolhaathma naathanavan\nMaaril chaari njaan aashwasikkum\n-daiva...\n\n3. Ethra nallavan mathiyaayavan\nEnney karuthunna Karthanavan\nEntey aavashyangalh ellaam arinjidunna\nEttamaduththa sahaayakan thaan\n\n-daiva...\n\n4. Entey aayussin dinamaakeyum\nThantey naama mahathwaththinaai\nOru kaithiripol kaththi erinjorikkal\nThiru maaril maranjidum njaan\n\n-daiva...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(Charles John)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0354": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0354-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0354-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Ponneshu thamburaan Nalloru rakshakan\nEnne snehichchu Than jeevan vechchu\n\n1. Swargga simhaasanam Thaathantey maarvvathum\nDoothanmaar sèvayum vitten pèrkkaai\nDaasaneyppolavan jeevichu paapiyen\nShaapam shirassathilèttiduvaan\n\n\n\n-ponneshu...\n\n2. Thallhayepol namukkullhoru rakshakan\nKollhakaaran poley Krooshil thoongi\nUllhamurukunnen chanku thakarunnen\nKannhunirayunnen rakshakaney\n\n\n\n-ponneshu...\n\n3. Enthoru snehamee saadhuvey orthu nee\nSanthaapa saagaram thannil veenhu\nEnney vilhichchu nee Enney eduththu ni-\nNnomanappaithalaai theerkkenhamey\n\n\n-ponneshu...\n\n4. Paapam perukiya sthaanaththu kripayum\nEttam perukiyath aascharyamey!\nPaapiyil pradhaaniyaayirunna njaanum\nSnèhatthin Puthrantey raajyaththilaai\n\n\n-ponneshu...\n\n5. Bhooloka maayayil môham pathichchentey\nKaalam njaan paazhil kalhanjidaaivaan\nSwarloka raajyaththil thankakireedaththi-\nLullaasamèkanhey ponneshuvey\n\n\n\n-ponneshu...\n\n6. Paapam cheyyaathenney kaaval cheithiduvaan\nSarvèshaa thrikaiyilelpikkunnen\nRaappakal neeyenney veezhchayil ninnentey\nSwapnaththil koodeyum kaakkenhamey\n\n\n-ponneshu...\n\n7. Karththaavu vègaththil mèghangalhil kôdi\nDoothanmaarppumaaivanneedumbolh\nEnnil kaninjenney maarodanhachchentey\nSankadam theerkkanham rakshakaney\n\n\n-ponneshu...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n        (Muthampakkal Kochukunju Upadeshi)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0355": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0355-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0355-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Mahaathbhuthame kaalvarhiyil kaanhunna sneham\n\n\nMahonnathan vahicheedunnu lokaththin paapam\n\n\nSarvalokaththin shaapam\n\n1. Aadiyugangalh thudassam aayathin mumbe\nAadiparaa! Paapikalhe orththa nin anpe!\nAashrayamathaanhenikkullhaashayin koombe - divya - kaarunyakaambe!\n-mahaa…\n\n2. Vedanappedum manujanaayavathaaram\nMedura manoharam nee cheythathin saaram\nAararhiyunnathishayame ninnupakaaram thava - snehamapaaram\n\n-maha…\n\n3. Thirusabhaye nin ninhaththaal vaangukayenno!\nThiruhithathin nirnhayangalhee vidhamenno!\nThiru hridayam ezhakalhkaai thakarukayenno?\nDaivam kaividukenno?\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n-maha…\n\n4. Swargga sukhamanhuvolhavum-anubhavamaakkaan\nYogyathayilla gathiyenikkalpavumorkkil\nBhagyavashaal paapiyaam njan rakshithanaayi shaapa shikshakalh poyi!\n-maha…\n          (M. E. Cherian)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0356": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0356-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0356-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Snehamaam thaathaa! Swargeeya naadhaa\nAhamahamaayavane yahove\nIhaparipaalakane\nBahulamaam kripayaal thiruhithamathinaal\nMahithale suthaneththanna deveshaa\nThava paadam kumbidunnen\n-thava…\n\n2. Aadima manushyan paapam cheythathinaal\nMediniyil vasikkum manujar\nYaathanapettithu haa\nPaathakam neekkaan paathakar kaiyyaal\nVedana aettoru yeshudevaa!\n-thava…\n\n3. Paapaviheenan neethimaanaayon\nPaapiyeppol mahaashikshayettu\nPaapiye shudhdhanakkaan\nPaapaththin bhaaram dehaththilettu\nPaapiyin rakshakanaaya naadha!\n-thava…\n\n4. Swantha janaththaal thllhappettayyo!\nAnthamillaththathaam snehahridayam\nVenthu neerhidunnithaa!\nSwantha manassaa krooshinmel thoongi\nChinthi than thiruninham paapikalhkaai   -thava…\n\n5. Maranham sahicha daivathinputhram\nMaranhaththin shakthiyaal tholkkappedumo\nMaranhathe than jayichu marichavaril\nninnuyirththezhunettu!\nMarichorkku punarjeevan saadhyamaakki -thava…\n\n6. Lokaanthyam vareyum koode undennu\nVaakku thannon vishudha roohaaye\nVegaththil ayachu thannu\nLokathth ejayikkan puthushakthi tharunnon\nVegaththil varum mahaa raajavaayi         -thava…\n\n7. Praanhanaadha! Nee praanhaneththannu\nKshonhiye veendeduththa maa sneham\nKaanhunnu doshiyaam njan!\nThaanhu vanhangi namicheedunnadiyaan\nPaanhiyil thaanganhame kripaalo!\n       -thava…\n\n\n\n\n\n(Rev. K.P. Philip)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0357": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0357-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0357-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Maa paapi enne thedivannoruy\nMaa manusuthan yeshuve\nMama aashathan veenhayil koode\nModa gaanangalh paadum njan\n\n2. Swar mahimakalhaakave vedi-\n-njidhdharayil vannu thaan\nSarvva lokaththin sarvva paapavum\nThanburaan vahichchillayo?\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n3. Aekanaal vanna paathakam theerppaan\nAekanaayavan vannatho\nSnehamaanhathin kaaranhamenna-\n-thorththu paadi sthuthikkum njan\n\n4. Snehadeepam kolhuththiyeeloka\nGhoramaam kooriruttil nee\nNeethimaargaththe othi en priya\nPraanha naayakanavan\n\n5. Kaaththu kaahalham njan naadha!\nNinnude\nKaahalha swaram kelhkkuvaan\nYeshuve vegam vanneedanhame!\nAasha poorthiyakkenhame!\n\n(P.D. John)\n\nSneham", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0358": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0358-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0358-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Thèdivannu doshiyaam enneyum enneyum Naathaa\nIthramaam sneham uyir koduththenikkaai\nMannavaa! Varnnhippaan elhuthalley enikku\n\n\nThèdivannu doshiyaam enneyum enneyum Naathaa\n\n2. Kunjaadintey koodey gamichchavar paadumey môdaal\nSeeyon malayil seemayattaanandam\nEnnini shobhikkumo mal praanha Naatha!\n\n-thedi...\n\n3. Kshonhithaley ksheenham bhavichcheedaathenneyum Naathaa\nAanhippazhuthullha paanhikalhaaley\nPreenhichchanugrahicheeduka nithyam\n\n\n-thedi...\n\n4. Nirththeeduka kalhankamatteyshuvey karayillaathenney\nPalhunku kadal theeraththirunnu njaanentey\nMadhura gaana ratha mathilèri gamippaan\n\n-thedi...\n\n5. Pôshippikka pathya vachanamaam ksheeraththalenney\nNirmala thôyam nithyam kudippichu\nPachchapul shayyayil kidaththeedunnenney\n\n-thedi...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(M. E. Cherian)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0359": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0359-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0359-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Mahalsneham mahalsneham Paraloka Pithaavu Than\nMakaney marippathinaai Kurishil kai vedinjo\nMakaney marippathinaai (3)   Kurishil kai vedinjo\n\n\n-mahal...\n\n2. Swargga sthalangalhilullhanugraham namukkaai\nSakalavum nalkiduvaan Pithaavinnu hithamaai\nSakalavum nalkiduvaan (3) Pithavinnu hithamaai\n\n\n-mahal...\n\n3. Ulaka sthaapanaththin munbulhavaa-yoranpaal\nThiranjeduththavan nammey Thiru munbil vasippaan\nThiranjeduththavan nammey (3)  Thiru munbil vasippaan\n\n-mahal...\n\n4. Malinatha maari nammalh Mahimayil vilhangaan\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nManuvèlin ninham chinthi Nararey veendeduppaan\nManuvèlin ninham chinthi (3) Nararey veendeduppaan\n\n-mahal...\n\n5. Athikrama môchanamaam anugraha mavanil\nAnubhavikkunnu nammalh Avan thanna kripayaal\nAnubhavikkunnu nammalh (3) Avan thanna kripayaal\n\n-mahal...\n\n6. Maranhaththaal marayaatha Mahal sneha prabhayaal\nPiriyaa bandhamaanhithu Yugakaalam vareyum\nPiriyaa bandhamaanhithu (3) Yugakaalam vareyum\n\n-mahal...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(M. E. Cherian)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0360": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0360-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0360-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Yeshuvin snehamo shaashwathamaam-shaashwathamaam-shaashwathamaam\nKaarunhya naathan than kripayaal\nJeevan nalki raksha èki\nNaashaththin saagarey veezhaathey kaaththidum\nNinpaadam thedunni paapikalh -Naam\n\n\n\n-Yeshu...\n\n2. Yeshuvin snehamo maadhuryamaam (3)\nThèjassil vaazhum vallabhaney\nThèduka naam ennumennum\nNirmala maanasaraayi naam mèvidaan\nNithya mahathwaththil than varavil, than varavil…\n\n-Yeshu...\n\n3. Yeshuvin snehamo paavanamaam (3)\nNal sthuthigeetham paadiddum naam\nAanadaththodey keerthikkum naam\nAathmeeya deepamaai aasha sankethamaai\nAashraya mèkunnu nallidayan nallidayan\nYeshuvin snehamo shaashwathamaam Maadhuryamaam Paavanamaam-", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0361": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0361-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0361-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Njaan paapi yaayirunne-neshu enney thèdi vannallo\nEnnudey paapam vahichavan kurishil thannuyir-thannallo\n\nEnthathbhutham Daiva snehaththin aazham-arivaanelhuthalla\n\nSankadaththil thaangi nadaththum Thankripa-cheruthalla\n\n2. Rakthaambaram pôl kadum chuvappaayiru nnennudey paapangalh\nKarthaavathu hima samamaai maatti Than priya makanaakki\n-enthathbhutham...\n\n3. Kaarmègha muyaraa mennaal Karthan thallhuka yillenney\nKaanhum njaanathin naduvil kripayezhum than mazhavillonnu\n-enthathbhutham...\n\n4. Athyunnathan Than maravil vaasam cheithidum njaaninnu\nAthyaadaram njaan paadu mennabhayavum kôttayumavanennu -enthathbhutham...\n\n5. Seeyon giriyilorikkal ini njaan nilkum saanandam\nKaanhum Priyaney sthuthiyin pallavi paadum njaanennum\n-enthathbhutham…\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(Charles John)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0362": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0362-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0362-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Kaanhuka neeyee kaarunhya vaaney kurishathil kaalvariyil\nKènhu kannheer thookunnu nôkku kaalvari mèdukalhil\nEnthoru sneham Enthoru sneham paapikalhaam nararil\n\n\nNonthu, nonthu, chankudanju praanhan vediyukayaai\n\n2. Paapaththaal ghôra mrithyu kavarnna lôkaththey veendiduvaan\nAanhi munnil praanhanaathan kaanhuka Daiva sneham\n\n-enthoru...\n\n3. Enthinu neeyee paapaththin bhaara van chumadènthidunnu\nChinthi raktham sarvva paapa-bandham pôkiduvaan\n\n-enthoru...\n\n4. Jayichchavanaayi vinhpuri thannil jeevikkunneshuparan\nJayichcheedaam naam porithinkal anthyaththolham dharayil\n-enthoru...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(P.D. John)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0363": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0363-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0363-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Sthothrangal paadi njaan vaazhtheedumey\nDevaadi Devaney raajaadi raajaavey vaazhthi vanhangeedumey\n\n1. Athbudha nithya sneham ennil santhatham thannidum Daivasneham\nEnnum maaraththa divya sneham ennil vasikkum sneham\n\n-sthothrangal...\n\n2. Jyothiyaay kaanhum sneham ullhil Jeevan thannu enney veenda sneham\nThyaagam sahichchu krushil sneham divyamadhura sneham\n\n-sthothrangal...\n\n3. Maaya lokaththin moham thèdi shaapamètta enney veenda sneham\nEnney thèdiya divya sneham ennil perukum sneham\n\n\n-sthothrangal...\n\n4. Jeevanèkiya sneham sarva lokaththin shaapaththey neekkum sneham\nJeeva shakthiyaam krushin sneham ullham kavarum sneham\n\n-sthothrangal...\n\n5. Vaakku maaraaththa sneham thiru vaagdaththam thannenney nirthum sneham\nSarva vallabhanaamen aathaa sthothram sthuthi ninakkey\n\n-sthothrangal…", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0364": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0364-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0364-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Athishayame yeshuvin sneham\nAanandame aayathin dhyaanam\nAazhamuyaram neelham veethi\nAarkkugrahikkam ee bhoovil\n(2)\n\n\nMama manhaalhaa! Nin premathaale\nNirhayunne Ennullhaminneram\n\n2. Marhannu Swargga sukhamakhilavum nee\nAlanja enne maarvilanhappaan\nMahathwame nin naamaththinu\nMahathwame ennum ennekkum\n(2)\n\n\n\n\n-mama…\n\n3. Kaaththu kripayil kaalam muzhuvan nee\nKaividaathenne kanhmanhi pole\nKalangiyullham neerhunneram\nArikil vanneki aashwaasam\n(2)\n\n\n\n\n-mama…\n\n4. Thalharnna neram thirubhujamathinaal\nThaangiyeduththu thaathanodiruththaan\nTharunnenaadhaa! Samasthavum njan\nMahathwa sevakkai mal priya\n(2)\n\n\n\n\n-mama…\n\n5. Marhannalum oramma than kunjinne\nMarhakkayillorunaalhum neeyenne\nVahichallo nin ullham kaiyyil\nVaakku maaraatha maheshaa\n(2)\n\n\n\n\n-mama…\n(K. M. John, Channapetta)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0365": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0365-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0365-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Daivasneham pole verhe snehamillaho!\n\n1. Abba thaatha! Ennu njangalh vilhicheeduvaan\nAmbaravaasiyaam daivam puthrathvam thannu\n\n-daiva…\n\n2. Jeevaahaara paaneeyamaam praanha naayakan\nJeevanatta paapikalkku jeevane thannu\n\n\n-daiva…\n\n3. Nallidayanaakunnennu vallabhan cholli\nChellum aadukalh than pinpe allal neengidaan\n\n-daiva…\n\n4. Sathya munthiri vallhiyaam puthranaam daivam\nCheththi shudhdhamaakkum phalam adhikam kaaypaan\n-daiva…\n\n5. Aathmavaal daivaththin sneham pakarnu nammil\nNammethaan snehichapole nammalh snehippaan\n-daiva…\n\n(Rev. K. P. Philip)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0366": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0366-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0366-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 2, "tune": 2, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0366-malayalam-1.jpg", "choir/KK-0366-malayalam-2.jpg"], "manglish": "Enthathishayamey Daivaththin Sneham\nEthra manoharamey\nAthu chinthayil adangaa sindhu samaanamaai\nSanthatham kaanhunnu njaan\n\n\n\n-enthathishayamey...\n\n1. Daivamey Nin mahaa sneham athin vidham\nAarkku chinthichchariyaam\nEnikkaavathilley athin aazham alhanneedaan\nEthra bahulamathu\n\n\n\n\n\n-enthathishayamey...\n\n\n2. Aayiram aayiram naavukalhaalathu\nVarnhippathin elhutho\nPathinaayirathinkalhor amsham cholleeduvaan\nPaaril asaadhyamaho\n\n\n\n\n-enthathishayamey...\n\n3. Mothamezhum Thiru maarvvil ullaasamaai\nSanthatham chèrnnirunna\nEka jaathanaam Yeshuvey paathakarkkaai thanna\nSnehamathishayamey\n\n\n\n\n-enthathishayamey...\n\n4. Paapaththaal Ninney njaan kopipichchullhoru\nKaalaththilum dayavaai\nSneha vaapiye Nee enney snehichchathorthennil\nAashcharyam èreedunnu\n\n\n\n\n-enthathishayamey...\n\n5. Jeevithaththil pala veezhchakalh vannittum\nOttum nishèdhikkaathey\nEnney kèvalam snehichchu paalichchidum thava\nsnehamathulyamaho\n\n\n\n\n-enthathishayamey...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(P.V. Thommi)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0367": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0367-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0367-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 2, "tune": 1, "kind": "CONTINUATION"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0367-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "‘Tell me the old old story’\n- Miss Hankey\n1. Yeshuvin divyasneham ennodu varnnhikka\nThan jeevane en perkkai vecha -\nvriththaanthavum\nAayathenikkeppozhum aanandam nalkunnu\nThan snehakkodikkeezhil vasikkum njan ennum\n\nYeshuvin divya sneham! Yeshuvin divya\nsneham!\nYeshuvin divya sneham Ennodu Varnhikka\n\n2. Yeshuvin divya sneham ennodu varnhikka\nEn hridayaththe athu kavarnnirikkunnu\nChinthinkumthorhum aettam\nmaadhuryamaamathu!\nIvvidhamaam santhosham urvviyil illengum\n\n\n\n\n\n-yeshu…\n\n3. Yeshuvin divya sneham ennodu varnhikka\nArhivine kaviyum aa snehathin neelham\nVeethi uyaram aazham enthennu grahippaan\nNithyathayinkalum njan shakthanaaiththeerumo?\n\n\n\n\n\n-yeshu…\n\n4. Yeshuvin divya sneham ennodu varnhikka\nNirbandhikkunnathenne shudhdhiyil jeevippaan\nEe sneham dinam thorhum en sodararodu\nKaanhippaan ninte kripa nalkenham daivame\n\n\n\n\n\n-yeshu…\n\n5. Yeshuvin divya sneham ennodu varnhikka\nBhoovil athennaashwaasam jeevikkum naalhelaam\nAakarshikkunnathenne thankalekk-eppozhum\nVegam njan cherum thante bhagya sannidhiyil\n\n\n\n\n\n-yeshu…\n\nPrarthana", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0368": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0368-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0368-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Inneram priya daivame! Ninaathma daanam\n\nThannalum prarthicheeduvan\n\n\n\nNinnodu prarthicheedaan ninnadiyangalh ninte\n\n\nSannidhaanaththil vannu chernnirikkunnu naadhaa\n-inne…\n\n1. Ninthiru paadapeedaththil - anhayuvathinenthullhu njangalhappane!\nNin thirusuthaneshuvin thiru jadam bhoovi\nChinthiyor puthuvazhi thurhannu prathishtichathaal\n\n-inne…\n\n2. Mandathayelaam neekkuka ninnadiyaaril thannarulh nallunharchchaye\nVannidunnoru ksheenham nidra, mayakkamiva\nOnnake neeyakatti thannidukaathma shakthi\n\n\n-inne…\n\n3. Oro chinthakalh njangalhil varunne manassoronnum patharhidunne\nGhora vairiyodu nee poraadiyadiyaarkku\nChorayaal jayam nalkeedenham paramanaadha!\n\n-inne…\n\n4. Ninthiru vaagdathangalhe - manathalhiril chinthichu nalla dhairyamaay\nShaanthathayodum bhaval sannidhi bodhaththodum\nSanthatham praarthicheedaan nin thunha nalkeedenham\n-inne…\n\n5. Neeyallathaarumillayyo! Njangalkkabhayam neeyallo praanhanaadhane!\nNee yaachana ketteedaathaayaal pishaachinude\nMaayavalayil naashamaayidumaayathinaal\n\n\n-inne…\n\n      (P. V. Thommi)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0369": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0369-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0369-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Prarthana Kelhkkenhame\nKarththave! En yaachana nalkanhame!\n\n1. Puthrante naamaththil chodikkum kaaryangalh-\nKkuththaram thannarulhaamennullhoru\nVaagdaththam pol dayavaay\n\n2. Thaathanum maathaavum neeyenikkallathe\nBhoothalam thannilille verhaarumen\nAathangam neekkiduvaan\n\n3. Nithyathayil ninnullhathyantha snehaththaal\nShathruthaye akatti enikku nee\nPuthrathvam thannathinaal\n\n4. Swantha kumaarane aadariyaathenmel\nSindusamam kaninja sampreethiyo-\nrththanthike chernnidunnen\n\n5. Brithyaranekarin praarthana kettu nee\nUththaram nalkiyathorththathyaadaram\nThippaadam thedidunnen\n\n6. Kallhante yaachana kettullhalinja nin\nThulyamillaadayayorththithaavannen\nNallavane! Sadayam\n\n7. Yeshuvin moolamen yaachana nalkumen-\nAashayil kenjidunnenallathennil\nLeshavum nanmayille!\n(T. J. Varkey)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0370": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0370-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0370-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Tune: This is the God we adore\n\n1. Ente praanhasakhi yeshuve!\nEnte ullhaththin aanandame!\nEnne nin maarvinkal cherppanaai\nVannithaa ippolh nin paadathil\n\nParhaka - Parhaka - njan praarthikkumbolh\nKarththave! Ee neecha paapikku\nPrema hithathe nee kaattuka!\n\n2. Ninne snehikkunna makkalkku\nUllhathaam elaa padavikalhum\nAdiyaanum thiricharhivaan\nAppane! Budhiye thelhikka!       -parhaka…\n\n3. Aeliyaa Elishaa pravararh\nBalamaai cheytha kriyakalh kaanhmaan\nAeloheem Enneyum orkkuka\nVela ninnude njan cheyyuvaan   -parhaka…\n\n4. Paapikalkku ninte snehathe\nEnte sheelaththaal njan kaattuvaan\nKaalvary malamel kaanhicha\nNinte anpinsheelam pakarkka     -parhaka…\n\n5. Ente aayussinte naalhelaam\nNee poya vazhiye pokuvaan\nAashayodeshuve! Enne njan\nJeevabaliyayi nalkunne\n     -parhaka…\n         ( John Easow, Malabar)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0371": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0371-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0371-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Uyarththidum njanente kanhkalh\nThunhayarulhum van giriyil\n\nEn sahaayam vaanam bhoomi\nAkhilam vaazhum yahovayil  -uyartheedum\n\n1. Israayelin kaavalkaaran\nNidrabhaaram thoongunilla\nYahova en paalakan thaan!\nIllenikku khedamottum\n           -uyar…\n\n2. Sathru bheethi neekki enne\nMaathra thorum kaaththeedunnu\nNeethiyin sal paadhakalhil\nNithyavum nadaththeedunnu            -uyar…\n\n3. Shobhayerhum swarpuriyin\ntheeramathil chernnidunnu\nShobhitha puraththin vaathil-\nen munpil njan kandidunnu               -uyar…\n\n4. Vaanasena gaanam paadi\nvaanhidunna swargga seeyon\nDhyaanicheedum neramente\nmaanasam modicheedunnu              -uyar…\n\n5. Halleluia halleluia\nchernnidum njan bhaagyadeshe\nHalleluia paadi sarvva\nkaalavum njan vaanheeduvaan         -uyar…\n(K. V. David)\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nRogikalhkku vendiyullha Prarthana", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0372": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0372-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0372-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Sarvva shakthan yahovaa than parishuddhan! Parishuddhan\nSaadhukkalkku sahaayanum aadyanthanum neeyallayo!\n\n2. Rogikalkku vaidyanum nee rogam neekkum marunnum nee\nAashwasathe nalkeedenham rogiyaamee nin makanum\n\n3. Nin mukham nee marhacheedil nanma pinne aaru nalkum?\nThinmayellaam theerthidenham kaarunyangalh shobhippaanai\n\n4. Sarvvashakthan yahovaaye kopikkalle saadhukkalhil\nDaivame! Nee thunhakkenham aathmasoukhyam kandeththuvaan\n\n5.Shathruthwangalh perukunne sathyaathmaave! Thunhakkenham\nDaivaputhraa! Kripathaa! Nin Sathyaathaavil modicheedaan\n\n(Muthampakkal Kochukunju Upadeshi)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0373": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0373-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0373-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Parane nin thiru mumbil varunnoree samaye\nShariyay praarthana cheyvaan kripayeththannrulkaa\n\n2. Urukiyinnadiyaar ninnodu yojicheeduvaan\nTharika ninnaathmaave puthumaari pole\n\n\n-parane…\n\n3. Njarangi njangalhin perkkayiranneedunnavane!\nVarikkinneeyadiyaaril chorika nin varangalh\n\n-parane…\n\n4. Anugraha murhiyin poottukalh thaane thurhappaan\nManassinneshuvinnodu layippaanaayarulhka!\n\n-parane…\n\n5. Unharthikkum varamellaam kshanham thaneedanhame!\nThunha neeyenniye verhillarhinju nalkenhame!\n\n-parane…\n\n6. Paramaanandamodam vannakame thinganhame\nParanaam ninnodaanandicheeduvaan nalkenhame!\n-parane…\n\n(T. J. Varkey)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0374": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0374-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0374-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Ninnodu praarthippaan priya pithaave\nVanna nin makkalhe chevikkondidenham\n\n2. Yeshuvin naamaththil vannithaa njangalh\nAashisham tharika nin vaagdaththam pole\n\n3. Parishshudhaathmavin sahaaythe nalki\nShariyaayi praarthippaanabhyasippikka\n\n4. Lokaththin chinthakalh leshamillaththa\nAekamaam maanasam thannarulhenham\n\n5. Chodippin nalkum njanenna nin vaakkil\nModamodaashrayam vachu nin makkalh\n\n6. Ennhamillaatha nin kripakalkkayi\nNanniyum sthothravumennekkum amen\n\n(V. Nagel)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0375": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0375-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0375-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Prarthanaykkuththaram nalkkunnone\nNinte sannidhiyil njan varunnu\nSwarggeeya-nugraha bhandaaraththin\nVaathil Thurhakkenhame\n\n\nKelkkanhe en praarthana\n\nNalkanhe en yaachana\n\n2. Puthrante naamaththil chodikkumbolh\nUththaram tharummennarulhiyone\nNeekkam varaaththa nin vaagdaththamen\nPerkku nee thannuvallo\n       -Kelkka…\n\n3. Vachanam en aathmaavin daaham theerppaan\nArulhuka daasaril varamadhikam\nPakaruka aathmaavin thirushakthiyaal\nNirhayuvaan nin janangalh          -kelkka…\n\n4. Paapavum rogavum akateedumaa-\nRudhiraththin athbhutha shakthiyinnu\nArhiyuvaanivide vishwaasaththinte\nHridayangalh thurhakkenhame      -kelkka…\n\n\n    (P. D. John)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0376": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0376-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0376-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Daivamey Thriyèkaney-\n\nNin savidhey njaan varunnu-\n\n1. Appan than makkalhil kaarunhyam pôl\nIppaapi yaamenney darshikkanhey\nPuthran moolam nin savidhey\nEththanhamey entey yaachanakalh\n          -daiva...\n2. Swarggaththiley divyaanugrahaththaal\nNithyam niraikkaa mennoththiyoney\nSathya vazhi Yeshuvey nee\nNithyathayilèkku vaathilum nee\n\n          -daiva...\n\n3. Jalpanam cheyyuvaanalla njangalh\nHridya maai ninnil layichcheeduvaan\nÈkaathmaavil èkamaai nin\nSaannidhyam thèdi varunnu njangalh\n          -daiva...\n4 .Rôgikku soukhya pradaayakan nee\nPaapikku rakshayum neethiyum nee\nAathmaavinaal athyanthamaai\nShaktheekarichchu nayippathum nee\n          -daiva...\n\n     (P.D. John)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0377": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0377-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0377-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Paramaguruvaranaam Yeshuvey Nee\nVaram thaa prarthana cheithidaan\nIruvaro moovaro Thirunaamathil\nVarikil varumennarulhiyoney\nThiru saanidhyam sadaa nalkanham\n\nSharanham Nee maathramen Naathaney\n\n1. Thiru munbil kazhikkunna prarthanaikkuththaram\nArulhanhamey priya Naathaney\nManam nonthu yaachana cheyyumbozhellaam\nKanivintey uravukalh thurannavaney (2)\n\n-parama...\n\n2. Janam Ninnil aanandicheeduvaan avaril\nVeendum Nin jeevaney nalkanhey\nMaalhikayil thava daasaril nalkiya\nVaramengalhkkarulhuka ee tharunham (2)\n-parama...\n\n3. Anavathiyaavashyangalh Thiru savidhey\nUyarththunnu vishwaasa kaikalhaal\nAsharanharaakular rogikalhaayor\nKarunhayin karathalam kandidattey (2)\n\n-parama...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(P. D. John)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0378": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0378-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0378-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 2, "tune": 1, "kind": "CONTINUATION"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0378-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Sweet hour of prayer\n- W.W. Walford\n\n1. Prarthanayin nal neramey Lôka chintha kalhakatti\nEnnaa grahaa vashyangalhey Pithaa munpil kèlhppikkum Nee\nAapal dukkha kaalangalhil aashwaasam kandathum aathmam\nPèkkanhiyil veezhaanjathum inpa sakhee! Ninnaal thanney (2)\n\n2. Prarthanayin nal neramey Kaaththidunnaathmaavey vaazhththaan\nNithyam kaaththirippôn munbil eththikku mennaagraham Nee\nThanmukham thèdi vachanam vishwasippan Thaan chonnathaal\nThannil muttumaashrayichcu Ninney kaappaan nalneramey (2)\n\n3. Prarthanayin nal neramey Pisgaa mèl ninnen veediney\nNôkki njaan parakkum varey thaa ninnaashwaasapankiney\nIjjada vasthram vittu njaan laakkinaai parannuyarnnu\nVaanam kadakkumbolh ninney vittupôkum nal neramey (2)\n\n\nSeva", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0379": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0379-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0379-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Jayam jayam kollhum naam jayam kollhum naam!\n\nYeshuvinte kodikkeezhil jayam kollhum naam!\n\n1. Naayakanaai yeshu thanne nadaththunna sainyam\nMaayalokam pedikkenda jayam kollhum naam!\n\n-jayam…\n\n2. Sarvvaloka sainyangalhe saathaan koottiyaalum\nSwargganaadhan chirikkunnu jayam kollhum naam!\n-jayam…\n\n3. Koushalangalh thathvajnjaanam yeshuvinu venda\nVachanaththin shakthi mathi jayam kollhum naam!\n-jayam…\n\n4. Kristhan krooshin rakthathaalum nithya jeevanaalum\nVishudhaathma shakthiyaalum jayam kollhum naam!\n-jayam…\n\n5. Kleshikkenda halleluiah daivaththinu sthothram\nYeshu konda jayaththale jayam kollhum naam!\n\n-jayam…\n(V. Nagal)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0380": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0380-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0380-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Tune: Am I a soldier of the cross\n\n1. En Kristhan yodhdhaavaakuvaan chèrnnen than sainyaththil\nThan divya vilhi kèttu njaan Daivaathma shakthiyaal\n\n\nNalla pôr poruthum njaan en Kristhan naamaththil\n\nVaadaa kireedam praapippaan Than nithya raajyaththil\n\n2. Than krooshu chumanniduvaan illoru lajjayum\nEn pèrkku kashtapettu thaan ennennum ôrththidum\n\n\n-nalla...\n\n3. Pishaachinôdu lôkavum chernneedum vanchippaan\nVènda nin chappum kuppayum ennurachcheedum njaan\n\n\n-nalla...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n4. Ôr mulh kireedam allayo en naathan lakshanham?\nThan yodhdhaa vaagrahikkumo ee lôkaadambaram\n\n\n-nalla...\n\n5. Njaan kandu valiya sainyamaai vishwaasa veerarey\nPin chellum njaanum nishchayam ee Daiva dheerarey\n\n\n-nalla...\n\n6. Kunjaattin thiru rakthaththaal enikkum jayikkaam\nThan sarvaayudha vargaththaal ellaam samaapikkaam\n\n\n-nalla...\n\n7. Valloru murivèlkukil nashikkayilla njaan\nThan shathruvintey kaikalhil èlpikkayilla thaan\n\n\n\n-nalla...\n\n8. En jeevaneyum vekkuvaan en naathan kalpikkil\nSanthoshaththodo-rungum njaan than Krooshin shakthiyaal\n\n-nalla...\n\n9. Vishwaasaththintey naayakaa, ee nintey yodhdhaavey\nVishwasthanaakki kaakkuka nal anthyaththolhamey\n\n\n-nalla...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(V. Nagal)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0381": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0381-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0381-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Yudhathinu yudhathinu kelhkka kaahalham\nShakthiyodu dhwanikkunnu sainyam koodenham\n\n\nYeshukristhu raajavaakum sarvva bhoomiyil\n\nSevakaraam naamum koode vaazhum thejjassil\n\n2. Krooshin kodikkeezhil engum jayam kollhum naam\nVaashiyil ethirkkunnavan veezhum nishchayam\n\n-yeshu…\n\n3. Saathaan thante sainyam kootti ethir nilkkumo?\nYeshu naamam kettittavar odukillayo\n\n\n-yeshu…\n\n4. Maayabhakthi lokayukthi alla aashrayam\nDaivaathmavum daivavaakkum athre aayudham\n\n-yeshu…\n\n5. Kaahalhangalh oothi naam attahasicheedum\nAppolh iruttinte kotta thaane veenhidum\n\n\n-yeshu…\n\n6. Neethisuryan shobhayodudikkum ullhaththil\nPaadikondanekar varum jeeva vazhiyil\n\n\n-yeshu…\n\n7. Bhoomiyude attatholham sarva srishtiyum\nDaivaththin mahathwam kanduveenhu kumbidum\n-yeshu…\n\n8. Halleluia halleluia sthuthi sthothravum\nEnnannekkum daivaththinum puthraathmanum\n\n-yeshu…\n\n(V. Nagal)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0382": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0382-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0382-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Hold the fort\n- P.P. Bliss\n\n1. Entey thozharey! Kodi kaanh veeshunnaakaashey\nEn sahaaya sena varunney jayam thanney!\n\n\n‘Kotta kaappin’ Yeshu chollunnu ‘Varunnu njaan’\n\n‘Nin kripayaal kaakkaam’ ennuththaramaay cholleen\n\n2. Shreshtam sainyam èrunnu mun saaththaantey chol keezh\nShakthi maanmaar veezhunney chuttum bhayaththin keezh\n\n-Kotta...\n\n3. Thejassin lakshyaththey kaanhmeen kaahalham kelhppin\nSainya naathan naamaththil jayam ripukkalh mèl\n\n\n\n-Kotta...\n\n4. Ghora yudhdham neendennaalum koottarund hey!\nSainya naathan mun varunnu modam koottary\n\n\n\n-Kotta...", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0383": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0383-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0383-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Stand up Stand up for Jesus\n- G. Duffield\n1. Ninneedin yeshuvinnai kristhya senakalhe\nUyartheedin kodiye nashtam nerdalle\nJayam jayam thanikkum thante senakalhkkum\nVairikkalh elaam tholkkum thaan karthaavai vaazhum\n\n2. Ninneedin yeshuvinnai ennee porvilhikelh\nNingalh nidra kondaalo avanu lajja thaan\nNin ullhilum purhaththum kaanhunna thinmaye\nNee nerittu poraadi illaima aakkuka\n\n3. Ninneedin yeshuvinnai kaahalha naadam kelh\nMunnottu cherin poril ee neram veerare\nEnhnham illaa vairikalh aettam shouryam ullhor\nPedichidendavare dairyamaayi cheyka porh\n\n4. Ninneedin yeshuvinnai than shakthi sharanham\nSwashakthi phalicheedaa swa aashrayam vridhaa\nSarvaayudhavarggam nee aathmaavil dharikka\nAapaththin naduvilum aavathu cheyka nee\n\n5. Ninneedin yeshuvinnai yudham vegam theerum\nInnu porin sannaaham naalhe jayageetham\nJayaalhikku labhikkum jeevante kireedam\nThejjassil yeshuvodu vaanhidum ennume!", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0384": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0384-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0384-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 2, "tune": 1, "kind": "CONTINUATION"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0384-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "‘Onward Christian Soldiers’\n- S. Baring Gould\n1. Kristhya Sainyame! Vaa! Porin nirayaai\nMumbe poya yeshu thanne nokkeedin\nKristhu raajan ippolh vairikalhkkethir\nMumbotteththi poril kaanhmeen than kodi\n\n\nKristhya sainyame! Vaa porin nirayaay\n\n\nMumbe poya yeshu thanne nokkidin\n2. Saathaan sena elaam paanjodunnu kaanh\nMunnottodi ethin kristhya sainyame!\nPaathalham ilhaki jaya bheriyaal\nGhoshichaanandippin paadin uchaththil\n\n-kristhya…\n\n3. Van senaye pole pokunnee sabha\nShudhdhar poya maargge naamum pokunnu\nNaam aevarum aekam aeka shareeram\nSneham aashaa bandham ennathil aekam\n-kristhya…\n\n4. Loka raajyam elaam pokum illathaai\nKristhu sabha ennum ennum irikkum\nNarakaththin vaathil ethiraaivaraa\nEnnu chonna vaakku maatamillaathaam\n\n-kristhya…\n\n5. Hey janame! Mumbottodi vanneedin\nEe koottaththodonnichchaanandicheedin\nMahathwam sthuthiyum maanam enniva\nYeshu raajanennum aayirikkatte\n\n\n-kristhya…", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0385": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0385-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0385-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Vishwaasikalhe! Vishwaasikalhe!\nUyartheeduveen jayaththin kodikalh\nEkkaalham ekkaalham dhwanippan kaalamai\nMalpriyan varunnu\n\n(2)\n\n\n-vishwa…\n\n2. Niranneeduveen niranneeduveen\nPorveeraraai naam sudheeraraayi naam\nDharippin sarvvayudhavarggam\nAathmaavil dharippin\n(2)\n\n\n-vishwa…\n\n3. Samaadhaanamaam samaadhaanamaam\nSuvishesham dharippin kaalinu dharippin\nEllattinum meethe thee ambe keduppeen\nThee ambe keduppeen\n(2)\n\n\n-vishwa…\n\n4. Poraattamullhathu porattamullhathu\nEe lokarodalla jadeekarodalla\nSwarlokangalhil ullha vaazhchakalhodum\nDushta sainyaththodum\n(2)\n\n\n-vishwa…\n\n5. Ksheenham theernnupom ksheenham theernnupom\nKsheenhangalh theernnupom malpriyan varumbolh\nAanandam aanandam nithyaanandamundu\nJayam nammukkundu\n(2)\n\n\n-vishwa…", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0386": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0386-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0386-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "‘Work for the night is coming’  - A. L. Walker\n1. Raathriyithaa varunnu adhwaanam cheythu kolh\nPrabhaatha manjin kaale pularunthorhum\nKaadinyamerhum choodil cheythukolh prayathnam\nAdhwaanam theerum raathri vanneedunnithaa\n\n2. Raathriyithaa varunnu adhwaanam cheythu kolh\nAthyucha samayaththum nal pakalilum\nVishraamam varum vegam badhappettoduka\nAdhwaanam illa raathri vannidunnithaa\n\n3. Raathriyithaa varunnu adhwaanam cheythu kolh\nAsthamayathinkalum prabhaanthyathilum\nPoy maryayunne pakal adhwaanam theerthukkolh\nAndhakaaramaam raathri vannidum mumbe", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0387": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0387-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0387-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Njaanumentey bhavanavumo njangal Yehovayé sevikkum\n\n\nNanma cheithu jeevikkum than nanmakalh ghoshikkum\n\n1. Bhaarangal nèridum nèrathil – onnaai vannidum nin savidhey\nBhaarangalhellaamakannu paalikkum anthyaththolhavum\n\n-njaanum...\n\n2. Kaarmegha jaalangalherilum – kaanhaathen chaaraththeyththunnu\nEn bhavanaththilenneshu – paarthidum nalla naadhanaay\n\n-njaanum...\n\n3. Entey veettilenneshuvund jayaththin ullaasa ghoshamund\nHalleluyya geetham paadi vaazththidum ennennekumaay\n\n-njaanum...\n\n4. Vishwaasa veeraraayththeerunna - Veera Saakshikalheyriduvaan\nEn bhavanaththilen saakshyam paalikkum nannaay ennumey\n\n-njaanum…\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(Rev. V. M. Mathew)\n\nKristhuvinte Randaamaththe Varavu", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0388": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0388-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0388-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 2, "tune": 1, "kind": "CONTINUATION"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0388-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Kaanthaa! Thaamasamenthaho! Vanneedaaneshu\n\nKaanthaa! Thaamasamenthaho!\n\n\n\nKaantha! Nin varavinay Kaathirunnente manam\n\n\nVenthurukunnu kannhum mangunnen manuvele\n\n-kaantha…\n\n1. Vegaththil njan varunnennu paranjittethra varshamathaayirikkunnu!\nMeghangalhil varunnennu parhanjathorththu daahaththodeyirikkunnu\nAeka vallabhanaakum Yeshuve! Ninte nalla\nAagamanam njan nokki aashayodirikkayaal\n\n\n\n-kaantha…\n\n2. Dukham nee nokkunnillayo Ente vilaapashabdham nee kalhkkunnillayo\nThakkam nokkeedunnillayo pishaachenmanam vekkam hanippanayayyo!\nThrikkannhaalenne nokki durithangalhaake pokki\nVekkam nin manhavaatti-yaakki kkollhuvaan priya!\n\n\n-kaantha…\n\n(Yusthus Youseph)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0389": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0389-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0389-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Ennu nee vannidum ente priya! Thava\n\nPonmukham njanonnu kandeeduvaan\n\n\n\nEthrakaalam njnagalh kaathirunnidenham\n\n\nYaathrayum paarththukondimmaruvin madhye\n-ennu…\n\n1. Eeshaanamoolan-angoottamadikkunna\nKlesha samudramaanheeyulakam\nAashayode njangalh nin mukhaththe nokki\nKleshamellaam marhannodidunne priya\n\n\n-ennu…\n\n2. Ee loka suryante ghorakiranhangalh\nMaalekidunnathum kaanhunnille?\nPaalakan neeyallathaarullhee njangalhkku\nElohi! Nee enthu thaamasicheedunnu\n\n\n-ennu…\n\n3. Ennhamillathullha vaishamyamedukhalh\nKannheerolippichchu ninte vrithar\nAerhikkadakkunna kaazhcha nee kanditta-\nngaadalethumille? Devakumaarakaa!\n\n\n-ennu…\n\n4. Meghaaroodanaayi thaarangalhezhenthi\nAadithya thulyavedananaayi\nKaahalha dhwannavum minnalumaarhppumaai\nSheekhram njan vannidumennura cheythone\n\n-ennu…\n\n5. Maarvvodanhachenne aashwassippikkuvaan\nKaalvarykkunnilangerhiyone!\nPonmudi enne dharippikkuvaanoru\nMulhmudi aettayyo! Kashtam sahichone\n\n\n-ennu…\n\n6. Immanuvele nin shobha nirhanjullha\nAmmahimaapuram onnu kandaal\nImmaheethalaththin mohana vasthukkalh\nOnnumillaththathenne-nnhaaththathaaruthaan\n\n-ennu…\n\n7. Mrithyuvil ninnenne veendedutheeduvaan\nDaivakopaagniyil ventherinja\nSnehaswaroopanaam yeshunaadhaa - ninte\nmanhiyarha thannillangenneyum - cherththidaan\n\n-ennu…\n\n(Muthampakkal Kochukunju Upadeshi)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0390": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0390-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0390-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Yeshuvarum vegaththil aashwasame\n\n\nYeshuvarum vegaththil - kristheshu varum\n1. Megham thantherum anekaraam dootharum\nShekharippaan thannilekkellashudhdhare\n\n-yeshu…\n\n2. Daivaththe sathyaththil seva cheythavarkku\nChaavine jayichu than jeevane koduppaan\n\n-yeshu…\n\n3. Than thiru varavinaai santhatham kaaththavarh-\nKkanthamillaaththoru santhosham labhippan\n\n-yeshu…\n\n4. Bhrithyanmaarh thaan cheytha sathya prakaaram\nNithya mahathwaththin raajyaththil vaazhaan\n\n-yeshu…\n\n5. Than janaththinnellaa ninnayum neekki\nAnpullha kai kondu kannhuneerh thudappaan\n\n-yeshu…\n\n6. Than thirumukhathe naam kanhkondu kandu\nSanthushtaraayennum than naamam sthuthippaan\n-yeshu…\n\n7. Lokaththin chinthakalh pokatteyellaam\nAekaprathyaasha ingaaka enyeshu\n\n\n-yeshu…\n\n(V. Nagal)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0391": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0391-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0391-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Yeshuraajante ezhunnellhaththin mun doothukalhi-\nthaa! Nadannu kondu varunnu…\n\nYeshu raajanaakum nasareshanaam mashihaa devan\n\nBhoothalaththilekkezhunnellhunnathinu vannu kaalam\n1. Kanyaka makanai vannavan - manujarkkaayi\nDhanndamettu chaththuyirththavan - mahimayodu\nUnnathan valabhaaga-ththinkalirikkunu raajan\nUnnatha prathaapamodee mannhil vegam varunnathaal\n\n-yeshu…\n\n2. Daveedinte veenhu poyoru - koodaaram devaa-\nthmaavithaa  panhi nadaththunnu - athinte kedu -\nPaadukalhozhinjozhinju poyidunnathaal puthiya-\nthaayidunnalpamalpam nivarnneedunnithaa! Mashihaa\n\n-yeshu…\n\n3. Yudha kalahangalh pakarum vyaadhikalh mattum\nKarththan mashihaayurachcha pol -vannukondaho!\nEthrayum naashatheyithaa idhareyinkal varuththi\nKarthrubhakthare-yezhunnallhaththinnaa-yorikkeedunnu\n\n-yeshu…\n\n4. Raaja raajante yaathrakkithaa - avante vazhi -\nyaakave nannakki varunnu - nammude naadha-\nnnaayoru peruvazhiva-naththilorukki varunnu\nThaanha pradeshangalhumuyarnnithaa varunnu\n\n\n-yeshu…\n\n5. Vakrathayullhathu chovvai-ththeernnu varunnu\nDurkhadamullhathu samamai theernnu varunnu\nOkkeyiprakaaramingorungi vannidunnathaale\nSheekhramaay-ezhunnallhaththundaam-athin-unharnnu kolhvin  -yeshu…\n(Yusthus Youseph)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0392": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0392-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0392-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Yeshuvodu chernnirippathethra modame\nYeshuvinaai jeevikkunnathethra bhaagyame\nAasha thannodennumennil vardhicheedunne\nAashu thante koode vaazhaan kaamkshicheedunne\n\n-yeshu…\n\n2. Pokkiyente paapamellaam thante yaagaththaal\nNeekkiyente shaapamelaam thaan vahichathaal\nOrkkunthorhum snehamennil vardhicheedunne\nPaarkkunne than koode vaazhaan ennu saadhyamo?\n\n-yeshu…\n\n3. Shreshtamerhum naattilente vaasamaakkuvaan\nShobhayerum veedenikkorikkeedunnavan\nKaikalhaal theerkaatha nithya paarpidam thannil\nVaanhidunna naalhinaai njan nokki paarkunne\n\n\n-yeshu..\n\n4. Annu theerumente kashtam innee mannile\nAnnu maarhumente dukham nishchayam thanne\nAnnu thante shudhdharoththu paadiyaarkkume\nEnnenikku saadhyamo mahal sammelhanam\n\n\n-yeshu…\n\n5. Nallavane vallabhane ponnukaanthane\nAllal theerkkaanennu vannu cherththidumenne\nThulyamillaa modamode veenhakalhenthi\nHalleluiaa gaanam paadi vaanhiduvaanaai\n\n\n-yeshu...", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0393": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0393-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0393-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 2, "tune": 1, "kind": "CONTINUATION"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0393-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Tune: I’ve reached the land\n\n1. Kaalvariyil en perkkaho\nJeevan koduththen rakshakan\nMahathwaththil dootharumaai ihaththil veendum vannidum\n\n\n\nYeshu varum veendum varum Than shudhdharey chèrthukolhvaan\n\n\nAakaasha mandalangalhil meghangalhil aaghoshamaai\n\n\nAanandamey haa! Ennumey manuvèli-nnalleyluyya\n\n2. Lôkaththin naanaa bhaagaththum Kèlhkkunnithaa athyuchchaththil\nThan varavinnaarppu vilhi evarum kèttunharuvin\n\n\n\n-yeshu...\n\n3. Kaththum vilhakkôdum ara- kettiyum thanney kaakkuvin\nAllaaikil ningalh évarum thallhappedum puraththaho\n\n\n-yeshu...\n\n4. Vaathil adachcha shésham ee bhoothaleyundaa mèvarkkum\nAthyantha kashtangalh ava thetti ozhivin ippozhey\n\n\n-yeshu...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(T.D. George)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0394": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0394-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0394-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 2, "tune": 1, "kind": "CONTINUATION"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0394-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Maanavare rakshicheeduvaanaai\nVaanaththil ninnihaththil vannuthaan\nJeevanekiyoreshu\nBhoovil thirike varum\n\nVegameshu rakshakan aagamicheedum\nMeghamathaam vaahane\n       -vegam…\n\n2. Than shudhdhare aakaashe koottuvaan\nYeshu varunnu thaamasam vinaa\nPaarthalaththil ninnavan\nCherththidum than sannidhou       -vegam…\n\n3. Ningalhude arakalh kettiyum\nBhangiyode deepam vilhangiyum\nKarthaavin varavinaai\n\nKaaththiduvin sarvadaa\n       -vegam…\n\n4. Kunjaadinte kalyaanham vannithaa\nKaantha alamkritha manohari\nKshnikkappettorellaam\nDhanyaraho ennume\n       -vegam…\n\n(Rev. T. D. George)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0395": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0395-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0395-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Aanandam-aanandam-aanandame\nAanandam-aanandame\nNjanenete priyaneshuvin koode\nVaazhunna jeevithame\n\n2. Maalinyameshaathe kaaththidunna\nSoubhaagyamaam jeevitham\nNjan pinne vaazhum Thejassoumorththaal\nHa! Ethra modamathe\n\n3. Bhooloka jeevitha kaalamellaam\nVijayamaai kaaththathaal\nDevakumaaran yshuvin paade\nNaalhthorhum veezhunne njan\n\n4. Thaathante rajyam pookidumbolh\nSthaana maanam aekume\nNjan annu paadum paattu kettaal\nAaru grahicheedumo\n\n5. Devaadi devan veendeduththa\nThejasserhum kaanthaye\nKaanhunna neram dootha ganhangalh\nAashcharyam koorhidume", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0396": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0396-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0396-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Shuddhar sthuthikkum veedey Daiva makkalhkkullhashrayamey\nParilasikkum swarnnhaththeru veethiyil\nAthi koothukaal ennu njaan chernneedumo\n\n\n\nVaanavarin sthuthi naadam sadaa muzhangum shaalemil\n\n\nEnnu njaan chernneedumo - parasuthaney\nennu njaan chernnidumo (3)\n\n2. Muththinaal nirmmithamaayullha panthrandu gopuramey\nThava mahathwam kandittangaanandippaan\nMama kanhkal paaram kothichchidunney\n\n\n\n-vaana...\n\n3. Andhatha illaa naadey Daiva thejassaal minnum veedey\nThavavilhakkaam Daivaththin kunjaadiney\nAlhavenyey paadi sthuthichcheedaam njaan\n\n\n-vaana...\n\n4. Kashtathayillaa naadey Daivabhaktharin vishramamey\nPookalh perukum puththanerushalemey\nThiru maarvil ennu njaan chaaridumo\n\n\n\n-vaana...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n5. Shudhdhavum shubhravumayullha jeeva jala nadiyin\nIru karayum jeeva vruksha phalangal\nParilasikkum Daivaththin udyaanamey\n\n\n\n-vaana...\n\n6. Karthru simhaasanaththin chuttum veenhakalh meettidunna\nSuravararey chernnangu paadiduvaan\nPurumodam paaram valharunnaho\n\n\n\n-vaana...", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0397": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0397-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0397-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Loke njan en ottam thikachchu\nSwarga gehe viruthinaayi\nParhaneedum njan marhuroopamaai\nParaneshu raajan sannidhou\n\nDootha sanghamaakave enne ethirelkkuvaan\n\nSada sannadharaai ninneedunne\n\nShubhra vasthra dhaariyaai ente priyante mumbil\n\nHalleluiah paadidum njan\n\n2. Aerhe naalhaai kaanhmaan aashayaai\nKaaththirunna ente priyane\nThejassode njan kaanhunna neram\nThirumaarhvod-anhanjeedume\n\n\n-dootha…\n\n3. Neethimaanmaar-aaya sidhdhanmaarh\nJeevitham verhuththa veeranmaar\nVeenhakalhenthi gaanam paadumbolh\nNjanum chernnu paadeedume\n\n\n-dootha…\n\n4. Thaathan perkkai seva cheythathaal\nThaathane maanikkuvaanaai\nTharumororo bahumaanangalh\nVilhangeedum kireedangalhai\n\n\n-dootha…\n\n5. Kaikalhaal theerkkapedaathathaam\nPuthu shaalem nagaramathil\nSadaa kaalam njaan manhavaattiyaai\nParanodu koode vaazhume\n\n\n-dootha...", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0398": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0398-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0398-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Kaaththu kaaththekanaai nin varavorhththu\n-njan\nNaalhethra neekkiyen yeshudevaa!\nKaanhum prapanjamo maarhumennaakilum\nMaarhaaththa veekku nee thannathallo\n\n2. Samsaara saagare neenthi neenthi njan\nSanthaapaththaal-uzhaneedunnayyo\nSanthoshamekuvaan ninkoode vaazhuvaan\nSoundarya ponmukham kandeeduvaan\n\n\n\n\n-kaaththu…\n\n3. Swanthamaayonnume kaanhuvaan-illihe\nSwanthamaai nee mathi yeshudevaa\nBandhukkalh mithrarum anthya samayame\nPinthirinjeedumaa-shokarangam\n\n\n\n\n\n-kaaththu…\n\n4. Aashwaasamekuka vishwaasanaayaka\nNashwara-naadakamaanhee-lokam\nAashishamekuka en shwaasam pom vare\nNin gaanam paaduvaan shakthi nalka\n\n\n\n\n-kaaththu…\n(P.D. John)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0399": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0399-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0399-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Bhaagyanaattil pokum njan\nEnte bhaagyanaattil pokum njan\nBhagyanaattil chennu shudhdharodoththu njan\nYeshuve vaazhtheedume\n\n\n-bhaagya…\n\n2. Maaya imbam vidunne - ente\nLoka sukhangalhellaam\nNaayakanaam ente mannane orththu njan\nThan thiru naamaththinaayi\n\n\n-bhaagya…\n\n3. Swargga bhaagyamorkkumbolh - ente\nUllham-aanandikkunne\nThullhikkallhichente santhosha raajyaththil\nVegam njan chernnidume\n\n\n\n-bhaagya…\n\n4. Oro divasavum njan - ente\nPriyane nokkikkondu\nNeraaya paathayil sevanam cheythu njan\nMaarvodanhanjeedume\n\n\n\n-bhaagya…\n\n(P. D. John)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0400": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0400-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0400-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Naamellaarum kooduvom daya labhichor\nNaadhane kondaaduvom\nVaanameghaththeril dootharin sanghamaai\nVegam vannidum priyan\n\n\nSaanandam kondaaduvin\n\nHalleluiah paaduvin\n\nCherum naamellaarum aa sammelhana dinam\n\nKaanhum raajan ponmukham\n\n2. Kaahalham dwanichidum arajodiyil\nKarththavil mritharellaam\nJeevanode bhoovil vaanhidum vishudhdharum\nVaanil pokum kaalamaai\n\n\n-saanandam…\n\n3. Naamee loke enthinaai anudinavum\nMevidunnu khedaththaal\nHa ha kannheer kanham thudakkuvaan kaalamaai\nSheekhram thaan varunnithaa\n\n-saanandam…\n\n4. Ingu naam viheenaraai ee bhoovane\nPaaram ninnayelkkukil\nAngu prabhukkalaai mahathwa raajye vaanhidum\nKodi kodi kaalamaai\n\n\n-saanandam…\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nKristhuvin Sannidhi", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0401": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0401-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0401-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Nin sannidhiyil daivame! Poornha santhosham poornha bhaagyame\n\n\nThan makkalhkkelaaippozhum sammodam labhippaanaai\n\n\nUnhmayaayanthamillaa nanmakalh niranjullha\nnin…\n\n1. Vairikalhaal niranjathaam mahaa ghora vipinamaam bhoovi\nSwairamaai nin makkalh sanchaaram cheytheedaanaai nin\nChaaraththu cherththu dairaththode nadatheedunna\n\n-nin…\n\n2. Ullaasangalh vridhaalaapam pala vallaatha ninnaa-vachanam\nChollaanaruthaathullha bhallherhum vachangangalh\nElaam allaathe kelhppaan illa lokamakkalhil\n\n\n-nin…\n\n3. Aadhi samshayangalh kondum mahavyaadhi chinthaakulam kondum\nBheethi valharnnu manamaake virandu njan san-\nketham naadhane! Nin thripaadam praapicheedumbolh!\n\n-nin…\n\n4. Vaana senakalheppozhum sthothra gaanangalhaal nin sannidhou\nOonamillathe manathaaril nirhanja bhakthi\nAanandangalhodennum paadi sthuthicheedunna\n\n\n-nin…\n(Moshavatsalam)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0402": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0402-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0402-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Yeshuve ninte roopameeyente\nKannukalhkethra soundaryam\nShishyanaakunna enneyum ninneppole\nAakkanham muzhuvan.\n\n2. Snehamaam ninne kandavar - pinne\nSnehikkaathe jeevikkumo\nDahippikenham enne ashesham\nSneham nalkanham en prabho!\n\n3. Deenakkaareyum heenanmareyum\nAashwasippippaan vannone\nAanandathode njaan ninnepole\nKaarunyham cheyvaan nalkuke\n\n4. Daasaneppole sevanam cheytha\nDaivathin ekajaathane!\nVaasam cheyyanham ee nin vinayam\nEnte ullhillum naathane!\n\n5. Paapikalhude vipareethaththe\nEllam sahicha kunjaade!\nKopippan alla kshemippanullha\nShakthi ennikkum nalkuke\n\n6. Thante pithaavin hitham-eppozhum\nModamod-udan cheythone!\nEnte ishtavum Daiva ishtathin-\nAnuroopam aakkenhame\n\n7. Thiruvezhutthu shaishavam thottu\nSnehichaaraanja yeshuve!\nGuru nee thanne vachanam nanne\nGrahippikka nin shishyane!\n\n8. Raathri muzhuvan praarthippanai\nUnharnnirunna en yeshuve!\nPraarthippanaayum unharaanaayum\nShakthi tharenham ennumme\n\n9. Loka sthaanavum saathaan maanavum\nVerhuttha daiva jaathane\nEkamaam manam thannitten dhanam\nDaivam thaan ennorppikkuke\n\n10. Koushalangalhum upaayangalhum\nPakekkum sathya raajaave!\nShishuvinulla paramaarthatha\nEnnilhum nithyam kakkuke\n\n11. Iha lokathin chinthakal lesham\nAeshaanj-aashritha valtsala\nMahal shakthiyaam nin daivashrayam\nKondennulham urhappikka\n\n12. Manushyarilum doothanmaarilum\nAthi sundaranaayone\nAnudhinam nin dhivya soundharyam\nEnn-aamodha-maakkenhame\n(V. Nagal)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0403": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0403-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0403-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Nin sannidhi mathi ha! Yeshuve\nNin prasaadam mathi ee enikku\nVan dukhangalhilum nin sannidhi mathi\nNin sannidhi mathi - innum ennum\n\n2. Bhoomiyilhakilum maa-samudram -\nKoppikkilum bhayam illenikku\nAnnu nin kai mathi - nin sannidhi mathi\nNin sannidhi mathi - innum ennum!\n3. Lokaththilekanaai theerukilum\nRogaththal baadhithan aayidilum\nThrikkanhmel mathi - nin sannidhi mathi\nNin sannidhi mathi - innum ennum!\n\n4. Aayiram aayiram vairikalhaal\nAavrithanaakilum - njan bramikkaa!\nNeeyen paksham mathi - nin sannidhi mathi\nNin sannidhi mathi - innum ennum!", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0404": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0404-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0404-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "En priyaneshuvil - njan vasikkenhame ennum -\n\n\nKombu munthiri vallhiyil - enna pole\n-en…\n1. Kristhu-vonnichaho! Mrithyuvettanguyirththa njan\nNithyavum than kripayaal jeevanil vaazhaan\n\n-en…\n\n2. Daivahithamathi sarvva kaaryangalhilum njan\nCheyvathinenneyavanu samarppichu\n\n\n-en…\n\n3. Sarvva bhaarangalhum rakshakan tholhathiletti -\nSathathamavanil poornhaashrayaththode\n\n\n-en…\n\n4. Karththavinodu njan aettavum-aanandamode\nNithya samsarggamathil jeevanam cheyvaan\n\n-en…\n\n5. Daivaathma-shakthiyaal njan nadaththapedunnonaai\nJeeva-vishwaasam-athinaal dinam thorhum\n\n-en…\n\n6. En pithavinude nithyamahathwamathinnu\nInpa phalam valhare kaaypathinaayi\n\n\n-en…\n\n(T. D. George)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0405": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0405-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0405-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 2, "tune": 1, "kind": "CONTINUATION"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0405-notation-3.jpg", "sourcePage": 3, "tune": 2, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0405-malayalam-1.jpg", "choir/KK-0405-malayalam-2.jpg"], "manglish": "Tune - ‘ I will sing of my Redeemer’\n1. Njaan Karthaavinaai paadum\nJeevichcheedum naalhellaam\nDaiva mahathwam kondaadum\nKeerththikum than vaalsalyam\nHalleluyya Daivaththinum\nHalleluyya Puthranum\n\nHalleluyya Aathmaavinum\n\nInnum sarvakaalaththum\n\n2. Bhaara mullhôr manamalla\nDaivaathmaavin lakshanham\nSaakshaal abhishikthar kellaa\nKaalaththum santhoshikkaam         -Hallel…\n\n3. Daiva mukhaththin munbaakey\nVeenha yaaley sthuthippaan\nYeshuvin thiru raktha ththaaley\nEnney praapthan aakki thaan          -Hallel...\n\n4. Kèlhkka doothanmaaril gaanam\nBethlehemin vayalil\nNôkkuka pithaavin daanam\nChèruka sangeethaththil\n          -Hallel...\n\n5. Paalum thènum ozhukeedum\nNallôr raajyam entethaam\nAashwaasangalh niranjeedum\nKristhan maarven paarppidam         -Hallel...\n\n6. Paadum njaan santhoshaththaaley\nUllham ellaam thullhumbolh\nPaadum enney agniyaaley\nShôdana cheitheedumbolh\n          -Hallel...\n\n7. Aththi vriksham vaadiyaalum\nMunthiriyin vallhiyum\nOnnum nalkaa thirunnaalum\nNjaan karththaavil pukazhum           -Hallel...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n8. En nikshèpam swarggaththinkal\nAakayaal njaan bhaagyavaan\nLôkarudey dukhathtinkal\nEnikkundo dukhippaan\n          -Hallel...\n\n9. Daivaththinkaley santhosham\nAashritharin balamaam\nAashayattu pôya klèsham\nDooraththeriyuka naam\n         -Hallel…\n(V. Nagal)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0406": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0406-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0406-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Tune - ‘Showers of blessing’\n\n1. Daivathin paithale! Ninte\nJeevitha kaalam athil\nOroro bharangalhaale\nPaaram valanjeedumbolh\n\nChinthaakulangalh\nChinthaakulangalh ellaam\nIttu kolh Yeshumel nin\nPerkkai karuthunnundavan\n\n2. Lokaththin chinthakalhaalum\nRoga peedakalhaalum\nMattu prayaasangalhaalum\nMuttum thalharnneedumbolh  -chintha…\n\n3. Karthaavinishtamaam vannham\nNithyam jeevicheeduvaan\nNin prayathnangalh eppozhum\nNishphalamaai varumbolh\n-chintha…\n\n4. Daivam ninne nadaththunnu\nNin vazhiyil muzhuvan\nAndhakaaram varumbozhum\nAntharangaththile nin\n-chintha…\n\n5. Ninnude perkkiha loke\nVannu marichavanaam\nYeshuvin vaakkukalhe nee\nVishwasichu sathatham\n-chintha...\n\nKristhuvum Sabhayum", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0407": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0407-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0407-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "‘The Church’s one foundation’\n- S.J. Stone\n\n1. Sabhakkekaadisthaanam than kaanthanaam kristhu\nVellham vachanam moolam avalh puthu srishti\nAvalhe velhkkaan vaanam  vedinju thaan thedi\nThan raktham chorinjathaal jeevan avalh nedi\n\n2. Naanaa jaathikkarennaal onnavar ee bhoomou\nNeettonnathre rakshakku karthan vishwaasavum\nJananam, sthuthi onnu vishudhdha bhojanam\nAekaasha avar laakku kripayaal nirhanju\n\n3. Lokarkkaashcharyam, ninna peeda, njerukkavum\nShishma, idaththudaalum bhinnichum kaanhkayaal\nShudhdhar nokki karayum ethra naalhkee vidham\nVegam vyaakulam maarhum varum nithyaanandam\n\n4. Poraattam sankadangalh prayathnam irikke\nVaanchikkunnundee sabha poornha shaanthathaye\nKaaththirikkum mahathwam darshikkum naalhvare\nJayam kollhum maa sabha aashwasikkum vare\n\n5. Bhoovil thriyekanodu samsargam sabhakku\nJayicha shudharodu rahasya kootaayma\nHa shudhar, bhaagyavaanmaar! Njangalhum avar pol\nSwarge thaazhmayaai vaasam! Cheyaan arulh karthaa", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0408": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0408-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0408-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Yeshuvin thirusabhaye parishudha aalayame\n\nVishudhdharin vamshamathe vishudha purohithar naam\n-yeshuvin…\n\n1. Yeshuvin rakthathaal mochitharum\nPuthiyoru niyamaththin sevakarum\nVishudhiyin aathmaavaal niranjeedunor naam\nAathmika grihamaanhe - avar swantha janamaanhe\n\n-yeshuvin…\n\n2. Rakshayin vaathil kadannavarum\nrakshakaneshuve kandavarum\nKaalvary snehathin paathayilennennum kandidum puthujeevan\nAvar krooshil puthujeevan\n\n\n\n\n\n-yeshuvin…\n\n3. Prathikoolam-anavadhi uyarneedumbolh\nAnukoolamaayavan koodeyundu\nAgniyil koodeyum koottinaai vannidum\nAathma sakhiyennumavan than jeevan nalkiyon\n\n\n-yeshuvin…\n  (Rev. V. M. Mathew)\nAashwaasam", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0409": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0409-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0409-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "‘My hope is built on nothing less’  - E. Mote\n\n1. En aasha Yeshuvil thanney\nThan neethi rakthaththil maathram\nNjaan nambollaa mattonniney\nEn Yeshumaathram sharanham\n\nPaarhayaam Kristhanmel nilpen\nVerhum manhal mattullhedam (2)\n\n2. Kaarmeghangal andhakaaram\nMaraikkumbol Thirumukham\nMaaraaththathaam than kripayil\nUrappodey aashrayamey\n          -paara...\n\n\n3. Kallola jaalam pongattey\n Nallaasha enna nankuram\nIttittund maraikkullhil\nOttum bhayappedunnilla\n          -paara...\n\n4. Than raktham vaakkudambadi\nEn thaangaayund pralhayé\nEnnaathmanum thaaney thunha\nanyaashrayangalpoyaalum\n          -paara...\n\n5. Kaahalhaththodey thaanvannu\nSimhaasanaththil irikkey\nThan neethi maathram dharichu\nMun nilkum nyaankoottamenye       -paara...", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0410": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0410-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0410-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Than nithya snehaththaal naadhan - anthamillaathoru bhaagyathe\nEnnekkumaai namukku nalki\nHa! Ethra modam nin jeevitham daivathinte paithale\n\nKannhuneerelaam thudacheedum aa naalhilenthu santhosham\n\n2. Loka dukhangalherhidumbolh - aashwasamekunna thankarangalh\nKondu ninne thalodidum\nDukham prayaasamaake neengipom\nThan krooshine nee dhyaanikkumbolh\n\n-Ha!...\n\n3. Nin jeevithakkapalithaa lokamaakunna van samudraththil\nKoodi mumbottu paayunnu\nSwargeeya thuramukhaththeththidumbolh\nNaayakan ninne sweekarikkum\n\n\n-Ha!...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n4. Shathrukkalh-aarumillaaththa veettil palhungunadi pavahikkum theeraththil\nNishchayamaai nee aanandikkum\nEe lokaththinte elaa mohangalhum\nEnnekkumaai nee parithyajikkum\n\n\n-Ha!...", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0411": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0411-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0411-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Entey jeevanaam Yeshuvey\nNintey swaram en cheviyil\nImbamodey vannadichcheedunnu\nNjaan kèttu Nathaa\n\n1. Ksheenha paapiye vaayennil\nAashwasikka nee sathatham -\nKsheenhamullha nin thalayen maarvil\nChaari sukhikka\n\n-entey...\n\n2. Vannu kandu shaanthathaye\nYeshuvintey sneha maarvil\nEnneyadupichchu santhoshaththaal\nDukhangalh maati\n\n-entey...\n\n3. Sarvvavum njaan daanamaayi\nNirvyaajam tharunnu paapi\nJeevavellham kudichaanandam\npraapichcheeduka\n\n-entey...\n\n4. Jeevanadiyil ninnu njaan\nMôdamodey paanam cheithu\nKèvalamen daaham shamichchappolh\nJeevikkunnu njaan\n\n-entey...\n\n5. Koorirulhaal moodiyoree\nLôkaththinu Njaan velhichcham\nPaaraathey Nee enney nokki nokki\nNithyam sukhikkaa\n\n-entey...\n\n6. Entey jeeva kaalamellaam\nYeshuvenna mei velhichcham\nKandu nadappaan kripa nalkanham\nDèvaadhi Devaa\n\n-entey...\n\n(V. Nagal)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0412": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0412-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0412-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Aashwaasame enikkerhe thingeedunnu\nVishwaasakkanhaal njan nokkeedumbolh\nSnehamerheedumen rakshakan sannidhou\nAanandakkoottare kaanhunnallo\n\n2. Aamodaththaal thingi aashcharya-modavar\nChuttum ninnu sthuthi cheytheedunnu\nThankathirumukham kaanhmaan kothichavar\nUllaasamodithaa nokkeedunnu\n\n3. Than kaikalhaal kannhuneerellaam thaathan thaan\nEnnekkumaayi thudachithallo\nPonveenhakalh dharichaamoda poornharaai\nKarththavine sthuthi cheyyunnavar\n\n4. Kunjaadinte raktham thannil thangalh angi\nNannaai velhuppicha koottarivarh\nPoornha vishudharaaiththeernnavar-eshuvin\nThanka rudhiraththin shakthiyaale\n\n5. Thankakkireedangalh thangalh shirassinmel\nVenhnilayangi dharichorivarh\nKaiyyil kuruththola aettittavar sthuthi\nPaadeettaanandamor-aartheedunnu\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n6. Chernneedume vegam njanum aa koottathil\nShudhdharodonnichangaanandippaan\nLokam vendaa enikkonnum venda ente\nNaadhante sannidhou chernnal mathi\n\n7. Karthaave! Vishwaasapporil tholkkathenne\nAvasaanaththolham nee nirthenhame\nAakashameghaththil kaahalha naadaththil\nAdiyanum nin mumbil kaanhenhame\n(Muthampakkal Kochukunju Upadeshi)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0413": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0413-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0413-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Daivaththil njaan kandoru - nirbhayamaam paarppidam\nIthra soukhyamengumey - kaanhunnilla sadhu njaan\nThantey chirakinu keezh durghatanangalh neengi njaan\n\n\nVaazhunnenthumôthamaai - paadum njaanathyuchchamaai!\n\n2. Thantey nizhalinu keezh channanaai njaan paarkkayaal\nRaappakal njaan nirbhayan bheethidoorey paanju poi\n-thante...\n\n3. Ghôramahaamaariyo kooriruttin vèlhayo\nIlla thellum chanchalam naathanundu koodavey\n\n-thante...\n\n4. Aayirangalhennudey nèrkku vanneythirkkilum\nVeethiyullha pakshangalh saadhuvey marachchidum\n-thante...\n\n5. Snehashaali rakshakan khèdakam than sathyamaam\nEntey chankilundithaa rakshithaavin pèr sadaa\n\n-thante...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(K.V. Simon)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0414": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0414-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0414-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Paraparameshaa! Varamaruleeshaa!\n\n\nNeeyathre en rakshaa sthaanam\n\n1. Ninne kaanhum janangalhkku pinne dukhamonnumilla\n-para…\n\n2. Ninte ellaa nadaththippum ente bhaagya nirhavallo\n\n-para…\n\n3. Aadiyinkal kaippaakilum-anthyamo madhuramathre!\n\n-para…\n\n4. Kaarmeghaththinullhilee njan minnum suryashobha kaanhum! -para…\n\n5. Sandhyayinkal vilaapavum santhoshamushassinkalum!\n-para…\n\n6. Ninnodonnichullha vaasam ente kanheer thudacheedum!\n-para…\n\n7.  Ninte mukha shobha moolam ente dukham theernnu pokum!  -para…\n\n(K. V. Simon)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0415": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0415-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0415-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Yeshuve! Thirunaamamethra madhuram\n\n\nBhoomiyilagathikken\n\n\n- yeshuve\n\n1. Aashwaasameshu bhavaan aarogyam rogikkullhil\nVishwe bandhu neeyenye verhaarum ille swami\n\n-yeshuve…\n\n2. Khedam ozhikkum bhavaan bheethi akattum bhavaan\nThaathan maathavum bhavaan nithyam adimaykkallo\n-yeshuve…\n\n3. Manna! Mannayum bhavaan ennaachaaryan raajan nee\nEnnum sakhi jeevan nee en bhagyavum neeyallo\n\n-yeshuve…\n\n4. Sankethame! Malaye enkhedam vazhi nee\nEn karthaave! Bharthaave! En jeevanum idayan…\n-yeshuve…\n\n5. Nikshepam lakshyam bhavaan rakshaasthalam shirasse!\nRakshaakaran guruve saakshi madhyasthanum nee\n-yeshuve…\n\n6. Ennil ninne sthuthippaan onnum thraanhiyingille\nNinne vannu kandennum - nanne paadum adiyan\n-yeshuve…\n\n7. Aththal koodaathe karthaa cherththidenham angane\nMrithyu pirikkuvolham kaaththidenhame priyan\n\n-yeshuve…\n\n8. Nithyam agathi thirusthothram swarge dhwanippaan\nSathyam vidaathe odiyeththum thirukripayaal\n\n-yeshuve…\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n(Moshavatsalam)\n\nRogikalhe Sandarshikkuka", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0416": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0416-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0416-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Draw me nearer – Fanny J. Crosby\n\n1. Enney rakshippaan unnatham vittu\nMannil vanna Karthaavey!\nNinney swargaththil ninnihakondu\nVannathu Nin snehamey!\n\n\nAakarshikka enney priya Rakshakaa\n\nNee marichcha krooshinkal\nAakarshikka enney priya Rakshakaa\n\nNin murinja maarvinkal\n\n2. Naavu kondu chollaavathinmel Nee\nNôven pèrkkaaiyettallo\nEe vidham sneham jeevanaathaa!\nEe bhoovilaarkkumillaho!\n-aakarshikka...\n\n3. Ninkalekenney aakarshippaanaai\nRôgamaam Nin doothaney\nNin karaththaal Nee enkal ayachcha\nNin kripaikkaai sthothramey  -aakarshikka...\n\n4. Nin swaroopaththod anuroopamai\nVaruvaan naalhil naalhil\nChorikaathmaavin varangalh ennum\nNiravaai Nee ennullhil\n-aakarshikka...\n\n5. Jeevanullhathaam Daiva vachanam\nSarva nèravumentey\nPaavanaahaara maavathinennum\nDivya kripa nalkuka\n\n-aakarshikka...\n\n6. Unnathaththil Nin sannidhou vannu\nNinney njaan kaanhunneram\nEnnil undomaananda mavarnnhyam\nEnnumennekkum bhaagyam -aakarshikka...\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nPuthuvarsham", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0417": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0417-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0417-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Father let me dedicate\n\n1. Daivamey ee aandiney\nprathistikkunnu\nEduppaan en pankiney\n kaaththirikkunnu\nIllenikkathillaathey p\nraathana vèrey\nMahathwamaakkenhamey!\n Nintey naamaththey\n\n2. Kutti thantey ishtam pôley\naagrahikkumo?\nThaathan nanma allaathey\nnithyam nalkumo?\nThannathellaattinnumey\nsthothramennumey\nMahathwamaakkenhamey!\nNintey naamaththey\n\n3. Innum Nee santhoshaththey\nenikku thannaal\nImbamaam prakaashaththey\nenmèl veeshiyaal\nEntey hridayameppozhum\ncholleedum itham\nMahathwamaakkenhamey!\nNintey naamaththey\n\n4. Krooshu njaan edukkuvaan\nnin hitham enkil\nLaabham nashtamaakuvaan\nsangathi enkil\nNin Puthran chonnapôley\nennum ennullhil\nMahathwamaakkenhamey!\nNintey naamaththey", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0418": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0418-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0418-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Innèram Yeshu Devaney! - Kadakanh nôkki\nEnney rakshikka naathaney\n\n1. Ninney maranna mahaa\nNeecha paapi ee varsham\nOnnukoodey jeevippaan\nUllham alinjallônee\n\n-Inneram...\n\n2. Vanpullaasangalhaaya\nKombum ilayumenye\nMannaa! Kanikalhonnum\nThannilleypaathakan njaan\n-Inneram...\n\n3. Nalla viththitta manna\nKallaayi poyen ullham\nNaanaa vidham kalhakalh\nThaaney mulhachchupoyi\n-Inneram...\n\n4. Aandonnu koodey nilpaan\nAnuvaadam thèdiyoney\nVènda kôpa minneram\nVerukkarutheynneswaamee  -Inneram...\n\n5. Chuttum kilhaikka vaakkaal\nChorika nin aathmavellham\nMuttum aathma phalangalh\nMôdiyaai njaan tharuvaan\n-Inneram...\n\n6. Varsham onnu pôkunney\nMaa paapi cheitha dôsham\nVaishamya bhaaramaayi\nMalapolpongi nilkunney\n-Inneram...\n\n7. Ee bhaara chumadu\nKondenganey ksheenhanaam njaan\nNilpullha lôka kaattil\nTheevram nadappènayyo\n-Inneram…\n\n8. Kai neetti ippolh entey\nKanaththa chumadaam paapam\nManuvèla nee neekki\nMaruvarsham nalkeeduka\n-Inneram...", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0419": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0419-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0419-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "O God our help in ages past\n- Issac Watts\n\n1. Inneyolham thunhachchoney\nIniyum thunhaikka!\nIha dukkha rakhshayum nee\nEee en nithya griham\n\n2. Nin simhaasana nizhalil\nNin shudhdhar paarkkunnu\nNin bhujam mathiyavarkku\nNirbhayam vasippaan\n\n3. Parvathangalh nadum munbey\nPandu bhoomiyekkaalh\nParaney! Nee anaadiyaai\nPaarkkunnallo sadaa\n4. Aayiram varsham ninakku\nAakunninalley ppol\nAadithyodaya munbiley\nAlpa yaamam pôley\n\n5. Nithya nadi pôley kaalam\nNithyam than makkalhey\nNithyathwam pukippikkunna\nNidrapôley yathrey\n\n6. Inneyolham thunhachchoney\nIniyum thunhaikka\nIham vittupiriyumbolh\nEe en nithya graham", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0420": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0420-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0420-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Puthu vathsarathin piraviyil\nPimbilullhathellaam poi maranju\nPuthuthaakki theerkkaan puraanha kaaryangalh\nPukazhthum Karthaavey puthunaavaal\n\n2. Eeyaandu kaakkanhey ee dèshaththey\nEe lôka baadhayaal ilhakaathey\nEesho kripa nalki eeshan vishwaasaththey\nEeyadiyaarkkellaam eedaakkanhey\n\n3. Varum kaalangalhey vallabhaney\nVashakkèdillaathey vahichcheedaan\nVallabhan Daivamey vasham nee tharika\nValiya paapangalh vahichchoney\n\n4. Ennekum mahathwam  eka Pithaa\nEnnekum mahathwam eka Suthaa\nEnnum ennekumey, evam bhavikkattey\nEkaathmavaayonum ettam sthuthi\n\nChristmas (con’t)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0421": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0421-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0421-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Innu namukkeka shishu jaathanaayithaa - chithram\nInnu namukkeka puthran nalkappettallo!\n\n2. Aadhipathyam aayavan than tholhilirikkum nalla\nAalochanakkaranennu thannude naamam\n\n3. Thante naamam athyathbhuthan ennumaakunnu - sarva\nShakthanaaya daivam nithyanaaya pithaavu\n\n4. Daaveedin simhaasanaththinmel iruneedum - thante\nRaajyam-avasaanamillaath-ennumirikkum\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n5. Nyaayamodum neethiyodum thaan bharicheedum - thante\nAadhipathyam vardhichidum anthamillaathe\n\n6. Halleluiah, halleluiah daivasuthanu nithyam\nHalleluiah yeshuraajan-alleluiah-amen\n\n\n\n\n(P. T. Itty)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0422": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0422-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0422-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Munnam para-suthan-ambara naayakan\nImmaanuveloru naariyaam mary-than\nNandanan-omana baalakanaayavalh\nMadiyilirunnaanathum vismayam\n\n2. Mannil naranude vedivu dharichchu\nPirhannoru suravaranude jananaththe\nAmbara suraganham-idayarodarhiyi-\nChathi-modichaarathum vismayam\n\n3. Aattidayar surar cholliya vaachakam\nKettudanodiya bethlehem pul-\nKoottilamarnnoru shishuvine vannavar\nVandanam cheythaarathum vismayam\n\n4. Senakalhin paranaam yahovaa pari-\nShudhanennum surar vaazhthidave vannu\nMaanichousephinnude hithavum\nSaadhippaan ninnathum vismayam\n\n5. Poorvadeshaagatharaakiya shaasthrikalh\nThaarakamathinude vazhiye gamichavar\nPaarthivananpodu kaazhchakalh vachadha\nThipaadam kumbittaar vismayam\n(P. C. Ittiyera)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0423": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0423-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0423-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 2, "tune": 1, "kind": "CONTINUATION"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0423-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Maattin thozhuththil pirhanninaalh\n\n\nMahathwam nirhanja jagaththinnadhipan\n\n-maa…\n\n\n\n\nBethlem pooraththil swantha-\n\n\n\nMadaththe thyajichittumdambum dharichu -maa…\n\n1. Swanthamahathwam vedinjittu - kshayicha nararkkappadacha paran than\nChankinnurukkapperukkaththe - marukkappadaththaal dharippippathinu\nHantha! Param vittirhangiva-nnavatharichu nal athishayam! para-\nNunnathangalhil mahathwavum - nirappum jagaththil mahathwam paranu\nThinnham maa-navarkku bandham bhavippichihaththil - paranum nadukka-\nPonnhan peyuragadantham samastham idichingadarththippodippaan\n\n-maa…\n\n2. Aattin kaavalittirunnidaththilidayarkkudicha velhicham\nKandu ninnavar bhayannappolh thelhinjammahathwa surar sammodichu\nChonna geethaththin porulhenthe-nnelhuppam thiranjappuraththil\nKadannittunnhiye namichavar thanmel - puthechullha vasthrappazhakkathe\nKandu chinthichaar-surante chollum - kurhiyum peruththu vichithram\nKirasthu venthandaa-veedinte janmamidaththiludichennurhachu ghoshichaar\n-maa…\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n3. Pullathil kidannurhangiyenmanuvel thozhuththil thanikkullha janangalh\nUllham mathichu pizhachittu - alanjum valanjum uzhallunneraththil\nNalla idayan kaninjittu - aghaththaliruttichirikkum jagaththil\nNalla manassodudichithaa-thozhuththil thanikkullha janaththe varuththi-\nTtallalum hanichittishtam - peruththa kulaththe ppuraththiliruththaan\nHallelu-thanikku nithyam pukazhcha mahathwam samastham irikkum\n\n-maa…\n\n(P. C. Ittiyera)\nSaamaanya geethangalh", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0424": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0424-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0424-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 2, "tune": 1, "kind": "CONTINUATION"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0424-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "‘Be glad in the Lord’\n1. Karthannil aarththu santhoshikka\nChiththathil sathyamullhorelaam\nThanne thiranjeduththavare\nVyaakula dukhangalh pokkuka\n\n\nKarthanil, karthanil\n\nKarthanil aarththu santhoshikka (2)\n\n2. Avan thaan karthanennorkkuka\nVaanilum bhoovilum naadhan thaan\nVachanaththaal bharikkunnu thaan\nBalaveerare veendeduppaan           -kartha..\n\n\n3. Neethikkayullha poraattaththil\nShathruvin shakthi vardhichaalum\nKaazhchamarhanju daiva sainyam\nShathru sainyaththekkaalh adhikam\n        -kartha…\n4. Pakalil irulh nin chuttilum\nRaathriyil meghangalh nin melum\nVannidumbolh nee kulungeedaa\nAashrayikkavanil aapaththil          -kartha…\n\n5. Karthanil aarththu santhoshikka\nKeerthichu ghoshikka than sthuthi\nVaadyaththodu cherththu nin swaram\nHallelujah geetham paaduka         -kartha…\n\nVimochanam", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0425": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0425-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0425-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "Kristhu yeshuvin swaathanthryam muzhakkeeduvaan\n\nKrooshin maargam naam pinthudaraam\nAdimaththaththin ghadanakalhudemel\nVijayam varicheedenham naam\n (2)\n\n1. Andhakaaraththin shakthikalhe - avan krooshinmel thakarththuvallo\nAa vijayaththin shakthiye naam - anudinam anubhavikkuka naam\n\nPuthughadanakalh nirmichchu vazhikaatti\n\nVimochanam ghoshicheedaam\n(2)\n\n\n-Kristhu…\n\n2. Daivaneethiyin mmargaththaale - thadassangalh naam thakartheedenham\nSaahodaryam sthaapicheedan - peedithare cherththanhachu kondu\n\nPuthughadanakalh nirmichchu vazhikaatti\n\nVimochanam ghoshicheedaam\n(2)\n\n\n-Kristhu…\n\n3. Nithyam maattaththin alayadikalh - prathidwanikkunnu lokamengum\nSaahodarya seemakalhe - punarh chinthanam cheytheeduvaan\n\nPuthughadanakalh nirmichchu vazhikaatti\n\nVimochanam ghoshicheedaam\n(2)\n\n\n-Kristhu…\n\n(Rev. V. M. Mathew)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0426": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0426-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0426-malayalam-1.jpg"], "manglish": "1. Kristhu yeshu shishyarude kaalukalhe kazhu-\nkeettu thann-uduppukalhuduththa shesham\nPinneyum chaariyirunnu chonnavarodu njaan\nInnu ningalhodu chonnathinnathennullhil\n\n2. Ningalh arhiyunnuvo guruvumadhipanume-\nnningane ningalh vilhichidunnathenne\nAngane njanaakayaal nannayuraykkunnu-yennaal\nNingalhude naadhanum guruvumaaya njan\n\n3. Ningal paadangalhe kazhukiyenkil thammil\nNingalhum paadangalhe kazhukendathaakunnu\nNinglhodu cheythavannham ningalhum cheyyanoru\nMangala drishtaanthaminnu thannu ningalhkku\n\n4. Aamen-aamen ningalhodu njaanuraykkunnu than\nKarththavinekkaalh daasanumayachavanekkaalh\nDoothanum valuthalliva ningalharhiyunnenkil\nCheythuvennaaliva ningalh dhanyaraakunnu\n\n5. Ingane thaazhma upadeshicha yeshuve dhosham\nThingiyettam pongiyullhoreeyadiyane\nBhangiyil thaazhmappeduththi mangalamaakki\nKripa thaanguvaan thiru kadaakshamingu nalkuka\n\n(Yusthus Youseph)", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}, "KK-0427": {"notation": [{"file": "choir/KK-0427-notation-1.jpg", "sourcePage": 1, "tune": 1, "kind": "START"}, {"file": "choir/KK-0427-notation-2.jpg", "sourcePage": 2, "tune": 2, "kind": "START"}], "malayalam": ["choir/KK-0427-malayalam-1.jpg", "choir/KK-0427-malayalam-2.jpg"], "manglish": "‘Guide me O Thou great Jehovah’\n1. Nithyanaaya Yehovaayé Lokavan kaattil koodé\nBelaheenan aaya enné Nadaththi thaanghenhamé\nSwarga appam, Swarga appam Enikku tharanhamé\n\n2. Nithya paara thurannittu jeevajalam nalkuka\nAgni meghaththoonhu kondu paatha nannaai kaanhikka\nBelavaaney, Belavaaney raksha nee aakenhamey\n\n3. Yorddaaney njaan kadakkumbolh bhayam ellaam maattuka\nMrithyuviney jayichchoney Kanaanil kaikollhuka\nNinney maathram, ninney maathram njaan ennekum sthuthikkum\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nShushrooshaarambham", "qaStatus": "PASS", "qaIssues": []}};
